/span></span><br />\r\n<br />\r\n<span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">But because it is a big player in the market, so bear with me.</span></span></span><br />\r\n<br />\r\n<span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">Its value according to me:</span></span></span><br />\r\n&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<div id=\"blogTLDR\">\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#434343\"><strong>TL;DR:</strong></span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#434343\">A widely-used email finder tool with a large global user base and decent accuracy. It offers 50 free searches monthly, but user-reported bugs raise questions about reliability. Still, it&#39;s considered a significant player in the market.</span></span></span></p>\r\n</div>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\"><strong>Accuracy-</strong> Highly accurate find email address by name. Source credibility- Utilises an extensive database</span></span></span><br />\r\n<br />\r\n<span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\"><strong>Global reach-</strong> Serves over 400,000 users across more than 130,000 companies in 180+ countries</span></span></span><br />\r\n<br />\r\n<span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">Free Plan Availability-&nbsp; 50 free email searches per month.</span></span></span><br />\r\n&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<h3><span style=\"font-size:20pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#434343\">8. Viola Norbert</span></span></span></h3>\r\n\r\n<p><br />\r\n<span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><a href=\"https://www.voilanorbert.com/\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#0000ff\">Viola Norbert</span></a><span style=\"color:#666666\"> Now, would I use it for bulk email campaigns? Nah.</span></span></span><br />\r\n<br />\r\n<span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">Then why am I suggesting something I wouldn&#39;t use myself?</span></span></span><br />\r\n<br />\r\n<span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">It is decent for individual searches.</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<div id=\"blogTLDR\">\r\n<p><br />\r\n<span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#434343\"><strong>TL;DR:</strong></span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#434343\">Good for individual email searches, but not ideal for bulk campaigns due to bugs and user complaints. Accuracy is around 86%. Emails are fairly credible and fresh. Limited global reach. Offers 50 free searches upon signup.</span></span></span></p>\r\n</div>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">But beware, we analysed many user complaints, like poor experience and bugs and all.</span></span></span><br />\r\n<br />\r\n<span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">Its value according to me:</span></span></span><br />\r\n<br />\r\n<span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\"><strong>Accuracy:</strong> 86%</span></span></span><br />\r\n<br />\r\n<span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\"><strong>Source credibility:</strong> Ensure emails are fresh and up-to-date.</span></span></span><br />\r\n<br />\r\n<span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\"><strong>Global Reach-</strong> Not so much, but does serve a few international clients.</span></span></span><br />\r\n<br />\r\n<span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">Free Availability- Upon registration, users receive 50 free email searches.</span></span></span><br />\r\n&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<h3><span style=\"font-size:20pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#434343\">9. RocketReach</span></span></span></h3>\r\n\r\n<p><br />\r\n<span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><a href=\"https://rocketreach.co/\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#0000ff\">RocketReach</span></a><span style=\"color:#666666\"> I think you&#39;d have listened about this one. A very popular email finder tool! But is it good?</span></span></span><br />\r\n<br />\r\n<span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">I&#39;d say decent, to be honest.</span></span></span><br />\r\n<br />\r\n<span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">I am not here to sugarcoat things for you people.</span></span></span><br />\r\n&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<div id=\"blogTLDR\">\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#434343\"><strong>TL;DR:</strong></span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#434343\">A popular email finder tool with decent performance. Offers 85% accuracy, credible sources, and global reach (700M+ professionals, 35M+ companies). Lacks phone verification for one-on-one lead connection. Free plan includes 5 monthly lookups.</span></span></span></p>\r\n</div>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">Not be the best tool for connecting with leads one-on-one, as there&rsquo;s no phone-verification on-demand service.</span></span></span><br />\r\n<br />\r\n<span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">Its value according to me: </span></span></span><br />\r\n<br />\r\n<span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\"><strong>Accuracy-</strong> 85%</span></span></span><br />\r\n<br />\r\n<span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\"><strong>Source Credibility-</strong>&nbsp; Aggregates data from a vast array of public sources, so i guess it&#39;s credible.</span></span></span><br />\r\n<br />\r\n<span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\"><strong>Global reach-</strong>&nbsp; Extensive database includes over 700 million professionals across 35 million companies worldwide</span></span></span><br />\r\n<br />\r\n<span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">Free plan availability- Free trial, 5 lookups per month.</span></span></span><br />\r\n&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<h3><span style=\"font-size:20pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#434343\">10. Skrapp.io</span></span></span></h3>\r\n\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><a href=\"https://skrapp.io/\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#0000ff\">Skrapp</span></a><span style=\"color:#666666\"> A worthy tool, to be in the list of the top 10 best email finder tools for 2025.</span></span></span><br />\r\n<br />\r\n<span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">Loved even by its competitors, scrapp.io is really something.</span></span></span><br />\r\n<br />\r\n<span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">Free Chrome &amp; LinkedIn Extension.</span></span></span><br />\r\n<br />\r\n<span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\"><span style=\"background-color:#ffffff\">But know that when you do bulk email search, the invalid and catch-all </span></span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">emails are not discarded, so keep that in mind.</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<div id=\"blogTLDR\">\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#434343\"><strong>TL;DR:</strong></span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#434343\">Skrapp.io is a top email finder tool for 2025, offering a free Chrome &amp; LinkedIn extension. It provides 85% accuracy in finding leads, access to 150M+ profiles, and 20M+ companies worldwide. It offers 100 free credits/month but doesn&#39;t discard invalid/catch-all emails in bulk searches. Its email verifier ensures source credibility.</span></span></span></p>\r\n</div>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">Its value according to me:</span></span></span><br />\r\n<br />\r\n<span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\"><strong>Accuracy:</strong> 85% success rate in locating prospect leads.</span></span></span><br />\r\n<br />\r\n<span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\"><strong>Source Credibility-</strong> Employs a rigorous email verifier.</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\"><strong>Global reach-</strong> Access to over 150 million business profiles and more than 20 million companies worldwide</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">Free availability- 100 free email finder credits per month.</span></span></span><br />\r\n&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<h2><span style=\"font-size:24pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#434343\">Conclusion</span></span></span></h2>\r\n\r\n<p><br />\r\n<span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">This year is the moment, this year is the start of a new world of digitalisation. You better grab the opportunity. Lead generation shouldn&#39;t be a headache but an easy, peasy task.</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><br />\r\n<span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">I personally loved Go4Databse &amp; Apollo.io. Go4Datadase may be an<br />\r\n<br />\r\nunderrated tool, but come on. You know it is not good to judge someone based on popularity.</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><br />\r\n<span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">And if popularity matters to you so much, you can go ahead with Apollo.io and Saleshandy. Both are widely used when people want to learn </span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">how to find someones email</span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\"> quickly.&nbsp;</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><br />\r\n<span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">But if you know better tools, make sure to comment about them.</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><br />\r\n<span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">I wish a beautiful day to you fellas. Bye.</span></span></span></p>', '765', 'Top 10 Best Email Finder Tools for Fast Lead Generation', 'Find verified professional emails in seconds with the top 10 email finder tools of 2025. Supercharge your outreach and watch your leads grow effortlessly!', '<script type=\"application/ld+json\">\r\n         {         \r\n            \"@context\": \"https://schema.org/\",         \r\n            \"@type\": \"WebPage\",         \r\n            \"@id\": \"#WebPage\",         \r\n            \"url\": \"https://www.go4database.com/blog/best-email-finder\",          \r\n            \"name\": \"Top 10 Best Email Finder Tools for 2025\"\r\n          } \r\n      </script>\r\n      <script type=\"application/ld+json\" class=\"schemantra\">{\r\n  \"@context\": \"https://schema.org\",\r\n  \"@type\": \"SpeakableSpecification\",\r\n  \"@id\": \"SpeakableSpecification\",\r\n  \"alternateName\": \"What Is Email Finder?\",\r\n  \"description\": \"An email finder is a tool or software that helps locate and verify email addresses, typically for business or marketing purposes. It searches online databases, social media, or websites to identify potential leads and gather contact information.\",\r\n  \"additionalType\": \"https://www.go4database.com/blog/best-email-finder\"\r\n}\r\n</script>\r\n\r\n<script type=\"application/ld+json\">\r\n{\r\n  \"@context\": \"https://schema.org\",\r\n  \"@type\": \"Organization\",\r\n  \"name\": \"Go4Database\",\r\n  \"url\": \"https://go4database.com/\",\r\n  \"logo\": \"https://go4database.com/assets/uploads/media-uploader/go4database-logo1751467973.png\",\r\n  \"contactPoint\": {\r\n    \"@type\": \"ContactPoint\",\r\n    \"telephone\": \"+17867852141\",\r\n    \"contactType\": \"customer service\",\r\n    \"areaServed\": \"US\",\