ation</span></span></span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">This is a customised plan tailored as per organisational needs, and the pricing will be discussed on request.</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<div id=\"BigCTA\" style=\"background:#e7fde7; border:1px solid #6fd943; padding:20px 50px\">\r\n<h4 style=\"text-align:center\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://go4database.com/assets/uploads/media-uploader/yellow-and-blue-bold-marketing-agency-with-hexagon-frame-linkedin-banner-1-removebg-preview1734171422.png\" style=\"height:50px; width:200px\" /><br />\r\n<br />\r\n<span style=\"font-size:24pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#434343\">Customize Your B2B Data Strategy</span></span></span></h4>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><br />\r\n<span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">Build lists, users, and workflows that scale with your team.</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:28px\"><a href=\"https://tawk.to/chat/5943715ce9c6d324a4735bbb/1bj559389\" id=\"TrailBtn\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\">Chat with us!</span></a></span><br />\r\n&nbsp;</p>\r\n</div>\r\n\r\n<h2><br />\r\n<span style=\"font-size:24pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#434343\">Lusha Pricing Plans</span></span></span></h2>\r\n\r\n<p><br />\r\n<span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">Lusha offers 3 paid plans and 1 free plan. However, it works very differently based on a credit subscription model. Which means you&#39;re buying credits to access contact information.</span></span></span><br />\r\n&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p><em><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span styl