(72, 'The Ultimate Guide to B2B Lead Generation: Strategies to Drive High-Quality Leads', '<p><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">In today&#39;s competitive market, </span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\"><strong>B2B Lead Generation</strong></span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\"> is the backbone of sustainable growth.&nbsp;</span></span></span></p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">According to research from the </span></span></span><a href=\"https://contentmarketinginstitute.com/wp-content/uploads/2015/09/2016_B2B_Report_Final.pdf\" style=\"text-decoration:none\"><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">2016 Benchmarks, Budgets, and Trends&mdash;</span></span></span></a></p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><a href=\"https://contentmarketinginstitute.com/wp-content/uploads/2015/09/2016_B2B_Report_Final.pdf\" style=\"text-decoration:none\"><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\"><strong>North America</strong></span></span></span></a><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\"><strong>, 85% of B2B marketers say lead generation is a top priority, but 44% rate their efforts as neutral when it boils down to effectiveness.</strong></span></span></span></p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">Hello! Marketers &amp; Business owners!&nbsp;</span></span></span></p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><a href=\"https://www.go4database.com/\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#1155cc\">Go4Database</span></a><span style=\"color:#666666\">&nbsp;</span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">family welcomes you all.&nbsp;</span></span></span></p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">We hope that you&#39;ve had a wonderful day, or maybe you are going to have one!&nbsp;</span></span></span></p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">In this article, we&rsquo;ll review over 12 proven strategies to generate high-quality leads for your business.&nbsp;</span></span></span></p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">We&rsquo;ll also show you how to keep your B2B lead generation strategies strong and reliable.&nbsp;</span></span></span></p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">For more information on </span><a href=\"https://www.go4database.com/blog/lead-generation-guide\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#1155cc\">Lead Generation</span></a><span style=\"color:#666666\">, make sure to check out.</span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\"><strong>&nbsp;</strong></span></span></span></p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">Let&#39;s get started! </span></span></span></p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<h2><span style=\"font-size:24pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#434343\">Table Of Content: Key Strategies for B2B Lead Generation.</span></span></span></h2>\n\n<p><br />\n<span style=\"font-size