ns-serif\"><span style=\"color:#434343\">&nbsp;</span></span></span></h4>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><a href=\"https://www.semrush.com/blog/seo-visibility/\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#1155cc\">SEO visibility</span></a><span style=\"color:#666666\"> (also called &ldquo;organic search visibility&rdquo;) represents how likely it is for users to see and click on your website in organic search results.&nbsp;</span></span></span></p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">The more keywords you target and the higher you rank for them, the higher your SEO visibility will be.</span></span></span></p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">And it&rsquo;s reflected as a metric called </span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\"><strong>SEO visibility score.</strong></span></span></span><br />\n&nbsp;</p>\n\n<h4><span style=\"font-size:18pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#434343\">How to improve it?</span></span></span></h4>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<ul>\n	<li style=\"list-style-type:disc\"><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">Targeting industry-specific keywords (like B2B lead generation tips)</span></span></span></li>\n	<li style=\"list-style-type:disc\"><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">Creating long-form content that provides in-depth insights</span></span></span></li>\n	<li style=\"list-style-type:disc\"><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">Building backlinks from authoritative sites</span></span></span></li>\n	<li style=\"list-style-type:disc\"><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">Improving website speed and user experience</span></span></span></li>\n</ul>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">Before you launch your next </span><a href=\"http://go4database.com/email-verifier\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#1155cc\">email verification&nbsp;</span></a></span></span><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><a href=\"http://go4database.com/email-verifier\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#1155cc\">campaign</span></a><span style=\"color:#666666\">, make sure your list is clean with Go4Database&rsquo;s &nbsp;&mdash; it helps you eliminate bounces and protect your sender reputation.</span></span></span></p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<h3><span style=\"font-size:20pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#434343\">3. Implementing Email Marketing Campaigns</span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">&nbsp;</span></span></span></h3>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">An </span><span style=\"color:#4e5f70\">email marketing campaign</span><span style=\"color:#666666\"> is a coordinated set of individual email messages that are deployed across a specific period with one specific purpose.&nbsp;</span></span></span></p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">These specific purposes or calls-to-action (CTAs) can include the following:&nbsp;</span></span></span></p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#