"><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\"><strong>Real-Time Data Updates:</strong></span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\"> The database is updated on a real-time basis to ensure there are no unresponsive leads.</span></span></span><br />\r\n	&nbsp;</li>\r\n	<li style=\"list-style-type:disc\"><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\"><strong>Click-to-Dial &amp; Email Integration:</strong> Call or </span><a href=\"https://go4database.com/b2b/email-list\"><span style=\"color:#0000ff\">email list</span></a><span style=\"color:#666666\"> directly from the platform through integrated communications tools.</span></span></span><br />\r\n	&nbsp;</li>\r\n	<li style=\"list-style-type:disc\"><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\"><strong>Export &amp; Data Download:</strong></span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\"> Lists can be exported and contacts can be used externally for campaigns.</span></span></span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<h2><span style=\"font-size:24pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#434343\">Who is ZoomInfo for?</span></span></span></h2>\r\n\r\n<p><br />\r\n<span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">The key users of ZoomInfo are:</span></span></span><br />\r\n&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li style=\"list-style-type:disc\"><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">Sales teams</span></span></span></li>\r\n	<li style=\"list-style-type:disc\"><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"c