uitment, and marketing—any sector that relies on outbound sales or lead generation.\"\r\n    }\r\n  }]\r\n}\r\n</script>', '12', 'ZoomInfo is an all-in-one operating system and intelligence platform that helps businesses find, acquire, and convert leads by providing them with access to detailed company profiles and contact information at their disposal.', 'what-is-zoominfo', 'Riya', 'publish', 'en_US', '2025-07-23', '2543', '2025-05-21 13:44:13', '2025-12-17 16:01:49', 0, NULL);
