ant</span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\"><strong> </strong></span><strong><a href=\"https://go4database.com/blog/go4database-vs-lusha\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#2980b9\">business contact</span></a></strong></span></span><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\"><strong>&nbsp;</strong></span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">lists tailored for your target audience. The best part is, you can use filters to narrow down your email list and zero in on your target audience before spending your credits.</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><br />\r\n<span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">Not only this, but you can also use filters based on buyer intent and their scores, just like you can with Lusha and Apollo.</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><br />\r\n<span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">This helps you better understand what your prospects are looking for so you can personalize your messages accordingly and boost your outreach.</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><br />\r\n<span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">That said, let&#39;s quickly jump to pricing.</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><br />\r\n<span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\"><strong>Pricing</strong></span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><br />\r\n<span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">This platform provides a customized pricing option, which is quite expensive.</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span s