=\"color:#666666\">&nbsp;isn&rsquo;t just a reliable mailing list provider but also a B2B sales intelligence platform. It offers high-quality email lists along with legal compliance, which helps to boost your lead generation process.</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://go4database.com/assets/uploads/media-uploader/cognism1753348599.webp\" style=\"height:350px; width:800px\" /></p>\r\n\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<h3><span style=\"font-size:20pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#434343\">What else can you get on this platform?</span></span></span></h3>\r\n\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">If you&#39;re looking for a platform to buy email lists and want to get the leads&#39; insights, then Cognism can be the best option for you.</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><br />\r\n<span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">You will be able to find your ideal prospect in one go by using AI as your personal assistance. All you need to do is just type or speak your prompt.</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><br />\r\n<span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">The coolest part is that you can access companies&#39; insights, including hiring, funding, and job changes. This makes Cognism a top pick for sales reports and smart outreach.</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><br />\r\n<span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">By this, you will be able to know buyer intent and identify your right audience effortlessly.</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><br />\r\n<span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">Guess what? You will get the intent data in Cognism, which is powered by Bombora, a well-known platform that offers B2B intent data.</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><br />\r\n<span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">What&#39;s even better? You can upload your existing data in a feature known as CSV enrichment, and it will churn that data by updating the details with fresh and relevant information such as phone numbers and more.</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><br />\r\n<span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">Let&#39;s dig into pricing!</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><br />\r\n<span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\"><strong>Pricing</strong></span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><br />\r\n<span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">Here you will get customized pricing based on your requirements, and for this, you need to send a request to Cognism.</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><br />\r\n<span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\"><strong>Point to remember</strong></span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">: Cognism has never disclosed its database publicly.</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><br />\r\n<span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\"><strong>G2 Ratings: 4.6/5</strong></span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><br />\r\n<span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\"><strong>Best for: </strong></span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">medium-sized firms&#39; sales and marketing teams.</span></span></span></p>\r\n\