(79, 'Looking Beyond Apollo.io? Here are 11 Alternatives!', '<p style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">Apollo is a great tool that helps businesses identify, connect and close deals with their customers but users have faced a few issues such as:</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"text-align:justify\"><br />\r\n<span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">Technical glitches.&nbsp;</span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">Lack of accuracy in data.&nbsp;</span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">Complexity with almost no learning curve.&nbsp;</span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">Customer support challenges.&nbsp;</span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">Concerns with pricing structure.</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"text-align:justify\"><br />\r\n<span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">Difficulty in finding contacts from certain regions (e.g., Eastern Europe, Middle East)</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">&nbsp;</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<h2 style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:24pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#434343\">Best 11 Apollo Alternatives:</span></span></span></h2>\r\n\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">&nbsp; &nbsp;1.&nbsp;&nbsp;</span><a href=\"https://go4database.com/blog/apollo-io-alternatives#1-go4database\"><span style=\"color:#1155cc\">Go4Database</span></a></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">&nbsp; &nbsp;2.&nbsp;&nbsp;</span><a href=\"https://go4database.com/blog/apollo-io-alternatives#2-zoominfo\"><span style=\"color:#1155cc\">ZoomInfo</span></a></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">&nbsp; &nbsp;3.&nbsp;&nbsp;</span><a href=\"https://go4database.com/blog/apollo-io-alternatives#3-rocketreach\"><span style=\"color:#1155cc\">RocketReach</span></a></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">&nbsp; &nbsp;4.</span><span style=\"color:#1155cc\">&nbsp;&nbsp;</span><a href=\"https://go4database.com/blog/apollo-io-alternatives#4-uplead\"><span style=\"color:#1155cc\">UpLead</span></a></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">&nbsp; &nbsp;5.&nbsp;&nbsp;</span><a href=\"https://go4database.com/blog/apollo-io-alternatives#5-lusha\"><span style=\"color:#1155cc\">Lusha</span></a></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">&nbsp; &nbsp;6.&nbsp;&nbsp;</span><a href=\"https://go4database.com/blog/apollo-io-alternatives#6-hunterio\"><span style=\"color:#1155cc\">Hunter.io</span></a></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">&nbsp; &nbsp;7.&nbsp;&nbsp;</span><a href=\"https://go4database.com/blog/apollo-io-alternatives#7-cognism\"><span style=\"color:#1155cc\">Cognism</span></a></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">&nbsp; &nbsp;8.&nbsp;&nbsp;</span><a href=\"https://go4database.com/blog/apollo-io-alternatives#8-book-your-data\"><span style=\"color:#1155cc\">Book Your Data</span></a></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">&nbsp; &nbsp;9.&nbsp;&nbsp;</span><a href=\"https://go4database.com/blog/apollo-io-alternatives#9-saleshandy\"><span style=\"color:#1155cc\">Saleshandy</span></a></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">&nbsp; 10.&nbsp;</span><a href=\"https://go4database.com/blog/apollo-io-alternatives#10-lead411\"><span style=\"color:#1155cc\">Lead411</span></a></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">&nbsp; 11. </span><a href=\"https://go4database.com/blog/apollo-io-alternatives#11-snovio\"><span style=\"color:#1155cc\">Snov.io</span></a></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<h3><span style=\"font-size:20pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#434343\">1. Go4Database</span></span></span></h3>\r\n\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">Go4Database is a mass &amp; global Business Contacts Search Platform. Help almost all small companies, freelancers and startups to find their right audience for business generation at a very affordable price.</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"text-align:justify\"><br />\r\n<img alt=\"\" src=\"https://go4database.com/assets/uploads/media-uploader/go4database1753348599.webp\" style=\"height:350px; width:800px\" /></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"text-align:justify\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">Go4Database has years of problem-solving experience in the Business &amp; Consumer email list and it is known in the industry for <strong>Active &ndash; Specific &ndash; Effortless solutions for their consumers</strong>.</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">Go4Database itself suggests to consumers that they first use it and then believe it.</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<div id=\"blogTLDR\">\r\n<p style=\"text-align:justify\"><br />\r\n<span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\"><strong>TL;DR </strong></span></span></span><br />\r\n<span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">Go4Database is an affordable, global B2B &amp; B2C lead generation and business contact search platform. Ideal for small businesses, startups, and freelancers, it offers verified and customizable contact lists (email, phone, business, consumer, etc.) with high accuracy (95%) and GDPR compliance.</span></span></span></p>\r\n</div>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">This platform truly deserves to be on the top of the list as it is one of the leading lead generation companies that provides comprehensive B2B &amp; B2C databases to help businesses connect with the right audience.</span></span></spa