yle=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">Integration with over 5000 applications.</span></span></span></li>\r\n	<li style=\"list-style-type:disc\"><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">Lead Lists and Filters</span></span></span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">&nbsp;</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<h4 style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:18pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#434343\">Cons of Snov.io</span></span></span></h4>\r\n\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li style=\"list-style-type:disc\"><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">Poor customer support.</span></span></span></li>\r\n	<li style=\"list-style-type:disc\"><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">Every month, credit expires.</span></span></span></li>\r\n	<li style=\"list-style-type:disc\"><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">No access to phone numbers.</span></span></span></li>\r\n	<li style=\"list-style-type:disc\"><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">No refund policy.</span></span></span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">&nbsp;</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">If you are still confused about finding the best alternative, try Go4Datababse with affordable pricing, accurate data, high reliability and proper support facilities.</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:16pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">You can contact us via WhatsApp at +17867852141 or by using official email address </span></span></span><a href=\"mailto:info@go4database.com\" style=\"text-decoration:none\"><span style=\"font-size:16pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#1155cc\"><u>info@go4database.com</u></span></span></span></a></p>\r\n\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<h2 style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:24pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#434343\">FAQs</span></span></span></h2>\r\n\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<h3><span style=\"font-size:20pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#434343\">1. Who should consider Go4Database instead of Apollo.io?</span></span></span></h3>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"text-align:justify\"><br />\r\n<span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">Businesses or individuals who want direct access to B2B contacts for their own campaigns, without the need for automation, advanced analytics, or CRM integrations, will benefit most from Go4database.</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">&nbsp;</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<h3><span style=\"font-size:20pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#434343\">2. How does Go4Database handle support?</span></span></span></h3>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"text-align:justify\"><br />\r\n<span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">Instead of using automated bots or outsourced contact centers, support is delivered by email by a real person, adding a personal touch.</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">&nbsp;</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<h3><span style=\"font-size:20pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#434343\">3. What kind of businesses benefit most from Go4Database?</span></span></span></h3>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"text-align:justify\"><br />\r\n<span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">Those looking for simplicity, cost control, and complete control over their business-to-business data, particularly for initiatives that are one-time or highly targeted.</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">Apollo.io and its competitors are superior in automation, integrations, and sophisticated sales intelligence services, but Go4database is notable for its ease of use, clear price, and user autonomy.</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>', '774', 'Top Apollo.io Alternatives | Boost Your Lead Generation', 'Explore the best Apollo.io alternatives for lead gen, sales, and CRM integration. Supercharge outreach and conversions with these top tools today!', '<script type=\"application/ld+json\">\r\n{\r\n  \"@context\": \"https://schema.org\",\r\n  \"@type\": \"Organization\",\r\n  \"name\": \"Go4Database\",\r\n  \"url\": \"https://www.go4database.com/\",\r\n  \"logo\": \"https://go4database.com/assets/uploads/media-uploader/go4database-logo1751528079.png\",\r\n  \"contactPoint\": {\r\n    \"@type\": \"ContactPoint\",\r\n    \"telephone\": \"+ 1 786 785 2141\",\r\n    \"contactType\": \"customer service\",\r\n    \"areaServed\": \"US\",\r\n    \"availableLanguage\": \"en\"\r\n  },\r\n  \"sameAs\": [\r\n    \"https://www.facebook.com/Go4Database\",\r\n    \"https://twitter.com/DatabaseGo4\",\r\n    \"https://www.instagram.com/go4database/\",\r\n    \"https://www.youtube.com/@Go4Database\",\r\n    \"https://www.linkedin.com/company/go4database/\",\r\n    \"https://in.pinterest.com/gofourdatabase/\"\r\n  ]\r\n}\r\n</script>\r\n<script type=\"application/ld+json\">\r\n{\r\n  \"@context\": \"https://schema.org\",\r\n  \"@type\": \"BlogPosting\",\r\n  \"mainEntityOfPage\": {\r\n    \"@type\": \"WebPage\",\r\n    \"@id\": \"https://www.go4database.com/blog/apollo-io-alternatives\"\r\n  },\r\n  \"headline\": \"Looking Beyond Apollo.io? Here are 11 Alternatives!\",\r\n  \"description\": \"Apollo is a great tool that helps businesses identify, connect and close deals with their customers but users have faced a few issues such as:\",\r\n  \"image\": \"https://www.go4database.com/assets/uploads/media-uploader/top-alternatives-to-apollo-go4database1753247427.webp\",  \r\n  \"author\": {\r\n    \"@type\": \"Person\",\r\n    \"name\": \"Deepa Tyagi\"\r\n  },  \r\n  \"publisher\": {\r\n    \"@type\": \"Organization\",\r\n    \"name\": \"\",\r\n    \"logo\": {\r\n      \"@type\": \"ImageObject\",\r\n      \"url\": \"\"\r\n    }\r\n  },\r\n  \"datePublished\": \"2025-07-23\",\r\n  \"dateModified\": \"2025-09-10\"\r\n}\r\n</script>\r\n<script type=\"application/ld+json\">\r\n         {         \r\n            \"@context\": \"https://schema.org/\",         \r\n            \"@type\": \"WebPage\",         \r\n            \"@id\": \"#WebPage\",         \r\n            \"url\": \"https://www.go4database.com/blog/apollo-io-alternatives\",          \r\n            \"name\": \"Looking Beyond Apollo.io? Here are 11 Alternatives!\"\r\n          } \r\n      </script>\r\n      <script type=\"application/ld+json\">\r\n{\r\n  \"@context\": \"https://schema.org/\", \r\n  \"@type\": \"BreadcrumbList\", \r\n  \"itemListElement\": [{\r\n    \"@type\": \"ListItem\", \r\n    \"position\": 1, \r\n    \"name\": \"Homepage\",\r\n    \"item\": \"https://www.go4database.com/