font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">CSV Enrichment &amp; CRM Enrichment</span></span></span></li>\r\n	<li style=\"list-style-type:disc\"><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">Integrations with CRM &amp; Sales tools</span></span></span></li>\r\n	<li style=\"list-style-type:disc\"><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">No advanced firmographics of intent data</span></span></span></li>\r\n	<li style=\"list-style-type:disc\"><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">Best for small scale prospecting, not enterprise use</span></span></span></li>\r\n	<li style=\"list-style-type:disc\"><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">Data Accuracy 85%&nbsp;</span></span></span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">&ldquo;It&rsquo;s a horrible experience that your product can&rsquo;t be used on a phone. How are reps on the go supposed to successfully prospect?</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">Also, they claim their data is accurate yet we are finding 40% inaccuracy and that&#39;s being modest. I wouldn&#39;t recommend anyone to this platform.&rdquo;</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">Review by Trisha G.&nbsp;</span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">President and CEO&nbsp;</span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">Small-Business (50 or fewer emp.)</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><a href=\"https://www.g2.com/products/lusha/reviews#reviews\" style=\"text-decoration:none\"><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#1155cc\"><u>Lusha Reviews 2025: Details, Pricing, &amp; Features | G2</u></span></span></span></a></p>\r\n\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<h3><span style=\"font-size:20pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#434343\">11. Saleshandy</span></span></span></h3>\r\n\r\n<p><br />\r\n<span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">Saleshandy is an email outreach &amp; sales engagement tool, primarily designed for cold emailing, email tracking and automation.</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">Best for Sales teams, startups, and recruiters needing automated cold email outreach. Not ideal for companies looking for B2B Lead Database or sales intelligence.</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li style=\"list-style-type:disc\"><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">Cold email outreach automation</span></span></span></li>\r\n	<li style=\"list-style-type:disc\"><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">Email tracking and analytics</span></span></span></li>\r\n	<li style=\"list-style-type:disc\"><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">Does not provide contact data</span></span></span></li>\r\n	<li style=\"list-style-type:disc\"><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">No linkedin or social media integration</span></span></span></li>\r\n	<li style=\"list-style-type:disc\"><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">Accuracy rate 90%</span></span></span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">&ldquo;Saleshandy lists out contacts at companies with redacted emails or phone numbers, but when you spend credits on revealing emails, phones, it shows none or shows wrong unverified emails, phones. Very misleading!&rdquo;</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">Review by Dũng C.&nbsp;</span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">Director&nbsp;</span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">Small-Business(50 or fewer emp.)</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><a href=\"https://www.g2.com/products/saleshandy/reviews#reviews\" style=\"text-decoration:none\"><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#1155cc\"><u>Saleshandy Reviews 2025: Details, Pricing, &amp; Features | G2</u></span></span></span></a></p>\r\n\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<h3><span style=\"font-size:20pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#434343\">12. Dun &amp; Bradstreet (D &amp; B)</span></span></span></h3>\r\n\r\n<p><br />\r\n<span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">Dun &amp; Bradstreet, a leading global provider of business decisioning data and analytics, enables companies around the world to improve their </span><a href=\"https://go4databaseinfo.wixsite.com/go4database-1\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#1155cc\">business performance</span></a><span style=\"color:#666666\">.&nbsp;</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">This B2B data provider is best for enterprise level &amp; business credit risk management.</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li style=\"list-style-type:disc\"><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">95% Accuracy rate</span></span></span></li>\r\n	<li style=\"list-style-type:disc\"><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">Largest B2B Database for financial &amp; business insights</span></span></span></li>\r\n	<li style=\"list-style-type:disc\"><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">Strong data compliance and security</span></span></span></li>\r\n	<li style=\"list-style-type:disc\"><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">Industry specific business intelligence</span></span></span></li>\r\n	<li style=\"list-style-type:disc\"><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">Not ideal for direct contact data</span></span></span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<div id=\"BigCTA\" style=\"background:#e7fde7; border:1px solid #6fd943; padding:20px 50px\">\r\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://go4database.com/assets/uploads/media-uploader/yellow-and-blue-bold-marketing-agency-with-hexagon-frame-linkedin-banner-1-removebg-preview1734171422.png\" style=\"height:50px; width:200px\" /></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><strong><span style=\"font-size:24pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\">Unlock Growth With B2B Intelligence</span></span></span></strong></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">Empower your business with accurate B2B data to drive smarter decisions, leads, and growth.</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:20px\"><a href=\"https://tawk.to/chat/5943715ce9c6d324a4735bbb/1bj559389\" id=\"TrailBtn\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\">Access Data Today</span></a></span><br />\r\n&nbsp;</p>\r\n</div>\r\n\r\n<p><br />\r\n&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<h2><span style=\"font-size:24pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#434343\">Conclusion</span></span></span></h2>\r\n\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">You know us. You know we always leave the conclusion in your hands. You are the </span><a href=\"https://go4database.com/b2c/consumer-email-list-gmail\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#0000ff\">ultimate consumer</span></a><span style=\"color:#666666\">. First analyse your database size requirement, whether you are a small, medium or large enterprise? Or what kind of data you require? And all the above criterias will help you better find your B2B data provider.&nbsp;</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">If it were up to me, I&#39;d go with Go4Database and RocketReach as my B2B data provider. But hey if you know a better B2B database provider, be sure to comment about it.</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">We would always like to know more and upgrade accordingly. We hope you find what you need. Till then, Farewell!&nbsp;</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><br />\r\n&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<h2><span style=\"font-size:24pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#434343\">FAQs</span></span></span></h2>\r\n\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<h3><span style=\"font-size:20pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#434343\">1. Best B2B Data Provider according to Go4Database?</span></span></span></h3>\r\n\r\n<p><br />\r\n<span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">Go4Database, is itself a competitor of Lusha, Apollo, Saleshandy, Lead411 and all the above. So why not choose Go4Database! It is the best B2B &amp; B2C Data Provider. It has global reach, an amazing integration system. It is best for both startups &amp; enterprise levels.</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<h3><span style=\"font-size:20pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#434343\">2. What are the benefits of a B2B data provider?</span></span></span></h3>\r\n\r\n<p><br />\r\n<span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">Well, You will be easily able to access high quality, verified business contacts, better sales targeting and personalisation, a b2b data provider provides data accuracy and reduced bounce rates, they also offer time &amp; cost efficiency.&nbsp;</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<h3><span style=\"font-size:20pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#434343\">3. Who should use B2B Data Providers?</span></span></span></h3>\r\n\r\n<p><br />\r\n<span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">Sales Teams &ndash; For targeted prospecting.</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">Marketing Teams &ndash; For better campaign segmentation.</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">Business Development &ndash; For identifying partnerships.</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">Investors &ndash; For market and company analysis.</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>', '775', 'Top 10 B2B Data Providers 2025: Power Your Business Growth', 'Go4Database: Trusted B2B Data Providers offering accurate leads, firmographics & decision-maker insights to fuel your business growth. Start growing today!', '<script type=\"application/ld+json\">\r\n{\r\n  \"@context\": \"https://schema.org\",\r\n  \"@type\": \"BlogPosting\",\r\n  \"mainEntityOfPage\": {\r\n    \"@type\": \"WebPage\",\r\n    \"@id\": \"https://www.go4database.com/blog/b2b-data-providers\"\r\n  },\r\n  \"headline\": \"Top 10 B2B Data Providers of 2025: The Ultimate Vendors Fueling Your Growth\",\r\n  \"description\": \"You\'d know that the demand for high-quality data is a hot topic of 2025. But how\'d you know which one is the best for your industry/business?\",\r\n  \"image\": \"https://www.go4database.com/assets/uploads/media-uploader/top-10-b2b-data-providers-of-2025-go4database1753247428.webp\",  \r\n  \"author\": {\r\n    \"@type\": \"Person\",\r\n    \"name\": \"Payal Patwal\"\r\n  },  \r\n  \"publisher\": {\r\n    \"@type\": \"Organization\",\r\n    \"name\": \"\",\r\n    \"logo\": {\r\n      \"@type\": \"ImageObject\",\r\n      \"url\": \"\"\r\n    }\r\n  },\r\n  \"datePublished\": \"2025-07-23\",\r\n  \"dateModified\": \"2025-09-09\"\r\n}\r\n</script>\r\n<script type=\"application/ld+json\">\r\n{\r\n  \"@context\": \"https://schema.org/\", \r\n  \"@type\": \"BreadcrumbList\", \r\n  \"itemListElement\": [{\r\n    \"@t