/\"\r\n  ]\r\n}\r\n</script>', '1', 'You\'d know that the demand for high-quality data is a hot topic of 2025. But how\'d you know which one is the best for your industry/business?', 'b2b-data-providers', 'Payal Patwal', 'publish', 'en_US', '2025-07-23', '2302', '2025-06-12 12:57:28', '2025-12-17 09:53:21', 0, NULL);
