(81, 'Go4database Buying Guide:  Choose a Targeted Email List That Works for You', '<p><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">Running a successful email marketing campaign isn&rsquo;t like a piece of cake; you cannot do it in a day, but you can speed up the process by using <strong>targeted email lists</strong>.</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><br />\r\n<span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">Think that you&#39;re inviting people for an evening dinner party. Would you randomly flip through a phone book and start calling people? Of course not.</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><br />\r\n<span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">You would carefully consider who should be there, who will enjoy the vibe, spark meaningful conversation, and make the evening party memorable.</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">It is same for email marketing campaigns as well. A good and well-selected email list means you&#39;re bringing the right people to your table, and those who are genuinely interested in what you have to offer.</span></span></span><br />\r\n&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">So, you need to be careful while choosing your email lists, otherwise, you will not be able to reach your ideal prospects easily. Then, are you wondering if there is any solution to build a high-quality lead list?</span></span></span><br />\r\n&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">Absolutely! You just need the right steps and a proper direction. That&rsquo;s exactly what we&rsquo;re going learn.</span></span></span><br />\r\n&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">In this blog post, we will go through the nuts and bolts of creating a targeted email lead list that will increase your conversion rates.</span></span></span><br />\r\n&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">So, are you ready? Let&#39;s get rolling.</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">&nbsp;</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<blockquote>\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\"><strong>What is a Targeted Email List?</strong></span></span></span><br />\r\n<br />\r\n<span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">A targeted email list is a well-chosen set of contacts that match your ideal customer profile. You select these recipients through things like their industry, job title, where they&#39;re located, or what their interests are. This means they&#39;re more likely to respond with the emails you send. It helps to increase open rates, leads to more conversions, and ensures your message reaches to the right people.</span></span></span></p>\r\n</blockquote>\r\n\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<h2><span style=\"font-size:24pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#434343\">Methods to Build a Targeted Email List</span></span></span></h2>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">&nbsp;</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<div id=\"blogTLDR\">\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\"><strong>TL;DR</strong></span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">To build a high-quality targeted email list, you need to begin by defining your Ideal Customer Profile (ICP). Begin with a look at your top existing customers. Identify key characteristics such as their industry, the size of their company, and the problems they face. Write down what you discover. Keep your attention on useful information rather than diving into complex behavioural patterns.</span></span></span></p>\r\n</div>\r\n\r\n<p><br />\r\n&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<h2><span style=\"font-size:24pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#434343\">Table of contents:</span></span></span></h2>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;1. </span><a href=\"https://go4database.com/blog/targeted-email-list#1-define-your-ideal-customer-profile-icp\"><span style=\"color:#1155cc\">Define Your Ideal Customer Profile (ICP)</span></a></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;2. </span><a href=\"https://go4database.com/blog/targeted-email-list#2-explore-more-channels-to-research-the-target-audience\"><span style=\"color:#1155cc\">Explore more channels to research the target audience</span></a></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;3. </span><a href=\"https://go4database.com/blog/targeted-email-list#3-build-a-targeted-email-list-through-networking-events-or-webinars\"><span style=\"color:#1155cc\">Build a targeted email list through networking, events, or&nbsp; webinars.</span></a></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;4. </span><a href=\"https://go4database.com/blog/targeted-email-list#4-identify-the-right-email-leads-by-analysing-competitors\"><span style=\"color:#1155cc\">Identify the right email leads by analysing competitors</span></a></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<h3><span style=\"font-size:20pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#434343\">1. Define Your Ideal Customer Profile (ICP)</span></span></span></h3>\r\n\r\n<p><br />\r\n<span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">Are you wondering why defining your ideal customer profile (ICP) is essential at the early stages of email building?</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">Well, knowing your target audience helps you build quality leads that match your ideal prospect.</span></span></span><br />\r\n&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">This way, you will be able to pitch your target prospect that can be converted into leads. And, in turn, your efforts will get fruitful results that you deserve.</span></span></span><br />\r\n&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">So, ready to kick-start the process of building your ideal customer profile?</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">Then, Follow these easy steps to create:</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">First thing, begin with your existing customers.</span></span></span><br />\r\n&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">Discover the patterns in their demographics, issues, and behaviours.</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">For this, you can start by asking some important questions such as:</span></span></span><br />\r\n&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li style=\"list-style-type:disc\"><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">What industry are they in?</span></span></span></li>\r\n	<li style=\"list-style-type:disc\"><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">What is their company size?</span></span></span></li>\r\n	<li style=\"list-style-type:disc\"><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">What solutions are they searching for?</span></span></span></li>\r\n	<li style=\"list-style-type:disc\"><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">Where are they located?</span></span></span></li>\r\n	<li style=\"list-style-type:disc\"><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">What is their budget?</span></span></span></li>\r\n	<li style=\"list-style-type:disc\"><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">Who are the decision makers?</span></span></span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">Asking these questions can help you to understand the key traits of your ideal customer profile.</span></span></span><br />\r\n&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">Once you have figured it out, the next stage is to know about the issues their facing, and identify what solutions exist, then help them to overcome those pain points.</span></span></span><br />\r\n&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">Let&rsquo;s take an example, assume you&#39;re doing B2B marketing for a logistics management platform. Your ideal customer could be the supply chain director at a manufacturing company in the United States, who want to optimise shipping routes and minimise operational costs.</span></span></span><br />\r\n&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">Now, you can note down or create a document of your ideal customer profile. To make your work easy you can take the help of the templates available in the market.</span></span></span><br />\r\n&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">Finally, you will be able to create your ICP with this is the process&nbsp; and for your surprise i also follow these steps to define my ICP for </span></span></span><a href=\"https://go4database.com/b2b/us-business-email-list\"><span style=\"color:#1155cc\"><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\">creating a targeted email database</span></span></span></a><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">.</span></span></span><br />\r\n&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\"><strong>Pro tip:</strong></span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">Do not dive deep into the behavioural traits of your ICP. Just focus on their challenges like buying triggers, and the platforms or technologies they are already using. Behavioural traits are more useful during lead nurturing or outreach, not at the stage of ICP.</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">&nbsp;</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<h3><span style=\"font-size:20pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#434343\">2. Explore More Channels to Research the Target Audience</span></span></span></h3>\r\n\r\n<p><br />\r\n<span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">What comes next? Once you&#39;re done with identifying the ideal customer, the real search begins.</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">Now you have to start identifying your target email leads.</span></span></span><br />\r\n&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<div id=\"blogTLDR\">\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\"><strong>TL;DR:</strong></span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">After you&#39;ve figured out your Ideal Customer Profile (ICP), it&#39;s time to begin finding actual leads. Make use of sites like LinkedIn, social media and industry groups to sort potential customers by job title, industry, and location. Put your energy into matching leads to your ICP and create your cold email list based on this.</span></span></span></p>\r\n</div>\r\n\r\n<p><br />\r\n<span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">Where can you find it? There are various platforms like social media sites, events, LinkedIn, and competitor analysis to find your perfect lead.</span></span></span><br />\r\n&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">Well, these steps will help you find your right prospect by building cold email lists.&nbsp;</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><br />\r\n<span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">How? For this, you need to take the privilege of a social media platform.</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><br />\r\n<span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">Apart from that, you can use LinkedIn, which is like a secret weapon that allows you to find your target prospects effortlessly.</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><br />\r\n<span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">To begin your search, you need to keep your ideal customer profile (ICP) at the back of your mind. Accordingly, add filters to your leads by industry type, company size, job title, and location.</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><br />\r\n<span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">Furthermore, narrow down your search on LinkedIn by exploring industry-specific forums, online communities, and groups.</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">Here you will find people talking about the actual challenges that your ideal prospects are facing. In turn, this will allow you to find your potential leads by discussing industry trends, problems, and solutions that sync with the pain points of the ICP.</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><br />\r\n<span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">From here, let&#39;s move to the next option, which is building networks.</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><br />\r\n<span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\"><strong>Pro tip</strong></span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">:</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">There are smart filters available in LinkedIn that you can use to find leads by industry type, company size, job title, and location.</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<div id=\"BigCTA\" style=\"background:#e7fde7; border:1px solid #6fd943; padding:20px 50px\">\r\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://go4database.com/assets/uploads/media-uploader/yellow-and-blue-bold-marketing-agency-with-hexagon-frame-linkedin-banner-1-removebg-preview1734171422.png\" style=\"height:50px; width:200px\" /></p>\r\n\r\n<h4 style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:24pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\">Ready to reach your ideal customer?</span></span></span></h4>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><br />\r\n<span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">Get upto 95% accurate contact lists in just few clicks!</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://tawk.to/chat/5943715ce9c6d324a4735bbb/1bj559389\" id=\"TrailBtn\"><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\">Start creating your list today</span></span></a></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n</div>\r\n\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<h3><span style=\"font-size:20pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#434343\">3. Build a Targeted Email List Through Networking, Events, or Webinars</span></span></span></h3>\r\n\r\n<p><br />\r\n<span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">Networking is another way to build your potential email leads, but let ICP slide away in your mind.</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><br />\r\n<span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">This way, you will not just gather contacts, but you&#39;re also building a list of the right prospects.</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><br />\r\n<span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">In addition, whenever you&#39;re attending any webinars or events, try building connections with individuals who match your profile.</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><br />\r\n<span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">And if you feel they&rsquo;re a good fit, get their contact details for follow-up outreach.</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><br />\r\n<span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">I know what your thinking? What if you&#39;re not attending webinars in person? Worry not,&nbsp; there are many webinars and events taking place on LinkedIn or WhatsApp groups.</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><br />\r\n<span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">Join them! connect with individuals who match your ideal prospect. Then, make a list of those prospects, and sort and filter them based on your ICP.</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">&nbsp;</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<h3><span style=\"font-size:20pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#434343\">4. Identify the Right Email Leads by Analysing Competitors</span></span></span></h3>\r\n\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">Another effective strategy for unlocking your </span></span></span><a href=\"https://go4database.com/b2b/business-leads\"><span style=\"color:#1155cc\"><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\">potential B2b leads</span></span></span></a><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">&nbsp;is conducting competitor analysis.</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">Now comes the fourth step, let me break it down for you.</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><br />\r\n<span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">There are three useful yet powerful methods you can follow:</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<div id=\"blogTLDR\">\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\"><strong>TL;DR:</strong></span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">Go4Database consist of +350 million verified email lists with advanced filter options, bounce-back guarantee, and multi-channel features such as WhatsApp contact filtering and chatbot support integration. The price starts at $35/month, one of the credible platforms to create a targeted email list with desired outreach</span></span></span></p>\r\n</div>\r\n\r\n<p><br />\r\n<span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">You can kick start by checking out competitors&#39; sites and understanding the pain points of your ideal prospect by diving into their reviews, testimonials, and case studies.</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><br />\r\n<span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">How this helps?</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><br />\r\n<span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">Competitor analysis will allow you to spot the gaps in your offering or areas where a specific customer segment might feel uncovered. When you understand these overlooked opportunities, you can target them directly to the needs of your customers.</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><br />\r\n<span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">To know your ideal customers, you can analyze competitors by using your competitors&#39; products or services and interests in similar products.</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">Hope you&#39;ve figured out by now how to analyze a competitor&#39;s site.</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><br />\r\n<span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">Let&#39;s learn how to research a competitor&#39;s site.</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><br />\r\n<span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">For this, start by understanding the reviews of your competitor&#39;s website on testimonial pages or on platforms like G2, Capterra, or Trustpilot.</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><br />\r\n<span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">Plus, explore social media hashtags and posts about competitors&#39; products or services by including keywords like &ldquo;problem,&rdquo; frustrating, or &ldquo;alternatives.</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><br />\r\n<span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">Apart from this, track comments, shares, and likes on competitors websites by using social tools 