color:#434343\">Why choose Go4Database over Lusha and its alternatives?</span></span></span></h3>\r\n\r\n<p><br />\r\n<span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">Go4database provides a simple, affordable solution that does not require dashboards, platform lock-in, or required logins. It is perfect for customers who desire independence and flexibility without recurring subscriptions or hidden fees because it gives you segmented, ready-to-use mailing lists and complete control over data verification and outreach.</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">&nbsp;</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<h3><span style=\"font-size:20pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#434343\">2.</span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:6.999999999999999pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#434343\">&nbsp; </span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:20pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#434343\">How does Go4Database&rsquo;s pricing compare to Lusha?</span></span></span></h3>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">&nbsp;</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">Go4database only charges for what you require because it takes a one-time, pay-per-list strategy. In contrast, Lusha costs more for additional features or API access and can be more costly, particularly for larger quantities.</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">&nbsp;</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<h3><span style=\"font-size:20pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#434343\">3.</span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:6.999999999999999pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#434343\">&nbsp; </span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:20pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#434343\">Does Go4Database offers better data control than Lusha?</span></span></span></h3>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">Yes. With Go4database, you own the data and manage verification and compliance your way. Lusha&rsquo;s data is accessed through their platform, and you&rsquo;re reliant on their algorithms and integrations.</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">&nbsp;</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<h3><span style=\"font-size:20pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#434343\">4.</span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:6.999999999999999pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#434343\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; </span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:20pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#434343\">Is Go4Database suitable for users who want to avoid complex tools?</span></span></span></h3>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">&nbsp;</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">Absolutely. Go4database is designed for simplicity: no dashboards, no forced integrations, and no unnecessary features. This is ideal for users who want to focus on outreach, not learning a new SaaS product.</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>', '778', 'Lusha Alternatives: 10 Better Contact Tools for 2025', 'Seeking Lusha alternatives? Discover 10 top tools that boost sales and data accuracy. Compare now to elevate your outreach strategy today!', NULL, '1', 'No doubt! Lusha company is one of the best platforms to reach out to your newly identified prospects, Lusha allows you to create cold email sequences. Lusha has quite responsive customer support and also has a smooth interface.', 'lusha-alternatives', 'Deepa Tyagi', 'publish', 'en_US', '2025-07-23', '1103', '2025-06-16 19:02:37', '2025-12-17 09:33:40', 0, NULL);
