(83, 'Looking for Hunter.io Alternatives? Try these 11 Websites Like Hunter!', '<p><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">No doubt! <strong>Hunter.io Alternatives</strong> is one of the best resources for quickly finding and verifying email addresses, domain search and API integration.</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">&nbsp;</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">Hunter.io offers a LinkedIn Chrome extension if you want to obtain contact information straight from LinkedIn or business websites while doing lead research.</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">&nbsp;</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">It provides </span><a href=\"https://go4database.com/blog/email-finder-tools\"><span style=\"color:#1155cc\">bulk email finding tool</span></a><span style=\"color:#666666\"> and bulk email verification features which help generate and validate email lists on a single platform.</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">&nbsp;</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">It integrates with CRMs like Salesforce and HubSpot, which makes it easy to manage contacts and the platform offers a free plan with limited searches.</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">&nbsp;</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">Provides campaign control and link tracking features with a user-friendly interface.</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">&nbsp;</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">Offers a free plan.</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">&nbsp;</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">Provides a domain search feature to find all email addresses connected to a domain.</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">&nbsp;</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">You are notified by its job change filter, every time a prospect changes their employment role or firm.</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">&nbsp;</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">Automatically sends out job change notices and email sequences.</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">&nbsp;</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<blockquote>\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\"><strong>Who are Hunter.io alternatives?</strong></span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><br />\r\n<span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">Hunter.io is a 100% well-known email search &amp; verification platform. and If you&#39;re exploring its alternatives in the market, then there are some good options on internet like Go4Database, Lusha, Apollo.io, Snov.io, UpLead, ZoomInfo and RocketReach. They all offer similar features&mdash;like email search, lead generation and emails leads verification. But every company has its own USPs and pricing plan. but every company has their own fiment as per customer&#39;s expectations.</span></span></span></p>\r\n</blockquote>\r\n\r\n<p><br />\r\n&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<h2><span style=\"font-size:24pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#434343\">While Hunter.io simplifies email prospecting, there are a few limitations such as:</span></span></span></h2>\r\n\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li style=\"list-style-type:disc\"><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">Face difficulty in finding emails even if they are available online elsewhere</span></span></span></li>\r\n	<li style=\"list-style-type:disc\"><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">Providing fewer contact information</span></span></span></li>\r\n	<li style=\"list-style-type:disc\"><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">Lack of accuracy in data</span></span></span></li>\r\n	<li style=\"list-style-type:disc\"><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">Providing emails with business domain addresses only.</span></span></span></li>\r\n	<li style=\"list-style-type:disc\"><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">Limited searches are available in Hunter.i