l,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">Surprisingly, many users find that ZoomInfo pricing is very complicated. That said, ZoomInfo pricing depends on factors like several users, credits, and extra add-ons you have chosen according to your business needs.</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><br />\r\n<span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\"><em>Are you looking for a platform with simple, budget-friendly pricing and global access? Why not switch to </em></span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\"><strong><em>Go4Database?</em></strong></span></span></span><br />\r\n&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<h2><span style=\"font-size:24pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#434343\">ZoomInfo Pricing Comparison From 2023 to 2025</span></span></span></h2>\r\n\r\n<p><br />\r\n<span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">To be honest, the pricing hasn&rsquo;t changed. Back then, they offered a starter plan, and then it was removed. Now, the platform provides three different tiers, such as Lite, Professional, Advanced, and Elite.</span></span></span><br />\r\n&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<h2><span style=\"font-size:24pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#434343\">Which ZoomInfo Package Fits Your Business Needs?</span></span></span></h2>\r\n\r\n<p><br />\r\n<span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">Here are the three main packages ZoomInfo offers:</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<h3>&nbsp;</h3>\r\n\r\n<div id=\"blogTLDR\">\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\"><strong>TL;DR</strong></span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">ZoomInfo provides customised packages, Sales, Marketing, Talent, Operations, DaaS, and Copilot, each addressing particular business needs from finding leads to hiring and streamlining processes. Pick one that matches your goals. For a more straightforward, cost-effective option, Go4Database delivers clever solutions with top-notch data at reduced prices.</span></span></span></p>\r\n</div>\r\n\r\n<h3><br />\r\n<span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\"><strong>Sales</strong></span></span></span></h3>\r\n\r\n<p><br />\r\n<span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">This package was previously known as SalesOS, and it is designed to help you zero in on your ideal prospect.</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><br />\r\n<span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">It allows you to </span></span></span><a href=\"https://go4database.com/b2b/sales-leads\"><span style=\"color:#0033ff\"><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\">scale your sales process</span></span></span></a><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">&nbsp;by analysing the company&rsquo;s activities and buyer intent. So, you will be laser-focused on your right prospect.</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<h3><br />\r\n<span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\"><strong>Marketing</strong></span></span></span></h3>\r\n\r\n<p><br />\r\n<span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">It was previously termed as MarketingOS, it targets leads and </span></span></span><a href=\"https://go4database.com/b2b/business-leads\"><span style=\"color:#0033ff\"><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\">converts them to buyers</span></span></span></a><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">. For this, it uses data advertising tools that enable the ads to reach the target audience across multiple channels.</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<h3><br />\r\n<span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\"><strong>Talent</strong></span></span></span></h3>\r\n\r\n<p><br />\r\n<span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">It was previously termed TalentOS. </span></span></span><a href=\"https://go4database.com/b2c/it-recuiter-mailing-list\"><span style=\"color:#0033ff\"><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\">it is for recruiters</span></span></span></a><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\"> </span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">to find talent quickly for the job role in the company. This package comprises advanced filters and candidate insights, allowing HR to meet their target hiring like a breeze.</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<div id=\"BigCTA\" style=\"background:#e7fde7; border:1px solid #6fd943; padding:20px 50px\">\r\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://go4database.com/assets/uploads/media-uploader/yellow-and-blue-bold-marketing-agency-with-hexagon-frame-linkedin-banner-1-removebg-preview1734171422.png\" style=\"height:50px; width:200px\" /></p>\r\n\r\n<h4 style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:24pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\">Looking for an all-in-one prospecting for less hassle?</span></span></span></h4>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p styl