(85, 'Top 10 Saleshandy Alternatives with Better Features!', '<p style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">Saleshandy is one of the best B2B lead finders that helps the client automate and scale personalized cold emails with 95% data accuracy.</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">&nbsp;</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">You can effectively scale your cold email campaigns for </span><a href=\"https://www.go4database.com/blog/b2b-lead-generation\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#1155cc\">lead generation</span></a><span style=\"color:#666666\"> with Saleshandy.</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">&nbsp;</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">Saleshandy has an agency function that adds and manages unlimited clients, and teams and uses white labeling and bulk import for efficient client management.</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">&nbsp;</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">On a single platform, you may obtain automated cold email sequences, sender rotation, unified inbox, lead finder, email personalization, webhooks, sequence score, and many more features.</span></span></span></p>\r\