=\"color:#666666\">&nbsp;</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">Exact Data worked to build and enhance our consumer and business databases.</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">&nbsp;</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">A thorough data hygiene procedure is regularly applied to its extensive databases to ensure that all selections, new movers and new addresses are correct and updated.</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">&nbsp;</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">Exact Data offers the industry&rsquo;s most comprehensive set of data-driven marketing solutions for the SMB market.</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">&nbsp;</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">Providing an approximate 95% deliverability rate makes it a great choice in the email outreach tools segment.</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">&nbsp;</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">Due to its well-known affordability, small and medium-sized organizations can now use Exact Data.</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">&nbsp;</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<h4 style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:18pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#434343\">Drawbacks of Exact Data</span></span></span></h4>\r\n\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li style=\"list-style-type:disc\"><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">Data Quality Concerns</span></span></span></li>\r\n	<li style=\"list-style-type:disc\"><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">Data Security</span></span></span></li>\r\n	<li style=\"list-style-type:disc\"><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">The data that Exact Data provides may not always be up-to-date according to certain users&#39; reports.</span></span></span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">&nbsp;</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<h3 style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:20pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#434343\">4. LeadIQ</span></span></span></h3>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">&nbsp;</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">LeadIQ is a B2B lead generation platform that uses automation and helps in finding and engaging the right contacts at the right time.</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">&nbsp;</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">LeadIQ uses automation to find client details.</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">&nbsp;</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">LeadIQ integrates with CRMs such as Salesforce and it works next to LinkedIn Sales Navigator to enable sales teams to find prospect data.</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">&nbsp;</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">LeadIQ makes it possible to interact with new clients without handling several tools and sync data to their CRM.</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">&nbsp;</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">Offers features such as personalized cold outreach messages, a user-friendly interface and contacts and sales trigger tracking- which makes it part of the leading email outreach tools.</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">&nbsp;</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">As the LeadIQ package has a limit on the amount of mobile numbers, it might not be suitable for heavy dialers.</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">&nbsp;</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">Offers Chrome extension for <strong>email finding tools</strong> prospects faster, making it a trusted tool like Saleshandy.</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"text-align:justify\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<blockquote>\r\n<p style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"color:#666666\"><strong>Also Read:</strong></span></span><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"color:#666666\"> </span><a href=\"https://go4database.com/blog/email-finder-tools\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#1155cc\">8 Powerful Email Finder Tools: Tested, Reviewed &amp; Compared</span></a></span></span></p>\r\n</blockquote>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">&nbsp;</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<h4 style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:18pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#434343\">Drawbacks of LeadIQ</span></span></span></h4>\r\n\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li style=\"list-style-type:disc\"><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">Inaccuracy in data.</span></span></span></li>\r\n	<li style=\"list-style-type:disc\"><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">Limited customization options.</span></span></span></li>\r\n	<li style=\"list-style-type:disc\"><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">Outdated contacts.</span></span></span></li>\r\n	<li style=\"list-style-type:disc\"><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">Sometimes incorrect numbers.</span></span></span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">&nbsp;</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">Despite having these drawbacks, LeadIQ remains a trusted user-friendly platform.</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">&nbsp;</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<h3 style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:20pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#434343\">5. Cognism</span></span></span></h3>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">&nbsp;</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">Cognism is one of the smart alternatives to Saleshandy when it comes to direct dials.</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">&nbsp;</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">A reliable </span><a href=\"https://go4database.com/blog/b2b-data-providers\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#1155cc\">B2B data providers</span></a><span style=\"color:#666666\"> that leverages advanced filters to refine the search by industry, revenue, location, etc.</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">&nbsp;</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">Focuses on Data privacy.</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">&nbsp;</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">This platform focuses on providing more comprehensive prospect details.</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">&nbsp;</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">By using human verification which it labels as Diamond Data for its users, Cognism ensures the highest level of data accuracy.</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">&nbsp;</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">Cognism offers customized pricing plans based on your requirements.</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">&nbsp;</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">Cognism uses its AI-driven insights and saves time when integrating it into the workflow.</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">&nbsp;</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">It integrates with CRM such as Salesforce and HubSpot for smooth workflow- a core element in any email tracking software.</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">&nbsp;</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">Cognism offers dedicated customer support.</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">&nbsp;</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">One of Cognism&#39;s advantages is that it adds business intelligence to prospecting, which helps you create a list of leads who are already interested in purchasing your goods and/or services.</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">&nbsp;</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">Cognism provides a user-friendly interface such as a simple dashboard, intuitive </span><a href=\"https://www.go4database.com/blog/sales-leads\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#1155cc\">sales lead</span></a><span style=\"color:#666666\"> search and filtering, one-click prospect enrichment, and customizable reports.</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">&nbsp;</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<h4 style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:18pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#434343\">Drawbacks of Cognism</span></span></span></h4>\r\n\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li style=\"list-style-type:disc\"><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">Bugs in the CRM integration.</span></span></span></li>\r\n	<li style=\"list-style-type:disc\"><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">Less transparent pricing strategies.</span></span></span></li>\r\n	<li style=\"list-style-type:disc\"><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">Limited regional reach.</span></span></span></li>\r\n	<li style=\"list-style-type:disc\"><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">Might be too expensive for startups, solopreneurs, or SMBs.</span></span></span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-famil