67852141 or by using official email address </span></span></span><a href=\"mailto:info@go4database.com\" style=\"text-decoration:none\"><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#1155cc\"><u>info@go4database.com</u></span></span></span></a></p>\r\n\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<h2><span style=\"font-size:20pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#434343\">FAQs:</span></span></span></h2>\r\n\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<h3 style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:20pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#434343\">1. Who should use Go4Database instead of Saleshandy?</span></span></span></h3>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">&nbsp;</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">Go4database is best for users who want to purchase and own their data, manage outreach independently, or need flexibility without being tied to a platform subscription. It&rsquo;s particularly suitable for small businesses, solo professionals, or agencies running custom campaigns.</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">&nbsp;</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<h3 style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:20pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#434343\">2. What are the main benefits of Go4Database over Saleshandy alternatives?</span></span></span></h3>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">&nbsp;</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">Direct access to a wide variety of industry-specific and regional </span><a href=\"https://go4database.com/b2b/us-business-email-list\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#1155cc\">business email list</span></a><span style=\"color:#666666\">.</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">No recurring fees or subscription lock-in.</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">Full control over how and when you use the data.</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">Suitable for both short-term and long-term prospecting needs.</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">&nbsp;</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<h3 style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:20pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#434343\">3. How does Go4Database&rsquo;s pricing compare to Saleshandy?</span></span></span></h3>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">&nbsp;</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">Go4database offers straightforward, one-time payments for each list, making it cost-effective for targeted campaigns. In contrast, Saleshandy and its main alternatives typically use monthly or annual subscription models, which can be more expensive if you only need data occasionally.</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>', '780', 'Top 10 Saleshandy Alternatives & Competitors (2025)', 'Discover the top 10 Saleshandy alternatives with better features, pricing, and performance to boost your sales outreach in 2025.', '<script type=\"application/ld+json\">\r\n{\r\n  \"@context\": \"https://schema.org\",\r\n  \"@type\": \"Organization\",\r\n  \"name\": \"Go4Database\",\r\n  \"url\": \"https://www.go4database.com/\",\r\n  \"logo\": \"https://go4database.com/assets/uploads/media-uploader/go4database-logo1751528079.png\",\r\n  \"contactPoint\": {\r\n    \"@type\": \"ContactPoint\",\r\n    \"telephone\": \"+ 1 786 785 2141\",\r\n    \"contactType\": \"customer service\",\r\n    \"areaServed\": \"US\",\r\n    \"availableLanguage\": \"en\"\r\n  },\r\n  \"sameAs\": [\r\n    \"https://www.facebook.com/Go4Database\",\r\n    \"https://twitter.com/DatabaseGo4\",\r\n    \"https://www.instagram.com/go4database/\",\r\n    \"https://www.youtube.com/@Go4Database\",\r\n    \"https://www.linkedin.com/company/go4database/\",\r\n    \"https://in.pinterest.com/gofourdatabase/\"\r\n  ]\r\n}\r\n</script>\r\n\r\n\r\n<script type=\"application/ld+json\">\r\n{\r\n  \"@context\": \"https://schema.org\",\r\n  \"@type\": \"BlogPosting\",\r\n  \"mainEntityOfPage\": {\r\n    \"@type\": \"WebPage\",\r\n    \"@id\": \"https://www.go4database.com/blog/saleshandy-alternatives\"\r\n  },\r\n  \"headline\": \"Top 10 Saleshandy Alternatives with Better Features!\",\r\n  \"description\": \"Saleshandy is one of the best B2B lead finders that helps the client automate and scale personalized cold emails with 95% data accuracy.\r\n\r\n \r\n\r\nYou can effectively scale your cold email campaigns for lead generation with Saleshandy.\",\r\n  \"image\": \"https://www.go4database.com/assets/uploads/media-uploader/saleshandy-alternatives-go4database1753247430.webp\",  \r\n  \"author\": {\r\n    \"@type\": \"Person\",\r\n    \"name\": \"Deepa Tyagi\"