(87, 'ZoomInfo Reviews: Is It the Best Tool to Buy Verified Email Lists in 2025?', '<p><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">It is very challenging for any sales and marketing team to scale their outreach game and stand out in the buzzing market.&nbsp;</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><br />\r\n<span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">So, it is very crucial to choose the </span></span></span><a href=\"https://www.go4database.com/blog/mailing-list\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#0033ff\"><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\">right mailing list</span></span></span></a><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\"> </span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">from an accurate and trustworthy platform that will help you to connect with your ideal customer easily.</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><br />\r\n<span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">That&rsquo;s where top email list providers like ZoomInfo come in. They claim to provide verified email lists and real-time contact database enrichment to boost targeted outreach and streamline workflow.</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><br />\r\n<span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">Now, you must be wondering if ZoomInfo is reliable.</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><br />\r\n<span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">If you take a closer look, </span></span></span><a href=\"https://go4database.com/blog/what-is-zoominfo\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#0033ff\"><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\">ZoomInfo</span></span></span></a><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\"><strong>&nbsp;</strong></span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">is a key player in the email marketing space. It&#39;s known for accuracy, speed, and helping businesses grow faster.&nbsp;</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><br />\r\n<span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">It is ideal for businesses looking for precision, speed, and growth.&nbsp;</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><br />\r\n<span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">Let&rsquo;s dive deep and discover whether ZoomInfo is truly legit and what are its reviews.</span></span></span><br />\r\n&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<h2><span style=\"font-size:24pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#434343\">Is ZoomInfo Legit?</span></span></span></h2>\r\n\r\n<p><br />\r\n<span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">ZoomInfo is a prominent sales intelligence tool that is a publicly traded company enables sales, marketing, and recruitment teams find their ideal prospects and connect with them by using tools like SalesOS and MarketingOS.</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><br />\r\n<span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">The company was founded in 2007 by Henry Schuck and named </span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\"><strong>DiscoverOrg.</strong></span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\"> Later in 2019, the company was acquired and rebranded its name as ZoomInfo.&nbsp;</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><br />\r\n<span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">In 2020, ZoomInfo went public. They have put tremendous efforts into </span></span></span><a href=\"https://www.go4database.com/blog/buy-email-list\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#0033ff\"><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\">staying compliant</span></span></span></a><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\"><strong>&nbsp;</strong></span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">with data regulations like GDPR and CCPA.</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><br />\r\n<span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">While they are pretty transparent about sourcing their data and </span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><a href=\"https://go4database.com/email-verifier\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#0033ff\">verified email database</span></a><span style=\"color:#666666\"><strong>.</strong></span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><br />\r\n<span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">Despite this, many people raise concerns about their data quality.</span></span></span><br />\r\n&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<h2><span style=\"font-size:24pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#434343\">Overview of ZoomInfo B2B Intelligent Platform</span></span></span></h2>\r\n\r\n<p><br />\r\n<span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">The interesting thing about ZoomInfo is that you can get access to an extensive database ranging over 321 million business contacts.</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><br />\r\n<span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">As a result, it provides huge access to the company database, especially for sales, marketing, and recruitment teams.</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><br />\r\n<span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">In turn, businesses can push pipeline generation and close more deals.</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><br />\r\n<span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">Although it is a good tool, there are some pros and cons tied to it.&nbsp;</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><br />\r\n<span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">What&#39;s great? It helps to</span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\"><strong> </strong></span><a href=\"https://www.go4database.com/blog/lead-generation-guide\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#0033ff\">scale lead generation</span></a><span style=\"color:#666666\"><strong>,</strong></span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">&nbsp;smart targeting through intent data, and easy CRM integration.</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><br />\r\n<span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">What&#39;s the drawback? Many users find pricing very complex; setup can be tricky, and UX learning curves cause friction.</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><br />\r\n<span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">On top of that, some users have reported outdated data and expensive prices for add-ons.</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><br />\r\n<span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">On the flip side, there are some users who claim ZoomInfo&rsquo;s in-depth data with smart targeting options through intent data enables boosting productivity and drive </span><a href=\"https://www.go4database.com/blog/sales-leads\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#0033ff\">sales leads</span></a><span style=\"color:#666666\">.</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><br />\r\n<span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">To sum up, I feel the prices of ZoomInfo are indeed heavier on the pockets of small businesses. But it can be a great choice for companies with huge budgets and looking for extensive </span></span></span><a href=\"https://go4database.com/blog/go4database-vs-lusha\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#0033ff\"><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\">verified B2B contacts</span></span></span></a><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">.</span></span></span><br />\r\n&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<h2><span style=\"font-size:24pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#434343\">How does ZoomInfo Get its Data?</span></span></span></h2>\r\n\r\n<p><br />\r\n<span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">Have you ever wondered how ZoomInfo gets this data?</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><br />\r\n<span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">Well, the system scans over 28+ million websites daily, fetching details from press releases, news mentions, job listings, and more.</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><br />\r\n<span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">It further combines with users sharing their emails (with permission) and signatures. They follow data privacy rules to drive personal emails.</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><br />\r\n<span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">Apart from this, they pull in official data such as government filings and licensed data sets around public companies, mergers, and acquisitions.</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><br />\r\n<span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">After gathering all the data, the ZoomInfo research team fine-tunes the data and makes it clean and reliable.</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><br />\r\n<span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">Finally, it is churned into a huge refreshed data set of over 321 million and 14+ million companies.&nbsp;</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><br />\r\n<span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">Hence, this is how you will get the most accurate data from </span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><a href=\"https://www.zoominfo.com/\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#0033ff\">ZoomInfo</span></a><span style=\"color:#666666\"><strong>. </strong></span></span></span><br />\r\n<span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\"><strong>&nbsp;</strong></span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<div id=\"BigCTA\" style=\"background:#e7fde7; border:1px solid #6fd943; padding:20px 50px\">\r\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://go4database.com/assets/uploads/media-uploader/yellow-and-blue-bold-marketing-agency-with-hexagon-frame-linkedin-banner-1-removebg-preview1734171422.png\" style=\"height:50px; width:200px\" /></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><strong><span style=\"