les intelligence, allowing companies to track the latest developments and identify high-intent leads.&nbsp;</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://www.go4database.com/assets/uploads/media-uploader/lead4111753375180.webp\" style=\"height:349px; width:800px\" /></p>\r\n\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">With options for lead scoring and CRM integration, Lead411 ensures your sales efforts are as targeted as possible.</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<h3><span style=\"font-size:20pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#434343\">7. Cognism</span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">&nbsp;</span></span></span></h3>\r\n\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><a href=\"https://www.cognism.com/\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#0033ff\">Cognism</span></a><span style=\"color:#666666\"> gives you lead data that&rsquo;s ready to use and follows all the rules.&nbsp;&nbsp;</span></span></span><br />\r\n&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">Cognism gives you verified business emails and accurate phone numbers to connect with the right people.&nbsp;</span></span></span><br />\r\n&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">It works well with big CRM and sales tools like Salesforce and HubSpot.&nbsp;</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://www.go4database.com/assets/uploads/media-uploader/cognism1753348599.webp\" style=\"height:350px; width:800px\" /></p>\r\n\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\