access to </span></span></span><a href=\"https://www.go4database.com/blog/business-mailing-list\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#0000ff\"><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\">business and consumer contact lists</span></span></span></a><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\"> </span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">you can download and use right away, no waiting around.</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><br />\r\n<span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">Whether you&rsquo;re just starting out or working with a lean team, it helps you find real people to reach out to, without draining your budget.</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><br />\r\n<span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">And if you need help, there&rsquo;s always someone to talk to, by phone, chat, or email.</span></span></span><br />\r\n&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<div id=\"blogTLDR\">\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\"><strong>TL;DR</strong><br />\r\nGo4Database is a cost-effective platform for lead generation. It gives you verified B2B and B2C contacts, makes downloads easy, and offers solid support. This tool works great for new businesses and small groups who need genuine correct data. You don&#39;t have to sign long contracts, which makes it a good choice instead of more expensive options like Cognism.&nbsp;</span></span></span></p>\r\n</div>\r\n\r\n<h3><span style=\"font-size:20pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#434343\">How is Go4Database better than Cognism?</span></span></span></h3>\r\n\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li style=\"list-style-type:disc\"><span style=\"font-