cial channels. The goal is to share valuable content with your target audience, so as to position you as a thought leader in the industry.</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">In turn, this builds a community of professionals who like and follow your brand. Some will become customers and even more may turn into brand advocates. And like who doesn&rsquo;t want that?</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<h3><span style=\"font-size:20pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#434343\">3. Gather More Customer Reviews</span></span></span></h3>\r\n\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">Social proof is everything when it comes to convincing prospects to convert into customers. And there&rsquo;s no better form of it than a review from a past client.</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">But you don&rsquo;t always get these automatically (even when your product or service is excellent). So it pays (literally) to ask your customers for testimonials and reviews.</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">You can then use this within your marketing collateral, such as your website, emails, videos, social media posts, and infographics.</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<h3><span style=\"font-size:20pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#434343\">4. Boost Your Revenue</span></span></span></h3>\r\n\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">When done correctly, marketing lead generation can maximize your brand&rsquo;s ability for reaching target prospects. This requires using the right messaging, offer, and content to generate interest from these specific groups.</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">In doing so, you&rsquo;ll find it easier to capture the attention of qualified leads, which makes it easier for sales to convert them.&nbsp;</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">The revenue growth potential is great, especially when you&rsquo;re focusing on interests and pain points your audience cares about.</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<h3><span style=\"font-size:20pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#434343\">5. Generate Business Opportunities</span></span></span></h3>\r\n\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">Lead generation doesn&rsquo;t only help with finding prospects. It can also present business opportunities. Maybe a non-competing brand in your industry reaches out to host a webinar together. And by teaming up, you gain access to their audience (and vice versa).</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">It&rsquo;s a mutually beneficial partnership that can lead to well&hellip;more leads.</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<h3><span style=\"font-size:20pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#434343\">6. Improve Lead Quality</span></span></span></h3>\r\n\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">Creating content and dumping it onto the web can get you traffic. Maybe even a ton of it. But if your visitors aren&rsquo;t converting into leads, then it&rsquo;s a wasted effort.</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">With lead generation, you&rsquo;re taking a highly <strong>targeted email list</strong> approach to content creation. Everything you write for your brand from the website and email copy to social media and blog posts needs to cater to these specific groups.</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<blockquote>\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\"><strong>Also Read:</strong> </span><a href=\"https://go4database.com/blog/targeted-email-list\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#1155cc\">Go4database Buying Guide: Choose a Targeted Email List That Works for You</span></a></span></span></p>\r\n</blockquote>\r\n\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">This makes it easier to create topics and messages that resonate with each audience. And by doing this, you&rsquo;ll improve the quality of your leads, which improves conversions and sales.</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<h3><span style=\"font-size:20pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#434343\">7. Build Visibility and Awareness</span></span></span></h3>\r\n\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">Companies that invest in marketing lead generation often see higher ROI in the long run.&nbsp;</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\">