(116, 'Lusha Pricing 2025: Features, Plans, and What You Get', '<p><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">Thinking about what Lusha might set you back in 2025? You&rsquo;re definitely not alone.</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">With so many sales tools promising </span></span></span><a href=\"https://go4database.com/blog/go4database-vs-lusha\" style=\"text-decoration:none\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#1155cc\">accurate contact info</span></span></span></a><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">, it&rsquo;s tough to figure out which ones are worth it, especially when pricing changes all the time.</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">Lusha has a good reputation for finding direct dials and emails fast, which can seriously cut down on prospecting headaches.</span></span></span><br />\r\n&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">But before you jump in, it helps to see exactly what each plan covers, what those credits mean in real-world terms, and whether the price makes sense for your business.</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">We&rsquo;ll walk through it all, plus look at Go4Database if you&rsquo;d rather avoid monthly subscriptions.</span></span></span><br />\r\n<br />\r\n&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<h2><span style=\"font-size:24pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#434343\">Table of Contents Of Lusha Pricing 2025</span></span></span></h2>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-left:48px\"><br />\r\n<span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#1155cc\">1. </span><a href=\"https://www.go4database.com/blog/lusha-pricing#overview-of-lushas-pricing\"><span style=\"color:#1155cc\">Overview of lusha pricing.</span></a></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-left:48px\"><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#1155cc\">2. </span><a href=\"https://www.go4database.com/blog/lusha-pricing#lusha-free-trial-what-does-it-include\"><span style=\"color:#1155cc\">Lusha free trail: what does it includes</span></a></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-left:48px\"><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#1155cc\">3. </span><a href=\"https://www.go4database.com/blog/lusha-pricing#what-is-lushas-monthly-cost\"><span style=\"color:#1155cc\">What is lusha&rsquo;s&nbsp; monthly cost?</span></a></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-left:48px\"><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#1155cc\">4. </span><a href=\"https://www.go4database.com/blog/lusha-pricing#what-is-lushas-monthly-cost\"><span style=\"color:#1155cc\">Quick Comparison Table of Go4Database And Lusha Pricing And Features.</span></a></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-left:48px\"><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#1155cc\">5. </span><a href=\"https://www.go4database.com/blog/lusha-pricing#lusha-pricing-plans-features-and-who-they-fit\"><span style=\"color:#1155cc\">Lusha Pricing Plans: Features And Who They Fit?</span></a></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-left:48px\"><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#1155cc\">6. </span><a href=\"https://www.go4database.com/blog/lusha-pricing#what-are-you-paying-for\"><span style=\"color:#1155cc\">What Are You Paying For?</span></a></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-left:48px\"><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#1155cc\">7.</span><a href=\"https://www.go4database.com/blog/lusha-pricing#is-lusha-worth-the-money\"><span style=\"color:#1155cc\"> Is Lusha Worth the Money?</span></a></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-left:48px\"><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#1155cc\">8. </span><a href=\"https://www.go4database.com/blog/lusha-pricing#tips-to-get-the-most-from-lusha\"><span style=\"color:#1155cc\">Tips to Get the Most from Lusha</span></a></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-left:48px\"><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#1155cc\">9. </span><a href=\"https://www.go4database.com/blog/lusha-pricing#conclusion\"><span style=\"color:#1155cc\">conclusion</span></a></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-left:48px\"><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#1155cc\">10. </span><a href=\"https://www.go4database.com/blog/lusha-pricing#faqs\"><span style=\"color:#1155cc\">Fa&amp;Q</span></a></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<h2><span style=\"font-size:24pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#434343\">Overview of Lusha&rsquo;s Pricing</span></span></span></h2>\r\n\r\n<p><br />\r\n<span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">Lusha keeps things simple with four plans: Free, Essentials, Pro, and Enterprise. You buy credits, which let you unlock </span></span></span><a href=\"https://go4database.com/blog/buy-email-list\" style=\"text-decoration:none\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#1155cc\">email addresses</span></span></span></a><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\"><strong> </strong></span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">or phone numbers.</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">You can pay each month or pay once a year for a discount, usually about 20&ndash;30% off compared to monthly billing.</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">If you&rsquo;re running outreach every day, a subscription makes sense. But if you only need a list now and then, you might be better off with something like Go4Database, where you can just buy a single&nbsp;</span></span></span><a href=\"https://go4database.com/blog/b2b-mailing-list\" style=\"text-decoration:none\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#1155cc\">targeted mailing list</span></span></span><span style=\"color:#1155cc\"> </span></a><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">when you need it, no ongoing payments.</span></span></span><br />\r\n<span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">&nbsp;</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<h2><span style=\"font-size:24pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#434343\">Lusha Free Trial: What Does it Include?</span></span></span></h2>\r\n\r\n<p><br />\r\n<span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">Yup! A free plan with about five credits per month is available from Lusha.</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">It is more of a &quot;starter&quot; package that allows you to assess the quality of their data before committing, rather than a conventional timed trial.</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">That&#39;s a good way to gauge match rates and accuracy without using your credit card.&nbsp;</span></span></span><br />\r\n&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<blockquote>\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\"><strong>Also read:</strong> </span></span></span><a href=\"https://go4database.com/blog/zoominfo-pricing\" style=\"text-decoration:none\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#1155cc\">ZoomInfo Pricing Breakdown (2025): Everything You Need To Know Before Buying</span></span></span></a></p>\r\n</blockquote>\r\n\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<h2><span style=\"font-size:24pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#434343\">What is Lusha&#39;s Monthly Cost?</span></span></span></h2>\r\n\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<div id=\"blogTLDR\">\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\"><strong>TL;DR</strong></span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">Lusha plans start free, then range from $49 to $79 per user monthly, with Enterprise custom rates. Costs scale by credits and features. If you need one-time lists, Go4Database avoids recurring fees.</span></span></span></p>\r\n</div>\r\n\r\n<p><br />\r\n<span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">Here&rsquo;s what you&rsquo;ll pay if you go with monthly pricing (annual billing brings a lowe