(117, 'Hunter Pricing: Everything You Need to Know Before Buying', '<p><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">If you&rsquo;re trying to get your cold outreach right, you&rsquo;ve probably heard of Hunter.io. It&rsquo;s one of the go-to tools for finding and verifying </span></span></span><a href=\"https://go4database.com/blog/apollo-vs.-zoominfo\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#1155cc\">business emails</span></span></span></a><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\"><a href=\"https://go4database.com/blog/apollo-vs.-zoominfo\" target=\"_blank\">.</a> But before you swipe your card, it&rsquo;s smart to look at </span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\"><strong>Hunter pricing</strong></span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\"> in detail so you know exactly what you&rsquo;re paying for, and don&rsquo;t waste money on the wrong plan.</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">I will walk you through it so you can pick w</span></span></span><a href=\"javascript:void(0)\" tabindex=\"-1\" title=\"Close\">X</a><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">hat actually works for you.</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<h2><span style=\"font-size:24pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#434343\">Table of contents of Hunter Pricing</span></span></span></h2>\r\n\r\n<p><br />\r\n<a href=\"https://www.go4database.com/blog/hunter-pricing#hunter-pricing-overview\"><span style=\"color:#1155cc\"><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\">1. Hunter Pricing Overview&nbsp;</span></span></span></a></p>\r\n\r\n<p><a href=\"https://www.go4database.com/blog/hunter-pricing#how-much-does-hunterio-cost\"><span style=\"color:#1155cc\"><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\">2. How Much Does Hunter.io Cost ?</span></span></span></a></p>\r\n\r\n<p><a href=\"https://www.go4database.com/blog/hunter-pricing#enterprise-personalized-prices\"><span style=\"color:#1155cc\"><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\">3. Enterprise (personalized prices)</span></span></span></a></p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"color:#1155cc\"><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\">4. What is Hunter.io API Pricing?</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><a href=\"https://www.go4database.com/blog/hunter-pricing#quick-hunter-plan-cheat-sheet\"><span style=\"color:#1155cc\"><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\">5. Quick Hunter Plan Cheat Sheet</span></span></span></a></p>\r\n\r\n<p><a href=\"https://www.go4database.com/blog/hunter-pricing#why-flexible-credits\"><span style=\"color:#1155cc\"><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\">6. Why Flexible Credits ?</span></span></span></a></p>\r\n\r\n<p><a href=\"https://www.go4database.com/blog/hunter-pricing#free-plan-limitations\"><span style=\"color:#1155cc\"><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\">7. Free Plan Limitations</span></span></span></a></p>\r\n\r\n<p><a href=\"https://www.go4database.com/blog/hunter-pricing#enterprise-and-custom-setups\"><span style=\"color:#1155cc\"><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\">8. Enterprise and custom setups</span></span></span></a></p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><a href=\"https://www.go4database.com/blog/hunter-pricing#conclusion\"><span style=\"color:#1155cc\">9. Conclusion</span></a><span style=\"color:#1155cc\">&nbsp;</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><a href=\"https://www.go4database.com/blog/hunter-pricing#faqs\"><span style=\"color:#1155cc\"><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\">10. Fa&amp;Qs</span></span></span></a></p>\r\n\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<h2><span style=\"font-size:24pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#434343\">Hunter Pricing Overview</span></span></span></h2>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">Hunter keeps pricing simple, with options for everyone from solo freelancers to big sales teams:</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li style=\"list-style-type:disc\"><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\"><strong>Free Plan</strong></span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\"> &mdash; 25 searches and 50 verifications per month</span></span></span></li>\r\n	<li style=\"list-style-type:disc\"><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\"><strong>Starter</strong></span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\"> &mdash; $49/month (or $34/month if billed yearly)</span></span></span></li>\r\n	<li style=\"list-style-type:disc\"><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\"><strong>Growth</strong></span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\"> &mdash; $149/month (or $104/yearly)</span></span></span></li>\r\n	<li style=\"list-style-type:disc\"><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\"><strong>Scale</strong></span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\"> &mdash; $299/month (or $209/yearly)</span></span></span></li>\r\n	<li style=\"list-style-type:disc\"><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\"><strong>Enterprise</strong></span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\"> &mdash; custom pricing depending on your team&rsquo;s needs</span></span></span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">Paying yearly gives you around 30% off, which helps if you&rsquo;re running outreach all year.&nbsp;</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">Additionally, you receive all of your credits for the entire year up front if you select an annual plan, which is ideal if you run campaigns in spurts rather than monthly.</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<blockquote>\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">&nbsp;</span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\"><strong>Also read</strong></span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">:</span></span></span><a href=\"https://go4database.com/blog/rocketreach-vs-zoominfo\" style=\"text-decoration:none\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#1155cc\"> Rocketreach vs Zoominfo: Which one is the best in 2025?&nbsp;</span></span></span></a></p>\r\n</blockquote>\r\n\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<h2><span style=\"font-size:24pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#434343\">How Much Does Hunter.io Cost ?</span></span></span></h2>\r\n\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<div id=\"blogTLDR\">\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\"><strong>TL;DR</strong></span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">Hunter.io offers plans that start at no cost and go up to $299 each month, with choices for solo workers to large sales groups. You can use credits , and the API comes with it. If you&#39;re looking for a more straightforward single purchase of data, you might want to look into Go4Database.</span></span></span></p>\r\n</div>\r\n\r\n<p><br />\r\n<span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">Let&#39;s simplify this and discuss what each plan offers, how much it costs, and who each plan is meant for:</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<h3><span style=\"font-size:20pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#434343\">Free plan</span></span></span></h3>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li style=\"list-style-type:disc\"><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">$0/month</span></span></span></li>\r\n	<li style=\"list-style-type:disc\"><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">50 verifications and 25 searches</span></span></span></li>\r\n	<li style=\"list-style-type:disc\"><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">500 contacts per campaign with one email account</span></span></span></li>\r\n	<li style=\"list-style-type:disc\"><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial