s or multiple departments that need everything set up to match their workflow.</span></span></span><br />\r\n&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<div id=\"blogTLDR\">\r\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><br />\r\n<img alt=\"\" src=\"https://go4database.com/assets/uploads/media-uploader/go4database-logo1751528079.png\" style=\"height:51px; width:200px\" /></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><br />\r\n<strong><span style=\"font-size:20pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\">More Data, Fewer Fees</span></span></span></strong></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">Verified contacts from Go4Database with no monthly renewals.</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><br />\r\n<a href=\"https://app.go4database.com/login?utm_source=blogpage&amp;utm_medium=internal&amp;utm_campaign=app_login\" id=\"TrailBtn\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\">Explore the pricing and plans</span></span></a><br />\r\n&nbsp;</p>\r\n</div>\r\n\r\n<h2><span style=\"font-size:24pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#434343\">Benefits and Drawbacks</span></span></span></h2>\r\n\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<h3><span style=\"font-size:20pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#434343\">What&#39;s good?</span></span></span></h3>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li style=\"list-style-type:disc\"><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">No unstated costs</span></span></span></li>\r\n	<li style=\"list-style-type:disc\"><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">Annual credits are available up front.</span></span></span></li>\r\n	<li style=\"list-style-type:disc\"><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">Included is real-time verified data API access.</span></span></span></li>\r\n	<li style=\"list-style-type:disc\"><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">Connecting to CRMs is simple.</span></span></span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<h3><span style=\"font-size:20pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#434343\">What should I consider?</span></span></span></h3>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">For small budgets, starter pricing may seem excessive.</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">With large sends, credits can quickly run out.</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">Go4Database may be more appealing to one-time data buyers.</span></span></span><br />\r\n<br />\r\n&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<blockquote>\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\"><strong>Also read:</strong></span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\"> </span></span></span><a href=\"https://go4database.com/blog/zoominfo-reviews\" style=\"text-decoration:none\"><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#1155cc\">ZoomInfo Reviews: Is It the Best Tool to Buy Verified Email Lists in 2025?&nbsp;</span></span></span></a></p>\r\n</blockquote>\r\n\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<h2><span style=\"font-size:24pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#434343\">Conclusion</span></span></span></h2>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">Hunter pricing is reasonable for what you get, reliable, validated data and a seamless system that expands with you. It&#39;s a wise choice if you&#39;re looking for something dependable and easy to use for long-term outreach.</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">Additionally, Go4Database offers reasonably priced data lists to help you launch your next campaign quickly if you&#39;d prefer to get a large, </span></span></span><a href=\"https://go4database.com/blog/mailing-list\" style=\"text-decoration:none\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#1155cc\">b2b email list </span></span></span></a><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">and get going right away. You can choose what best suits your prospecting style by looking at their pricing here.</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">&nbsp;</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<h2><span style=\"font-size:24pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#434343\">FAQs</span></span></span></h2>\r\n\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<h3><span style=\"font-size:20pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#434343\">Q1. How much does Hunter.io cost?</span></span></span></h3>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">Plans range from free to $299/month, with custom enterprise options.</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">&nbsp;</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<h3><span style=\"font-size:20pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#434343\">Q2. What is included in Hunter.io&rsquo;s free plan?</span></span></span></h3>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">&nbsp;25 searches, 50 verifications, and basic campaign tools.</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">&nbsp;</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<h3><span style=\"font-size:20pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#434343\">Q3. Does Hunter.io charge extra for API access?</span></span></span></h3>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">No, the API is included with every plan.</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">&nbsp;</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<h3><span style=\"font-size:20pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#434343\">Q4. How does Go4Database pricing differ from </span></span></span><a href=\"http://hunter.io\" style=\"text-decoration:none\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"font-size:20pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#1155cc\">Hunter.io</span></span></span></a><span style=\"font-size:20pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#434343\">?</span></span></span></h3>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">&nbsp;Go4Database offers one-time data purchases instead of monthly subscriptions.</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>', '1034', 'Hunter Pricing Guide: Key Details Before You Buy', 'discover Hunter Pricing: key details, costs, and tips to make an informed purchase decision before buying. Get all you need to know today!', '<script type=\"application/ld+json\">\r\n{\r\n  \"@context\": \"https://schema.org\",\r\n  \"@type\": \"Organization\",\r\n  \"name\": \"Go4Database\",\r\n  \"url\": \"https://www.go4database.com/\",\r\n  \"logo\": \"https://go4database.com/assets/uploads/media-uploader/go4database-logo1751528079.png\",\r\n  \"contactPoint\": {\r\n    \"@type\": \"ContactPoint\",\r\n    \"telephone\": \"+ 1 786 785 2141\",\r\n    \"contactType\": \"customer service\",\r\n    \"areaServed\": \"US\",\r\n    \"availableLanguage\": \"en\"\r\n  },\r\n  \"sameAs\": [\r\n    \"https://www.facebook.com/Go4Database\",\r\n    \"https://twitter.com/DatabaseGo4\",\r\n    \"https://www.instagram.com/go4database/\",\r\n    \"https://www.youtube.com/@Go4Database\",\r\n    \"https://www.linkedin.com/company/go4database/\",\r\n    \"https://in.pinterest.com/gofourdatabase/\"\r\n  ]\r\n}\r\n</script>\r\n<script type=\"application/ld+json\">\r\n{\r\n  \"@context\": \"https://schema.org\",\r\n  \"@type\": \"FAQPage\",\r\n  \"mainEntity\": [{\r\n    \"@type\": \"Question\",\r\n    \"name\": \"Q1. How much does Hunter.io cost?\",\r\n    \"acceptedAnswer\": {\r\n      \"@type\": \"Answer\",\r\n      \"text\": \"Plans range from free to $299/month, with custom enterprise options.\"\r\n    }\r\n  },{\r\n    \"@type\": \"Question\",\r\n    \"name\": \"Q2. What is included in Hunter.io’s free plan?\",\r\n    \"acceptedAnswer\": {\r\n      \"@type\": \"Answer\",\r\n      \"text\": \"25 searches, 50 verifications, and basic campaign tools.\"\r\n    }\r\n  },{\r\n    \"@type\": \"Question\",\r\n    \"name\": \"Q3. Does Hunter.io charge extra for API access?\",\r\n    \"acceptedAnswer\": {\r\n      \"@type\": \"Answer\",\r\n      \"text\": \"No, the API is included with every plan.\"\r\n    }\r\n  },{\r\n    \"@type\": \"Question\",\r\n    \"name\": \"Q4. How does Go4Database pricing differ from Hunter.io?\",\r\n    \"acceptedAnswer\": {\r\n      \"@type\": \"Answer\",\r\n      \"text\": \"Go4Database offers one-time data purchases instead of monthly subscriptions.\"\r\n    }\r\n  }]\r\n}\r\n</script>\r\n<script type=\"application/ld+json\">\r\n{\r\n  \"@context\": \"https://schema.org/\", \r\n  \"@type\": \"BreadcrumbList\", \r\n  \"itemListElement\": [{\r\n    \"@type\": \"ListItem\", \r\n    \"position\": 1, \r\n    \"name\": \"Hunter Pricing: Everything You Need to Know Before Buying\",\r\n    \"item\": \"https://www.go4database.com/blog/hunter-pricing\"  \r\n  },{\r\n    \"@type\": \"ListItem\", \r\n    \"position\": 2, \r\n    \"name\": \"blog\",\r\n    \"item\": \"https://www.go4database.com/blog\"  \r\n  },{\r\n    \"@type\": \"ListItem\", \r\n    \"position\": 3, \r\n    \"name\": \"home\",\r\n    \"item\": \"https://www.go4database.com/\"  \r\n  }]\r\n}\r\n</script>\r\n<script type=\"application/ld+json\">\r\n         {         \r\n            \"@context\": \"https://schema.org/\",         \r\n            \"@type\": \"WebPage\",         \r\n            \"@id\": \"#WebPage\",         \r\n            \"url\": \"https://www.go4database.com/blog/hunter-pricing\",          \r\n            \"name\": \"Hunter Pricing: Everything You Need to Know Before Buying\"\r\n          } \r\n      </script>\r\n      <script type=\"application/ld+json\">\r\n{\r\n  \"@context\": \"https://schema.org\",\r\n  \"@type\": \"BlogPosting\",\r\n  \"mainEntityOfPage\": {\r\n    \"@type\": \"WebPage\",\r\n    \"@id\": \"https://www.go4database.com/blog/hunter-pricing\"\r\n  },\r\n  \"headline\": \"Hunter Pricing: Everything You Need to Know Before Buying\",\r\n  \"description\": \"If you’re trying to get your cold outreach right, you’ve probably heard of Hunter.io. It’s one of the go-to tools for finding and verifying business emails.\",\r\n  \"image\": \"https://www.go4database.com/assets/uploads/media-uploader/agricultre-industry-mailing-list-go4database-10-11760112343.webp\",  \r\n  \"author\": {\r\n    \"@type\": \"Person\",\r\n    \"name\": \"Ashwini Bochkeri\"\r\n  },  \r\n  \"publisher\": {\r\n    \"@type\": \"Organization\",\r\n    \"name\": \"\",\r\n    \"logo\": {\r\n      \"@type\": \"ImageObject\",\r\n      \"url\": \"\"\r\n    }\r\n  },\r\n  \"datePublished\": \"2025-10-10\"\r\n}\r\n</script>', '12', 'Hunter Pricing: Everything You Need to Know Before Buying', 'hunter-pricing', 'Ashwini Bochkeri', 'publish', 'en_US', '2025-10-09', '1555', '2025-10-09 18:08:11', '2025-12-17 16:45:32', 0, NULL);
