(126, '12 Best B2B Lead Generation Companies to Drive High-Quality Lead', '<p><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">Greetings everyone! Go4database family welcomes you yet again. We all hope that you have been doing great.&nbsp;</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">&ldquo;Getting leads is the first step but converting those leads into satisfied customers is one of the most important and most challenging tasks of a business.&rdquo;&nbsp;</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">by Pooja Agnihotri, 17 Reasons Why Businesses Fail : Unscrew Yourself From business failure&nbsp; Goodreads&nbsp;</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">In this blog we will take a closer look at the 12 Best B2B Lead Generation Companies to drive high quality lead for your company too! Let&#39;s get going.</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><br />\r\n&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<h2><span style=\"font-size:24pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#434343\">12 Best B2B Lead Generation Companies</span></span></span></h2>\r\n\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">Here we have ranked these 12 </span><a href=\"https://www.go4database.com/b2b\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#1155cc\">B2B lead</span></a><span style=\"color:#666666\"> generation companies. Lets see each one in detail and compare them.&nbsp;</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li style=\"list-style-type:disc\"><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-