\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">With initial 350Mn verified records worldwide and is known in industry for Active &ndash; Specific &ndash; Effortless solution for their consumers. Go4Database itself suggests consumers that they first use it then believe it.&nbsp;</span></span></span><br />\r\n&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<h4><span style=\"font-size:18pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#434343\">Key Features of this B2B lead generation company</span></span></span></h4>\r\n\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li style=\"list-style-type:none\"><img alt=\"unchecked\" src=\"data:image/png;base64,\" style=\"height:24px; margin-right:3px; width:24px\" /><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">Extensive B2B Lead Generation Database for targeted marketing</span></span></span></li>\r\n	<li style=\"list-style-type:none\"><img alt=\"unchecked\" src=\"data:image/png;base64,\" style=\"height:24px; margin-right:3px; width:24px\" /><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">Real time data verification for high quality B2B sales leads</span></span></span></li>\r\n	<li style=\"list-style-type:none\"><img alt=\"unchecked\" src=\"data:image/png;base64,\" style=\"height:24px; margin-right:3px; width:24px\" /><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">AI driven lead generation solutions for enhanced accuracy</span></span></span></li>\r\n	<li style=\"list-style-type:none\"><img alt=\"unchecked\" src=\"data:image/png;base64,\" style=\"height:24px; margin-right:3px; width:24px\" /><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">Integration with major CRMs for easy management</span></span></span></li>\r\n	<li style=\"list-style-type:none\"><img alt=\"unchecked\" src=\"data:image/png;base64,\" s