6\">3. Effective for large enterprises.</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<h4><span style=\"font-size:18pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#434343\">Cons of Sapper Consulting</span></span></span></h4>\r\n\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-left:48px\"><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">1. Expensive for startups.</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-left:48px\"><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">2. Their approach can reportedly be hit-or-miss.</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-left:48px\"><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">3. User investment isn&rsquo;t guaranteed to pay off,</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-left:48px\"><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">4. Long onboarding process.</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">&nbsp;</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">Head of Consulting</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">Small-Business(50 or fewer emp.)</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">&quot;All results seem fictional - zero benefit for the money paid&quot;</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<h4><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">What do you like b