e=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\"><span style=\"background-color:#ffffff\">But know that when you do bulk email search, the invalid and catch-all </span></span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">emails are not discarded, so keep that in mind.</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<div id=\"blogTLDR\">\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#434343\"><strong>TL;DR:</strong></span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#434343\">Skrapp.io is a top email finder tool for 2026, offering a free Chrome &amp; LinkedIn extension. It provides 85% accuracy in finding leads, access to 150M+ profiles, and 20M+ companies worldwide. It offers 100 free credits/month but doesn&#39;t discard invalid/catch-all emails in bulk searches. Its email verifier ensures source credibility.</span></span></span></p>\r\n</div>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">Its value according to me:</span></span></span><br />\r\n<br />\r\n<span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\"><strong>Accuracy:</strong> 85% success rate in locating prospect leads.</span></span></span><br />\r\n<br />\r\n<span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\"><strong>Source Credibility-</strong> Employs a rigorous email verifier.</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\"><strong>Global reach-</strong> Access to over 150 million business profiles and more than 20 million companies worldwide</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">Free availability- 100 free email finder credits per month.</span></span></span><br />\r\n&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<h2><span style=\"font-size:24pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#434343\">Conclusion</span></span></span></h2>\r\n\r\n<p><br />\r\n<span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">This year is the moment, this year is the start of a new world of digitalisation. You better grab the opportunity. Lead generation shouldn&#39;t be a headache but an easy, peasy task.</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><br />\r\n<span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">I personally loved Go4Databse &amp; Apollo.io. Go4Datadase may be an<br />\r\n<br />\r\nunderrated tool, but come on. You know it is not good to judge someone based on popularity.</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><br />\r\n<span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">And if popularity matters to you so much, you can go ahead with Apollo.io and Saleshandy. Both are widely used when people want to learn </span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">how to find someones email</span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\"> quickly.&nbsp;</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><br />\r\n<span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">But if you know better tools, make sure to comment about them.</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><br />\r\n<span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">I wish a beautiful day to you fellas. Bye.</span></span></span></p>', NULL, 18, 'a:1: