ysis of Go4database vs. Lusha</span></span></span></h2>\r\n\r\n<p><br />\r\n<span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">Let&#39;s break down these B2B contact list tools more by their features.</span></span></span><br />\r\n&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">At first glance, Lush looks attractive, right? But when you take a closer look, you&rsquo;ll find that Go4database appears similar. Both tools promise to provide accurate data and outreach.</span></span></span><br />\r\n&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">However, to know more about them, you need to dive in and start using them; that&rsquo;s when the real differences will pop up.</span></span></span><br />\r\n&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">I know choosing the right tool is still not easy. That&rsquo;s why I&rsquo;ve simplified it into four key areas to help you decide </span><a href=\"https://www.go4database.com/blog/buy-email-list\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#3498db\">email listing platform</span></a></span></span><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">:</span></span></span><br />\r\n&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li style=\"list-style-type:disc\"><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">Database size</span></span></span></li>\r\n	<li style=\"list-style-type:disc\"><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">Data accuracy</span></span></span></li>\r\n	<li style=\"list-style-type:disc\"><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">Pricing models</span></span></span></li>\r\n	<li style=\"list-style-type:disc\"><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">Integration capabilities</span></span></span></li>\r\n	<li style=\"list-style-type:disc\"><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">Ideal user profiles</span></span></span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p><br />\r\n<span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\"><em>Let&#39;s gauge them and find out which one is perfect!</em></span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">&nbsp;</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<h2><span style=\"font-size:24pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#434343\">Database Size: Go4Database vs. Lusha for Accurate B2B Contact Lists</span></span></span></h2>\r\n\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">Go4database size is pretty impressive; it comes with a huge database size of more than 350 million verified</span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\"><strong> </strong></span><a href=\"https://www.go4database.com/b2b/professionals-mailing-list\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#3498db\">business-to-business contact lists</span></a><span style=\"color:#666666\"><strong> </strong></span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">&nbsp;spanning across 190-plus countries and more than 30 different industries.</span></span></span><br />\r\n&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">What&rsquo;s even cooler is that it offers advanced customisation options. You can sort the contacts by job titles, industries, geographic locations, company sizes, and a lot more.</span></span></span><br />\r\n&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">Besides, you have access to </span><a href=\"https://www.go4database.com/blog/buy-email-list\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#3498db\">buy email lists</span></a><span style=\"color:#666666\"> upto&nbsp;</span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">1500 contacts/month and 18000 contacts/year with real-time verified leads at the starting price.</span></span></span><br />\r\n&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">It is like the icing on a cake, especially for businesses aiming for bulk emails and targeted outreach campaigns. Moreover, you can get these contacts handy by downloading them in Excel or CSV formats.</span></span></span><br />\r\n&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">On the flip side, Lusha offers over 100 million B2B contact lists, but its approach is different. It doesn&rsquo;t provide a bulk list, but it provides real-time contact discovery through its Chrome extension.</span></span></span><br />\r\n&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">Lusha works by pulling out the information from public sources like LinkedIn and company websites. Then, it adds user queries with phone numbers and email addresses. It&#39;s handy only for those who are looking for individual prospects.</span></span></span><br />\r\n&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">One thing that is cool about Lusha is that it offers customised AI recommendations, enabling you to explore prospects in your search criteria. Plus, it lets you enrich your data with CSV.</span></span></span><br />\r\n&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">To be real, its database verification and segmentation are not as good as what Go4database provides. If your business is looking for bulk segmented, and verified accurate B2B contacts for some </span><a href=\"https://go4database.com/b2b/global-email-list\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#3498db\">big global campaigns</span></a></span></span><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">, Go4database is the way to go.&nbsp;</span></span></span><br />\r\n&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">In short, it is on the upper hand when it comes to database size.</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">&nbsp;</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<h2><span style=\"font-size:24pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#434343\">Data Accuracy: Go4Database vs. Lusha for Accurate B2B Contact Lists</span></span></span></h2>\r\n\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">Now comes another crucial factor to consider while choosing a business-to-business contact provider is the accuracy and credibility of data.</span></span></span><br />\r\n&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">Let&#39;s start with Go4database; it has a pretty organised method of handling data accuracy. Which means it provides real-time verification before the data reaches your hands.</span></span></span><br />\r\n&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<div id=\"blogTLDR\">\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\"><strong>TL;DR:</strong></span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">Go4Database shines with 95% confirmed B2B contacts instant checking, and a bounce-back promise, something you don&#39;t see often in this field. Lusha, while handy, gets mixed feedback on precision and doesn&#39;t offer a replacement plan, which means Go4Database comes out on top for trustworthy data and spot-on outreach.</span></span></span></p>\r\n</div>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">It undergoes a mix of AI-driven validation with human checks to ensure that every contact in their database is pre-screened, cleaned up, and verified.</span></span></span><br />\r\n&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">Here comes an interesting factor: they offer a bounce-back guarantee and replacement policy for any invalid contacts. This feature is unique and something rarely found in any other competitor&#39;s platforms.</span></span></span><br />\r\n&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">It is a strong statement that shows confidence in their data credibility, which explains why they claim 95 % data accuracy.</span></span></span><br />\r\n&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">So, if you&rsquo;re a marketer or a part of a business searching for high-accuracy, ready-to-use </span><a href=\"https://www.go4database.com/blog/b2b-mailing-list\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#3498db\">B2B mailing list</span></a></span></span><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">&nbsp;for effective outreach, this will be a good fit.</span></span></span><br />\r\n&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">Let&#39;s talk about Lusha, which also claims to offer an organised process to verify contacts by using crowdsourcing and AI.</span></span></span><br />\r\n&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">However, according to some users on G2 reported that they&rsquo;ve encountered some invalid contact information, making prospecting difficult. On the other hand, they do not offer any replacement or bounce-back guarantee, unlike Go4database.</span></span></span><br />\r\n&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">In short, Lusha&rsquo;s data accuracy falls short when compared to Go4database, making it somewhat less reliable for precision-driven outreach.</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<h2><span style=\"font-size:24pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#434343\">Integration Capabilities: Go4Database vs. Lusha for Accurate B2B Contact Lists</span></span></span></h2>\r\n\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">Integration capabilities are also considered an important factor in maintaining a streamlined workflow. Let&rsquo;s dive into it!</span></span></span><br />\r\n&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">Go4Database doesn&rsquo;t