orms such as Salesforce, HubSpot, Pipedrive, and Zoho.</span></span></span><br />\r\n&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">This means you have the benefit of boosting your B2B contact lists right in your workflow. Plus, they provide a browser extension in hand, which enables you to pull data in real time and sync it instantly with your CRM.</span></span></span><br />\r\n&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">For recruiters and sales teams, this can be a game-changer to find leads swiftly and efficiently.&nbsp;</span></span></span><br />\r\n&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">Having said that, you can give </span></span></span><a href=\"https://www.lusha.com/\" style=\"text-decoration:none\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#3498db\"><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\">Lusha</span></span></span></a>&nbsp;<span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">a shot to get that ideal propect within minutes. To sum up, if you&#39;re looking for automated CRM integration, Lusha can be the best fit.</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">&nbsp;</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<h2><span style=\"font-size:24pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#434343\">Ideal User Profiles: Go4Database vs. Lusha for Accurate B2B Contact Lists</span></span></span></h2>\r\n\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">Go4Database and Lush cater to different types of users, based on their requirements for contact dat