ns-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">Here you can discover different use cases that will help you decide which platform provides a better return on investment (ROI) based on your specific requirements.</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><br />\r\n<span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">If you&#39;re looking for accurate B2B contact lists with maximum outreach, Go4database is a good option. On the other hand, Lusha provides only 1000 emails per day.</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><br />\r\n<span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">But if you&#39;re looking for speed and flexibility to use credits, then Lusha is a good choice. It allows you to use credits either for emails or phone numbers.</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><br />\r\n<span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">You will be able to control the prospecting strategy with Lusha. But, heads-up, it will cost you 10 credits for 1 phone number.</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><br />\r\n<span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">In contrast, Go4Database comes with attractive pricing plans. It is ideal for those looking to run bulk campaigns and get thousands of verified B2B contact lists without recurring monthly charges.</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><br />\r\n<span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">After buying and downloading the list, you can use it whenever you want, unlike Lusha&#39;s model, which expires based on credits.</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><br />\r\n<span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">You can target specific niches by location, sector, and position, which helps boost your chances of converting leads.</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><br />\r\n<span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">Hopefully, you might have got a clear picture of which platform might suit your plans better according to your needs.</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">&nbsp;</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<h3><span style=\"font-size:20pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#434343\">Here Comes the Final Verdict: Which Is Better, Go4Database or Lusha?</span></span></span></h3>\r\n\r\n<p><br />\r\n<span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">Well, this depends upon what your business is looking for, how big your outreach is, and your preferred way of getting </span><a href=\"https://www.go4database.com/blog/b2b-mailing-list\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#3498db\">business-to-business contact lists</span></a></span></span><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#3498db\">&nbsp;</span><span style=\"color:#666666\">Each platform has its unique perks and ideal use cases.</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><br />\r\n<span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">To give you more clarity, I have given a brief on which platform suits your goals best.</span></span></span><br />\r\n&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<h2><span style=\"font-size:24pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#434343\">Go4Database is the best fit for</span></span></span></h2>\r\n\r\n<p><br />\r\n<span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">Agencies running mass email and telemarketing campaigns&nbsp;</span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">B2B market looking to target specific industries or regions</span></span></span><br />\r\n&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">Businesses looking for high volumes of data without recurring charges</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">&nbsp;</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<h2><span style=\"font-size:24pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#434343\">Lusha is the Best Fit For:</span></span></span></h2>\r\n\r\n<p><br />\r\n<span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">Sales representatives, SDRs, and recruiters who are looking to get contacts from</span></span></span>&nbsp;<span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">LinkedIn.</span></span></span><br />\r\n&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">Small teams looking for fresh contact information on demand&nbsp;</span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">Businesses that are dependent on CRM workflows and integrations</span></span></span><br />\r\n&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<blockquote>\r\n<p><em><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">Personally, I&rsquo;d go with Lusha if I were looking for any particular B2B contact from LinkedIn or the company site.</span></span></span></em></p>\r\n</blockquote>\r\n\r\n<p><br />\r\n<span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">You know why, because of the LinkedIn extension and CRM integration. It&#39;s so handy to get data within minutes, plus keep my workflow on track.</span></span></span><br />\r\n&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">But if I am running a huge email campaign, I&rsquo;d turn to Go4Database.</span></span></span><br />\r\n&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">Why? Honestly, it gives me tons of verified B2B contacts all in one place, which makes reaching out way quicker and a whole lot easier.</span></span></span><br />\r\n&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<h2><span style=\"font-size:24pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#434343\">Conclusion</span></span></span></h2>\r\n\r\n<p><br />\r\n<span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">Make a smart move by choosing the platform that fulfils your outreach goals, your scale, and your workflow. Or you can also combine both the tools to grow your top of funnel and help you close the deal quicker.</span></span></span><br />\r\n&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">Want to take your email or telemarketing campaign to the next level?</span></span></span><br />\r\n&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">Click </span><a href=\"https://go4database.com/\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#3498db\">Go4database</span></a><span style=\"color:#666666\"> to get high-quality, accurate B2B contact lists and reach your target prospects in just minutes.</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>', NULL, 16, 'a:1:{i:0;s:2:\"11\";}', 'B2B contacts', '772', NULL, 'Go4Database vs Lusha: Best Source for Accurate B2B Contacts', 'Compare Go4Database and Lusha to find which platform delivers more accurate B2B contacts, helping you boost sales and streamline lead generation.', '<script type=\"application/ld+json\">\r\n{\r\n  \"@context\": \"https://schema.org\",\r\n  \"@type\": \"Organization\",\r\n  \"name\": \"Go4Database\",\r\n  \"url\": \"https://www.go4database.com/\",\r\n  \"logo\": \"https://go4database.com/assets/uploads/media-uploader/go4database-logo1751528079.png\",\r\n  \"contactPoint\": {\r\n    \"@type\": \"ContactPoint\",\r\n    \"telephone\": \"+ 1 786 785 2141\",\r\n    \"contactType\": \"customer service\",\r\n    \"areaServed\": \"US\",\r\n    \"availableLanguage\": \"en\"\r\n  },\r\n  \"sameAs\": [\r\n    \"https://www.facebook.com/Go4Database\",\r\n    \"https://twitter.com/DatabaseGo4\",\r\n    \"https://www.instagram.com/go4database/\",\r\n    \"https://www.youtube.com/@Go4Database\",\r\n    \"https://www.linkedin.com/company/go4database/\",\r\n    \"https://in.pinterest.com/gofourdatabase/\"\r\n  ]\r\n}\r\n</script>\r\n<script type=\"application/ld+json\">\r\n{\r\n  \"@context\": \"https://schema.org\",\r\n  \"@type\": \"BlogPosting\",\r\n  \"mainEntityOfPage\": {\r\n    \"@type\": \"WebPage\",\r\n    \"@id\": \"https://www.go4database.com/blog/go4database-vs-lusha\"\r\n  },\r\n  \"headline\": \"Go4Database vs Lusha: Which One Offers More Accurate B2B Contacts?\",\r\n  \"description\": \"In this ever-changing world of B2B marketing and sales, finding accurate B2B contacts is not just a need; it has become mandatory. You must have stumbled upon a lot of tools that promise to provide accurate data, but only a few do it.\",\r\n  \"image\": \"https://www.go4database.com/assets/uploads/media-uploader/go4database-vs-lusha1753247426.webp\",  \r\n  \"author\": {\r\n    \"@type\": \"Person\",\r\n    \"name\": \"Ashwini\"\r\n  },  \r\n  \"publisher\": {\r\n    \"@type\": \"Organization\",\r\n    \"name\": \"\",\r\n    \"logo\": {\r\n      \"@type\": \"ImageObject\",\r\n      \"url\": \"\"\r\n    }\r\n  },\r\n  \"datePublished\": \"2025-07-23\",\r\n  \"dateModified\": \"2025-09-10\"\r\n}\r\n</script>\r\n<script type=\"application/ld+json\">\r\n         {         \r\n            \"@context\": \"https://schema.org/\",         \r\n            \"@type\": \"WebPage\",         \r\n            \"@id\": \"#WebPage\",         \r\n            \"url\": \"https://www.go4database.com/blog/go4database-vs-lusha\",          \r\n            \"name\": \"Go4Database vs Lusha: Which One Offers More Accurate B2B Contacts?\"\r\n          } \r\n      </script>\r\n      <script type=\"application/ld+json\" class=\"schemantra\">{\r\n  \"@context\": \"https://schema.org\",\r\n  \"@type\": \"SpeakableSpecification\",\r\n  \"@id\": \"SpeakableSpecification\",\r\n  \"additionalType\": \"https://www.go4database.com/blog/go4database-vs-lusha\",\r\n  \"alternateName\": \"What is B2B Contacts List?\",\r\n  \"description\": \"A B2B contacts list is a curated database of business professionals and decision-makers used for marketing, sales, or networking. It includes details like names, job titles, company names, emails, and phone numbers to facilitate targeted outreach.   In this blog post, we will compare Go4database and Lusha based on their key features, pricing, and functions, which will help you determine the right tool for your business needs.  \"\r\n}</script>\r\n<script type=\"application/ld+json\">\r\n{\r\n  \"@context\": \"https://schema.org/\", \r\n  \"@type\": \"BreadcrumbList\", \r\n  \"itemListElement\": [{\r\n    \"@type\": \"ListItem\", \r\n    \"position\": 1, \r\n    \"name\": \"Homepage\",\r\n    \"item\": \"https://www.go4database.com/\"  \r\n  },{\r\n    \"@type\": \"ListItem\", \r\n    \"position\": 2, \r\n    \"name\": \"Blog\",\r\n    \"item\": \"https://www.go4database.com/blog\"  \r\n  },{\r\n    \"@type\": \"ListItem\", \r\n    \"position\": 3, \r\n    \"name\": \"Go4Database vs Lusha: Which One Offers More Accurate B2B Contacts?\",\r\n    \"item\": \"https://www.go4database.com/blog/go4database-vs-lusha\"  \r\n  }]\r\n}\r\n</script>\r\n<script type=\"application/ld+json\">\r\n{\r\n  \"@context\": \"https://schema.org\",\r\n  \"@type\": \"FAQPage\",\r\n  \"mainEntity\": [{\r\n    \"@type\": \"Question\",\r\n    \"name\": \"1. Which company provides more dependable B2B contacts, Go4Database or Lusha?\",\r\n    \"acceptedAnswer\": {\r\n      \"@type\": \"Answer\",\r\n      \"text\": \"Go4Database stands out with verified and accurate contact lists you can count on.\"\r\n    }\r\n  },{\r\n    \"@type\": \"Question\",\r\n    \"name\": \"2. Does Go4Database outperform Lusha for extensive marketing?\",\r\n    \"acceptedAnswer\": {\r\n      \"@type\": \"Answer\",\r\n      \"text\": \"Yes, it\'s designed for mass outreach, whereas Lusha is more suitable for quick individual searches.\"\r\n    }\r\n  },{\r\n    \"@type\": \"Question\",\r\n    \"name\": \"3. How do their price structures stack up?\",\r\n    \"acceptedAnswer\": {\r\n      \"@type\": \"Answer\",\r\n      \"text\": \"Go4Database allows you to make a one-time payment and retain the data, while Lusha bills you each month.\"\r\n    }\r\n  },{\r\n    \"@type\": \"Question\",\r\n    \"name\": \"4. Do both tools comply with privacy regulations?\",\r\n    \"acceptedAnswer\": {\r\n      \"@type\": \"Answer\",\r\n      \"text\": \"Yes, but Go4Database takes it a step further by performing additional contact verifications and securing opt-ins.\"\r\n    }\r\n  },{\r\n    \"@type\": \"Question\",\r\n    \"name\": \"5. Which platform delivers better value for money?\",\r\n    \"acceptedAnswer\": {\r\n      \"@type\": \"Answer\",\r\n      \"text\": \"If you plan to contact many people, Go4Database gives you more value for your investment.\"\r\n    }\r\n  }]\r\n}\r\n</script>', '18', 'In this ever-changing world of B2B marketing and sales, finding accurate B2B contacts is not just a need; it has become mandatory. You must have stumbled upon a lot of tools that promise to provide accurate data, but only a few do it.', 'go4database-vs-lusha', 'Ashwini', 10, 'publish', 'en_US', '2025-12-18', '3018', '2025-05-13 15:49:04', '2026-07-07 14:23:59', 0, NULL, '[{\"question\":\"Which company provides more dependable B2B contacts, Go4Database or Lusha?\",\"answer\":\"Go4Database stands out with verified and accurate contact lists you can count on.\"},{\"question\":\"Does Go4Database outperform Lusha for extensive marketing?\",\"answer\":\"Yes, it\'s designed for mass outreach, whereas Lusha is more suitable for quick individual searches.\"},{\"question\":\"How do their price structures stack up?\",\"answer\":\"Go4Database allows you to make a one-time payment and retain the data, while Lusha bills you each month.\"},{\"question\":\"Do both tools comply with privacy regulations?\",\"answer\":\"Yes, but Go4Database takes it a step further by performing additional contact verifications and securing opt-ins.\"},{\"question\":\"Which platform delivers better value for money?\",\"answer\":\"If you plan to contact many people, Go4Database gives you more value for your investment.\"}]');
