4><span style=\"font-size:18pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#434343\">Pros:</span></span></span></h4>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">- User-friendly interface.</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">- Bulk email finding and verification.</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">- Strong CRM integration.</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<h4><span style=\"font-size:18pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#434343\">Cons:</span></span></span></h4>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">- Limited free plan.</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">- No phone number retrieval.</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">- High cost for smaller businesses.</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<h3><span style=\"font-size:20pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#434343\">6. Cognism</span></span></span></h3>\r\n\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><a href=\"https://www.cognism.com/\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#3498db\">Cognism</span></a><span style=\"color:#666666\"> is one of the leading email finder tools of B2B data and sales intelligence.&nbsp;</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">Cogni