(74, 'Digging Into ZoomInfo: Features, Products, Pricing & Plans [2025 Guide]', '<p><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">Founded in 2007, by Henry Schuck under the name DiscoverOrg, the company went to acquire its Zoom info competitors Information in February of 2019 and rebranded itself as ZoomInfo. </span></span></span><br />\r\n<br />\r\n<span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">With millions of verified contacts and real-time company information in their database, ZoomInfo enables businesses to streamline outreach, enhance targeting, and close deals in record time. It is a go-to market platform for </span><span style=\"color:#4e5f70\">sales leads</span><span style=\"color:#666666\">, marketing, and recruitment teams to utilize and connect with high-quality leads.</span></span></span><br />\r\n&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<blockquote>\r\n<p><strong><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">What is ZoomInfo?</span></span></span></strong><br />\r\n<br />\r\n<span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">ZoomInfo is an all-in-one operating system and intelligence platform that helps businesses find, acquire, and convert leads by providing them with access to detailed company profiles and contact information at their disposal.</span></span></span><br />\r\n&nbsp;</p>\r\n</blockquote>\r\n\r\n<p><br />\r\n<span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">But what exactly does ZoomInfo do, and how much does it cost? In this blog we discuss everything about ZoomInfo - its features, product offerings, pricing and uses to help you make the best decision for your business. </span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<div id=\"BigCTA\" style=\"background:#e7fde7; border:1px solid #6fd943; padding:20px 50px\">\r\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://go4database.com/assets/uploads/media-uploader/yellow-and-blue-bold-marketing-agency-with-hexagon-frame-linkedin-banner-1-removebg-preview1734171422.png\" style=\"height:50px; width:200px\" /></p>\r\n\r\n<h4 style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:24pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#434343\">Supercharge Your Lead Generation</span></span></span></h4>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">Discover key decision-makers across millions of companies&mdash;emails, phones, and more.</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:28px\"><a href=\"https://tawk.to/chat/5943715ce9c6d324a4735bbb/1bj559389\" id=\"TrailBtn\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\">🚀 <span style=\"color:#3498db\">Get 5 Free Leads &ndash; Start Now</span></span></a></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n</div>\r\n\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p><br />\r\n<span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">In case you want to try a less-expensive alternative, we recommend checking out Go4Database.</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<h2><span style=\"font-size:24pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#434343\">List Of ZoomInfo:</span></span></span></h2>\r\n\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">&nbsp; &nbsp; 1. &nbsp;<span style=\"color:#3498db\"> </span>What is ZoomInfo used for?</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"color:#666666\"><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\">&nbsp; &nbsp; 2. &nbsp; How does ZoomInfo work?</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"color:#666666\"><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\">&nbsp; &nbsp; 3. &nbsp; Core features of ZoomInfo?</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"color:#666666\"><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\">&nbsp; &nbsp; 4. &nbsp; Who is ZoomInfo for?</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"color:#666666\"><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\">&nbsp; &nbsp; 5. &nbsp; Products&nbsp;and Services</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"color:#666666\"><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\">&nbsp; &nbsp; 6. &nbsp; Plans and Pricing</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"color:#666666\"><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\">&nbsp; &nbsp; 7. &nbsp; How does ZoomInfo get its data?</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"color:#666666\"><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\">&nbsp; &nbsp; 8. &nbsp; What integration does ZoomInfo offer?</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"color:#666666\"><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;9.&nbsp; ZoomInfo alternatives</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"color:#666666\"><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;10.&nbsp; Conclusion</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<h2><span style=\"font-size:24pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#434343\">What is ZoomInfo Used for?</span></span></span></h2>\r\n\r\n<p><br />\r\n<span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">ZoomInfo is a software that deals with providing data and insights to its customers that give them a 360-degree picture of their prospects and their customers.&nbsp;</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><br />\r\n<span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">It offers contacts, companies, technology stack information, direct-dial phone numbers, email addresses, corporate hierarchy data, location maps, and hundreds more fields and assists them in building customized go-to-market plans based on the profiles and real-time activity of their ideal prospects.</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<div id=\"blogTLDR\">\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\"><strong>TL;DR:</strong></span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">ZoomInfo is a B2B intelligence platform that provides detailed contact &nbsp; and company data&mdash;like emails, phone numbers, org charts, tech stacks, and more&mdash;to help businesses generate </span><span style=\"color:#4e5f70\">sales lead generation</span><span style=\"color:#666666\">, align sales and marketing, and accelerate revenue growth. It acts as a commercial search engine for business contact information and enables customized go-to-market strategies.</span></span></span></p>\r\n</div>\r\n\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">ZoomInfo defines its mission as empowering all businesses with go-to market intelligence that accelerates revenue growth. This intelligence platform enhances operational efficiency and aligns sales and marketing efforts. </span></span></span><br />\r\n<br />\r\n<span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">It is used as a commercial search engine that specializes in </span><span style=\"color:#4e5f70\">business leads</span><span style=\"color:#666666\"> contact information. </span></span></span><br />\r\n<br />\r\n<span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">It facilitates lead generation by providing contacts, companies information, direct-dial phone numbers, email addresses,location, and more such data.</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">&nbsp;</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<h2><span style=\"font-size:24pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#434343\">How does ZoomInfo work?</span></span></span></h2>\r\n\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:12pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"background-color:#f8f9ff\"><img src=\"https://lh7-rt.googleusercontent.com/docsz/AD_4nXegThUCFSx3khsSH8Hyl41qiNsu0uFVsN4bIW3Wq7hRdl_Z9URz4lyy1QKhtjSqGvrdT4C9mMGbhVj_71ubBwySYmkIeOYcdCyfzmP2QjT3mgkxSJbW8vUYEdIwmnnUEv3s4xSN?key=BTtqFqhVmg8-ypKIT8oVftwI\" style=\"height:503px; width:686px\" /></span></span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><br />\r\n<span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">ZoomInfo operates by gathering, validating, and categorizing business contact information so that users can search, filter, and connect with their most desirable prospects. It harmoniously integrates with CRMs and marketing technologies to power workflows, automate follow-ups, and fuel revenue.</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">It collects contact details and other information about individuals, companies and other </span><a href=\"https://go4database.com/b2b/us-business-email-list\"><span style=\"color:#3498db\">us business email list</span></a><span style=\"color:#666666\"> entities from the internet through public sources, proprietary sources and intent overlays. It uses the method of &lsquo;web scraping&rsquo; to gather data from sources that are not accessible to everyone. It also uses machine learning to extract job titles, contact info, and company details.</span></span></span><br />\r\n&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<h3><span style=\"font-size:20pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#434343\">Core features of ZoomInfo:</span></span></span></h3>\r\n\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li style=\"list-style-type:disc\"><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\"><strong>Contact and company search:</strong></span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\"> Ranging from direct dials to business email addresses, ZoomInfo provides authentic and accurate information to businesses. It provides detailed profiles so that businesses can connect with their buyers and secure high-value deals.</span></span></span><br />\r\n	&nbsp;</li>\r\n	<li style=\"list-style-type:disc\"><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\"><strong>Buyer intent:</strong></span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\"> With ZoomInfo Intent see which businesses are actively looking at particular topics, so you can engage high-intent buyers.</span></span></span><br />\r\n	&nbsp;</li>\r\n	<li style=\"list-style-type:disc\"><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\"><strong>Website visitor trafficking:</strong></span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\"> ZoomInfo helps you in identifying key website visitors exploring your site and accelerate deals by prioritizing outreach and customizing follow ups.</span></span></span><br />\r\n	&nbsp;</li>\r\n	<li style=\"list-style-type:disc\"><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\"><strong>Data Enrichment &amp; Cleaning:</strong></span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\"> Automatically complete missing fields and eliminate duplicates in your database with ZoomInfo&#39;s enrichment features.</span></span></span><br />\r\n	&nbsp;</li>\r\n	<li style=\"list-style-type:disc\"><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\"><strong>Real-Time Data Updates:</strong></span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\"> The database is updated on a real-time basis to ensure there are no unresponsive leads.</span></span></span><br />\r\n	&nbsp;</li>\r\n	<li style=\"list-style-type:disc\"><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\"><strong>Click-to-Dial &amp; Email Integration:</strong> Call or email list directly from the platform through integrated communications tools.</span></span></span><br />\r\n	&nbsp;</li>\r\n	<li style=\"list-style-type:disc\"><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\"><strong>Export &amp; Data Download:</strong></span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\"> Lists can be exported and contacts can be used externally for campaigns.</span></span></span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<h2><span style=\"font-size:24pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#434343\">Who is ZoomInfo for?</span></span></span></h2>\r\n\r\n<p><br />\r\n<span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">The key users of ZoomInfo are:</span></span></span><br />\r\n&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li style=\"list-style-type:disc\"><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">Sales teams</span></span></span></li>\r\n	<li style=\"list-style-type:disc\"><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">Marketing teams</span></span></span></li>\r\n	<li style=\"list-style-type:disc\"><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">Recruiters</span></span></span></li>\r\n	<li style=\"list-style-type:disc\"><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">Business development professionals</span></span></span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">ZoomInfo is designed for B2B professionals that leverage data-driven intelligence to discover, connect with, and convert leads. It can be helpful to sales teams as it aids them in discovering direct dials and mails of decision-makers and auto-outreach with sales engagement tools. Marketing teams can use ZoomInfo to create targeted audience lists for personalized campaigns, prioritize high-potential leads and improve account-based marketing strategies to increase the ROI. </span></span></span><br />\r\n<br />\r\n<span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">Additionally, hiring managers are able to leverage the platform in order to retrieve advanced job history details and link with the best potential candidates. Business development personnel are able to look for emerging business opportunities. </span></span></span><br />\r\n<br />\r\n<span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">Whether for B2B selling, marketing, hiring, or business intelligence, ZoomInfo provides a robust data-driven platform to drive growth and optimize go-to-market strategies.</span></span></span><br />\r\n&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<div id=\"BigCTA\" style=\"background:#e7fde7; border:1px solid #6fd943; padding:20px 50px\">\r\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://go4database.com/assets/uploads/media-uploader/yellow-and-blue-bold-marketing-agency-with-hexagon-frame-linkedin-banner-1-removebg-preview1734171422.png\" style=\"height:50px; width:200px\" /></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<h4 style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:24pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#434343\">Verified Contact Info, Instantly</span></span></span></h4>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">Tap into a massive B2B data network for real-time, accurate lead information.</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:28px\"><a href=\"https://tawk.to/chat/5943715ce9c6d324a4735bbb/1bj559389\" id=\"TrailBtn\"><span style=\"color:#3498db\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\">Try It Free &ndash; 5 Leads On Us</span></span></a></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n</div>\r\n\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<h3><span style=\"font-size:20pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#434343\">ZoomInfo products and services:</span></span></span></h3>\r\n\r\n<p><br />\r\n<span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><a href=\"ht