"background-color:#ffffff\">&nbsp;</span></span></span></span></li>\r\n	<li style=\"list-style-type:disc\"><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\"><span style=\"background-color:#ffffff\">Operations OS unifies teams and technologies with data-powered solutions. It creates and maintains engagement-ready data.</span></span></span></span><br />\r\n	&nbsp;</li>\r\n	<li style=\"list-style-type:disc\"><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\"><span style=\"background-color:#ffffff\">ZoomInfo Copilot is an AI driven solution that acts like a catalyst by quickening the conversion process and gives businesses and unfair advantage over the best accounts.</span></span></span></span><br />\r\n	<br />\r\n	&nbsp;</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<h3><span style=\"font-size:20pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#434343\">Plans and Pricing:</span></span></span></h3>\r\n\r\n<p><br />\r\n<span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">There are three types of paid plans for users to choose from, these are: the professional plan, the advance plan and the elite plan.&nbsp;</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<div>\r\n<table border=\"1\" cellpadding=\"1\" cellspacing=\"1\" class=\"table table-bordered\" style=\"width:800px\">\r\n	<tbody>\r\n		<tr>\r\n			<td>\r\n			<p><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\"><strong>PLAN</strong></span></span></span></p>\r\n			</td>\r\n			<td><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\"><strong>PRICING (annual)</strong></span></span></span></td>\r\n			<td><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\"><strong>CREDITS</strong></span></span></span></td>\r\n			<td><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\"><strong>BENEFITS</strong></span></span></span></td>\r\n		</tr>\r\n		<tr>\r\n			<td><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">Professional</span></span></span></td>\r\n			<td><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">$14,995</span></span></span></td>\r\n			<td><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">5,000 annual bulk credits</span></span></span></td>\r\n			<td><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">access to ZoomInfo&#39;s extensive B2B database, and basic email and dialing outreach functions</span></span></span></td>\r\n		</tr>\r\n		<tr>\r\n			<td><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">Advance</span></span></span></td>\r\n			<td><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">$24,995</span></span></span></td>\r\n			<td><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">10,000 annual bulk credits</span></span></span></td>\r\n			<td><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">advanced search filters, intent data insights, and enhanced automation tools</span></span></span></td>\r\n		</tr>\r\n		<tr>\r\n			<td><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">Elite</span></span></span></td>\r\n			<td><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">$39,995</span></span></span></td>\r\n			<td><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">10,000 annual bulk credits</span></span></span></td>\r\n			<td><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">comprehensive access to all features including real-time intent data, detailed org charts, and technographics.</span></span></span></td>\r\n		</tr>\r\n	</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n</div>\r\n\r\n<div>&nbsp;</div>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">In order to get additional credits and add-ons, users have to pay an extra amount. Go4Database provides the same services at a price more than 10 times less.</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<h2><span style=\"font-size:24pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#434343\">How does ZoomInfo get its data?</span></span></span></h2>\r\n\r\n<p><br />\r\n<span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">ZoomInfo gathers its information from a blend of public sources, proprietary technology, and user-submitted information. It aggregates information from company websites, news articles, SEC filings, job listings, and email signatures. </span></span></span><br />\r\n<br />\r\n<span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">Further, users who opt-in to ZoomInfo&#39;s Community Edition contribute business contacts through integrated tools such as Outlook or Gmail. </span></span></span><br />\r\n<br />\r\n<span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">This information is further confirmed using AI-powered algorithms and human researchers for precision. The site regularly refreshes its database to keep its B2B data fresh, reliable, and actionable.</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<h2><span style=\"font-size:24pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#434343\">What integrations does ZoomInfo offer?</span></span></span></h2>\r\n\r\n<p><br />\r\n<span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">ZoomInfo offers a wide range of integrations with third party applications that businesses might already be having access to. Integrations facilitate streamlining sales, marketing, and recruiting workflows.&nbsp;</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><br />\r\n<span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">ZoomInfo integrates seamlessly with top CRMs like for real-time syncing and enrichment of data. For marketing automation, it integrates with products like Eloqua, Pardot, and Mailchimp. ZoomInfo also integrates with sales engagement platforms like Outreach, SalesLoft, and Groove, with automated outreach and tracking. Furthermore, it combines with Slack, LinkedIn, and Zapier to support customized workflows and alerting. </span></span></span><br />\r\n<br />\r\n<span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">Such integration simplifies inter-team collaboration through the aggregation of data and automated core functions between platforms.</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<h2><span style=\"font-size:24pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#434343\">Zoominfo Alternatives:</span></span></span></h2>\r\n\r\n<p><br />\r\n<span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">ZoomInfo is one of the biggest players in the database providing market. However it works on contract basis and is very expensive for businesses testing waters in this domain. There are various alternatives that provide the same services at a relatively lower cost.</span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\">&nbsp;</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><br />\r\n<span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\"><em>Go4Database is one such platform.</em></span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><br />\r\n<span style=\"font-size:20pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#434343\"><strong>Go4Database as an alternative to ZoomInfo - a comprehensive comparison:</strong></span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><img src=\"https://lh7-rt.googleusercontent.com/docsz/AD_4nXe53TKzBN9GEkcG9e_Mi7WE1IsbSCll9yvMUaavPPqLs3ARNrMHATJWGRKCn-qX8JLHL1fjMWyGGm7C__2-QFoLgFctqMIQPyhmREUCeL0D8lAbwuB0ZeNGUvsqj-Yv9ukrKSFUeA?key=BTtqFqhVmg8-ypKIT8oVftwI\" style=\"height:528px; width:720px\" /></span></span></span><br />\r\n&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<h2><span style=\"font-size:24pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#434343\">Conclusion:</span></span></span></h2>\r\n\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">ZoomInfo is one of the top database providers and intelligence platforms in the B2B market&nbsp;</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">with rich features such as intent data, CRM integrations, and real-time updates. It has a comprehensive database and helps customers in tailoring go-to market strategies for their niche. ZoomInfo offers a plethora of features and is a big player in the lead generation industry, serving businesses of all sizes.</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">However, if you are still looking for something inexpensive yet reliable, switch to Go4Database and see the results yourself.</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>', NULL, 3, 'a:1:{i:0;s:2:\"11\";}', 'excellent-quality-email-lists,Zoominfo,B2B professional', '768', NULL, 'What Is ZoomInfo? Features, Pricing & Alternatives 2025', 'Explore ZoomInfo’s features, pricing, and plans. Discover how Go4Database compares as a powerful ZoomInfo alternative for smarter sales in 2025.', '<script type=\"application/ld+json\">\r\n{\r\n  \"@context\": \"https://schema.org\",\r\n  \"@type\": \"Organization\",\r\n  \"name\": \"Go4Database\",\r\n  \"url\": \"https://www.go4database.com/\",\r\n  \"logo\": \"https://go4database.com/assets/uploads/media-uploader/go4database-logo1751528079.png\",\r\n  \"contactPoint\": {\r\n    \"@type\": \"ContactPoint\",\r\n    \"telephone\": \"+ 1 786 785 2141\",\r\n    \"contactType\": \"customer service\",\r\n    \"areaServed\": \"US\",\r\n    \"availableLanguage\": \"en\"\r\n  },\r\n  \"sameAs\": [\r\n    \"https://www.facebook.com/Go4Database\",\r\n    \"https://twitter.com/DatabaseGo4\",\r\n    \"https://www.instagram.com/go4database/\",\r\n    \"https://www.youtube.com/@Go4Database\",\r\n    \"https://www.linkedin.com/company/go4database/\",\r\n    \"https://in.pinterest.com/gofourdatabase/\"\r\n  ]\r\n}\r\n</script>\r\n<script type=\"application/ld+json\">\r\n{\r\n  \"@context\": \"https://schema.org\",\r\n  \"@type\": \"BlogPosting\",\r\n  \"mainEntityOfPage\": {\r\n    \"@type\": \"WebPage\",\r\n    \"@id\": \"https://www.go4database.com/blog/what-is-zoominfo\"\r\n  },\r\n  \"headline\": \"Digging Into ZoomInfo: Features, Products, Pricing & Plans [2025 Guide]\",\r\n  \"description\": \"Founded in 2007, by Henry Schuck under the name DiscoverOrg, the company went to acquire its Zoom info competitors Information in February of 2019 and rebranded itself as ZoomInfo.\",\r\n  \"image\": \"https://www.go4database.com/assets/uploads/media-uploader/what-is-zoominfo-go4database-11753247424.webp\",  \r\n  \"author\": {\r\n    \"@type\": \"Person\",\r\n    \"name\": \"Riya\"\r\n  },  \r\n  \"publisher\": {\r\n    \"@type\": \"Organization\",\r\n    \"name\": \"\",\r\n    \"logo\": {\r\n      \"@type\": \"ImageObject\",\r\n      \"url\": \"\"\r\n    }\r\n  },\r\n  \"datePublished\": \"2025-07-23\",\r\n  \"dateModified\": \"2025-09-10\"\r\n}\r\n</script>\r\n<script type=\"application/ld+json\">\r\n         {         \r\n            \"@context\": \"https://schema.org/\",         \r\n            \"@type\": \"WebPage\",         \r\n            \"@id\": \"#WebPage\",         \r\n            \"url\": \"https://www.go4database.com/blog/what-is-zoominfo\",          \r\n            \"name\": \"Digging Into ZoomInfo: Features, Products, Pricing & Plans [2025 Guide]\"\r\n          } \r\n      </script>\r\n      <script type=\"application/ld+json\" class=\"schemantra\">{\r\n  \"@context\": \"https://schema.org\",\r\n  \"@type\": \"SpeakableSpecification\",\r\n  \"@id\": \"SpeakableSpecification\",\r\n  \"additionalType\": \"https://www.go4database.com/blog/what-is-zoominfo\",\r\n  \"alternateName\": \"What is ZoomInfo?\",\r\n  \"description\": \"ZoomInfo is an all-in-one operating system and intelligence platform that helps businesses find, acquire, and convert leads by providing them with access to detailed company profiles and contact information at their disposal.\"\r\n}</script>\r\n<script type=\"application/ld+json\">\r\n{\r\n  \"@context\": \"https://schema.org/\", \r\n  \"@type\": \"BreadcrumbList\", \r\n  \"itemListElement\": [{\r\n    \"@type\": \"ListItem\", \r\n    \"position\": 1, \r\n    \"name\": \"Homepage\",\r\n    \"item\": \"https://www.go4database.com/\"  \r\n  },{\r\n    \"@type\": \"ListItem\", \r\n    \"position\": 2, \r\n    \"name\": \"Blog\",\r\n    \"item\": \"https://www.go4database.com/blog\"  \r\n  },{\r\n    \"@type\": \"ListItem\", \r\n    \"position\": 3, \r\n    \"name\": \"Digging Into ZoomInfo: Features, Products, Pricing & Plans [2025 Guide]\",\r\n    \"item\": \"https://www.go4database.com/blog/what-is-zoominfo\"  \r\n  }]\r\n}\r\n</script>\r\n<script type=\"application/ld+json\">\r\n{\r\n  \"@context\": \"https://schema.org\",\r\n  \"@type\": \"FAQPage\",\r\n  \"mainEntity\": [{\r\n    \"@type\": \"Question\",\r\n    \"name\": \"1. Is ZoomInfo worth it?\",\r\n    \"acceptedAnswer\": {\r\n      \"@type\": \"Answer\",\r\n      \"text\": \"If there are no budget restraints, ZoomInfo is totally worth it but if you are looking for something more flexible at a lower cost - Go4Database is your answer.\"\r\n    }\r\n  },{\r\n    \"@type\": \"Question\",\r\n    \"name\": \"2. Does ZoomInfo offer a free plan?\",\r\n    \"acceptedAnswer\": {\r\n      \"@type\": \"Answer\",\r\n      \"text\": \"ZoomInfo does not have a free plan, instead it offers a 14-day free trial before starting any of its plans. Users need to schedule a demo and provide their business emails to avail this free trial.\"\r\n    }\r\n  },{\r\n    \"@type\": \"Question\",\r\n    \"name\": \"3. What type of data does ZoomInfo provide?\",\r\n    \"acceptedAnswer\": {\r\n      \"@type\": \"Answer\",\r\n      \"text\": \"ZoomInfo provides detailed B2B contact data including names, job titles, direct-dial phone numbers, email addresses, company details, location maps, and buying intent signals and hundreds of additional fields.\"\r\n    }\r\n  },{\r\n    \"@type\": \"Question\",\r\n    \"name\": \"4. How accurate is ZoomInfo’s data?\",\r\n    \"acceptedAnswer\": {\r\n      \"@type\": \"Answer\",\r\n      \"text\": \"ZoomInfo assures maximum accuracy and guarantees\"\r\n    }\r\n  },{\r\n    \"@type\": \"Question\",\r\n    \"name\": \"5. What industries use ZoomInfo the most?\",\r\n    \"acceptedAnswer\": {\r\n      \"@type\": \"Answer\",\r\n      \"text\": \"ZoomInfo is widely used across industries like tech, finance, healthcare, recruitment, and marketing—any sector that relies on outbound sales or lead generation.\"\r\n    }\r\n  }]\r\n}\r\n</script>', '1', 'ZoomInfo is an all-in-one operating system and intelligence platform that helps businesses find, acquire, and convert leads by providing them with access to detailed company profiles and contact information at their disposal.', 'what-is-zoominfo', 'Riya', 8, 'publish', 'en_US', '2025-07-23', '7114', '2025-05-21 13:44:13', '2026-08-12 10:34:57', 0, NULL, '[{\"question\":\"Is ZoomInfo worth it?\",\"answer\":\"If there are no budget restraints, ZoomInfo is totally worth it but if you are looking for something more flexible at a lower cost - Go4Database is your answer.\"},{\"question\":\"Does ZoomInfo offer a free plan?\",\"answer\":\"ZoomInfo does not have a free plan, instead it offers a 14-day free trial before starting any of its plans. Users need to schedule a demo and provide their business emails to avail this free trial.\"},{\"question\":\"What type of data does ZoomInfo provide?\",\"answer\":\"ZoomInfo provides detailed B2B contact data including names, job titles, direct-dial phone numbers, email addresses, company details, location maps, and buying intent signals and hundreds of additional fields.\"},{\"question\":\"How accurate is ZoomInfo\\u2019s data?\",\"answer\":\"ZoomInfo assures maximum accuracy and guarantees\"},{\"question\":\"What industries use ZoomInfo the most?\",\"answer\":\"ZoomInfo is widely used across industries like tech, finance, healthcare, recruitment, and marketing\\u2014any sector that relies on outbound sales or lead generation.\"}]');
