 It Illegal To Buy Email Lists? Legal Formalities You Need To Know\",\r\n    \"item\": \"https://www.go4database.com/blog/is-it-illegal-to-buy-email-lists\"  \r\n  }]\r\n}\r\n</script>\r\n<script type=\"application/ld+json\">\r\n{\r\n  \"@context\": \"https://schema.org\",\r\n  \"@type\": \"FAQPage\",\r\n  \"mainEntity\": [{\r\n    \"@type\": \"Question\",\r\n    \"name\": \"1. Is it illegal to purchase email lists?\",\r\n    \"acceptedAnswer\": {\r\n      \"@type\": \"Answer\",\r\n      \"text\": \"A- It\'s not illegal if the list is opt-in and data protection compliant, such as GDPR.\"\r\n    }\r\n  },{\r\n    \"@type\": \"Question\",\r\n    \"name\": \"2. Is purchasing email lists GDPR compliant?\",\r\n    \"acceptedAnswer\": {\r\n      \"@type\": \"Answer\",\r\n      \"text\": \"A- It is GDPR compliant only if the contacts have given express consent, such as from Go4Database.\"\r\n    }\r\n  },{\r\n    \"@type\": \"Question\",\r\n    \"name\": \"3. Am I liable to get fined for using a bought email list?\",\r\n    \"acceptedAnswer\": {\r\n      \"@type\": \"Answer\",\r\n      \"text\": \"Yes, it can lead to heavy fines or legal action.\"\r\n    }\r\n  }]\r\n}\r\n</script>\r\n<script type=\"application/ld+json\" class=\"schemantra\">{\r\n  \"@context\": \"https://schema.org\",\r\n  \"@type\": \"SpeakableSpecification\",\r\n  \"@id\": \"SpeakableSpecification\",\r\n  \"additionalType\": \"https://www.go4database.com/blog/is-it-illegal-to-buy-email-lists\",\r\n  \"alternateName\": \"Is It Illegal To Buy Email Lists? Legal Formalities You Need To Know\",\r\n  \"description\": \"What is email list marketing?     Email list marketing involves companies sending targeted emails to a selected group of subscribers or contacts. These emails serve various purposes: promoting products, sharing company news, developing potential customers, or strengthening customer bonds. This approach offers a budget-friendly way to connect with an audience, spark interest, and increase sales through tailored messages.\"\r\n}</script>\r\n\r\n<script type=\"application/ld+json\">\r\n{\r\n  \"@context\": \"https://schema.org\",\r\n  \"@type\": \"Article\",\r\n  \"mainEntityOfPage\": {\r\n    \"@type\": \"WebPage\",\r\n    \"@id\": \"https://www.go4database.com/blog/is-it-illegal-to-buy-email-lists\"\r\n  },\r\n  \"headline\": \"Is It Illegal To Buy Email Lists? Legal Formalities You Need To Know\",\r\n  \"description\": \"In the fast-paced world of digital marketing, purchasing an email list has become an essential and quick approach to broaden your audience.\r\n\r\nOf course, why not? Why struggle when there are numerous popular tools claiming accurate contact lists right at your fingertips?\",\r\n  \"image\": \"https://www.go4database.com/assets/uploads/media-uploader/is-it-illegal-to-buy-email-lists-go4database1753247425.webp\",  \r\n  \"author\": {\r\n    \"@type\": \"Person\",\r\n    \"name\": \"Ashwini Bochkeri\"\r\n  },  \r\n  \"publisher\": {\r\n    \"@type\": \"Organization\",\r\n    \"name\": \"\",\r\n    \"logo\": {\r\n      \"@type\": \"ImageObject\",\r\n      \"url\": \"\"\r\n    }\r\n  },\r\n  \"datePublished\": \"2025-07-23\",\r\n  \"dateModified\": \"2026-03-24\"\r\n}\r\n</script>\r\n<script type=\"application/ld+json\">\r\n         {         \r\n            \"@context\": \"https://schema.org/\",         \r\n            \"@type\": \"WebPage\",         \r\n            \"@id\": \"#WebPage\",         \r\n            \"url\": \"https://www.go4database.com/blog/is-it-illegal-to-buy-email-lists\",          \r\n            \"name\": \"Is It Illegal To Buy Email Lists? Legal Formalities You Need To Know\"\r\n          } \r\n      </script>', '1', 'Email list marketing involves companies sending targeted emails to a selected group of subscribers or contacts. These emails serve various purposes: promoting products, sharing company news, developing potential customers, or strengthening customer bonds. This approach offers a budget-friendly way to connect with an audience, spark interest, and increase sales through tailored messages.”', 'is-it-illegal-to-buy-email-lists', 'Ashwini Bochkeri', 10, 'publish', 'en_US', '2026-03-24', '2604', '2025-05-26 12:54:41', '2026-08-12 10:13:51', 0, NULL, '[{\"question\":\"Is it illegal to purchase email lists?\",\"answer\":\"It\'s not illegal if the list is opt-in and data protection compliant, such as GDPR.\"},{\"question\":\"Is purchasing email lists GDPR compliant?\",\"answer\":\"It is GDPR compliant only if the contacts have given express consent, such as from Go4Database.\"},{\"question\":\"Am I liable to get fined for using a bought email list?\",\"answer\":\"Yes, it can lead to heavy fines or legal action.\"}]');
