oose a Reputable Email List Provider?</span></span></span></h2>\r\n\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">It is very important to choose a reputable B2B email list provider to avoid falling into a trap with legal issues.</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><br />\r\n<span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">Even though you chose a reliable mailing list provider, just don&rsquo;t brush off the thought that everything will be sorted. No!</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<div id=\"BigCTA\" style=\"background:#e7fde7; border:1px solid #6fd943; padding:20px 50px\">\r\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://go4database.com/assets/uploads/media-uploader/yellow-and-blue-bold-marketing-agency-with-hexagon-frame-linkedin-banner-1-removebg-preview1734171422.png\" style=\"height:50px; width:200px\" /></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><strong><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-size:28px\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\">Don&rsquo;t settle for outdated email lists!</span></span></span></strong></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">Upgrade to real-time verified data from Go4Database</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://app.go4database.com/login?utm_source=blogpage&amp;utm_medium=internal&amp;utm_campaign=app_login\" id=\"TrailBtn\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\">Download a free sample today!</span></span></a></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n</div>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">&nbsp;</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">You have to keep in mind certain legal guidelines to make sure you are on the safe side.</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><br />\r\n<span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">Why?</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">Buying email lists from an untrustworthy platform&nbsp;or using them in the wrong way can get your domain flagged; in the worst cases, you will end up breaking the law.</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><br />\r\n<span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">Don&rsquo;t worry! Follow these simple 4 steps to keep your email list safe and spam-free:</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\"><strong>Choose a compliant platform</strong></span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><br />\r\n<span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">Whenever you buy emails for outreach, check for platforms that comply with the regional guidelines. For example, the GDPR guidelines are liable for someone who wants to perform outreach in Europe.</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\"><strong>Always verify your email lists</strong></span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><br />\r\n<span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">Always use tools that verify your email list to avoid invalid or outdated emails. Irrelevant emails can increase the bounce rate and a rise in spam complaints, which can lead to your domain being flagged.</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><br />\r\n<span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">So, you shouldn&rsquo;t skip on verifying emails before using them, even if the email list provider claims to offer highly accurate emails. This ensures compliance with anti-spam regulations</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\"><strong>Include a clear opt-out option</strong></span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><br />\r\n<span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">You need to include an easy unsubscribe option, because GDPR and CAN-SPAM have made this option mandatory.</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\"><strong>Know the regional laws</strong></span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><br />\r\n<span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">Don&rsquo;t ignore regional laws because all regions have varied laws; for example, GDPR for Europeans, CCPA in California, and CASL in Canada.</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><br />\r\n<span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">If you&#39;re targeting a broader audience worldwide, then you must understand these laws. Plus, you need to choose an email list provider that has various compliance certificates.</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<h2><span style=\"font-size:24pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#434343\">What is the Cost Estimation to Buy Email Lists</span></span></span></h2>\r\n\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">So far, I&#39;ve covered you with the legalities and recommended the best B2B email list provider tools.</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><br />\r\n<span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">Now, you must be wondering what is the right price to buy an email list.</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">According to my experience with different platforms, I found that you can buy 1000 emails along with buyer intent, costing around $20 to $30.</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><br />\r\n<span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">This means that every email should cost you not more than $30. If So, go for other platforms.</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<div id=\"BigCTA\" style=\"background:#e7fde7; border:1px solid #6fd943; padding:20px 50px\">\r\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://go4database.com/assets/uploads/media-uploader/yellow-and-blue-bold-marketing-agency-with-hexagon-frame-linkedin-banner-1-removebg-preview1734171422.png\" style=\"height:50px; width:200px\" /></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><strong><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-size:28px\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\">Ready to choose a reliable mailing list provider?</span></span></span></strong></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">Try Go4Database&rsquo;s which provides 95% accurate and compliant data</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://app.go4database.com/login?utm_source=blogpage&amp;utm_medium=internal&amp;utm_campaign=app_login\" id=\"TrailBtn\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\">Get 100 contacts for free!</span></span></a></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n</div>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">&nbsp;</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<h2><span style=\"font-size:24pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#434343\">Conclusion</span></span></span></h2>\r\n\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">By now, you must have understood that it is crucial to choose a reliable mailing list provider to scale your outreach game.</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><br />\r\n<span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">It&#39;s not just about having a bunch of contact lists, but it&#39;s more about connecting with ideal prospects who are interested in your products and making sure that you&#39;re following the guidelines, too.</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><br />\r\n<span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">Check out Go4Database, an all-in-one platform to get verified contacts, advanced filters, and global reach.</span></span></span></p>', NULL, 16, 'a:1:{i:0;s:2:\"11\";}', 'B2B Sales,Business Lead Generation,Mailing List', '773', NULL, 'Go4Database Your trusted mailing list provider solution', 'Go4Database is a top mailing list provider offering accurate business email databases for targeted marketing, lead generation, and powerful B2B outreach.', '<script type=\"application/ld+json\">\r\n{