olor:#666666\">An underrated platform.</span></span></span></li>\r\n	<li style=\"list-style-type:disc\"><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">No refund policy.</span></span></span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"text-align:justify\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<h3 style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:20pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#434343\">2. Findymail</span></span></span></h3>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"text-align:justify\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><a href=\"https://www.findymail.com/\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#3498db\">Findymail</span></a><span style=\"color:#666666\"> is a B2B email finder and verifier built for teams who want accurate contact data without paying for a bloated all-in-one platform.</span></span></span><br />\r\n&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">Unlike Apollo, which bundles data sourcing with sequencing and CRM features, Findymail focuses squarely on finding and verifying contacts, so every email you get has already been checked in real time before it reaches you.</span></span></span><br />\r\n&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">It also includes a phone number finder, a Chrome extension for quick lookups, Intellimatch to surface AI-matched leads that fit your ideal customer profile, and Signals to flag intent so you know who&#39;s actually ready to hear from you.</span></span></span><br />\r\n&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<h4><span style=\"font-size:18pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#434343\">Pros of Findymail</span></span></span></h4>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"list-style-type:disc\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li style=\"list-style-type:disc\"><span style=\"f