</span></span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">&nbsp;</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<h3><span style=\"font-size:20pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#434343\">Limitations of Clearbit</span></span></span></h3>\r\n\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li style=\"list-style-type:disc\"><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">&nbsp;Costly for small businesses.</span></span></span></li>\r\n	<li style=\"list-style-type:disc\"><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">&nbsp;Data provided is sometimes outdated.</span></span></span></li>\r\n	<li style=\"list-style-type:disc\"><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">&nbsp;Restrictive credit limits.</span></span></span></li>\r\n	<li style=\"list-style-type:disc\"><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">&nbsp;On basic plans, limited contact exporting.</span></span></span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">&nbsp;</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<h3><span style=\"font-size:20pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#434343\">9.&nbsp; &nbsp; Saleshandy</span></span></span></h3>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">&nbsp;</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">Saleshandy is not only a cold email outreach tool but also a lightweight CRM similar to Lusha in lead interaction.</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">Saleshandy has an agency function that adds and manages unlimited clients, and teams and uses white labeling and bulk import for efficient client management.</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">&nbsp;</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">Saleshandy, similar to Lusha, is one of the best </span><a href=\"https://go4database.com/blog/best-email-finder\"><span style=\"color:#3498db\">B2B email finder</span></a><span style=\"color:#666666\"> that helps the client automate and scale personalized cold emails with 95% data accuracy.</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">It integrates various CRM tools such as HubSpot, Salesforce and Zoho. For extensive integration capabilities, Saleshandy uses Zapier.</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">&nbsp;</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<h3><span style=\"font-size:20pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#434343\">Features of Saleshandy</span></span></span></h3>\r\n\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li style=\"list-style-type:disc\"><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">&nbsp; An inbuilt email verifier.</span></span></span></li>\r\n	<li style=\"list-style-type:disc\"><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">&nbsp;&nbsp;User friendly interface.</span></span></span></li>\r\n	<li style=\"list-style-type:disc\"><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">&nbsp;&nbsp;Cold email outreach tool.</span></span></span></li>\r\n	<li style=\"list-style-type:disc\"><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">&nbsp;&nbsp;Offers accurate email tracking.</span></span></span></li>\r\n	<li style=\"list-style-type:disc\"><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;Personalization features.</span></span></span></li>\r\n	<li style=\"list-style-type:disc\"><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;Seamless sequence automation.</span></span></span></li>\r\n	<li style=\"list-style-type:disc\"><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;Unlimited scalability with no additional charges for email accounts.</span></span></span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">&nbsp;</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<h3><span style=\"font-size:20pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#434343\">Limitations of Saleshandy</span></span></span></h3>\r\n\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li style=\"list-style-type:disc\"><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">&nbsp;Getting logged out frequently.</span></span></span></li>\r\n	<li style=\"list-style-type:disc\"><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">&nbsp;Only a seven day trial period.</span></span></span></li>\r\n	<li style=\"list-style-type:disc\"><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">&nbsp;Some clients face bugs in a system.</span></span></span></li>\r\n	<li style=\"list-style-type:disc\"><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">&nbsp;Only five free leads are available during the trial.&nbsp;</span></span></span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<h3><span style=\"font-size:20pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#434343\">10.&nbsp; &nbsp; CoPilot AI</span></span></span></h3>\r\n\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">One LinkedIn-based high-quality lead generation product that is ideal for the Lusha Similar Apps category is CoPilot AI.</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">&nbsp;</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">Boost productivity by focusing on LinkedIn prospects with the highest intent and automate your outreach with AI.</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">&nbsp;</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">Automate personalized communications with the appropriate individuals.</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">Focuses on four main aspects i.e. prospect, engage, convert and optimize.</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">&nbsp;</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">CoPilot Ai offers features such as task automation, content generation and real-time insights within Microsoft applications and services.</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">&nbsp;</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<h3><span style=\"font-size:20pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#434343\">Features of CoPilot AI</span></span></span></h3>\r\n\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li style=\"list-style-type:disc\"><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">&nbsp; Modify messages according to the needs of prospects.</span></span></span></li>\r\n	<li style=\"list-style-type:disc\"><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">&nbsp;&nbsp;Automation of tasks.</span></span></span></li>\r\n	<li style=\"list-style-type:disc\"><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">&nbsp;&nbsp;Integration with AI systems.</span></span></span></li>\r\n	<li style=\"list-style-type:disc\"><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">&nbsp;&nbsp;Provides real-time support and insights.</span></span></span></li>\r\n	<li style=\"list-style-type:disc\"><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">&nbsp;&nbsp;Integrates data from various sources.</span></span></span></li>\r\n	<li style=\"list-style-type:disc\"><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">&nbsp;&nbsp;Customized tracking and dashboard</span></span></span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">&nbsp;</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<h3><span style=\"font-size:20pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#434343\">Limitations of CoPilot AI</span></span></span></h3>\r\n\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li style=\"list-style-type:disc\"><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">Privacy Concerns.</span></span></span></li>\r\n	<li style=\"list-style-type:disc\"><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">Technical issues.</span></span></span></li>\r\n	<li style=\"list-style-type:disc\"><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">Limited customer support.</span></span></span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">&nbsp;</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">Finally, which company to choose that is Similar to Lusha?</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\"><em>Still Confused!!</em></span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<h3><span style=\"font-size:20pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#434343\">Try Go4Database.</span></span></span></h3>\r\n\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">If you&#39;re looking for an affordable, accurate, reliable, and scalable <strong>B2B lead generation</strong> solution, Go4Database should be your priority.</span></span></span><br />\r\n&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<blockquote>\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\"><strong>Also Read:</strong></span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\"> </span><a href=\"https://go4database.com/blog/b2b-lead-generation\"><span style=\"color:#3498db\">B2B Lead Generation: Strategies to Drive High-Quality Leads</span></a></span></span></p>\r\n</blockquote>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">&nbsp;</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">To unlock better outreach today, explore this high-value option.</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">&nbsp;</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">You can contact us via WhatsApp at +17867852141 or by using official email address </span></span></span><a href=\"mailto:info@go4database.com\" style=\"text-decoration:none\"><span style=\"color:#3498db\"><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><u>info@go4database.com</u></span></span></span></a></p>\r\n\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>', NULL, 16, 'a:1:{i:0;s:2:\"11\";}', 'Lusha Alternatives', '778', NULL, 'Lusha Alternatives: 10 Better Contact Tools for 2025', 'Seeking Lusha alternatives? Discover 10 top tools that boost sales and data accuracy. Compare now to elevate your outreach strategy today!', NULL, '18', 'No doubt! Lusha company is one of the best platforms to reach out to your newly identified prospects, Lusha allows you to create cold email sequences. Lusha has quite responsive customer support and also has a smooth interface.', 'lusha-alternatives', 'Deepa Tyagi', 7, 'publish', 'en_US', '2025-07-23', '2345', '2025-06-16 19:02:37', '2026-07-07 14:51:05', 0, NULL, '[{\"question\":\"Why choose Go4Database over Lusha and its alternatives?\",\"answer\":\"Go4database provides a simple, affordable solution that does not require dashboards, platform lock-in, or required logins. It is perfect for customers who desire independence and flexibility without recurring subscriptions or hidden fees because it gives you segmented, ready-to-use mailing lists and complete control over data verification and outreach.\"},{\"question\":\"How does Go4Database\\u2019s pricing compare to Lusha?\",\"answer\":\"Go4database only charges for what you require because it takes a one-time, pay-per-list strategy. In contrast, Lusha costs more for additional features or API access and can be more costly, particularly for larger quantities.\"},{\"question\":\"Does Go4Database offers better data control than Lusha?\",\"answer\":\"Yes. With Go4database, you own the data and manage verification and compliance your way. Lusha\\u2019s data is accessed through their platform, and you\\u2019re reliant on their algorithms and integrations.\"},{\"question\":\"Is Go4Database suitable for users who want to avoid complex tools?\",\"answer\":\"Absolutely. Go4database is designed for simplicity: no dashboards, no forced integrations, and no unnecessary features. This is ideal for users who want to focus on outreach, not learning a new SaaS product.\"}]');
INSERT INTO `blogs` (`id`, `title`, `content`, `faq_content`, `blog_categories_id`, `categories_id`, `tags`, `image`, `read_time`, `meta_tags`, `meta_description`, `schema_code`, `user_id`, `excerpt`, `slug`, `author`, `author_id`, `status`, `lang`, `publish_date`, `total_visitors`, `created_at`, `updated_at`, `breaking_news`, `video_url`, `faqs`) VALUES
(83, 'Looking for Hunter Alternatives? Try these 11 Websites Like Hunter!', '<p><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">No doubt! <strong>Hunter Alternatives</strong> is one of the best resources for quickly finding and verifying email addresses, domain search and API integration.</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">&nbsp;</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">Hunter offers a LinkedIn Chrome extension if you want to obtain contact information straight from LinkedIn or business websites while doing lead research.</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">&nbsp;</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">It provides </span><a href=\"https://go4database.com/blog/email-finder-tools\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#1155cc\">bulk email finding tool</span></a><span style=\"color:#666666\"> and bulk email verification features which help generate and validate email lists on a single platform.</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">&nbsp;</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">It integrates with CRMs like Salesforce and HubSpot, which makes it easy to manage contacts and the platform offers a free plan with limited searches.</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">&nbsp;</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">Provides campaign control and link tracking features with a user-friendly interface.</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">&nbsp;</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">Offers a free plan.</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">&nbsp;</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">Provides a domain search feature to find all email addresses connected to a domain.</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">&nbsp;</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">You are notified by its job change filter, every time a prospect changes their employment role or firm.</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">&nbsp;</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">Automatically sends out job change notices and email sequences.</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">&nbsp;</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<blockquote>\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\"><strong>Who are Hunter alternatives?</strong></span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><br />\r\n<span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">Hunter is a 100% well-known email search &amp; verification platform. and If you&#39;re exploring its alternatives in the market, then there are some good options on internet like Go4Database, Lusha, Apollo.io, Snov.io, UpLead, ZoomInfo and RocketReach. They all offer similar features&mdash;like email search, lead generation and emails leads verification. But every company has its own USPs and pricing plan. but every company has their own fiment as per customer&#39;s expectations.</span></span></span></p>\r\n</blockquote>\r\n\r\n<p><br />\r\n&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<h2><span style=\"font-size:24pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#434343\">While Hunter simplifies email prospecting, there are a few limitations such as:</span></span></span></h2>\r\n\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li style=\"list-style-type:disc\"><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">Face difficulty in finding emails even if they are available online elsewhere</span></span></span></li>\r\n	<li style=\"list-style-type:disc\"><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">Providing fewer contact information</span></span></span></li>\r\n	<li style=\"list-style-type:disc\"><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">Lack of accuracy in data</span></span></span></li>\r\n	<li style=\"list-style-type:disc\"><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">Providing emails with business domain addresses only.</span></span></span></li>\r\n	<li style=\"list-style-type:disc\"><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">Limited searches are available in Hunter&nbsp;free plan.</span></span></span></li>\r\n	<li style=\"list-style-type:disc\"><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">The paid plans can be quite expensive.</span></span></span></li>\r\n	<li style=\"list-style-type:disc\"><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">Once emails are removed from a website or source, they are automatically removed on Hunter&nbsp;too, as they extract leads directly from the web.</span></span></span></li>\r\n	<li style=\"list-style-type:disc\"><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">No AI email assistant.</span></span></span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">&nbsp;</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<h2><span style=\"font-size:24pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#434343\">You can use similar tools like Hunter</span></span></span></h2>\r\n\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;1.&nbsp; </span><a href=\"https://go4database.com/blog/hunter.io-alternatives#1-go4database\"><span style=\"color:#1155cc\">Go4Database</span></a></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;2.&nbsp; </span><a href=\"https://go4database.com/blog/hunter.io-alternatives#2-uplead\"><span style=\"color:#1155cc\">UpLead</span></a></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;3.&nbsp; </span><a href=\"https://go4database.com/blog/hunter.io-alternatives#3-lusha\"><span style=\"color:#1155cc\">Lusha</span></a></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;4.&nbsp; </span><a href=\"https://go4database.com/blog/hunter.io-alternatives#4-seamlessai\"><span style=\"color:#1155cc\">Seamless.AI</span></a></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;5.&nbsp; </span><a href=\"https://go4database.com/blog/hunter.io-alternatives#5-apolloio\"><span style=\"color:#1155cc\">Apollo.io</span></a></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;6.&nbsp; </span><a href=\"https://go4database.com/blog/hunter.io-alternatives#6-bookyourdata\"><span style=\"color:#1155cc\">BookYourData</span></a></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;7.&nbsp; </span><a href=\"https://go4database.com/blog/hunter.io-alternatives#7-cognism\"><span style=\"color:#1155cc\">Cognism</span></a></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;8.&nbsp; </span><a href=\"https://go4database.com/blog/hunter.io-alternatives#8-snovio\"><span style=\"color:#1155cc\">Snov.io</span></a></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;9.&nbsp; </span><a href=\"https://go4database.com/blog/hunter.io-alternatives#9-rocketreach\"><span style=\"color:#1155cc\">RocketReach</span></a></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;10. </span><a href=\"https://go4database.com/blog/hunter.io-alternatives#10-lead411\"><span style=\"color:#1155cc\">Lead411</span></a></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;11. </span><a href=\"https://go4database.com/blog/hunter.io-alternatives#10-lead411\"><span style=\"color:#1155cc\">ZoomInfo</span></a></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">&nbsp;</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">The following listed apps are highly effective alternatives to Hunter, used by many professionals, and business owners, for the generation of leads. If you are looking for sites like Hunter, these apps can be a better option.</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">&nbsp;</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<h3><span style=\"font-size:20pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#434343\">1. Go4Database</span></span></span></h3>\r\n\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">This platform truly deserves to be on the top of the list as it is one of the leading </span><a href=\"https://www.go4database.com/blog/sales-lead-generation\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#1155cc\">lead generation companies</span></a><span style=\"color:#666666\"> that provides comprehensive B2B &amp; B2C databases to help businesses connect with the right audience.</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">&nbsp;</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">Provides access to a vast database of verified business contacts.</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><br />\r\n&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<div id=\"blogTLDR\">\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\"><strong>TL;DR</strong></span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">Go4Database is a top lead generation platform offering 95% accurate, real-time verified B2B &amp; B2C contacts. It provides affordable plans, advanced filters, excellent support, and customized services. Compared to Hunter, it offers better data accuracy, more features, flexible payments, and a larger, global database&mdash;ideal for startups and businesses.</span></span></span></p>\r\n</div>\r\n\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">It supports almost all small companies, freelancers and startups to find their right audience for business generation at a very affordable price.</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">&nbsp;</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">Go4Database itself suggests to consumers that they first use it and then believe it.</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">&nbsp;</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">Offers the best support facilities to help to deal with all types of issues by answering queries through phone calls, live chat and Email support.</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">&nbsp;</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">&nbsp;Go4Database identifies new opportunities and builds </span><a href=\"https://www.go4database.com/blog/marketing-mailing-list\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#1155cc\">targeted marketing mailing list</span></a><span style=\"color:#666666\"> using the most up-to-date records of the database.</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">&nbsp;</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">Go4database contains the information of targeted customers in the form of lists such as phone lists, </span><a href=\"https://www.go4database.com/blog/buy-email-list\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#1155cc\">email list</span></a><span style=\"color:#666666\">, business lists, consumer lists, website lists etc.</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">&nbsp;</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">Provides email marketing services, marketing mailing lists and </span><a href=\"https://go4database.com/b2b/industry-mailing-list\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#1155cc\">industry-specific email list</span></a><span style=\"color:#666666\"> which help businesses to reach their target audience efficiently.</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">&nbsp;</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">Offers data enrichment service which helps in enhancing the quality of the contact database ensuring higher reliability and accuracy.</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li style=\"list-style-type:disc\"><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">Offers affordable pricing and various payment options.</span></span></span></li>\r\n	<li style=\"list-style-type:disc\"><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">Provides the most accurate data with 95% reliability.</span></span></span></li>\r\n	<li style=\"list-style-type:disc\"><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">Offers customized lead generation services.</span></span></span></li>\r\n	<li style=\"list-style-type:disc\"><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">Delivers data in an easily downloadable format.</span></span></span></li>\r\n	<li style=\"list-style-type:disc\"><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">Great for all kinds of businesses &amp; companies especially startups.</span></span></span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<h4><span style=\"font-size:18pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#434343\">Limitations of Go4Database</span></span></span></h4>\r\n\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li style=\"list-style-type:disc\"><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">No refund policy.</span></span></span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">&nbsp;</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<h4><span style=\"font-size:18pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#434343\">Go4Database Vs Hunter</span></span></span></h4>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">&nbsp;</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">Go4Database offers 95% accuracy and reliability whereas Hunter claims 90% accuracy.</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">&nbsp;</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">Go4Database provides the most affordable pricing plans whereas the pricing of Hunter is considered a little expensive.</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">&nbsp;</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">With Go4Database users access unlimited list creation in lower-tier plans. Hunter users often face restrictions on list size.</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">&nbsp;</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">Go4Database offers real-time verified leads with relevance whereas Hunter faced complaints regarding contact details, as they extract leads directly from the web.</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">&nbs