(84, 'ZoomInfo Pricing Breakdown 2026: Everything You Need To Know Before Buying', '<p><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">ZoomInfo is a popular email marketing platform that offers a large database and robust B2B prospecting features.</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><br />\r\n<span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">But most users feel that <strong>ZoomInfo pricing</strong> plans are pretty complex to understand.</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><br />\r\n<span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">If you&#39;re among them. Then you&rsquo;re in the right place.</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">Don&#39;t worry. In this blog post, I will walk you through everything that you should know before </span></span></span><a href=\"https://www.go4database.com\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#3498db\"><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\">buying your email lists</span></span></span></a><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">.</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><br />\r\n<span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">Let&#39;s break the mystery and reveal ZoomInfo pricing that is truly worth investing in for your business.</span></span></span><br />\r\n&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<blockquote>\r\n<p><strong><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">What is ZoomInfo?</span></span></span></strong></p>\r\n\r\n<p><br />\r\n<span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">ZoomInfo is a B2B data platform that helps businesses find and connect with ideal prospects. It offers accurate contact details, company insights, and tools for sales, marketing, and recruiting.</span></span></span></p>\r\n</blockquote>\r\n\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<h2><span style=\"font-size:24pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#434343\">What is ZoomInfo&#39;s cost? Complete BreakDown</span></span></span></h2>\r\n\r\n<p><br />\r\n<span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">ZoomInfo&#39;s cost begins with a professional plan, which is billed annually at $14,995. This has 5000 credits and access for up to 3 individuals.</span></span></span><br />\r\n&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<div id=\"blogTLDR\">\r\n<p><strong><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">TL;DR:</span></span></span></strong></p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">ZoomInfo&#39;s annual fees start at $14,995, increasing with more users, credits, and extras. They offer Professional, Advanced, and Elite plans, each fitting different company sizes. Bulk purchases of users or credits result in discounts. If you want a clever, cheaper option, check out Go4Database to get adaptable data answers.</span></span></span></p>\r\n</div>\r\n\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">But here&rsquo;s a thing: your total cost depends on the three factors. What is it?</span></span></span><br />\r\n&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">The plan you choose, how many users you need, and the number of credits you will use.</span></span></span><br />\r\n&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">Besides, if you&#39;re looking for any extra features or add-ons for your business needs, the plan breaks down further.</span></span></span><br />\r\n&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">How? Let me make this simple: the following three main plans ZoomInfo offers</span></span></span><br />\r\n&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<h3><span style=\"font-size:20pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#434343\">Professional plan</span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">&nbsp;</span></span></span></h3>\r\n\r\n<p><br />\r\n<span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">This costs $14,995 annually, and it comes with an upgrade of 5000 bulk credits/year. Here, you have to bear an additional cost of $1500 per person.</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><br />\r\n<span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\"><strong>Best fit: </strong></span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">this plan is well-suited for new to medium-sized businesses with a goal of </span></span></span><a href=\"https://www.go4database.com/blog/lead-generation-guide\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#3498db\"><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\">large lead generation</span></span></span></a><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">&nbsp;but with a little marketing needs.</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<h3><br />\r\n<span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">Advanced plan</span></span></span></h3>\r\n\r\n<p><br />\r\n<span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">It costs $24,995 in year, and it includes up to 10,000 bulk credits/year, plus 1,000 monthly credits for users.</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><br />\r\n<span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">So, if you want to add more users to your ZoomInfo subscription, it will cost you around $2,500 per extra user.</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><br />\r\n<span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">But here&rsquo;s the silver lining: if your plan is to extend your team beyond 30 individuals, you might be eligible for a discount in that situation; each additional user may cost roughly $2,250, which is a nice method to save money on the overall costs.</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><br />\r\n<span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\"><strong>Best fit:</strong></span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\"> This is suitable for medium- to large-sized businesses that are specifically looking for intent data to reach the ideal customer.</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<h3><br />\r\n<span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">Elite plan</span></span></span></h3>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">It costs $39,995 annually, it includes 10,000 monthly credits per user. You will receive a majority of the add-ons and features in this package.</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><br />\r\n<span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\"><strong>Best fit: </strong></span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">This plan is suitable for large businesses that want to get deeper insights, advanced tools, and high-value prospecting.</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><br />\r\n<span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">This price will vary depending on the total number of credits and users you have added. Generally, the more credits you buy, the lower the cost per credit becomes.</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><br />\r\n<span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">Say, for example, if you start with 5000 credits at around $0.60 each, the rate can drop significantly, up to $0.20 per credit for over 250,500 credits.</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><br />\r\n<span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">Plus, if you get add-ons like WorldwideData, FormComplete, InboxAI premium, and compliances, they will majorly influence the total cost.</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><br />\r\n<span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">Experience flexibility with </span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\"><strong>Go4Database monthly plans.</strong></span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<h2><span style=\"font-size:24pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#434343\">Choose the Right ZoomInfo Pricing Plan That Fits Your Business Goals</span></span></span></h2>\r\n\r\n<p><br />\r\n<span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">Here is a quick glance at the pricing plan of ZoomInfo<strong>&nbsp;</strong></span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">to help you determine which plan is ideal for your business needs:</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<table border=\"1\" cellpadding=\"1\" cellspacing=\"1\" class=\"table table-bordered\" style=\"width:800px\">\r\n	<tbody>\r\n		<tr>\r\n			<td><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#434343\"><strong>Features</strong></span></span></span></td>\r\n			<td><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#434343\"><strong>Lite</strong></span></span></span></td>\r\n			<td><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#434343\"><strong>Professional</strong></span></span></span></td>\r\n			<td><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#434343\"><strong>Advanced</strong></span></span></span></td>\r\n			<td><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#434343\"><strong>Elite</strong></span></span></span></td>\r\n		</tr>\r\n		<tr>\r\n			<td><strong><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">Starting Price</span></span></span></strong></td>\r\n			<td><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">Free Trial</span></span></span></td>\r\n			<td><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">$14,995</span></span></span></td>\r\n			<td><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">$24,995</span></span></span></td>\r\n			<td><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">$39,995</span></span></span></td>\r\n		</tr>\r\n		<tr>\r\n			<td><strong><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=