yle=\"color:#666666\">Not-included</span></span></span></td>\r\n			<td><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">Not-included</span></span></span></td>\r\n			<td><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">Not-included</span></span></span></td>\r\n			<td><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">Included</span></span></span></td>\r\n		</tr>\r\n	</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n\r\n<div>&nbsp;</div>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">By now, you must have skimmed through the pricing plans and got the rough idea of which plan suits your business needs.</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><br />\r\n<span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">Let&#39;s dive a little deeper and figure out which one perfectly makes sense.</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">There are four types of ZoomInfo pricing plans: Lite, Professional, Advanced, and Elite. Each of these plans is created as per the business needs.</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<blockquote>\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#434343\"><strong>Also Read:</strong></span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">&nbsp; </span><a href=\"https://www.go4database.com/blog/what-is-zoominfo\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#3498db\">Digging Into ZoomInfo: Features, Products, Pricing &amp; Plans [2026 Guide]</span></a></span></span></p>\r\n</blockquote>\r\n\r\n<p><br />\r\n<span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">Let&rsquo;s dig in and explore ZoomInfo pricing plans</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<h2><span style=\"font-size:24pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#434343\">Table of contents</span></span></span></h2>\r\n\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">&nbsp; &nbsp;1. </span><a href=\"https://go4database.com/blog/zoominfo-pricing#zoominfo-professional-pricing-plans\"><span style=\"color:#3498db\">ZoomInfo professional pricing plans</span></a></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">&nbsp; &nbsp;2. </span><a href=\"https://go4database.com/blog/zoominfo-pricing#zoominfo-advanced-pricing-plans\"><span style=\"color:#3498db\">ZoomInfo advanced pricing plans</span></a></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">&nbsp; &nbsp;3. </span><a href=\"https://go4database.com/blog/zoominfo-pricing#zoominfo-elite-pricing-plans\"><span style=\"color:#3498db\">ZoomInfo elite pricing plans</span></a></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">It&rsquo;s totally free! You can access up to 10 contacts each month from their database. But there&rsquo;s a little catch here: you&rsquo;ll need to share your contact headers and email signature blocks.</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><br />\r\n<span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">This helps </span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><a href=\"https://www.zoominfo.com/\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#3498db\">ZoomInfo</span></a><span style=\"color:#666666\"><strong> </strong></span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">keep its information up to date, which is pretty cool. Honestly, it&rsquo;s a fantastic way for individuals or small businesses to test-run without any commitment before jumping into a paid plan.</span></span></span><br />\r\n&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<h3><span style=\"font-size:20pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#434343\">ZoomInfo professional pricing plans</span></span></span></h3>\r\n\r\n<p><br />\r\n<span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">This is like a gateway for you to access ZoomInfo features; you will have access to their database, enabling direct contact with your prospect and allowing you to build </span></span></span><a href=\"https://www.go4database.com/blog/buy-email-list\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#3498db\"><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\">targeted email lists</span></span></span></a><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">.</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><br />\r\n<span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">This type of plan is best suited for new users or small businesses looking to get basic data. The price is $15,000 annually, I know is a bit expensive for small businesses.</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><br />\r\n<span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">But you can give a shot for a free trial before buying a paid plan, and you also get familiar with the platform</span></span></span><br />\r\n&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<h3><span style=\"font-size:20pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#434343\">ZoomInfo advanced pricing plans</span></span></span></h3>\r\n\r\n<p><br />\r\n<span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">These pricing plans will take you a step further; you can get in-depth insights such as information, location, organization charts, and intent data.</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><br />\r\n<span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">It is best suited for businesses with a goal of a structured approach to campaigns, ready to invest in more quality data.</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><br />\r\n<span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">The price is more than the professional plan, and so, you have to connect with ZoomInfo sales teams to get the accurate costs and details.</span></span></span><br />\r\n&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<h3><span style=\"font-size:20pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#434343\">ZoomInfo elite pricing plans</span></span></span></h3>\r\n\r\n<p><br />\r\n<span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">This is the most advanced ZoomInfo pricing plan; it is loaded with all the premium features, such as real-time intent signals, powerful sales automation, and deep data insights.</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><br />\r\n<span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">This is suitable for businesses looking to supercharge their marketing and sales outreach by using robust tools and features.</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><br />\r\n<span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">It&#39;s interesting to know how ZoomInfo keeps on <strong>list building tools</strong> on the previous plan. It starts with basics, from having access to a simple database, and gradually adding more advanced tools for sales and marketing automation.</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<blockquote>\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#434343\"><strong>Also Read:</strong></span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">&nbsp; </span><a href=\"https://www.go4database.com/blog/list-building-tools\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#3498db\">List building tools and Optimization for regular lead generation - Best explained</span></a></span></span></p>\r\n</blockquote>\r\n\r\n<p><br />\r\n<span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">The more you move up on the pricing tiers, the more you will access richer the data and extra features.</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><br />\r\n<span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">On top of that, you can add extras like email verification depending on your needs.<br />\r\n&nbsp;&nbsp;</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<h2><span style=\"font-size:24pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#434343\">What is ZoomInfo Pricing Per User?</span></span></span></h2>\r\n\r\n<p><br />\r\n<span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">Well, this depends upon the price you choose and the amount of data you need as per your business needs. For example, if you choose the professional plan, the cost per contact will be $2.99 ($14,995 per 5000 credits).</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<div id=\"BigCTA\" style=\"background:#e7fde7; border:1px solid #6fd943; padding:20px 50px\">\r\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://go4database.com/assets/uploads/media-uploader/yellow-and-blue-bold-marketing-agency-with-hexagon-frame-linkedin-banner-1-removebg-preview1734171422.png\" style=\"height:50px; width:200px\" /></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><strong><span style=\"font-size:24pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\">Cut costs, not quality!</span></span></span></strong></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">Get verified quality leads at a fraction of the cost without paying a huge price.</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://app.go4database.com/login?utm_source=BlogPage&amp;utm_medium=Internal&amp;utm_campaign=app_login\" id=\"TrailBtn\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#3498db\"><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\">Switch to Go4Database today!</span></span></span></a><br />\r\n&nbsp;</p>\r\n</div>\r\n\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<h2><span style=\"font-size:24pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#434343\">What&#39;s Included in the ZoomInfo Free Trial?</span></span></span></h2>\r\n\r\n<p><br />\r\n<span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">If you&#39;re looking for a paid plan, I would recommend you go for the ZoomInfo free trial and take a test run to know how the platform works before purchasing the subscription.</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><br />\r\n<span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">However, ZoomInfo provides a free trial on all plans, but the duration is not disclosed on the company&rsquo;s website.</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><br />\r\n<span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">Some users have reported 