r\n\r\n<p style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">&nbsp;</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<h3 style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:20pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#434343\">2. ZoomInfo</span></span></span></h3>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">&nbsp;</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">ZoomInfo is one of the best enterprise-level Saleshandy alternatives.</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">&nbsp;</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">Helps in finding verified B2B leads and is ideal for enterprise-level companies.</span></span></span><br />\r\n&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<div id=\"blogTLDR\">\r\n<p style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\"><strong>TL;DR</strong></span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">ZoomInfo is a premium B2B sales and marketing platform ideal for enterprises. It offers verified leads, sales automation, visitor tracking, and tools for talent acquisition and marketing. While powerful, it&rsquo;s expensive and best suited for large businesses, with some limitations in exporting lead data to external platforms.</span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">&nbsp;</span></span></span></p>\r\n</div>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">It is an all-in-one platform for marketing and sales information, not just a prospecting tool.</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">&nbsp;</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">ZoomInfo offers various services for marketing, talent acquisition and business operations.</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">&nbsp;</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">ZoomInfo ensures that everything you need to find the right leads and their information is in one place.</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">&nbsp;</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">Data-powered sales engagement that triggers automatic sales plays based on market signals.</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">&nbsp;</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">Additionally, it provides specialized services to assist you acquire top people in your business, develop marketing campaigns, and optimize sales funnels.</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">&nbsp;</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">This software can be used by marketing and sales teams to identify and turn potential consumers into paying clients.</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">&nbsp;</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">Offers website visitor tracking services to help you turn inbound traffic into outbound marketing- a strong competitor in the cold email software space.</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">&nbsp;</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<h4 style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:18pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#434343\">Drawbacks of ZoomInfo</span></span></span></h4>\r\n\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li style=\"list-style-type:disc\"><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">Costly</span></span></span></li>\r\n	<li style=\"list-style-type:disc\"><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">Suitable for enterprises only.</span></span></span></li>\r\n	<li style=\"list-style-type:disc\"><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">Issues in exporting lead data to other platforms via integration.</span></span></span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"text-align:justify\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<blockquote>\r\n<p style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\"><strong>Also Read:</strong> </span><a href=\"https://go4database.com/blog/what-is-zoominfo\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#1155cc\">Digging Into ZoomInfo: Features, Products, Pricing &amp; Plans [2025 Guide]</span></a></span></span></p>\r\n</blockquote>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"text-align:justify\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<h3 style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:20pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#434343\">3. Exact Data</span></span></span></h3>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">&nbsp;</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">In the field of multi-channel direct marketing, Exact Data has been an early adopter and one of the best alternatives to Saleshandy.</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">&nbsp;</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">Exact Data is the prominent source for both online and offline business and consumer behavioral data, specializing in postal, email, and telephone list solutions.</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">&nbsp;</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">Exact Data worked to build and enhance our consumer and business databases.</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">&nbsp;</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">A thorough data hygiene procedure is regularly applied to its extensive databases to ensure that all selections, new movers and new addresses are correct and updated.</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">&nbsp;</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">Exact Data offers the industry&rsquo;s most comprehensive set of data-driven marketing solutions for the SMB market.</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">&nbsp;</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">Providing an approximate 95% deliverability rate makes it a great choice in the email outreach tools segment.</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">&nbsp;</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">Due to its well-known affordability, small and medium-sized organizations can now use Exact Data.</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">&nbsp;</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<h4 style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:18pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#434343\">Drawbacks of Exact Data</span></span></span></h4>\r\n\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li style=\"list-style-type:disc\"><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">Data Quality Concerns</span></span></span></li>\r\n	<li style=\"list-style-type:disc\"><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">Data Security</span></span></span></li>\r\n	<li style=\"list-style-type:disc\"><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">The data that Exact Data provides may not always be up-to-date according to certain users&#39; reports.</span></span></span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">&nbsp;</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<h3 style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:20pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#434343\">4. LeadIQ</span></span></span></h3>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">&nbsp;</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">LeadIQ is a B2B lead generation platform that uses automation and helps in