67852141 or by using official email address </span></span></span><a href=\"mailto:info@go4database.com\" style=\"text-decoration:none\"><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#1155cc\"><u>info@go4database.com</u></span></span></span></a></p>\r\n\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>', NULL, 16, 'a:1:{i:0;s:2:\"19\";}', 'Saleshandy Alternatives', '780', NULL, 'Top 10 Saleshandy Alternatives & Competitors (2025)', 'Discover the top 10 Saleshandy alternatives with better features, pricing, and performance to boost your sales outreach in 2025.', '<script type=\"application/ld+json\">\r\n{\r\n  \"@context\": \"https://schema.org\",\r\n  \"@type\": \"Organization\",\r\n  \"name\": \"Go4Database\",\r\n  \"url\": \"https://www.go4database.com/\",\r\n  \"logo\": \"https://go4database.com/assets/uploads/media-uploader/go4database-logo1751528079.png\",\r\n  \"contactPoint\": {\r\n    \"@type\": \"ContactPoint\",\r\n    \"telephone\": \"+ 1 786 785 2141\",\r\n    \"contactType\": \"customer service\",\r\n    \"areaServed\": \"US\",\r\n    \"availableLanguage\": \"en\"\r\n  },\r\n  \"sameAs\": [\r\n    \"https://www.facebook.com/Go4Database\",\r\n    \"https://twitter.com/DatabaseGo4\",\r\n    \"https://www.instagram.com/go4database/\",\r\n    \"https://www.youtube.com/@Go4Database\",\r\n    \"https://www.linkedin.com/company/go4database/\",\r\n    \"https://in.pinterest.com/gofourdatabase/\"\r\n  ]\r\n}\r\n</script>\r\n\r\n\r\n<script type=\"application/ld+json\">\r\n{\r\n  \"@context\": \"https://schema.org\",\r\n  \"@type\": \"BlogPosting\",\r\n  \"mainEntityOfPage\": {\r\n    \"@type\": \"WebPage\",\r\n    \"@id\": \"https://www.go4database.com/blog/saleshandy-alternatives\"\r\n  },\r\n  \"headline\": \"Top 10 Saleshandy Alternatives with Better Features!\",\r\n  \"description\": \"Saleshandy is one of the best B2B lead finders that helps the client automate and scale personalized cold emails with 95% data accuracy.\r\n\r\n \r\n\r\nYou can effectively scale your cold email campaigns for lead generation with Saleshandy.\",\r\n  \"image\": \"https://www.go4database.com/assets/uploads/media-uploader/saleshandy-alternatives-go4database1753247430.webp\",  \r\n  \"author\": {\r\n    \"@type\": \"Person\",\r\n    \"name\": \"Deepa Tyagi\"\r\n  },  \r\n  \"publisher\": {\r\n    \"@type\": \"Organization\",\r\n    \"name\": \"\",\r\n    \"logo\": {\r\n      \"@type\": \"ImageObject\",\r\n      \"url\": \"\"\r\n    }\r\n  },\r\n  \"datePublished\": \"2025-07-23\",\r\n  \"dateModified\": \"2025-09-09\"\r\n}\r\n</script>\r\n<script type=\"application/ld+json\">\r\n         {         \r\n            \"@context\": \"https://schema.org/\",         \r\n            \"@type\": \"WebPage\",         \r\n            \"@id\": \"#WebPage\",         \r\n            \"url\": \"https://www.go4database.com/blog/saleshandy-alternatives\",          \r\n            \"name\": \"Top 10 Saleshandy Alternatives with Better Features!\"\r\n          } \r\n      </script>\r\n<script type=\"application/ld+json\">\r\n{\r\n  \"@context\": \"https://schema.org\",\r\n  \"@type\": \"BlogPosting\",\r\n  \"mainEntityOfPage\": {\r\n    \"@type\": \"WebPage\",\r\n    \"@id\": \"https://www.go4database.com/blog/saleshandy-alternatives\"\r\n  },\r\n  \"headline\": \"Top 10 Saleshandy Alternatives with Better Features!\",\r\n  \"description\": \"Saleshandy is one of the best B2B lead finders that helps the client automate and scale personalized cold emails with 95% data accuracy.\r\n\r\n \r\n\r\nYou can effectively scale your cold email campaigns for lead generation with Saleshandy.\",\r\n  \"image\": \"https://www.go4database.com/assets/uploads/media-uploader/saleshandy-alternatives-go4database1753247430.webp\",  \r\n  \"author\": {\r\n    \"@type\": \"Person\",\r\n    \"name\": \"Deepa Tyagi\"\r\n  },  \r\n  \"publisher\": {\r\n    \"@type\": \"Organization\",\r\n    \"name\": \"\",\r\n    \"logo\": {\r\n      \"@type\": \"ImageObject\",\r\n      \"url\": \"\"\r\n    }\r\n  },\r\n  \"datePublished\": \"2025-07-23\",\r\n  \"dateModified\": \"2025-09-11\"\r\n}\r\n</script>\r\n<script type=\"application/ld+json\">\r\n{\r\n  \"@context\": \"https://schema.org/\", \r\n  \"@type\": \"BreadcrumbList\", \r\n  \"itemListElement\": [{\r\n    \"@type\": \"ListItem\", \r\n    \"position\": 1, \r\n    \"name\": \"Home\",\r\n    \"item\": \"https://www.go4database.com/\"  \r\n  },{\r\n    \"@type\": \"ListItem\", \r\n    \"position\": 2, \r\n    \"name\": \"Blog\",\r\n    \"item\": \"https://www.go4database.com/blog\"  \r\n  },{\r\n    \"@type\": \"ListItem\", \r\n    \"position\": 3, \r\n    \"name\": \"Top 10 Saleshandy Alternatives with Better Features!\",\r\n    \"item\": \"https://www.go4database.com/blog/saleshandy-alternatives\"  \r\n  }]\r\n}\r\n</script>', '1', 'Saleshandy is one of the best B2B lead finders that helps the client automate and scale personalized cold emails with 95% data accuracy.', 'saleshandy-alternatives', 'Deepa Tyagi', 7, 'publish', 'en_US', '2025-07-23', '2658', '2025-06-18 14:20:06', '2026-06-10 15:46:51', 0, NULL, '[{\"question\":\"Who should use Go4Database instead of Saleshandy?\",\"answer\":\"Go4database is best for users who want to purchase and own their data, manage outreach independently, or need flexibility without being tied to a platform subscription. It\\u2019s particularly suitable for small businesses, solo professionals, or agencies running custom campaigns.\"},{\"question\":\"What are the main benefits of Go4Database over Saleshandy alternatives?\",\"answer\":\"Direct access to a wide variety of industry-specific and regional business email list.\\r\\n\\r\\nNo recurring fees or subscription lock-in.\\r\\n\\r\\nFull control over how and when you use the data.\\r\\n\\r\\nSuitable for both short-term and long-term prospecting needs.\"},{\"question\":\"How does Go4Database\\u2019s pricing compare to Saleshandy?\",\"answer\":\"Go4database offers straightforward, one-time payments for each list, making it cost-effective for targeted campaigns. In contrast, Saleshandy and its main alternatives typically use monthly or annual subscription models, which can be more expensive if you only need data occasionally.\"}]');
INSERT INTO `blogs` (`id`, `title`, `content`, `faq_content`, `blog_categories_id`, `categories_id`, `tags`, `image`, `read_time`, `meta_tags`, `meta_description`, `schema_code`, `user_id`, `excerpt`, `slug`, `author`, `author_id`, `status`, `lang`, `publish_date`, `total_visitors`, `created_at`, `updated_at`, `breaking_news`, `video_url`, `faqs`) VALUES
(86, '7 Reliable Platforms to Buy Email List', '<p><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">Hello, Go4Database family welcomes you! We hope that you have been well!</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">We can see that you have finally decided to buy an email list. Worried about where to buy it from? Well no worries, we are with you.</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">This blog is the answer to this particular question,<br />\r\n<br />\r\n&lsquo;From where to <strong>buy email list</strong>?&rsquo; Now before we start we need to know a bit here and there, so let&#39;s do that first. Okay?<br />\r\n&nbsp;</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<blockquote>\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#434343\"><strong>What&#39;s an email list?</strong></span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><br />\r\n<span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">According to What is an Email List in marketing?&nbsp;</span></span></span><br />\r\n&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">An email list is a collection of email addresses from people who gave their explicit consent to receive promotions, newsletters, updates, and other content from a brand.&nbsp;</span></span></span></p>\r\n</blockquote>\r\n\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">Email lists let you reach a large audience quickly. You can also segment your email list based on your audience&rsquo;s interests, shopping behavior, or other criteria to deliver hyper-personalized and relevant content.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nThrough email lists, you can forge long-term business relationships with your existing customers and win over new ones.&rdquo;</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<h2><span style=\"font-size:24pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#434343\">What benefits do you get when you buy an email list?</span></span></span></h2>\r\n\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li style=\"list-style-type:disc\"><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">You get instant access to your lead.</span></span></span></li>\r\n	<li style=\"list-style-type:disc\"><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">Reach a larger audience and potential customers.</span></span></span></li>\r\n	<li style=\"list-style-type:disc\"><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">Email marketing is indeed cost effective.</span></span></span></li>\r\n	<li style=\"list-style-type:disc\"><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">It further helps in increasing your brand&rsquo;s awareness.</span></span></span></li>\r\n	<li style=\"list-style-type:disc\"><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">Most importantly, it saves your time &amp; efforts.</span></span></span></li>\r\n	<li style=\"list-style-type:disc\"><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><a href=\"https://www.go4database.com/blog/targeted-email-list\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#3498db\">Targeted email list</span></a><span style=\"color:#666666\">&nbsp;help boost sales.</span></span></span></li>\r\n	<li style=\"list-style-type:disc\"><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span sty