(87, 'ZoomInfo Reviews: Is It the Best Tool to Buy Verified Email Lists in 2026?', '<p><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">It is very challenging for any sales and marketing team to scale their outreach game and stand out in the buzzing market.&nbsp;</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><br />\r\n<span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">So, it is very crucial to choose the </span></span></span><a href=\"https://www.go4database.com/blog/mailing-list\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#3498db\"><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\">right mailing list</span></span></span></a><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\"> </span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">from an accurate and trustworthy platform that will help you to connect with your ideal customer easily.</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><br />\r\n<span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">That&rsquo;s where top email list providers like ZoomInfo come in. They claim to provide verified email lists and real-time contact database enrichment to boost targeted outreach and streamline workflow.</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><br />\r\n<span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">Now, you must be wondering if ZoomInfo is reliable.</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><br />\r\n<span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">If you take a closer look, </span></span></span><a href=\"https://go4database.com/blog/what-is-zoominfo\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#3498db\"><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\">ZoomInfo</span></span></span></a><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\"><strong>&nbsp;</strong></span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">is a key player in the email marketing space. It&#39;s known for accuracy, speed, and helping businesses grow faster.&nbsp;</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><br />\r\n<span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">It is ideal for businesses looking for precision, speed, and growth.&nbsp;</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><br />\r\n<span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">Let&rsquo;s dive deep and discover whether ZoomInfo is truly legit and what are its reviews.</span></span></span><br />\r\n&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<h2><span style=\"font-size:24pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#434343\">Is ZoomInfo Legit?</span></span></span></h2>\r\n\r\n<p><br />\r\n<span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">ZoomInfo is a prominent sales intelligence tool that is a publicly traded company enables sales, marketing, and recruitment teams find their ideal prospects and connect with them by using tools like SalesOS and MarketingOS.</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><br />\r\n<span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">The company was founded in 2007 by Henry Schuck and named </span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\"><strong>DiscoverOrg.</strong></span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\"> Later in 2019, the company was acquired and rebranded its name as ZoomInfo.&nbsp;</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><br />\r\n<span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">In 2020, ZoomInfo went public. They have put tremendous efforts into </span></span></span><a href=\"https://www.go4database.com/blog/buy-email-list\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#3498db\"><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\">staying compliant</span></span></span></a><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\"><strong>&nbsp;</strong></span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">with data regulations like GDPR and CCPA.</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><br />\r\n<span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">While they are pretty transparent about sourcing their data and </span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><a href=\"https://go4database.com/email-verifier\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#3498db\">verified email database</span></a><span style=\"color:#3498db\"><strong>.</strong></span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><br />\r\n<span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">Despite this, many people raise concerns about their data quality.</span></span></span><br />\r\n&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<h2><span style=\"font-size:24pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#434343\">Overview of ZoomInfo B2B Intelligent Platform</span></span></span></h2>\r\n\r\n<p><br />\r\n<span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">The interesting thing about ZoomInfo is that you can get access to an extensive database ranging over 321 million business contacts.</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><br />\r\n<span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">As a result, it provides huge access to the company database, especially for sales, marketing, and recruitment teams.</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><br />\r\n<span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">In turn, businesses can push pipeline generation and close more deals.</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><br />\r\n<span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">Although it is a good tool, there are some pros and cons tied to it.&nbsp;</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><br />\r\n<span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">What&#39;s great? It helps to</span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\"><strong> </strong></span><a href=\"https://www.go4database.com/blog/lead-generation-guide\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#3498db\">scale lead generation</span></a><span style=\"color:#666666\"><strong>,</strong></span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">&nbsp;smart targeting through intent data, and easy CRM integration.</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><br />\r\n<span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">What&#39;s the drawback? Many users find pricing very complex; setup can be tricky, and UX learning curves cause friction.</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><br />\r\n<span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">On top of that, some users have reported outdated data and expensive prices for add-ons.</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><br />\r\n<span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">On the flip side, there are some users who claim ZoomInfo&rsquo;s in-depth data with smart targeting options through intent data enables boosting productivity and drive </span><a href=\"https://www.go4database.com/blog/sales-leads\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#3498db\">sales leads</span></a><span style=\"color:#666666\">.</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><br />\r\n<span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">To sum up, I feel the prices of ZoomInfo are indeed heavier on the pockets of small businesses. But it can be a great choice for companies with huge budgets and looking for extensive </span></span></span><a href=\"https://go4database.com/blog/go4database-vs-lusha\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#3498db\"><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\">verified B2B contacts</span></span></span></a><span style=\"color:#3498db\"><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\">.</span></span></span><br />\r\n&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<h2><span style=\"font-size:24pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#434343\">How does ZoomInfo Get its Data?</span></span></span></h2>\r\n\r\n<p><br />\r\n<span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">Have you ever wondered how ZoomInfo gets this data?</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><br />\r\n<span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">Well, the system scans over 28+ million websites daily, fetching details from press releases, news mentions, job listings, and more.</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><br />\r\n<span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">It further combines with users sharing their emails (with permission) and signatures. They follow data privacy rules to drive personal emails.</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><br />\r\n<span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">Apart from this, they pull in official data such as government filings and licensed data sets around public companies, mergers, and acquisitions.</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><br />\r\n<span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">After gathering all the data, the ZoomInfo research team fine-tunes the data and makes it clean and reliable.</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><br />\r\n<span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">Finally, it is churned into a huge refreshed data set of over 321 million and 14+ million companies.&nbsp;</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><br />\r\n<span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">Hence, this is how you will get the most accurate data from </span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><a href=\"https://www.zoominfo.com/\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#3498db\">ZoomInfo</span></a><span style=\"color:#3498db\"><strong>. </strong></span></span></span><br />\r\n<span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\"><strong>&nbsp;</strong></span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<div id=\"BigCTA\" style=\"background:#e7fde7; border:1px solid #6fd943; padding:20px 50px\">\r\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://go4database.com/assets/uploads/media-uploader/yellow-and-blue-bold-marketing-agency-with-hexagon-frame-linkedin-banner-1-removebg-preview1734171422.png\" style=\"height:50px; width:200px\" /></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><strong><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\">No More Guesswork, Just Clean Data</span></span></span></strong></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">Say goodbye to stale or mismatched info&mdash;Go4Database is 95%+ accurate.</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:20px\"><a href=\"https://app.go4database.com/login?utm_source=BlogPage&amp;utm_medium=Internal&amp;utm_campaign=login\" id=\"TrailBtn\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\">Start Your Free Demo</span></a></span><br />\r\n&nbsp;</p>\r\n</div>\r\n\r\n<h2><span style=\"font-size:24pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#434343\">How Trustworthy is ZoomInfo&rsquo;s Data?</span></span></span></h2>\r\n\r\n<p><br />\r\n<span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">As mentioned above, you will get to know how much effort ZoomInfo puts into making its data reliable.&nbsp;</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><br />\r\n<span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">They claim to provide 99.9 per cent platform availability monthly and guarantee to refund if there is any failure to maintain the service.</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><br />\r\n<span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">Plus, they promise to offer 95% data accuracy and provide a refund if the data turns invalid.&nbsp;</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><br />\r\n<span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">Well, to be honest, some of the users have reported that the data quality is outdated most of the time.&nbsp;</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><br />\r\n<span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">However, with a big research team and constant updates, most of the users trust ZoomInfo&rsquo;s data.</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><br />\r\n<span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">Just to avoid the bottlenecks, double-check the data before sending the </span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><a href=\"https://www.go4database.com/blog/buy-email-list\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#3498db\">email lists</span></a><span style=\"color:#666666\"><strong>.&nbsp;</strong></span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<div id=\"BigCTA\" style=\"background:#e7fde7; border:1px solid #6fd943; padding:20px 50px\">\r\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://go4database.com/assets/uploads/media-uploader/yellow-and-blue-bold-marketing-agency-with-hexagon-frame-linkedin-banner-1-removebg-preview1734171422.png\" style=\"height:50px; width:200px\" /></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><strong><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\">Reliable Data, Not ZoomInfo Prices</span></span></span></strong></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">Go4Database gives you enterprise-grade B2B contacts without the ZoomInfo price tag.</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:20px\"><a href=\"https://app.go4database.com/login?utm_source=BlogPage&amp;utm_medium=Internal&amp;utm_campaign=login\" id=\"TrailBtn\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\">Compare &amp; Switch</span></a></span><br />\r\n&nbsp;</p>\r\n</div>\r\n\r\n<h2><span style=\"font-size:24pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#434343\">ZoomInfo Reviews Based on Reddit Users</span></span></span></h2>\r\n\r\n<p><br />\r\n<span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">When I went through the ZoomInfo reviews on Reddit of past 2 years, the <strong>ZoomInfo pricing</strong> starts from $15,000 per year for 3 users, with no option for Individual users.</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><br />\r\n<span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">A sales representative reported that a simple ZoomInfo package will roughly cost $ 7000 annually, but even this is eligible when you log in as a company, not as an individual.</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><br />\r\n<span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">Perhaps the prices must have been shifted, but this is the baseline to understand the pricing structure of ZoomInfo.</span></span></span><br />\r\n&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<blockquote>\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\"><strong>Also Read:</strong></span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">&nbsp; </span></span></span><a href=\"https://go4database.com/blog/zoominfo-pricing\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#3498db\"><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Nunito,sans-serif\">ZoomInfo Pricing: Everything You Need To Know Before Buying</span></span></span></a></p>\r\n</blockquote>\r\n\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<h2><span style=\"font-size:24pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#434343\">ZoomInfo Pricing Reviews</span></span></span></h2>\r\n\r\n<p><br />\r\n<span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">Although ZoomInfo claims that it provides </span><a href=\"https://www.go4database.com/b2b/healthcare-industry-email-list\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#3498db\">95% accurate data</span></a><span style=\"color:#666666\"> from its extensive contact database, its pricing has always been a concern for users.</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><br />\r\n<span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">According to the ZoomInfo pricing reviews, it appears that many businesses or organisations find it complex and also cumbersome, especially to get a request quote for pricing details.&nbsp;</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><br />\r\n<span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">Plus, it seems to be very difficult for a small business or organisation to rely on ZoomInfo due to its pricing, which is relatively very high.&nbsp;</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<div id=\"BigCTA\" style=\"background:#e7fde7; border:1px solid #6fd943; padding:20px 50px\">\r\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://go4database.com/assets/uploads/media-uploader/yellow-and-blue-bold-marketing-agency-with-hexagon-frame-linkedin-banner-1-removebg-preview1734171422.png\" style=\"height:50px; width:200px\" /></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><strong><span style=\"font-size:26px\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\">Trust Your Outreach with Verified Leads</span></span></span></strong></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">Unlike platforms with hidden flaws, Go4Database is transparent and reliable.</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:20px\"><a href=\"https://app.go4database.com/login?utm_source=BlogPage&amp;utm_medium=Internal&amp;utm_campaign=login\" id=\"TrailBtn\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\">Checkout Our Plans</span></a></span><br />\r\n&nbsp;</p>\r\n</div>\r\n\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<h2><span style=\"font-size:24pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#434343\">ZoomInfo Google Reviews</span></span></span></h2>\r\n\r\n<p><br />\r\n<span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">According to ZoomInfo Google reviews, many users found that the mobile interface is very difficult to use.</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><br />\r\n<span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">Many users reported that they were having trouble saving the searches, linking the contacts, and navigating. Also, some of them complained about data privacy regulations.</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><br />\r\n<span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">In contrast, the ZoomInfo Chrome extension has gotten some favourable responses, resulting in 4.0 out of 5 ratings.</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><br />\r\n<span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">People are delighted to get access to huge data and company info right from their browser.</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><br />\r\n<span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">It&#39;s a handy tool and a game-changer for sales and </span><span style=\"color:#4e5f70\">IT recruitment mailing List</span><span style=\"color:#4e5f70\"> </span><span style=\"color:#666666\">pros looking to boost their productivity.</span></span></span><br />\r\n&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<h2><span style=\"font-size:24pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#434343\">ZoomInfo Free Trial Reviews</span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">&nbsp;</span></span></span></h2>\r\n\r\n<p><br />\r\n<span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">If you&rsquo;re looking for a paid plan, I would recommend you try ZoomInfo&rsquo;s free trial and take a test run to see how the platform works before buying the subscription.</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><br />\r\n<span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">However, ZoomInfo provides a free trial on all plans, but the duration is not specified on the company&rsquo;s website.</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><br />\r\n<span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">Some users have reported that the trial lasts for 4-5 days and you can have access for 2-3 people.</span></span></span><br />\r\n&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<h2><span style=\"font-size:24pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#434343\">ZoomInfo Alternatives</span></span></span></h2>\r\n\r\n<p><br />\r\n<span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">Although ZoomInfo is the market leader, many consumers express dissatisfaction with privacy concerns, expensive and unclear pricing, and unclear. There are many alternatives that are reasonable and easy to use, such as Uplead, Lusha,&nbsp;</span></span></span><a href=\"http://apollo.io\" style=\"text-decoration:none\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#3498db\"><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><u>Apollo.io</u></span></span></span></a><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">, and Go4Database.&nbsp;</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><br />\r\n<span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">Go4Database is a platform where you get bulk verified contacts with 99% accuracy under your budget.</span></span></span><br />\r\n&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<h2><span style=\"font-size:24pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#434343\">Conclusion</span></span></span></h2>\r\n\r\n<p><br />\r\n<span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">So far, you must have gotten a clear picture of ZoomInfo reviews; it is a powerful B2B platform with an extensive database and the best choice for big companies.&nbsp;</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><br />\r\n<span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">Except for its price, it consists of great features such as intent data, CRM integrations, and real-time updates.</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><br />\r\n<span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">Moreover, it also offers a lot of features, and it stands out in the lead generation industry and provides services for all types of businesses.&nbsp;</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><br />\r\n<span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">However, if you&#39;re looking for something budget-friendly and easy to use for B2B contacts, then </span></span></span><strong><a href=\"https://go4database.com/\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#3498db\"><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\">Go4Database</span></span></span></a></strong><span style=\"font-si