iant database, which means you don&#39;t have to worry about the legal side of your email lists.</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><br />\r\n<span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">So, why don&#39;t you give Go4database a shot? Who knows? You may get the contact data you&rsquo;ve been looking for to drive your business goals.</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<div id=\"BigCTA\" style=\"background:#e7fde7; border:1px solid #6fd943; padding:20px 50px\">\r\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://go4database.com/assets/uploads/media-uploader/yellow-and-blue-bold-marketing-agency-with-hexagon-frame-linkedin-banner-1-removebg-preview1734171422.png\" style=\"height:50px; width:200px\" /></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><strong><span style=\"font-size:26px\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\">Reach the Right Decision Makers, Fast!</span></span></span></strong></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">Tap into 350M+ B2B contacts from 150 M+ companies - complete with verified emails and phone numbers</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:20px\"><a href=\"https://app.go4database.com/login?utm_source=BlogPage&amp;utm_medium=Internal&amp;utm_campaign=login\" id=\"TrailBtn\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\">Sign up now!</span></a></span><br />\r\n&nbsp;</p>\r\n</div>\r\n\r\n<p><br />\r\n&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<h2><span style=\"font-size:24pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#434343\">Uplead Vs ZoomInfo Features Comparison</span></span></span></h2>\r\n\r\n<p><br />\r\n<span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">I tried out both platforms myself and broke them down into five simple features that count when you&rsquo;re picking a </span></span></span><a href=\"https://www.go4database.com/blog/b2b-data-providers\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#1155cc\"><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\">B2B data provider</span></span></span></a><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">.</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><br />\r\n<span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">Here&rsquo;s what I looked at:</span></span></span><br />\r\n&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<h2><span style=\"font-size:24pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#434343\">Table of contents:</span></span></span></h2>\r\n\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li style=\"list-style-type:disc\"><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">Pricing and Credits</span></span></span></li>\r\n	<li style=\"list-style-type:disc\"><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">Size of Database and coverage</span></span></span></li>\r\n	<li style=\"list-style-type:disc\"><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">Data accuracy</span></span></span></li>\r\n	<li style=\"list-style-type:disc\"><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">LinkedIn prospecting tools&nbsp;</span></span></span></li>\r\n	<li style=\"list-style-type:disc\"><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">CRM integrations</span></span></span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p><br />\r\n<span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">Let&rsquo;s find out which one wins the spot</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<h2><span style=\"font-size:24pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#434343\">Uplead Vs ZoomInfo Pricing</span></span></span></h2>\r\n\r\n<p><br />\r\n<span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">Let&rsquo;s talk about the money part before we get into all the features.&nbsp;</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><br />\r\n<span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">Let&rsquo;s be real, what&rsquo;s the cost</span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\"><strong>?</strong></span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">If you&rsquo;re looking for an accurate </span></span></span><a href=\"https://www.go4database.com/blog/buy-email-list\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#1155cc\"><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\">B2B email list</span></span></span></a><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">, but you don&#39;t want to spend a fortune on it. Totally fair.</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<h3><br />\r\n<span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">UpLead Pricing (Billed Annually)</span></span></span></h3>\r\n\r\n<p><br />\r\n<span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">UpLead lays out its pricing pretty clearly with three plans:</span></span></span><br />\r\n&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li style=\"list-style-type:disc\"><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\"><strong>Essentials</strong></span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\"> &ndash; $74/month</span></span></span></li>\r\n	<li style=\"list-style-type:disc\"><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\"><strong>Plus</strong></span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\"> &ndash; $149/month</span></span></span></li>\r\n	<li style=\"list-style-type:disc\"><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\"><strong>Professional</strong></span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\"> &ndash; Custom quote</span></span></span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p><br />\r\n<span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">Each time you pull a </span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><a href=\"https://go4database.com/email-verifier\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#1155cc\">verified email lists</span></a><span style=\"color:#666666\"><strong>&nbsp;</strong></span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">or phone number, you use </span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\"><strong>1 credit</strong></span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">, so you&#39;re buying each lead one at a time.</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><br />\r\n<span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">They also have a </span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\"><strong>free trial</strong></span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">, but you&rsquo;ll need to provide your credit card details first, and you only get </span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\"><strong>5 credits</strong></span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\"> to play with.</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><br />\r\n<span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">One thing I noticed while testing: even the paid plans give you </span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\"><strong>very few phone number credits</strong></span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">, which could be a pain if cold calling is part of your strategy.</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">&nbsp;</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<h3><span style=\"font-size:20pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#434343\">ZoomInfo Pricing</span></span></span></h3>\r\n\r\n<p><br />\r\n<span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">ZoomInfo? Yeah, that one&#39;s a bit sophisticated&nbsp;</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><br />\r\n<span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">They don&rsquo;t put any actual pricing on their website, which means you&rsquo;ll need to talk to a sales representative to get a number.&nbsp;</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><br />\r\n<span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">The cost depends on what part of the platform you want, such as sales, marketing, and </span><a href=\"https://www.go4database.com/b2c/it-recruiter-mailing-list\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#1155cc\">IT recruiter mailing list</span></a><span style=\"color:#666666\">, which all come with different price tags.</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><br />\r\n<span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">And if you want extras like </span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\"><strong>intent data</strong></span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">, that&rsquo;s going to skyrocket your bill even more.</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><br />\r\n<span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">From what I&rsquo;ve seen in </span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\"><strong>G2 reviews</strong></span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">, a lot of users are frustrated, not just with the high prices, but also with how confusing the whole pricing model is.</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><br />\r\n<span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">So, if you&rsquo;re leaning toward ZoomInfo, just be ready for a higher bill than you might expect.</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<blockquote>\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\"><strong>Also Read:</strong></span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\"> </span><a href=\"https://go4database.com/blog/zoominfo-pricing\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#1155cc\">ZoomInfo Pricing Breakdown (2025): Everything You Need To Know Before Buying</span></a></span></span></p>\r\n</blockquote>\r\n\r\n<p><br />\r\n<span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">Here is a third option, Go4Database, for pocket-friendly B2B contact data provider with a high accuracy rate.</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<h2><span style=\"font-size:24pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#434343\">Uplead Vs ZoomInfo Database Size</span></span></span></h2>\r\n\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">So, we&rsquo;ve talked about pricing for ZoomInfo and UpLead. Now, let&rsquo;s take a closer look at how good their contact databases are.</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<h3><br />\r\n<span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">UpLead Database Size &amp; Coverage</span></span></span></h3>\r\n\r\n<p><br />\r\n<span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><a href=\"https://www.uplead.com/\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#1155cc\">UpLead</span></a></span></span><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">&nbsp;has a large database, you can access 160 M+ professional contacts, and 16M+ company profiles.</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<div id=\"blogTLDR\">\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\"><strong>TL;DR:</strong></span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">UpLead and ZoomInfo have big databases but cover North America. UpLead excels in SaaS, while ZoomInfo covers more ground. Both fall short on startup info. To get better worldwide coverage, Go4Database stands out as a good choice.</span></span></span></p>\r\n</div>\r\n\r\n<p><br />\r\n<span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">It mostly focuses on North America, but also includes verified emails and phone numbers for Europe.</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><br />\r\n<span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">Something I noticed is that UpLead does especially well with SaaS companies and professionals. It is their Technology Tracker, which helps you find SaaS businesses that match your ideal customer profile.</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><br />\r\n<span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">That said, when I tried it out, I found it tricky to get data on smaller companies and startups.</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><br />\r\n<span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">When looking at reviews on G2, some people mentioned the same problem.</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><br />\r\n<span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">Still, if your looking to drive sales by targeting your ideal customer, UpLead offers Bombora intent data, just keep in mind you&rsquo;ll need to pay extra since it&rsquo;s part of the custom plans.</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">&nbsp;</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<h3><span style=\"font-size:20pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#434343\">ZoomInfo Database Size &amp; Coverage</span></span></span></h3>\r\n\r\n<p><br />\r\n<span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><a href=\"https://go4database.com/blog/what-is-zoominfo\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#1155cc\">ZoomInfo</span></a></span></span><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\"><strong>&nbsp;</strong></span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">has a much larger database, which is over 321 million professional contacts and 104 million company profiles.</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><br />\r\n<span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">Like UpLead, it mainly covers North America, but also gives access to:</span></span></span><br />\r\n&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li style=\"list-style-type:disc\"><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">34 million company profiles</span></span></span></li>\r\n	<li style=\"list-style-type:disc\"><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">200 million professional contacts</span></span></span></li>\r\n	<li style=\"list-style-type:disc\"><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">45 million verified phone numbers outside North America</span></span></span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p><br />\r\n<span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">One handy feature is ZoomInfo&rsquo;s org charts, so you can figure out who the decision-makers are. Plus, it shows technographics for SaaS, and recent news or activity about your prospects.</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><br />\r\n<span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">At first, I thought ZoomInfo&rsquo;s data was mostly focused on the U.S., which didn&rsquo;t work well for the industry I was researching.</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><br />\r\n<span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">After reading reviews on G2, I saw that quite a few others had the same experience, finding limited data for certain industries outside the U.S.</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<blockquote>\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\"><strong>Also Read:</strong></span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\"> </span><a href=\"https://go4database.com/blog/zoominfo-reviews\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#1155cc\">ZoomInfo Reviews: Is It the Best Tool to Buy Verified Email Lists in 2025?</span></a></span></span></p>\r\n</blockquote>\r\n\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<h2><span style=\"font-size:24pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#434343\">Uplead Vs ZoomInfo Data Accuracy</span></span></span></h2>\r\n\r\n<p><br />\r\n<span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">When you&#39;re trying to </span></span></span><a href=\"https://www.go4database.com/blog/sales-leads\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#1155cc\"><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\">generate sales leads</span></span></span></a><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">, what really matters is how accurate the data is. You can have a huge list, but if half the emails bounce? Total waste of time.</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><br />\r\n<span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">So, how well do </span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\"><strong>UpLead</strong></span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\"> and </span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\"><strong>ZoomInfo</strong></span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\"> actually deliver when it comes to real, working contacts?</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><br />\r\n<span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">Let&rsquo;s take a closer look.</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<div id=\"blogTLDR\">\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\"><strong>TL;DR:</strong></span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">UpLead and ZoomInfo say their data is accurate, but actual users (and my own checks) reveal many emails are out of date or don&#39;t work. If you need dependable leads that deliver, Go4Database gives you more precise and better-quality data you can rely on.</span></span></span></p>\r\n</div>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">&nbsp;</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<h3><span style=\"font-size:20pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#434343\">UpLead&rsquo;s Data Accuracy</span></span></span></h3>\r\n\r\n<p><br />\r\n<span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">UpLead claims its data is </span></span></span><a href=\"https://www.go4database.com/blog/buy-email-list\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#1155cc\"><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\">95% accurate and compliant data</span></span></span></a><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">. Sounds solid, right?</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><br />\r\n<span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">But when I used it myself, and checked what others were saying on G2, I realized that&rsquo;s a bit of a stretch.</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><br />\r\n<span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">Here&rsquo;s what one user had to say:</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><br />\r\n<span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">&ldquo;Only 60% of emails are on there. You&rsquo;ll find a list of 750 people, and only 315 of them have valid emails. That&rsquo;s frustrating. Also, it&rsquo;s tough to find contacts from rural areas.&rdquo;</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">From my own experience, that tracks. I pulled a few lists, and about </span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\"><strong>70% of the emails actually worked</strong></span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">, the rest either bounced or were totally off.</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><br />\r\n<span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">So honestly, the 95% number feels more like marketing than reality.</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<div id=\"BigCTA\" style=\"background:#e7fde7; border:1px solid #6fd943; padding:20px 50px\">\r\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://go4database.com/assets/uploads/media-uploader/yellow-and-blue-bold-marketing-agency-with-hexagon-frame-linkedin-banner-1-removebg-preview1734171422.png\" style=\"height:50px; width:200px\" /></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><strong><span style=\"font-size:26px\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\">Only Real Contacts. No Fluff.</span></span></span></strong></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">Verified leads that actually respond.</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:20px\"><a href=\"https://app.go4database.com/login?utm_source=BlogPage&amp;utm_medium=Internal&amp;utm_campaign=login\" id=\"TrailBtn\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\">&rarr; Download Your Free Leads</span></a></span><br />\r\n&nbsp;</p>\r\n</div>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">&nbsp;</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<h3><span style=\"font-size:20pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#434343\">ZoomInfo&rsquo;s Data Accuracy</span></span></span></h3>\r\n\r\n<p><br />\r\n<span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">ZoomInfo says it pulls </span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><a href=\"https://www.go4database.com/blog/go4database-vs-lusha\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#1155cc\">business contact data</span></a><span style=\"color:#666666\"><strong>&nbsp;</strong></span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">from all over the place, partners, their own tools, contributions from users, and internal research.</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><br />\r\n<span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">Sounds impressive, but when I tried it out, I still ran into some </span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\"><strong>stale and outdated contacts</strong></span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">.</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><br />\r\n<span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">And when I looked through G2 reviews, I saw plenty of folks dealing with the same issue, some emails didn&rsquo;t work, some were super old, and others just weren&rsquo;t relevant anymore.</span></span></span><br />\r\n&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<h2><span style=\"font-size:24pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#434343\">Uplead Vs ZoomInfo LinkedIn prospect</span></span></span></h2>\r\n\r\n<p><br />\r\n<span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">If you&#39;re hunting for leads and want to pull their contact info straight from LinkedIn, a LinkedIn prospecting tool can really come in handy.</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">Both </span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\"><strong>UpLead</strong></span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\"> and </span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\"><strong>ZoomInfo</strong></span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\"> offer Chrome extensions that help with this. But which one actually works better in the real world? Let&rsquo;s find out.</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">&nbsp;</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<h3><span style=\"font-size:20pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#434343\">UpLead&rsquo;s LinkedIn Chrome Extension</span></span></span></h3>\r\n\r\n<p><br />\r\n<span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">UpLead gives you a Chrome extension that shows contact info while you&rsquo;re checking out profiles on LinkedIn.</span></span></span><br />\r\n<br />\r\n<span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">It also works on company websites and even some other platforms, which is a bonus.</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><br />\r\n<span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">Now here&rsquo;s the catch: every time you use it, it burns through your credits.</span></span></span><br />\r\n<span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">If you&rsquo;re on the free plan, you only get </span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\"><strong>5 credits</strong></span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">, and once they&rsquo;re gone, well, that&rsquo;s it unless you upgrade your plan.</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">&nbsp;</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<h3><span style=\"font-size:20pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#434343\">ZoomInfo&rsquo;s LinkedIn Chrome Extension</span></span></span></h3>\r\n\r\n<p><br />\r\n<span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">ZoomInfo&rsquo;s extension does pretty much the same thing. It pulls email addresses, phone numbers, and other details from LinkedIn and company pages.</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><br />\r\n<span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">But unlike UpLead, ZoomInfo doesn&rsquo;t offer any freebies here.</span></span></span><br />\r\n<span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">You can&rsquo;t even try it out unless you&rsquo;ve already paid for a plan. So yeah, no test run, if you want to use their Chrome extension, you&rsquo;ve got to be a paying customer and log into your ZoomInfo workspace.</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">&nbsp;</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<h2><span style=\"font-size:24pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#434343\">Uplead Vs ZoomInfo Integrations</span></span></span></h2>\r\n\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">Finding leads is just the beginning. Once you&#39;ve got the contacts, it&#39;s time to reach out, emails, follow-ups, reminders, you know the drill.</span></span></span><br />\r\n<span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">And for all that, you&rsquo;ll need your CRM, calendar, and email tools to work smoothly with your lead platform.</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><br />\r\n<span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">That&rsquo;s where </span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\"><strong>UpLead</strong></span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\"> and </span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\"><strong>ZoomInfo</strong></span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\"> come in. Both let you plug into the tools you already use. So, which one actually fits into your workflow better? Let&rsquo;s break it down.</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<div id=\"blogTLDR\">\r\n<p><strong><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">TL;DR:</span></span></span></strong></p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">UpLead and ZoomInfo both provide strong CRM and tool connections. However, setting up ZoomInfo can prove challenging. You can get UpLead up and running more quickly. If you want to link up and start contacting people faster without any fuss, Go4Database makes this process simpler.</span></span></span></p>\r\n</div>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">&nbsp;</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<h3><span style=\"font-size:20pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#434343\">UpLead Integrations</span></span></span></h3>\r\n\r\n<p><br />\r\n<span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">UpLead connects with most of the big-name CRMs, </span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\"><strong>HubSpot, Salesforce, Zoho</strong></span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">, and </span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\"><strong>SalesLoft</strong></span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">.</span></span></span><br />\r\n<br />\r\n<span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">If you&rsquo;re using their API, it opens up even more options like </span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\"><strong>Reply.io, Lemlist</strong></span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">, and </span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\"><strong>Woodpecker</strong></span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">.</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><br />\r\n<span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">The nice part? It doesn&rsquo;t take long to set up. I got things running in just a few minutes without having to jump through hoops.</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<div id=\"BigCTA\" style=\"background:#e7fde7; border:1px solid #6fd943; padding:20px 50px\">\r\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://go4database.com/assets/uploads/media-uploader/yellow-and-blue-bold-marketing-agency-with-hexagon-frame-linkedin-banner-1-removebg-preview1734171422.png\" style=\"height:50px; width:200px\" /></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><strong><span style=\"font-size:28px\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\">Stop Wasting Time On Bad Leads</span></span></span></strong></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">Get clean, accurate data you can actually trust.</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:20px\"><a href=\"https://app.go4database.com/login?utm_source=BlogPage&amp;utm_medium=Internal&amp;utm_campaign=login\" id=\"TrailBtn\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\">&rarr; Try Go4Database Today</span></a></span><br />\r\n&nbsp;</p>\r\n</div>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">&nbsp;</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<h3><span style=\"font-size:20pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#434343\">ZoomInfo Integrations</span></span></span></h3>\r\n\r\n<p><br />\r\n<span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">ZoomInfo covers a wide range of tools.</span></span></span><br />\r\n<span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">It works with cloud platforms like </span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\"><strong>AWS and Google Cloud</strong></span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">, email tools like </span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\"><strong>Outlook</strong></span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\"> and </span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\"><strong>Gmail</strong></span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">, and of course, CRMs like </span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\"><strong>HubSpot, Salesforce</strong></span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">, and </span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\"><strong>Pipedrive</strong></span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">.</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><br />\r\n<span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">It&rsquo;s a solid choice if your team uses a mix of sales, marketing, or recruitment tools.</span></span></span><br />\r\n<br />\r\n<span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">Though, a few people (myself included) found that getting everything set up took a bit more effort than expected.</span></span></span><br />\r\n&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<h2><span style=\"font-size:24pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#434343\">Conclusion</span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:24pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">&nbsp;</span></span></span></h2>\r\n\r\n<p><br />\r\n<span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">So, which is better, UpLead or ZoomInfo? Both have their good points, but sometimes their data isn&rsquo;t spot-on and neither comes with outreach tools built right in.&nbsp;</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><br />\r\n<span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">Finding leads is only half the work; actually reaching out is just as important. That&rsquo;s where </span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><strong><a href=\"https://www.go4database.com\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#1155cc\">Go4Database</span></a></strong><span style=\"color:#666666\"><strong> </strong></span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\"><strong>really helps out.</strong></span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">&nbsp;</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><br />\r\n<span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">It lets you </span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\"><strong>search for contacts and send emails without jumping between apps.</strong></span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\"> Plus, you can try it free without needing a credit card. Why not give it a shot?</span></span></span></p>', NULL, 16, 'a:1:{i:0;s:2:\"11\";}', 'Uplead vs. ZoomInfo', '786', NULL, 'Uplead vs ZoomInfo: Which B2B Data Provider Is Best?', 'Compare Uplead vs ZoomInfo on pricing, data accuracy, features, and use cases to find the best B2B contact data provider for your sales team.', '<script type=\"application/ld+json\">\r\n{\r\n  \"@context\": \"https://schema.org\",\r\n  \"@type\": \"BlogPosting\",\r\n  \"mainEntityOfPage\": {\r\n    \"@type\": \"WebPage\",\r\n    \"@id\": \"https://www.go4database.com/blog/uplead-vs-zoominfo\"\r\n  },\r\n  \"headline\": \"Uplead vs. ZoomInfo: Which B2B Contact Data Providers Fits You Well?\",\r\n  \"description\": \"Trying to choose between UpLead and ZoomInfo? Well, it\'s very challenging. \r\n\r\n\r\nBoth platforms are leading B2B contact data providers, and each promises to offer accurate and verified email lists.\",\r\n  \"image\": \"https://www.go4database.com/assets/uploads/media-uploader/uplead-vs-zoominfo-go4database1753247433.webp\",  \r\n  \"author\": {\r\n    \"@type\": \"Person\",\r\n    \"name\": \"Ashwini Bochkeri\"\r\n  },  \r\n  \"publisher\": {\r\n    \"@type\": \"Organization\",\r\n    \"name\": \"\",\r\n    \"logo\": {\r\n      \"@type\": \"ImageObject\",\r\n      \"url\": \"\"\r\n    }\r\n  },\r\n  \"datePublished\": \"2025-07-23\",\r\n  \"dateModified\": \"2025-09-10\"\r\n}\r\n</script>\r\n<script type=\"application/ld+json\">\r\n{\r\n  \"@context\": \"https://schema.org\",\r\n  \"@type\": \"Organization\",\r\n  \"name\": \"Go4Database\",\r\n  \"url\": \"https://www.go4database.com/\",\r\n  \"logo\": \"https://go4database.com/assets/uploads/media-uploader/go4database-logo1751528079.png\",\r\n  \"contactPoint\": {\r\n    \"@type\": \"ContactPoint\",\r\n    \"telephone\": \"+ 1 786 785 2141\",\r\n    \"contactType\": \"customer service\",\r\n    \"areaServed\": \"US\",\r\n    \"availableLanguage\": \"en\"\r\n  },\r\n  \"sameAs\": [\r\n    \"https://www.facebook.com/Go4Database\",\r\n    \"https://twitter.com/DatabaseGo4\",\r\n    \"https://www.instagram.com/go4database/\",\r\n    \"https://www.youtube.com/@Go4Database\",\r\n    \"https://www.linkedin.com/company/go4database/\",\r\n    \"https://in.pinterest.com/gofourdatabase/\"\r\n  ]\r\n}\r\n</script>\r\n\r\n\r\n<script type=\"application/ld+json\">\r\n{\r\n  \"@context\": \"https://schema.org/\", \r\n  \"@type\": \"BreadcrumbList\", \r\n  \"itemListElement\": [{\r\n    \"@type\": \"ListItem\", \r\n    \"position\": 1, \r\n    \"name\": \"Homepage\",\r\n    \"item\": \"https://www.go4database.com/\"  \r\n  },{\r\n    \"@type\": \"ListItem\", \r\n    \"position\": 2, \r\n    \"name\": \"Blog\",\r\n    \"item\": \"https://www.go4database.com/blog\"  \r\n  },{\r\n    \"@type\": \"ListItem\", \r\n    \"position\": 3, \r\n    \"name\": \"Uplead vs. ZoomInfo: Which B2B Contact Data Providers Fits You Well?\",\r\n    \"item\": \"https://www.go4database.com/blog/uplead-vs-zoominfo\"  \r\n  }]\r\n}\r\n</script>\r\n<script type=\"application/ld+json\">\r\n{\r\n  \"@context\": \"https://schema.org\",\r\n  \"@type\": \"FAQPage\",\r\n  \"mainEntity\": [{\r\n    \"@type\": \"Question\",\r\n    \"name\": \"1. What’s the main difference between UpLead and ZoomInfo?\",\r\n    \"acceptedAnswer\": {\r\n      \"@type\": \"Answer\",\r\n      \"text\": \"UpLead focuses on quality and niche markets, while ZoomInfo offers a bigger but pricier database.\"\r\n    }\r\n  },{\r\n    \"@type\": \"Question\",\r\n    \"name\": \"2. Which platform has more accurate data?\",\r\n    \"acceptedAnswer\": {\r\n      \"@type\": \"Answer\",\r\n      \"text\": \"Both have accuracy issues; neither is perfect.\"\r\n    }\r\n  },{\r\n    \"@type\": \"Question\",\r\n    \"name\": \"3. Can I send outreach emails directly from UpLead or ZoomInfo?\",\r\n    \"acceptedAnswer\": {\r\n      \"@type\": \"Answer\",\r\n      \"text\": \"No, both require separate tools for outreach.\"\r\n    }\r\n  }]\r\n}\r\n</script>\r\n<script type=\"application/ld+json\">\r\n         {         \r\n            \"@context\": \"https://schema.org/\",         \r\n            \"@type\": \"WebPage\",         \r\n            \"@id\": \"#WebPage\",         \r\n            \"url\": \"https://www.go4database.com/blog/uplead-vs-zoominfo\",          \r\n            \"name\": \"Uplead vs. ZoomInfo: Which B2B Contact Data Providers Fits You Well?\"\r\n          } \r\n      </script>', '1', 'Trying to choose between UpLead and ZoomInfo? Well, it\'s very challenging. Both platforms are leading B2B contact data providers, and each promises to offer accurate and verified email lists.', 'uplead-vs-zoominfo', 'Ashwini Bochkeri', 10, 'publish', 'en_US', '2025-12-18', '1940', '2025-06-23 13:14:55', '2026-08-12 10:28:13', 0, NULL, '[{\"question\":\"What\\u2019s the main difference between UpLead and ZoomInfo?\",\"answer\":\"What\\u2019s the main difference between UpLead and ZoomInfo?\"},{\"question\":\"Which platform has more accurate data?\",\"answer\":\"Both have accuracy issues; neither is perfect.\"},{\"question\":\"Can I send outreach emails directly from UpLead or ZoomInfo?\",\"answer\":\"No, both require separate tools for outreach.\"}]');
