(92, 'Lusha vs ZoomInfo: Features Compared for Smarter Prospecting', '<p><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">Let&rsquo;s be real! finding the </span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">right email lists&nbsp;</span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">isn&rsquo;t easy. You&rsquo;ve probably come across </span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\"><strong>Lusha vs ZoomInfo</strong></span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">, and maybe even tested one of them.&nbsp;</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><br />\r\n<span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">But when it comes to daily prospecting, how accurate the data is, how smooth the process feels, and how fast you can move, it&rsquo;s the small things that make the big difference.&nbsp;</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><br />\r\n<span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">One is designed for speed, the other digs deep. So, which one actually matches the way you work?&nbsp;</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><br />\r\n<span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">So, I have broken it down in plain terms, which will help you figure out what&rsquo;s worth your time.</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<h2><span style=\"font-size:24pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#434343\">Quick Comparison Table: Lusha Vs ZoomInfo</span></span></span></h2>\r\n\r\n<p><br />\r\n<span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">Short on time? Don&#39;t worry, just have a glance at the table and key highlights which will help you decide which platform suits your needs.</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<table border=\"1\" cellpadding=\"1\" cellspacing=\"1\" class=\"table table-bordered\" style=\"width:800px\">\r\n	<tbody>\r\n		<tr>\r\n			<td><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\"><strong>Feature</strong></span></span></span></td>\r\n			<td><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\"><strong>Lusha</strong></span></span></span></td>\r\n			<td><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\"><strong>ZoomInfo</strong></span></span></span></td>\r\n			<td><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\"><strong>Go4Database</strong></span></span></span></td>\r\n		</tr>\r\n		<tr>\r\n			<td><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\"><strong>Contact Database Size</strong></span></span></span></td>\r\n			<td><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">60M+ business profiles, 15M+ companies</span></span></span></td>\r\n			<td><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">150M+ emails, 50M+ direct dials, data from 300K+ domains</span></span></span></td>\r\n			<td><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">350M+ contacts, data across 60M+ companies worldwide</span></span></span></td>\r\n		</tr>\r\n		<tr>\r\n			<td><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\"><strong>Data Accuracy</strong></span></span></span></td>\r\n			<td><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">Verified through in-house filters and user network</span></span></span></td>\r\n			<td><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">Auto-updated using APIs and real-time syncing</span></span></span></td>\r\n			<td><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">Real-time verified contacts with bounce-back protection</span></span></span></td>\r\n		</tr>\r\n		<tr>\r\n			<td><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\"><strong>Data Enrichment</strong></span></span></span></td>\r\n			<td><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">Includes job title, location, company size, industry</span></span></span></td>\r\n			<td><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">Includes buyer intent, org charts, web visitor tracking</span></span></span></td>\r\n			<td><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">Enriched with company details, emails, phone numbers, location</span></span></span></td>\r\n		</tr>\r\n		<tr>\r\n			<td><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\"><strong>Compliance</strong></span></span></span></td>\r\n			<td><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">GDPR &amp; CCPA compliant; DNC filters on higher-tier plans</span></span></span></td>\r\n			<td><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">Built-in GDPR &amp; CCPA compliance</span></span></span></td>\r\n			<td><