ails like emails, phone numbers, and LinkedIn profiles.\"},{\"question\":\"What\\u2019s the size of ZoomInfo\\u2019s database?\",\"answer\":\"ZoomInfo offers 150M+ emails and access to 300K+ domains.\"},{\"question\":\"Are both tools GDPR and CCPA compliant?\",\"answer\":\"Yes, both comply ZoomInfo from the start, Lusha since 2023.\"}]');
