le=\"color:#666666\">This </span></span></span><a href=\"https://go4database.com/blog/email-finder-tools\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#0000ff\"><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\">email finder&rsquo;s</span></span></span></a><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">&nbsp;daily usability has a significant impact on the ZoomInfo vs. RocketReach comparison.</span></span></span><br />\r\n<br />\r\n&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<h3><span style=\"font-size:20pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#434343\">RocketReach</span></span></span><br />\r\n&nbsp;</h3>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">The majority of the features are operational with minimal setup, and the layout is clear. Contacts are easy to locate, export, and continue using.&nbsp;</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><br />\r\n<span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">If you need something that functions immediately, this is fantastic. Nevertheless, it lacks the sophisticated options and degree of control.</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<h3><span style=\"font-size:20pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#434343\">ZoomInfo</span></span></span><br />\r\n&nbsp;</h3>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">Custom filters, automation, and difficult workflows are just a few of the many tools at your disposal.</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><br />\r\n<span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">It is designed for groups that enjoy analyzing data and making things their own way.&nbsp;</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><br />\r\n<span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">However, there is a slight learning curve associated with all that functionality. It takes some getting used to, but it&#39;s not difficult.</span></span></span><br />\r\n&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<h3><span style=\"font-size:20pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#434343\">Who&rsquo;s Better?</span></span></span><br />\r\n&nbsp;</h3>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">ZoomInfo is a better option for teams that require flexibility. RocketReach simplifies the process for quick, targeted outreach.</span></span></span><br />\r\n<span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">&nbsp;</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<h2><span style=\"font-size:24pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#434343\">RocketReach vs. ZoomInfo: Plans &amp; Pricing</span></span></span></h2>\r\n\r\n<p><br />\r\n<span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">Regarding ZoomInfo vs. RocketReach, the pricing structures reveal a lot about the target audience for these tools.</span></span></span><br />\r\n&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<h3><span style=\"font-size:20pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#434343\">ZoomInfo</span></span></span><br />\r\n&nbsp;</h3>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">This one is obviously designed for businesses with larger budgets and teams. Prices are not listed on the website; you will need to speak with sales. Here&#39;s a broad concept, though:</span></span></span><br />\r\n<br />\r\n<br />\r\n<span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\"><strong>Professional:</strong></span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\"> $14,995/year</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">&rarr; 5,000 credits, up to 3 users</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">&rarr; $1,500 per additional user</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><br />\r\n<span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\"><strong>Advanced: </strong></span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">approximately $24,995/year</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">&rarr; 10,000 credits, more user access</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">&rarr; $2,500 per additional user.</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><br />\r\n<span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\"><strong>Elite:</strong></span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\"> approximately $39,995/year</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">&rarr; includes premium features and integrations in addition to everything mentioned above.</span></span></span><br />\r\n<span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">Although it is effective, the cost is appropriate for large teams.</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<h3><span style=\"font-size:20pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#434343\">RocketReach</span></span></span></h3>\r\n\r\n<p><br />\r\n<span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">For individuals or small teams, RocketReach is far more cost-effective and transparent.</span></span></span><br />\r\n<br />\r\n<br />\r\n<span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\"><strong>Essentials(billed annually)</strong></span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">$48 /month</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">&rarr; 1,200 exports, browser extensions, and emails</span></span></span><br />\r\n<br />\r\n<br />\r\n<span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\"><strong>Pro: </strong></span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">$108/month</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">&rarr; More exports, phones, and technological filters</span></span></span><br />\r\n<br />\r\n<br />\r\n<span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\"><strong>Ultimate: </strong></span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">$249/month</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">&rarr; Contains deeper search capabilities, Salesforce integration, and API</span></span></span><br />\r\n<br />\r\n&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<h3><span style=\"font-size:20pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#434343\">Who&rsquo;s Better?</span></span></span><br />\r\n<span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">&nbsp;</span></span></span></h3>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">RocketReach is the simpler option if you&#39;re just starting out or don&#39;t want to speak with sales representative to obtain a number. ZoomInfo works best if you have more money and a larger staff.</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<div id=\"BigCTA\" style=\"background:#e7fde7; border:1px solid #6fd943; padding:20px 50px\">\r\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://go4database.com/assets/uploads/media-uploader/yellow-and-blue-bold-marketing-agency-with-hexagon-frame-linkedin-banner-1-removebg-preview1734171422.png\" style=\"height:50px; width:200px\" /></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><strong><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\">Built For Speed. Backed By Precision!</span></span></span></strong></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">Find decision-makers faster with a platform that values your time (and budget).</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:20px\"><a href=\"https://app.go4database.com/login?utm_source=BlogPage&amp;utm_medium=Internal&amp;utm_campaign=login\" id=\"TrailBtn\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\">Start Finding Leads Smarter</span></a></span><br />\r\n&nbsp;</p>\r\n</div>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">&nbsp;</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<h2><span style=\"font-size:24pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#434343\">Conclusion</span></span></span></h2>\r\n\r\n<p><br />\r\n<span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">Your size, budget, and objectives will ultimately determine which of ZoomInfo and RocketReach is best for you.</span></span></span><br />\r\n<span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">&nbsp;</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">There is no doubt about ZoomInfo&#39;s power. It has a ton of features, deep data, and integrations that large sales teams can use.&nbsp;</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><br />\r\n<span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">But its quite inexpensive, though, and it takes some getting used to.</span></span></span><br />\r\n<br />\r\n<br />\r\n<span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">RocketReach? A lot lighter. It is quick, reasonably priced, and excels at providing you with contact information quickly.&nbsp;</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><br />\r\n<span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">Excellent for individuals or smaller teams that only require strong leads without the extra layers.</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><br />\r\n<span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">However, Go4Database subtly provides many of the features of both tools without the high cost.&nbsp;</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><br />\r\n<span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">It&#39;s worth taking a closer look if you&#39;re looking for verified </span></span></span><a href=\"https://www.go4database.com/blog/business-leads/\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#0000ff\"><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\">business leads</span></span></span></a><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">,</span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">&nbsp;usability, and good value.</span></span></span><br />\r\n<br />\r\n<br />\r\n<span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">Do you want precise business-to-business data without the hassle? Then checkout&nbsp; </span></span></span><a href=\"https://go4database.com/\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#0000ff\"><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><strong>Go4Database</strong></span></span></span></a><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">.</span></span></span></p>', NULL, 16, 'a:1:{i:0;s:2:\"19\";}', 'Roketreach vs Zoominfo', '1130', NULL, 'Rocketreach vs Zoominfo: Best B2B Tool in 2026', 'Compare Rocketreach and Zoominfo in 2026. Discover features, pricing, and accuracy to find the top B2B lead generation tool for your business.', '<script type=\"application/ld+json\">\r\n{\r\n  \"@context\": \"https://schema.org\",\r\n  \"@type\": \"Organization\",\r\n  \"name\": \"Go4Database\",\r\n  \"url\": \"https://www.go4database.com/\",\r\n  \"logo\": \"https://go4database.com/assets/uploads/media-uploader/go4database-logo1751528079.png\",\r\n  \"contactPoint\": {\r\n    \"@type\": \"ContactPoint\",\r\n    \"telephone\": \"+ 1 786 785 2141\",\r\n    \"contactType\": \"customer service\",\r\n    \"areaServed\": \"US\",\r\n    \"availableLanguage\": \"en\"\r\n  },\r\n  \"sameAs\": [\r\n    \"https://www.facebook.com/Go4Database\",\r\n    \"https://twitter.com/DatabaseGo4\",\r\n    \"https://www.instagram.com/go4database/\",\r\n    \"https://www.youtube.com/@Go4Database\",\r\n    \"https://www.linkedin.com/company/go4database/\",\r\n    \"https://in.pinterest.com/gofourdatabase/\"\r\n  ]\r\n}\r\n</script>\r\n\r\n<script type=\"application/ld+json\">\r\n{\r\n  \"@context\": \"https://schema.org\",\r\n  \"@type\": \"BlogPosting\",\r\n  \"mainEntityOfPage\": {\r\n    \"@type\": \"WebPage\",\r\n    \"@id\": \"https://www.go4database.com/blog/rocketreach-vs-zoominfo\"\r\n  },\r\n  \"headline\": \"Rocketreach vs Zoominfo: Which one is the best in 2026?\",\r\n  \"description\": \"If you’re into sales, marketing, or hiring, you’ve must have felt the frustration of bounced emails and old contacts.\r\n\r\n\r\nThat’s where tools like RocketReach VS ZoomInfo come in, offering verified contacts, company info, and smarter workflows to boost your pipeline.\",\r\n  \"image\": \"https://www.go4database.com/assets/uploads/media-uploader/rocketreach-vs-zoominfo1753247434.webp\",  \r\n  \"author\": {\r\n    \"@type\": \"Person\",\r\n    \"name\": \"Ashwini Bochkeri\"\r\n  },  \r\n  \"publisher\": {\r\n    \"@type\": \"Organization\",\r\n    \"name\": \"\",\r\n    \"logo\": {\r\n      \"@type\": \"ImageObject\",\r\n      \"url\": \"\"\r\n    }\r\n  },\r\n  \"datePublished\": \"2025-07-23\",\r\n  \"dateModified\": \"2026-02-03\"\r\n}\r\n</script>\r\n<script type=\"application/ld+json\">\r\n         {         \r\n            \"@context\": \"https://schema.org/\",         \r\n            \"@type\": \"WebPage\",         \r\n            \"@id\": \"#WebPage\",         \r\n            \"url\": \"https://www.go4database.com/blog/rocketreach-vs-zoominfo\",          \r\n            \"name\": \"Rocketreach vs Zoominfo: Which one is the best in 2026?\"\r\n          } \r\n      </script>\r\n      <script type=\"application/ld+json\">\r\n{\r\n  \"@context\": \"https://schema.org/\", \r\n  \"@type\": \"BreadcrumbList\", \r\n  \"itemListElement\": [{\r\n    \"@type\": \"ListItem\", \r\n    \"position\": 1, \r\n    \"name\": \"Homepage\",\r\n    \"item\": \"https://www.go4database.com/\"  \r\n  },{\r\n    \"@type\": \"ListItem\", \r\n    \"position\": 2, \r\n    \"name\": \"Blog\",\r\n    \"item\": \"https://www.go4database.com/blog\"  \r\n  },{\r\n    \"@type\": \"ListItem\", \r\n    \"position\": 3, \r\n    \"name\": \"Rocketreach vs Zoominfo: Which one is the best in 2026?\",\r\n    \"item\": \"https://www.go4database.com/blog/rocketreach-vs-zoominfo\"  \r\n  }]\r\n}\r\n</script>\r\n<script type=\"application/ld+json\">\r\n{\r\n  \"@context\": \"https://schema.org\",\r\n  \"@type\": \"FAQPage\",\r\n  \"mainEntity\": [{\r\n    \"@type\": \"Question\",\r\n    \"name\": \"1. What is the main difference between ZoomInfo and RocketReach?\",\r\n    \"acceptedAnswer\": {\r\n      \"@type\": \"Answer\",\r\n      \"text\": \"ZoomInfo offers deeper data and features; RocketReach focuses on fast, direct contacts.\"\r\n    }\r\n  },{\r\n    \"@type\": \"Question\",\r\n    \"name\": \"2. Which platform is better for small teams?\",\r\n    \"acceptedAnswer\": {\r\n      \"@type\": \"Answer\",\r\n      \"text\": \"RocketReach and Go4Database are simpler and more budget-friendly for small teams.\"\r\n    }\r\n  },{\r\n    \"@type\": \"Question\",\r\n    \"name\": \"3. Does Go4Database offer verified contact data?\",\r\n    \"acceptedAnswer\": {\r\n      \"@type\": \"Answer\",\r\n      \"text\": \"Yes, Go4Database provides verified and ready-to-use B2B contact details.\"\r\n    }\r\n  }]\r\n}\r\n</script>', '1', 'If you’re into sales, marketing, or hiring, you’ve must have felt the frustration of bounced emails and old contacts.', 'rocketreach-vs-zoominfo', 'Ashwini Bochkeri', 10, 'publish', 'en_US', '2026-02-03', '2508', '2025-06-23 18:10:31', '2026-06-11 14:43:39', 0, NULL, '[{\"question\":\"What is the main difference between ZoomInfo and RocketReach?\",\"answer\":\"ZoomInfo offers deeper data and features; RocketReach focuses on fast, direct contacts.\"},{\"question\":\"Which platform is better for small teams?\",\"answer\":\"RocketReach and Go4Database are simpler and more budget-friendly for small teams.\"},{\"question\":\"Does Go4Database offer verified contact data?\",\"answer\":\"Yes, Go4Database provides verified and ready-to-use B2B contact details.\"}]');
