(98, 'Go4Database vs ZoomInfo: Which Tool Offers Best ROI?', '<p><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">Want to know what Go4Database offers compared to ZoomInfo? Although, ZoomInfo is a prominent email platform, it&rsquo;s the name everyone uses when talking about </span><a href=\"https://www.go4database.com/blog/b2b-database-providers\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#0000ff\">B2B&nbsp;</span></a></span></span><a href=\"https://www.go4database.com/blog/b2b-database-providers\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#0000ff\"><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\">email databases</span></span></span></a><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">.</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><br />\r\n<span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">But Go4Database? It&rsquo;s the quiet one in the corner that delivers. I&rsquo;ve used it myself, and honestly, it works better than I expected.</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><br />\r\n<span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">The data is reliable, the pricing makes sense, and it&rsquo;s easy to use.</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><br />\r\n<span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">I&rsquo;m going to walk you through both tools and its features. Besides, if you&rsquo;re tired of paying for hype and just want something that works, this will help you make the call.</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<h2><span style=\"font-size:24pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#434343\">Go4Database vs. ZoomInfo: Quick Comparision Table</span></span></span></h2>\r\n\r\n<p><br />\r\n<span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">Are you having a busy day? Worry not, check out the quick comparison of <strong>ZoomInfo vs Go4Database</strong>, also find out why Go4Database is ideal for your prospecting needs</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<table border=\"1\" cellpadding=\"1\" cellspacing=\"1\" class=\"table table-bordered\" style=\"width:800px\">\r\n	<tbody>\r\n		<tr>\r\n			<td><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\"><strong>Feature</strong></span></span></span></td>\r\n			<td><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\"><strong>Go4Database</strong></span></span></span></td>\r\n			<td><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\"><strong>ZoomInfo</strong></span></span></span></td>\r\n		</tr>\r\n		<tr>\r\n			<td><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\"><strong>Contact Database Size</strong></span></span></span></td>\r\n			<td><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">350M+ contacts across 90+ countries</span></span></span></td>\r\n			<td><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">230M+ contacts, mainly U.S.-focused</span></span></span></td>\r\n		</tr>\r\n		<tr>\r\n			<td><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\"><strong>Pricing Transparency</strong></span></span></span></td>\r\n			<td><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">Public plans from $35/month</span></span></span></td>\r\n			<td><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">No public pricing, quote-based only</span></span></span></td>\r\n		</tr>\r\n		<tr>\r\n			<td><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\"><strong>Free Plan</strong></span></span></span></td>\r\n			<td><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">Yes &ndash; 100 contacts/month</span></span></span></td>\r\n			<td><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">No free plan</span></span></span></td>\r\n		</tr>\r\n		<tr>\r\n			<td><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\"><strong>Contract Requirement</strong></span></span></span></td>\r\n			<td><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">No &ndash; Pay-as-you-go options available</span></span></span></td>\r\n			<td><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">Yes &ndash; Annual contracts required</span></span></span></td>\r\n		</tr>\r\n		<tr>\r\n			<td><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\"><strong>Ease of Use</strong></span></span></span></td>\r\n			<td><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">Straightforward, beginner-friendly</span></span></span></td>\r\n			<td><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">More complex, better suited for enterprise teams</span></span></span></td>\r\n		</tr>\r\n		<tr>\r\n			<td><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\"><strong>Integrations</strong></span></span></span></td>\r\n			<td><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">Manual export/import (CSV, Excel)</span></span></span></td>\r\n			<td><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">Direct CRM integrations (Salesforce, HubSpot)</span></span></span></td>\r\n		</tr>\r\n		<tr>\r\n			<td><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\"><strong>Compliance</strong></span></span></span></td>\r\n			<td><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">GDPR-compliant with verified contacts</span></span></span></td>\r\n			<td><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">Also GDPR-compliant</span></span></span></td>\r\n		</tr>\r\n		<tr>\r\n			<td><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\"><strong>Best For</strong></span></span></span></td>\r\n			<td><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">Startups, solo users, budget-conscious teams</span></span></span></td>\r\n			<td><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">Large sales teams with bigger budgets</span></span></span></td>\r\n		</tr>\r\n	</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">Why Go4Database stands out?</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><br />\r\n<span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">Go4Database is great for teams seeking </span></span></span><a href=\"https://go4database.com/email-verifier\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#0000ff\"><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\">verified contacts</span></span></span></a><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">,</span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">&nbsp;worldwide reach, and flexible pricing without lengthy commitments. Plus, it&#39;s simple to use, affordable, and allows you to pay only for what you need, no hidden fees or sales calls.</span></span></span><br />\r\n&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<h2><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">&nbsp;</span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:24pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#434343\">Table of content:</span></span></span></h2>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li style=\"list-style-type:disc\"><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">Features</span></span></span></li>\r\n	<li style=\"list-style-type:disc\"><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">Data size and coverage</span></span></span></li>\r\n	<li style=\"list-style-type:disc\"><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">Data quality and compliance</span></span></span></li>\r\n	<li style=\"list-style-type:disc\"><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">Integrations</span></span></span></li>\r\n	<li style=\"list-style-type:disc\"><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">Usability</span></span></span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">Pricing and plans</span></span></span><br />\r\n<br />\r\n&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<h2><span style=\"font-size:24pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#434343\">Go4Database vs ZoomInfo: Features</span></span></span></h2>\r\n\r\n<p><br />\r\n<span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">Here&rsquo;s what you&rsquo;re really getting with each one:</span></span></span><br />\r\n&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<div id=\"blogTLDR\">\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\"><strong>TL;DR</strong><br />\r\nGo4Database offers the essential features you need, filters, checked contacts, and simple downloads, without extra stuff. ZoomInfo has more options, but for plain lead generation, Go4Database stays simple, targeted, and user-friendly.</span></span></span></p>\r\n</div>\r\n\r\n<h3><span style=\"font-size:20pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#434343\">Go4Database</span></span></span></h3>\r\n\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li style=\"list-style-type:disc\"><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">It&#39;s easy peasy to use, you won&rsquo;t waste time figuring it out things</span></span></span></li>\r\n	<li style=\"list-style-type:disc\"><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">Gives access to a huge list of real, working </span><a href=\"https://go4database.com/b2b/us-business-email-list\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#0000ff\">US business email list</span></a></span></span></li>\r\n	<li style=\"list-style-type:disc\"><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">Allows you filter by role, location, industry, and more</span></span></span></li>\r\n	<li style=\"list-style-type:disc\"><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">You can build and save as many lists as you want</span></span></span></li>\r\n	<li style=\"list-style-type:disc\"><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">Download your leads straight to Excel or CSV in seconds</span></span></span></li>\r\n	<li style=\"list-style-type:disc\"><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">Nothing unnecessary, just the stuff that helps you get moving</span></span></span><br />\r\n	&nbsp;</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<h3><span style=\"font-size:20pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#434343\">ZoomInfo</span></span></span></h3>\r\n\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li style=\"list-style-type:disc\"><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">Comes with a ton of extra tools like intent tracking and email activity</span></span></span></li>\r\n	<li style=\"list-style-type:disc\"><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">Shows detailed info about companies and people</span></span></span></li>\r\n	<li style=\"list-style-type:disc\"><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">Works well with tools like Salesforce and HubSpot</span></span></span></li>\r\n	<li style=\"list-style-type:disc\"><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">Feels a bit heavy if you&rsquo;re not part of a big sales team</span></span></span></li>\r\n	<li style=\"list-style-type:disc\"><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">Takes some time to learn and get used to</span></span></span><br />\r\n	&nbsp;</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<h3><span style=\"font-size:20pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#434343\">My Opinion:</span></span></span></h3>\r\n\r\n<p><br />\r\n<span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">Go4Database gives you what you need without making things complicated. ZoomInfo offers an extensive database, but if you just want ideal leads fast, Go4Database is way easier to work with.</span></span></span><br />\r\n&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<div id=\"BigCTA\" style=\"background:#e7fde7; border:1px solid #6fd943; padding:20px 50px\">\r\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><br />\r\n<img alt=\"\" src=\"https://go4database.com/assets/uploads/media-uploader/yellow-and-blue-bold-marketing-agency-with-hexagon-frame-linkedin-banner-1-removebg-preview1734171422.png\" style=\"height:50px; width:200px\" /><br />\r\n<br />\r\n<strong><span style=\"font-size:26px\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\">Receive Confirmed Emails That Are Effective</span></span></span></strong></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><br />\r\n<span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">Get ready-to-use, clean email lists in a matter of seconds.</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><br />\r\n<span style=\"font-size:20px\"><a href=\"https://app.go4database.com/login?utm_source=blogpage&amp;utm_medium=internal&amp;utm_campaign=app_login\" id=\"TrailBtn\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\">Get 100 Free Contacts to Start</span></a></span><br />\r\n&nbsp;</p>\r\n</div>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">&nbsp;</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<h2><span style=\"font-size:24pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#434343\">Go4Database vs ZoomInfo: Data Size and Coverage</span></span></span></h2>\r\n\r\n<p><br />\r\n<span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">Both platforms give you access to a </span></span></span><a href=\"https://go4database.com/b2b/global-email-list\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#0000ff\"><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\">large list of contacts</span></span></span></a><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">,</span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">&nbsp;but they differ in how wide and deep their data goes.</span></span></span><br />\r\n&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<div id=\"blogTLDR\">\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\"><strong>TL;DR</strong><br />\r\nGo4Database provides access to more than 350 million contacts in over 90 countries, which makes it ideal to reach out . ZoomInfo covers fewer areas and puts more emphasis on data from the United States. If you need to connect with a broader audience, Go4Database has an advantage.</span></span></span></p>\r\n</div>\r\n\r\n<h3><span style=\"font-size:20pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#434343\">Go4Database</span></span></span></h3>\r\n\r\n<p><br />\r\n<span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">Go4Database gives you over 350 million contacts spread across 90+ countries. You&rsquo;ll get direct info like emails, phone numbers, and LinkedIn links, strong, genuine details you can actually use.</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><br />\r\n<span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">It works well if you&#39;re reaching out to leads in different countries or running bulk campaigns without needing to mess around with complicated tools.</span></span></span><br />\r\n&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<h3><span style=\"font-size:20pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#434343\">ZoomInfo</span></span></span></h3>\r\n\r\n<p><br />\r\n<span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">ZoomInfo has about 230 million contacts and is more focused on U.S.-based companies. It digs into company structure and buying behavior, which can be helpful if you&rsquo;re chasing large corporate clients.</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<h3><span style=\"font-size:20pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#434343\">My Opinion</span></span></span></h3>\r\n\r\n<p><br />\r\n<span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">Go4Database gives you a stronger reach, more contacts, and an easier way to get started, great if you want</span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\"><strong> </strong></span><a href=\"https://go4database.com/blog/targeted-email-list\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#0000ff\">reliable targeted email list</span></a></span></span><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">&nbsp;without the extra steps.</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\"><strong>&nbsp;</strong></span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<h2><span style=\"font-size:24pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#434343\">Go4Database vs ZoomInfo: Data Quality and Compliance</span></span></span></h2>\r\n\r\n<p><br />\r\n<span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">Having a big list of contacts is great, but if the data&rsquo;s outdated or not legally usable, it&rsquo;s a waste of time. Here&rsquo;s how both compare.</span></span></span><br />\r\n&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<h3><span style=\"font-size:20pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#434343\">Go4Database</span></span></span></h3>\r\n\r\n<p><br />\r\n<span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">Go4Database says their data is 95% to 100% accurate, and from my experience, that holds up. Emails are verified before you get them, and if one doesn&rsquo;t work, they send you a replacement.</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><br />\r\n<span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">It also follows major data privacy </span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><a href=\"https://go4database.com/gdpr-ccpa\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#0000ff\">rules like GDPR</span></a><span style=\"color:#666666\"><strong>,&nbsp;</strong></span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">so you&#39;re not stepping into risky territory when you send out campaigns.</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<h3><span style=\"font-size:20pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#434343\">ZoomInfo</span></span></span></h3>\r\n\r\n<p><br />\r\n<span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">ZoomInfo updates its data often, and the detail level is solid for larger companies. But now and then, you&rsquo;ll come across contacts that aren&rsquo;t current, especially in smaller businesses.</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><br />\r\n<span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">It checks the compliance boxes, but the quality can feel uneven.</span></span></span><br />\r\n&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<h3><span style=\"font-size:20pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#434343\">My Opinion</span></span></span></h3>\r\n\r\n<p><br />\r\n<span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">If you&#39;re working on outreach and want fewer surprises, Go4Database tends to be more dependable.</span></span></span><br />\r\n&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<div id=\"BigCTA\" style=\"background:#e7fde7; border:1px solid #6fd943; padding:20px 50px\">\r\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://go4database.com/assets/uploads/media-uploader/yellow-and-blue-bold-marketing-agency-with-hexagon-frame-linkedin-banner-1-removebg-preview1734171422.png\" style=\"height:50px; width:200px\" /></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><strong><span style=\"font-size:26px\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\">Find The Right Prospects Quickly</span></span></span></strong></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><br />\r\n<span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">Reach the right people fast by tapping into 350M+ contacts.</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><br />\r\n<span style=\"font-size:20px\"><a href=\"https://app.go4database.com/login?utm_source=blogpage&amp;utm_medium=internal&amp;utm_campaign=app_login\" id=\"TrailBtn\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\">Do a Database Search Now</span></a></span><br />\r\n&nbsp;</p>\r\n</div>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\"><strong>&nbsp;</strong></span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<h2><span style=\"font-size:24pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#434343\">Go4Database vs ZoomInfo: Integrations</span></span></span></h2>\r\n\r\n<p><br />\r\n<span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">How a platform connects with the tools you already use can save you time or slow you down.</span></span></span><br />\r\n&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<h3><span style=\"font-size:20pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#434343\">Go4Database</span></span></span></h3>\r\n\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li style=\"list-style-type:disc\"><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">Allows you download contact lists in Excel or CSV</span></span></span></li>\r\n	<li style=\"list-style-type:disc\"><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">You can upload the file into whatever tool you&rsquo;re using, no extra steps</span></span></span></li>\r\n	<li style=\"list-style-type:disc\"><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">It doesn&rsquo;t connect directly with CRMs, but that&rsquo;s not a dealbreaker</span></span></span></li>\r\n	<li style=\"list-style-type:disc\"><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">Works well if you&rsquo;re used to managing your own lists and keeping things simple</span></span></span><br />\r\n	&nbsp;</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<h3><span style=\"font-size:20pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#434343\">ZoomInfo</span></span></span></h3>\r\n\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li style=\"list-style-type:disc\"><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">Hooks into Salesforce, HubSpot, Outreach, and similar platforms</span></span></span></li>\r\n	<li style=\"list-style-type:disc\"><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">You can send contact info straight into your system</span></span></span></li>\r\n	<li style=\"list-style-type:disc\"><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">It&rsquo;s made for teams that already use a full sales setup</span></span></span></li>\r\n	<li style=\"list-style-type:disc\"><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">Makes more sense if everything in your process is already connected</span></span></span><br />\r\n	&nbsp;</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<h3><span style=\"font-size:20pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#434343\">My Opinion</span></span></span></h3>\r\n\r\n<p><br />\r\n<span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">Go4Database keeps things straightforward, great if you like having control without needing to set up a bunch of tech.</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\"><strong>&nbsp;</strong></span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<h2><span style=\"font-size:24pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#434343\">Go4Database vs ZoomInfo: Usability</span></span></span></h2>\r\n\r\n<p><br />\r\n<span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">Let&rsquo;s find which tools offer simple usage that doesn&rsquo;t slow you down.</span></span></span><br />\r\n&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<h3><span style=\"font-size:20pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#434343\">Go4Database</span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">&nbsp;</span></span></span></h3>\r\n\r\n<p><br />\r\n<span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">Go4Database is easy to handle. You log in, pick your filters, download your list, and you&rsquo;re done. There&rsquo;s nothing complicated about it, and you don&rsquo;t need to dig around to figure things out. It does what it&rsquo;s supposed to without wasting your time.</span></span></span><br />\r\n&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<h3><span style=\"font-size:20pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#434343\">ZoomInfo</span></span></span></h3>\r\n\r\n<p><br />\r\n<span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">ZoomInfo offers more features, but that also means more clicking, more tabs, and more time spent learning where everything is. It&rsquo;s not hard, but it&rsquo;s not something you&rsquo;ll pick up in five minutes either.</span></span></span><br />\r\n&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<h3><span style=\"font-size:20pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#434343\">My Opinion</span></span></span></h3>\r\n\r\n<p><br />\r\n<span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">If you&#39;re someone who just wants to get the job done without overthinking it, Go4Database is the better fit.</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\"><strong>&nbsp;</strong></span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<h2><span style=\"font-size:24pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#434343\">Go4Database vs ZoomInfo: Pricing and Plans</span></span></span></h2>\r\n\r\n<p><br />\r\n<span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">Let&rsquo;s break down the cost, because it matters when you&rsquo;re deciding where to put your money.</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<div id=\"blogTLDR\">\r\n<p><br />\r\n<span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\"><strong>TL;DR</strong></span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">Go4Database offers straightforward, budget-friendly plans that begin at $35 per month without any contracts. In contrast, ZoomInfo demands yearly commitments and substantial initial expenses. If you&#39;re looking to save money and avoid complicated processes, Go4Database provides a more cost-effective solution.</span></span></span><br />\r\n&nbsp;</p>\r\n</div>\r\n\r\n<h3><span style=\"font-size:20pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#434343\">Go4Database</span></span></span></h3>\r\n\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li style=\"list-style-type:disc\"><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\"><strong>Free Plan</strong></span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">: $0/month &ndash; you get 100 contacts every month, no payment needed</span></span></span></li>\r\n	<li style=\"list-style-type:disc\"><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\"><strong>Nano Plan</strong></span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">: $35/month (paid yearly) &ndash; includes 1,500 contacts per month</span></span></span></li>\r\n	<li style=\"list-style-type:disc\"><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\"><strong>Micro Plan</strong></span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">: $49/month (paid yearly) &ndash; gives 3,000 contacts/month and access for two users</span></span></span></li>\r\n	<li style=\"list-style-type:disc\"><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\"><strong>Mega Plan</strong></span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">: Around $1,000/month &ndash; meant for bigger teams who need more volume and control</span></span></span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<h3><span style=\"font-size:20pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#434343\">ZoomInfo</span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">&nbsp;</span></span></span></h3>\r\n\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li style=\"list-style-type:disc\"><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\"><strong>Professional Plan</strong></span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">: Starts at roughly $14,995/year &ndash; includes 5,000 credits and 3 user seats</span></span></span></li>\r\n	<li style=\"list-style-type:disc\"><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\"><strong>Advanced Plan</strong></span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">: Around $24,995/year &ndash; comes with 10,000 credits and a few extra features</span></span></span></li>\r\n	<li style=\"list-style-type:disc\"><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\"><strong>Elite Plan</strong></span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">: Priced near $39,995/year &ndash; adds more monthly credits and full access to their tools</span></span></span></li>\r\n	<li style=\"list-style-type:disc\"><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">Pricing isn&rsquo;t shown on the site, you&rsquo;ll have to schedule a sales call to even get numbers</span></span><