pan></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:20px\"><a href=\"https://app.go4database.com/login?utm_source=blogpage&amp;utm_medium=internal&amp;utm_campaign=app_login\" id=\"TrailBtn\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\">View Prices &amp; Plans</span></a></span><br />\r\n&nbsp;</p>\r\n</div>\r\n\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<h2><span style=\"font-size:24pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#434343\">Conclusion</span></span></span></h2>\r\n\r\n<p><br />\r\n<span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">Hope you got clear picture about ZoomInfo vs. Go4Databas which suits your business needs.</span></span></span><br />\r\n&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">ZoomInfo is great if you&rsquo;re running a big operation and have the budget to match. But if you&rsquo;re just looking for reliable contacts and don&rsquo;t want to jump through hoops, </span></span></span><a href=\"https://go4database.com/\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#0000ff\"><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\">Go4Database</span></span></span></a><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">&nbsp;is a smart choice. It&rsquo;s easy to use, reasonably priced, and gets you what you actually need.</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>', NULL, 16, 'a:1:{i:0;s:1:\"4\";}', 'Go4Database vs ZoomInfo', '791', NULL, 'Go4Database vs ZoomInfo: Better Data, Smarter Choice', 'Go4Database vs ZoomInfo: Compare both to see which offers the best ROI for your sales and marketing data needs. Discover the smarter choice for lead generation.', '<script type=\"application/ld+json\">\r\n         {         \r\n            \"@context\": \