 style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\"><strong>Usability</strong></span></span></span></td>\r\n			<td><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">Simple UI, fast workflows</span></span></span></td>\r\n			<td><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">Feature-rich, steeper learning curve</span></span></span></td>\r\n			<td><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">Clean dashboard, easy filtering</span></span></span></td>\r\n		</tr>\r\n		<tr>\r\n			<td><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\"><strong>Pricing</strong></span></span></span></td>\r\n			<td><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">Starts ~$49/mo</span></span></span></td>\r\n			<td><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">Custom pricing, higher-end</span></span></span></td>\r\n			<td><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">Affordable plans with instant credits</span></span></span></td>\r\n		</tr>\r\n		<tr>\r\n			<td><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\"><strong>Best For</strong></span></span></span></td>\r\n			<td><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">SM teams, start-ups, email campaigns</span></span></span></td>\r\n			<td><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">Mid-size to enterprise B2B sales teams</span></span></span></td>\r\n			<td><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">Agencies, SMEs needing segmented lists</span></span></span></td>\r\n		</tr>\r\n	</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">Why Go4Database stands out?</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><br />\r\n<span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">With Go4Database, you can select the precise type of </span></span></span><a href=\"https://www.go4database.com/blog/b2b-mailing-list\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#0000ff\"><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\">business contact list</span></span></span></a><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\"> </span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">you require, filtered by country, industry, or job title. No subscriptions, no additional features to learn. Simply obtain the list and begin contacting people.</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<h2><span style=\"font-size:24pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#434343\">Hunter vs. ZoomInfo: Features</span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:20pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#434343\">&nbsp;</span></span></span></h2>\r\n\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">Let&#39;s explore the essential features that each tool provides.</span></span></span><br />\r\n&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<div id=\"blogTLDR\">\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\"><strong>TL;DR</strong></span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span st