e:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">Integral lead generation services.</span></span></span></li>\r\n	<li style=\"list-style-type:disc\"><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">Use AI &amp; Human expertise for better lead quality.</span></span></span></li>\r\n	<li style=\"list-style-type:disc\"><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">Can generate qualified leads.</span></span></span></li>\r\n	<li style=\"list-style-type:disc\"><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">Can develop and deploy full lead generation strategies.</span></span></span></li>\r\n	<li style=\"list-style-type:disc\"><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">Customizable lead generation strategies.</span></span></span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\"><strong>Cons of CIENCE</strong></span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li style=\"list-style-type:disc\"><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">Expensive.</span></span></span></li>\r\n	<li style=\"list-style-type:disc\"><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">Poor customer support.</span></span></span></li>\r\n	<li style=\"list-style-type:disc\"><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">Poor lead quality.</span></span></span></li>\r\n	<li style=\"list-style-type:disc\"><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">Delivery delays.</span></span></span></li>\r\n	<li style=\"list-style-type:disc\"><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">Fraudulent practices.</span></span></span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<h3><span style=\"font-size:20pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#434343\">3. HubSpot</span></span></span></h3>\r\n\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><a href=\"https://www.hubspot.com/\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#3498db\">HubSpot</span></a><span style=\"color:#666666\"> claims to bring your marketing, sales, and service teams together on the same AI-powered customer platform. It&#39;s easy to use, provides value fast, and gives all teams a unified view of the customer at every stage in their journey.&nbsp;</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">Each product in the platform is powerful on its own, but the real magic happens when you use them together. Also HubSpot has to be the most popular lead generation company out of all the lead generation companies on the list.</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p><img alt=\"hubspot\" src=\"https://www.go4database.com/assets/uploads/media-uploader/hubspot1753441010.webp\" style=\"height:335px; width:800px\" /></p>\r\n\r\n<p><br />\r\n&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\"><strong>Pros of HubSpot</strong></span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li style=\"list-style-type:disc\"><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">Comprehensive marketing automation features.</span></span></span></li>\r\n	<li style=\"list-style-type:disc\"><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">High rated CRM integration.</span></span></span></li>\r\n	<li style=\"list-style-type:disc\"><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">Strong analytics and reporting tools.</span></span></span></li>\r\n	<li style=\"list-style-type:disc\"><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">User friendly interface for businesses of all sizes.</span></span></span></li>\r\n	<li style=\"list-style-type:disc\"><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">Provides free tools for startups &amp; small businesses.</span></span></span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\"><strong>Cons of HubSpot</strong></span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li style=\"list-style-type:disc\"><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">Some users find the software overwhelming initially.</span></span></span></li>\r\n	<li style=\"list-style-type:disc\"><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">Requires training for optimal use.</span></span></span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">One of the best ways to kickstart your outreach is by grabbing a</span></span></span><a href=\"https://go4database.com/b2b/free-email-mailing-list\" style=\"text-decoration:none\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\"> </span></span></span><span style=\"color:#3498db\"><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><u>free email mailing list</u></span></span></span></a><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\"> from Go4Database&mdash;no strings attached, just pure lead generation power</span></span></span></p>', NULL, 13, 'a:1:{i:0;s:2:\"11\";}', 'Marketing Lead Generation', '802', NULL, 'Marketing Lead Gen Guide for Beginners & Top Companies', 'Learn the basics of marketing lead generation, proven strategies, and top companies that can help your business attract, nurture, and convert more leads.', '<script type=\"application/ld+json\">\r\n{\r\n  \"@context\": \"https://schema.org\",\r\n  \"@type\": \"Organization\",\r\n  \"name\": \"Go4Database\",\r\n  \"url\": \"https://www.go4database.com/\",\r\n  \"logo\": \"https://go4database.com/assets/uploads/media-uploader/go4database-logo1751528079.png\",\r\n  \"contactPoint\": {\r\n    \"@type\": \"ContactPoint\",\r\n    \"telephone\": \"+ 1 786 785 2141\",\r\n    \"contactType\": \"customer service\",\r\n    \"areaServed\": \"US\",\r\n    \"availableLanguage\": \"en\"\r\n  },\r\n  \"sameAs\": [\r\n    \"https://www.facebook.com/Go4Database\",\r\n    \"https://twitter.com/DatabaseGo4\",\r\n    \"https://www.instagram.com/go4database/\",\r\n    \"https://www.youtube.com/@Go4Database\",\r\n    \"https://www.linkedin.com/company/go4database/\",\r\n    \"https://in.pinterest.com/gofourdatabase/\"\r\n  ]\r\n}\r\n</script>\r\n\r\n\r\n<script type=\"application/ld+json\">\r\n{\r\n  \"@context\": \"https://schema.org\",\r\n  \"@type\": \"BlogPosting\",\r\n  \"mainEntityOfPage\": {\r\n    \"@type\": \"WebPage\",\r\n    \"@id\": \"https://www.go4database.com/blog/marketing-lead-generation\"\r\n  },\r\n  \"headline\": \"Marketing Lead Generation: A Beginner’s Guide and Top Lead Generation Companies\",\r\n  \"description\": \"“You are out of business if you don’t have a prospect.” – Zig Zigler\r\n\r\n \r\n\r\nI see, Marketing Lead Generation has piqued your interest. Well, a great topic to be interested in indeed. Hello, Marketers & Business owners, I hope you\'ve been well.\",\r\n  \"image\": \"https://www.go4database.com/assets/uploads/media-uploader/marketing-lead-generation-go4database1753337375.webp\",  \r\n  \"author\": {\r\n    \"@type\": \"Person\",\r\n    \"name\": \"Payal Patwal\"\r\n  },  \r\n  \"publisher\": {\r\n    \"@type\": \"Organization\",\r\n    \"name\": \"\",\r\n    \"logo\": {\r\n      \"@type\": \"ImageObject\",\r\n      \"url\": \"\"\r\n    }\r\n  },\r\n  \"datePublished\": \"2025-07-24\",\r\n  \"dateModified\": \"2025-12-29\"\r\n}\r\n</script>\r\n<script type=\"application/ld+json\">\r\n         {         \r\n            \"@context\": \"https://schema.org/\",         \r\n            \"@type\": \"WebPage\",         \r\n            \"@id\": \"#WebPage\",         \r\n            \"url\": \"https://www.go4database.com/blog/marketing-lead-generation\",          \r\n            \"name\": \"Marketing Lead Generation: A Beginner’s Guide and Top Lead Generation Companies\"\r\n          } \r\n      </script>\r\n      <script type=\"application/ld+json\" class=\"schemantra\">{\r\n  \"@context\": \"https://schema.org\",\r\n  \"@type\": \"SpeakableSpecification\",\r\n  \"@id\": \"SpeakableSpecification\",\r\n  \"additionalType\": \"https://www.go4database.com/blog/marketing-lead-generation\",\r\n  \"alternateName\": \"What is Marketing Lead Generation?\",\r\n  \"description\": \"Marketing lead generation is the process of attracting and capturing potential customers’ interest in a product or service, usually by collecting their contact information, with the goal of nurturing them into paying customers.\"\r\n}</script>\r\n<script type=\"application/ld+json\">\r\n{\r\n  \"@context\": \"https://schema.org\",\r\n  \"@type\": \"FAQPage\",\r\n  \"mainEntity\": [{\r\n    \"@type\": \"Question\",\r\n    \"name\": \"1. What are lead generation services?\",\r\n    \"acceptedAnswer\": {\r\n      \"@type\": \"Answer\",\r\n      \"text\": \"Lead generation services are specialized offerings from companies or agencies that help businesses attract and win potential customers. \r\n\r\n \r\n\r\nThese services include targeted marketing campaigns, content creation, and data analytics to generate high-quality leads that can be converted into sales, enhancing overall business growth.\"\r\n    }\r\n  },{\r\n    \"@type\": \"Question\",\r\n    \"name\": \"2. What are different marketing lead generation models?\",\r\n    \"acceptedAnswer\": {\r\n      \"@type\": \"Answer\",\r\n      \"text\": \"Email Forms\r\nChatbots and AI\r\nCalling Button\r\nLead magnets & freemium services\r\nWebsite pop-ups (exit, scroll, RCTA)\"\r\n    }\r\n  },{\r\n    \"@type\": \"Question\",\r\n    \"name\": \"3. How We Segment Marketing Lead Generation\",\r\n    \"acceptedAnswer\": {\r\n      \"@type\": \"Answer\",\r\n      \"text\": \"Segmentation ensures that your outreach is both strategic and impactful, driving results that matter. \r\n\r\n \r\n\r\nThis level of granularity allows you to create highly targeted campaigns that resonate with your specific audience, leading to improved engagement rates, higher conversion rates, and ultimately, better ROI for your marketing efforts.\"\r\n    }\r\n  }]\r\n}\r\n</script>\r\n<script type=\"application/ld+json\">\r\n{\r\n  \"@context\": \"https://schema.org/\", \r\n  \"@type\": \"BreadcrumbList\", \r\n  \"itemListElement\": [{\r\n    \"@type\": \"ListItem\", \r\n    \"position\": 1, \r\n    \"name\": \"Homepage\",\r\n    \"item\": \"https://www.go4database.com/\"  \r\n  },{\r\n    \"@type\": \"ListItem\", \r\n    \"position\": 2, \r\n    \"name\": \"Blog\",\r\n    \"item\": \"https://www.go4database.com/blog\"  \r\n  },{\r\n    \"@type\": \"ListItem\", \r\n    \"position\": 3, \r\n    \"name\": \"Marketing Lead Generation: A Beginner’s Guide and Top Lead Generation Companies\",\r\n    \"item\": \"https://www.go4database.com/blog/marketing-lead-generation\"  \r\n  }]\r\n}\r\n</script>', '1', 'I see, Marketing Lead Generation has piqued your interest. Well, a great topic to be interested in indeed. Hello, Marketers & Business owners, I hope you\'ve been well.', 'marketing-lead-generation', 'Payal Patwal', 3, 'publish', 'en_US', '2025-12-29', '7084', '2025-07-02 12:21:16', '2026-08-12 10:20:08', 0, NULL, '[{\"question\":\"What are lead generation services?\",\"answer\":\"Lead generation services are specialized offerings from companies or agencies that help businesses attract and win potential customers. \\r\\n\\r\\n These services include targeted marketing campaigns, content creation, and data analytics to generate high-quality leads that can be converted into sales, enhancing overall business growth.\"},{\"question\":\"What are different marketing lead generation models?\",\"answer\":\"Email Forms\\r\\nChatbots and AI\\r\\nCalling Button\\r\\nLead magnets & freemium services\\r\\nWebsite pop-ups (exit, scroll, RCTA)\"},{\"question\":\"How We Segment Marketing Lead Generation\",\"answer\":\"Segmentation ensures that your outreach is both strategic and impactful, driving results that matter. \\r\\n\\r\\n This level of granularity allows you to create highly targeted campaigns that resonate with your specific audience, leading to improved engagement rates, higher conversion rates, and ultimately, better ROI for your marketing efforts.\"}]');
