(115, 'Breaking Down RocketReach’s Pricing : Which One Fits You?', '<p><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">Wondering if </span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\"><strong>RocketReach</strong></span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\"> is really worth the money for your outreach goals? Well, its a fair question, because let&rsquo;s be honest, chasing down quality contacts can eat up your budget if you pick the wrong tool.&nbsp;</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">RocketReach has a strong name for its </span></span></span><a href=\"https://www.go4database.com/blog/business-mailing-list\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#0000ff\"><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\">business contact database</span></span></span></a><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">, but its pricing model can be confusing.</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">Let&rsquo;s break down RocketReach pricing clearly, so you can figure out if it makes sense for your outreach, or if you&#39;re looking for a third option like Go4Database might be a smarter fit.</span></span></span><br />\r\n&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<h2><span style=\"font-size:24pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#434343\">What Does RocketReach Offer?</span></span></span></h2>\r\n\r\n<p><br />\r\n<span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">RocketReach gives you access to </span></span></span><a href=\"https://www.go4database.com/blog/b2b-mailing-list\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#0000ff\"><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\">business emails</span></span></span></a><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">,</span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">phone numbers, and social media links, all in one place.&nbsp;</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">People use it for sales prospecting, recruiting, or marketing.&nbsp;</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">Now you might wonder how is it done? well it collects data from websites, company directories, and public profiles, then puts it into a simple search platform.</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">Impressive right?</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">It also connects with CRMs like Salesforce, HubSpot, and SalesLoft, so you don&rsquo;t have to constantly jump between tools.&nbsp;</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">That&rsquo;s a nice advantage if you want to find the </span></span></span><a href=\"https://www.go4database.com/b2b/decision-makers-mailing-list\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#0000ff\"><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\">right decision-maker</span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\"> </span></span></span></a><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">quickly and keep your outreach moving.</span></span></span><br />\r\n&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<div id=\"BigCTA\" style=\"background:#e7fde7; border:1px solid #6fd943; padding:20px 50px\">\r\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://go4database.com/assets/uploads/media-uploader/go4database-logo1751528079.png\" style=\"height:51px; width:200px\" /></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><strong><span style=\"font-size:20pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\">Say&nbsp; Goodbye To Monthly Credit Stress</span></span></strong></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><br />\r\n<span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">Grab a one-time, forever-usable list from Go4Database today!</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><br />\r\n<a href=\"https://app.go4database.com/login?utm_source=blogpage&amp;utm_medium=internal&amp;utm_campaign=app_login\" id=\"TrailBtn\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\">Checkout Now!</span></span></a><br />\r\n&nbsp;</p>\r\n</div>\r\n\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<h2><span style=\"font-size:24pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#434343\">RocketReach Pricing and Features Table</span></span></span></h2>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">For those who have a busy day can have a quick glance on the table below to understand RocketReach pricing and plans. This will help you take a better decision on which plan fit&rsquo;s you well.</span></span></span><br />\r\n&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<table border=\"1\" cellpadding=\"1\" cellspacing=\"1\" class=\"table table-bordered\" style=\"width:800px\">\r\n	<tbody>\