d can outperform Lusha&#39;s monthly expenses.</span></span></span><br />\r\n&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://app.go4database.com/login?utm_source=blogpage&amp;utm_medium=internal&amp;utm_campaign=app_login\" id=\"TrailBtn\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\">check out prices right now</span></span></a></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n</div>\r\n\r\n<h2><span style=\"font-size:24pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#434343\">Tips to Get the Most from Lusha</span></span></span></h2>\r\n\r\n<p><br />\r\n<span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">If you know you&rsquo;ll use it every month, pay annually for a better rate.&nbsp;</span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">Think through how many credits you really need so you don&rsquo;t get stuck paying for extras</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">Try the free plan first to see how accurate their contacts are</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">Mix in a one-time list from Go4Database if you ever need a niche group of contacts without committing to more seats</span></span></span><br />\r\n&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">That way, you cover day-to-day prospecting while still having the freedom to grab extra leads whenever you want.</span></span></span><br />\r\n&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<blockquote>\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\"><strong>Also read:</strong></span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\"> </span></span></span><a href=\"https://go4database.com/blog/zoominfo-reviews\" style=\"text-decoration:none\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#1155cc\">ZoomInfo Reviews: Is It the Best Tool to Buy Verified Email Lists in 2026?&nbsp;</span></span></span></a></p>\r\n</blockquote>\r\n\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<h2><span style=\"font-size:24pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#434343\">Conclusion</span></span></span></h2>\r\n\r\n<p><br />\r\n<span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">Lusha&rsquo;s pricing in 2026 makes sense if your team is constantly prospecting and you want your CRM to stay updated with fresh, verified data. It does the job well for steady sales outreach.</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">If you&rsquo;d rather skip ongoing fees and only buy lists when you really need them, check out </span></span></span><a href=\"https://www.go4database.com/\" style=\"text-decoration:none\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#1155cc\">Go4Database</span></span></span></a><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">,&nbsp; they&rsquo;ll build you a targeted list with no contracts or surprise charges.</span></span></span></p>', NULL, 16, 'a:1:{i:0;s:2:\"11\";}', 'Lusha Pricing', '1121', NULL, 'Lusha Pricing 2026: Is It Worth It? (Hidden Costs Revealed', 'Compare Lusha’s 2026 pricing plans, features and credit limits. Is Lusha too expensive for your ROI? Discover if Go4Database offers better data accuracy.', '<script type=\"applicati