(117, 'Hunter Pricing: Everything You Need to Know Before Buying', '<p><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">If you&rsquo;re trying to get your cold outreach right, you&rsquo;ve probably heard of Hunter.io. It&rsquo;s one of the go-to tools for finding and verifying </span></span></span><a href=\"https://www.go4database.com/blog/apollo-vs-zoominfo\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#1155cc\">business emails</span></span></span></a><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\"><a href=\"https://go4database.com/blog/apollo-vs.-zoominfo\" target=\"_blank\">.</a> But before you swipe your card, it&rsquo;s smart to look at </span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\"><strong>Hunter pricing</strong></span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\"> in detail so you know exactly what you&rsquo;re paying for, and don&rsquo;t waste money on the wrong plan.</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">I will walk you through it so you can pick w</span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">hat actually works for you.</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<h2><span style=\"font-size:24pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#434343\">Table of contents of Hunter Pricing</span></span></span></h2>\r\n\r\n<p><br />\r\n<a href=\"https://www.go4database.com/blog/hunter-pricing#hunter-pricing-overview\"><span style=\"color:#1155cc\"><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\">1. Hunter Pricing Overview&nbsp;</span></span></span></a></p>\r\n\r\n<p><a href=\"https://www.go4database.com/blog/hunter-pricing#how-much-does-hunterio-cost\"><span style=\"color:#1155cc\"><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\">2. How Much Does Hunter.io Cost ?</span></span></span></a></p>\r\n\r\n<p><a href=\"https://www.go4database.com/blog/hunter-pricing#enterprise-personalized-prices\"><span style=\"color:#1155cc\"><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\">3. Enterprise (personalized prices)</span></span></span></a></p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"color:#1155cc\"><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\">4. What is Hunter.io API Pricing?</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><a href=\"https://www.go4database.com/blog/hunter-pricing#quick-hunter-plan-cheat-sheet\"><span style=\"color:#1155cc\"><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\">5. Quick Hunter Plan Cheat Sheet</span></span></span></a></p>\r\n\r\n<p><a href=\"https://www.go4database.com/blog/hunter-pricing#why-flexible-credits\"><span style=\"color:#1155cc\"><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\">6. Why Flexible Credits ?</span></span></span></a></p>\r\n\r\n<p><a href=\"https://www.go4database.com/blog/hunter-pricing#free-plan-limitations\"><span style=\"color:#1155cc\"><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\">7. Free Plan Limitations</span></span></span></a></p>\r\n\r\n<p><a href=\"https://www.go4database.com/blog/hunter-pricing#enterprise-and-custom-setups\"><span style=\"color:#1155cc\"><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\">8. Enterprise and custom setups</span></span></span></a></p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><a href=\"https://www.go4database.com/blog/hunter-pricing#conclusion\"><span style=\"color:#1155cc\">9. Conclusion</span></a><span style=\"color:#1155cc\">&nbsp;</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><a href=\"https://www.go4database.com/blog/hunter-pricing#faqs\"><span style=\"color:#1155cc\"><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\">10. Fa&amp;Qs</span></span></span></a></p>\r\n\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<h2><span style=\"font-size:24pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#434343\">Hunter Pricing Overview</span></span></span></h2>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">Hunter keeps pricing simple, with options for everyone from solo freelancers to big sales teams:</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li style=\"list-style-type:disc\"><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\"><strong>Free Plan</strong></span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\"> &mdash; 25 searches and 50 verifications per month</span></span></span></li>\r\n	<li style=\"list-style-type:disc\"><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\"><strong>Starter</strong></span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\"> &mdash; $49/month (or $34/month if billed yearly)</span></span></span></li>\r\n	<li style=\"list-style-type:disc\"><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\"><strong>Growth</strong></span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\"> &mdash; $149/month (or $104/yearly)</span></span></span></li>\r\n	<li style=\"list-style-type:disc\"><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\"><strong>Scale</strong></span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\"> &mdash; $299/month (or $209/yearly)</span></span></span></li>\r\n	<li style=\"list-style-type:disc\"><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\"><strong>Enterprise</strong></span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\"> &mdash; custom pricing depending on your team&rsquo;s needs</span></span></span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">Paying yearly gives you around 30% off, which helps if you&rsquo;re running outreach all year.&nbsp;</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">Additionally, you receive all of your credits for the entire year up front if you select an annual plan, which is ideal if you run campaigns in spurts rather than monthly.</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<blockquote>\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">&nbsp;</span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\"><strong>Also read</strong></span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">:</span></span></span><a href=\"https://www.go4database.com/blog/rocketreach-vs-zoominfo\" style=\"text-decoration:none\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#1155cc\"> Rocketreach vs Zoominfo: Which one is the best in 2025?&nbsp;</span></span></span></a></p>\r\n</blockquote>\r\n\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<h2><span style=\"font-size:24pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#434343\">How Much Does Hunter.io Cost ?</span></span></span></h2>\r\n\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<div id=\"blogTLDR\">\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\"><strong>TL;DR</strong></span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">Hunter.io offers plans that start at no cost and go up to $299 each month, with choices for solo workers to large sales groups. You can use credits , and the API comes with it. If you&#39;re looking for a more straightforward single purchase of data, you might want to look into Go4Database.</span></span></span></p>\r\n</div>\r\n\r\n<p><br />\r\n<span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">Let&#39;s simplify this and discuss what each plan offers, how much it costs, and who each plan is meant for:</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<h3><span style=\"font-size:20pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#434343\">Free plan</span></span></span></h3>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li style=\"list-style-type:disc\"><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">$0/month</span></span></span></li>\r\n	<li style=\"list-style-type:disc\"><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">50 verifications and 25 searches</span></span></span></li>\r\n	<li style=\"list-style-type:disc\"><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">500 contacts per campaign with one email account</span></span></span></li>\r\n	<li style=\"list-style-type:disc\"><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">Simple domain lookup and validation</span></span></span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\"><strong>Ideal for: </strong></span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">launching small campaigns or experimenting.</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">&nbsp;</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<h3><span style=\"font-size:20pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#434343\">Starter plan</span></span></span></h3>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li style=\"list-style-type:disc\"><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">$49/month or $34/year</span></span></span></li>\r\n	<li style=\"list-style-type:disc\"><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">1,000 verifications and 500 searches</span></span></span></li>\r\n	<li style=\"list-style-type:disc\"><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">Three or more email accounts</span></span></span></li>\r\n	<li style=\"list-style-type:disc\"><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">2,500 contacts for the campaign</span></span></span></li>\r\n	<li style=\"list-style-type:disc\"><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">includes file attachments and link tracking.</span></span></span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\"><strong>Ideal for: </strong></span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">independent founders or consultants who require consistent outreach.</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">&nbsp;</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<h3><span style=\"font-size:20pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#434343\">Growth Plan</span></span></span></h3>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li style=\"list-style-type:disc\"><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">$149 per month or $104 per year</span></span></span></li>\r\n	<li style=\"list-style-type:disc\"><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">10,000 verifications and 5,000 searches</span></span></span></li>\r\n	<li style=\"list-style-type:disc\"><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">Ten email addresses</span></span></span></li>\r\n	<li style=\"list-style-type:disc\"><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">5,000 contacts for the campaign</span></span></span></li>\r\n	<li style=\"list-style-type:disc\"><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">Support for custom domains</span></span></span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\"><strong>Ideal for: </strong></span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">marketing or sales teams with a larger outreach volume.</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">&nbsp;</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<h3><span style=\"font-size:20pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#434343\">Scale Plan&nbsp;</span></span></span></h3>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li style=\"list-style-type:disc\"><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">$209 per year or $299 per month</span></span></span></li>\r\n	<li style=\"list-style-type:disc\"><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">20,000 verifications and 10,000 searches</span></span></span></li>\r\n	<li style=\"list-style-type:disc\"><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">Twenty </span></span></span><a href=\"https://www.go4database.com/blog/targeted-email-list\" style=\"text-decoration:none\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#1155cc\">email addresses</span></span></span></a></li>\r\n	<li style=\"list-style-type:disc\"><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">15,000 contacts for the campaign</span></span></span></li>\r\n	<li style=\"list-style-type:disc\"><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">Custom domain support</span></span></span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\"><strong>Ideal for: </strong></span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">larger teams managing sizable prospect lists.</span></span></span><br />\r\n<br />\r\n&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<h2><span style=\"font-size:24pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#434343\">Enterprise (personalized prices)</span></span></span></h2>\r\n\r\n<p><br />\r\n<span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">Customized credits, a committed manager, and cutting-edge features</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\"><strong>Ideal for:</strong></span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\"> large organizations with stringent security and difficult compliance requirements.</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">One thing I like is Hunter gives you API access on every plan, even free, so you can connect it to your CRM or other systems. No extra API bills, just one credit pool you can use anywhere.</span></span></span><br />\r\n&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<div id=\"blogTLDR\">\r\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><br />\r\n<span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://go4database.com/assets/uploads/media-uploader/go4database-logo1751528079.png\" style=\"height:51px; width:200px\" /></span></span></span><br />\r\n&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><strong><span style=\"font-size:20pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\">Own Your Leads for Less</span></span></span></strong><br />\r\n&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">Pay once with Go4Database and skip recurring charges.</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><br />\r\n<span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><a href=\"https://app.go4database.com/login?utm_source=blogpage&amp;utm_medium=internal&amp;utm_campaign=app_login\" id=\"TrailBtn\" target=\"_blank\">Check out Plans</a></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n</div>\r\n\r\n<h3><span style=\"font-size:20pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#434343\">What is Hunter.io API Pricing?</span></span></span></h3>\r\n\r\n<p><br />\r\n<span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">Here&rsquo;s the simple part: there&rsquo;s no extra fee for the API. It comes with every plan and uses your credits the same way as normal searches. If you run out, you can grab extra credits whenever you need them, usually about $1&ndash;$3 per 100 credits depending on your plan. No surprises, no hidden charges.</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">&nbsp;</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<h2><span style=\"font-size:24pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#434343\">Quick Hunter Plan Cheat Sheet</span></span></span></h2>\r\n\r\n<div>&nbsp;\r\n<table border=\"1\" cellpadding=\"1\" cellspacing=\"1\" class=\"table table-bordered\" style=\"width:800px\">\r\n	<tbody>\r\n		<tr>\r\n			<td><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\"><strong>Plan</strong></span></span></span></td>\r\n			<td><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\"><strong>Searches/Verifications</strong></span></span></span></td>\r\n			<td><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\"><strong>Email Accounts</strong></span></span></span></td>\r\n			<td><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\"><strong>Campaign Contacts</strong></span></span></span></td>\r\n			<td><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\"><strong>Monthly / Annual</strong></span></span></span></td>\r\n		</tr>\r\n		<tr>\r\n			<td><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">Free</span></span></span></td>\r\n			<td><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">25 / 50</span></span></span></td>\r\n			<td><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">1</span></span></span></td>\r\n			<td><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">500</span></span></span></td>\r\n			<td><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">$0</span></span></span></td>\r\n		</tr>\r\n		<tr>\r\n			<td><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">Starter</span></span></span></td>\r\n			<td><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">500 / 1,000</span></span></span></td>\r\n			<td><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">3</span></span></span></td>\r\n			<td><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">2,500</span></span></span></td>\r\n			<td><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">$49 / $34</span></span></span></td>\r\n		</tr>\r\n		<tr>\r\n			<td><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">Growth</span></span></span></td>\r\n			<td><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">5,000 / 10,000</span></span></span></td>\r\n			<td><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">10</span></span></span></td>\r\n			<td><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">5,000</span></span></span></td>\r\n			<td><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">$149 / $104</span></span></span></td>\r\n		</tr>\r\n		<tr>\r\n			<td><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">Scale</span></span></span></td>\r\n			<td><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">10,000 / 20,000</span></span></span></td>\r\n			<td><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">20</span></span></span></td>\r\n			<td><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">15,000</span></span></span></td>\r\n			<td><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">$299 / $209</span></span></span></td>\r\n		</tr>\r\n		<tr>\r\n			<td><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">Enterprise</span></span></span></td>\r\n			<td><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">Custom</span></span></span></td>\r\n			<td><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">Custom</span></span></span></td>\r\n			<td><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">Custom</span></span></span></td>\r\n			<td><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">Talk to sales</span></span></span></td>\r\n		</tr>\r\n	</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n</div>\r\n\r\n<h2><span style=\"font-size:24pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#434343\">Why Flexible Credits ?</span></span></span></h2>\r\n\r\n<p><br />\r\n<span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">A yearly plan with Hunter gives you all your credits at once. So if you need a big outreach push in March and nothing until June, you aren&rsquo;t stuck waiting for the next month&rsquo;s credits. And if you burn through them early, adding more credits later is simple and clear.</span></span></span><br />\r\n&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<blockquote>\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">&nbsp;</span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\"><strong>Also read:</strong></span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\"> </span></span></span><a href=\"https://www.go4database.com/blog/apollo-vs-zoominfo\" style=\"text-decoration:none\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#1155cc\">Apollo vs. ZoomInfo: Which Platform Delivers More Value</span></span></span></a><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">&nbsp;</span></span></span></p>\r\n</blockquote>\r\n\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<h2><span style=\"font-size:24pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#434343\">Free Plan Limitations</span></span></span></h2>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">Hunter&rsquo;s free plan is pretty good for testing, giving you basic search,</span></span></span><a href=\"https://www.go4database.com/email-verifier\" style=\"text-decoration:none\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#1155cc\"> email verification</span></span></span></a><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\"><strong>,</strong></span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\"> and a simple campaign tool. But with just 25 searches a month, you&rsquo;ll probably run out quickly if you&rsquo;re trying to scale.</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">Check out Go4Database if you would prefer to purchase a<strong> </strong></span></span></span><a href=\"https://www.go4database.com/blog/b2b-database-providers\" style=\"text-decoration:none\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#1155cc\">large list of contacts<u> </u></span></span></span></a><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">all at once rather than juggling monthly credits. They offer sizable, validated data lists that you can use immediately without having to worry about resets or quotas. If you simply need a boost in prospecting, this is a good choice.</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<h2><span style=\"font-size:24pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#434343\">Enterprise and Custom Setups</span></span></span></h2>\r\n\r\n<p><br />\r\n<span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">If you&rsquo;re running a big sales team, Hunter&rsquo;s plan is worth having a proper conversation about. You get a dedicated manager, custom features, and high-volume support so nothing falls through the cracks. This setup is great for brands with strict data rules or multiple departments that need everything set up to match their workflow.</span></span></span><br />\r\n&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<div id=\"blogTLDR\">\r\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><br />\r\n<img alt=\"\" src=\"https://go4database.com/assets/uploads/media-uploader/go4database-logo1751528079.png\" style=\"height:51px; width:200px\" /></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><br />\r\n<strong><span style=\"font-size:20pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\">More Data, Fewer Fees</span></span></span></strong></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">Verified contacts from Go4Database with no monthly renewals.</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><br />\r\n<a href=\"https://app.go4database.com/login?utm_source=blogpage&amp;utm_medium=internal&amp;utm_campaign=app_login\" id=\"TrailBtn\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\">Explore the pricing and plans</span></span></a><br />\r\n&nbsp;</p>\r\n</div>\r\n\r\n<h2><span style=\"font-size:24pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#434343\">Benefits and Drawbacks</span></span></span></h2>\r\n\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<h3><span style=\"font-size:20pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#434343\">What&#39;s good?</span></span></span></h3>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li style=\"list-style-type:disc\"><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">No unstated costs</span></span></span></li>\r\n	<li style=\"list-style-type:disc\"><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">Annual credits are available up front.</span></span></span></li>\r\n	<li style=\"list-style-type:disc\"><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">Included is real-time verified data API access.</span></span></span></li>\r\n	<li style=\"list-style-type:disc\"><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">Connecting to CRMs is simple.</span></span></span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<h3><span style=\"font-size:20pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#434343\">What should I consider?</span></span></span></h3>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">For small budgets, starter pricing may seem excessive.</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">With large sends, credits can quickly run out.</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">Go4Database may be more appealing to one-time data buyers.</span></span></span><br />\r\n<br />\r\n&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<blockquote>\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\"><strong>Also read:</strong></span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\"> </span></span></span><a href=\"https://www.go4database.com/blog/zoominfo-reviews\" style=\"text-decoration:none\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#1155cc\">ZoomInfo Reviews: Is It the Best Tool to Buy Verified Email Lists in 2025?&nbsp;</span></span></span></a></p>\r\n</blockquote>\r\n\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<h2><span style=\"font-size:24pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#434343\">Conclusion</span></span></span></h2>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">Hunter pricing is reasonable for what you get, reliable, validated data and a seamless system that expands with you. It&#39;s a wise choice if you&#39;re looking for something dependable and easy to use for long-term outreach.</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">Additionally, Go4Database offers reasonably priced data lists to help you launch your next campaign quickly if you&#39;d prefer to get a large, </span></span></span><a href=\"https://www.go4database.com/blog/mailing-list\" style=\"text-decoration:none\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#1155cc\">b2b email list </span></span></span></a><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">and get going right away. You can choose what best suits your prospecting style by looking at their pricing here.</span></span></span></p>', NULL, 2, 'a:1:{i:0;s:2:\"11\";}', 'hunter-pricing', '1034', NULL, 'Hunter Pricing Guide: Costs & Plans | Go4Database', 'Compare Hunter pricing plans, features, and costs. See what you get with each plan and try Hunter for free before you buy.', '<script type=\"application/ld+json\">\r\n{\r\n  \"@context\": \"https://schema.org\",\r\n  \"@type\": \"Organization\",\r\n  \"name\": \"Go4Database\",\r\n  \"url\": \"https://www.go4database.com/\",\r\n  \"logo\": \"https://go4database.com/assets/uploads/media-uploader/go4database-logo1751528079.png\",\r\n  \"contactPoint\": {\r\n    \"@type\": \"ContactPoint\",\r\n    \"telephone\": \"+ 1 786 785 2141\",\r\n    \"contactType\": \"customer service\",\r\n    \"areaServed\": \"US\",\r\n    \"availableLanguage\": \"en\"\r\n  },\r\n  \"sameAs\": [\r\n    \"https://www.facebook.com/Go4Database\",\r\n    \"https://twitter.com/go4database\",\r\n    \"https://www.instagram.com/go4database/\",\r\n    \"https://www.youtube.com/@Go4Database\",\r\n    \"https://www.linkedin.com/company/go4database/\",\r\n    \"https://in.pinterest.com/go4database/\"\r\n  ]\r\n}\r\n</script>\r\n\r\n<script type=\"application/ld+json\">\r\n{\r\n  \"@context\": \"https://schema.org\",\r\n  \"@type\": \"FAQPage\",\r\n  \"mainEntity\": [{\r\n    \"@type\": \"Question\",\r\n    \"name\": \"Q1. How much does Hunter.io cost?\",\r\n    \"acceptedAnswer\": {\r\n      \"@type\": \"Answer\",\r\n      \"text\": \"Plans range from free to $299/month, with custom enterprise options.\"\r\n    }\r\n  },{\r\n    \"@type\": \"Question\",\r\n    \"name\": \"Q2. What is included in Hunter.io’s free plan?\",\r\n    \"acceptedAnswer\": {\r\n      \"@type\": \"Answer\",\r\n      \"text\": \"25 searches, 50 verifications, and basic campaign tools.\"\r\n    }\r\n  },{\r\n    \"@type\": \"Question\",\r\n    \"name\": \"Q3. Does Hunter.io charge extra for API access?\",\r\n    \"acceptedAnswer\": {\r\n      \"@type\": \"Answer\",\r\n      \"text\": \"No, the API is included with every plan.\"\r\n    }\r\n  },{\r\n    \"@type\": \"Question\",\r\n    \"name\": \"Q4. How does Go4Database pricing differ from Hunter.io?\",\r\n    \"acceptedAnswer\": {\r\n      \"@type\": \"Answer\",\r\n      \"text\": \"Go4Database offers one-time data purchases instead of monthly subscriptions.\"\r\n    }\r\n  }]\r\n}\r\n</script>\r\n<script type=\"application/ld+json\">\r\n{\r\n  \"@context\": \"https://schema.org/\", \r\n  \"@type\": \"BreadcrumbList\", \r\n  \"itemListElement\": [{\r\n    \"@type\": \"ListItem\", \r\n    \"position\": 1, \r\n    \"name\": \"Home\",\r\n    \"item\": \"https://www.go4database.com/\"  \r\n  },{\r\n    \"@type\": \"ListItem\", \r\n    \"position\": 2, \r\n    \"name\": \"Blog\",\r\n    \"item\": \"https://www.go4database.com/blog\"  \r\n  },{\r\n    \"@type\": \"ListItem\", \r\n    \"position\": 3, \r\n    \"name\": \"Hunter Pricing: Everything You Need to Know Before Buying\",\r\n    \"item\": \"https://www.go4database.com/blog/hunter-pricing\"  \r\n  }]\r\n}\r\n</script>\r\n\r\n<script type=\"application/ld+json\">\r\n         {         \r\n            \"@context\": \"https://schema.org/\",         \r\n            \"@type\": \"WebPage\",         \r\n            \"@id\": \"#WebPage\",         \r\n            \"url\": \"https://www.go4database.com/blog/hunter-pricing\",          \r\n            \"name\": \"Hunter Pricing: Everything You Need to Know Before Buying\"\r\n          } \r\n      </script>\r\n      \r\n<script type=\"application/ld+json\">\r\n{\r\n  \"@context\": \"https://schema.org\",\r\n  \"@type\": \"BlogPosting\",\r\n  \"mainEntityOfPage\": {\r\n    \"@type\": \"WebPage\",\r\n    \"@id\": \"https://www.go4database.com/blog/hunter-pricing\"\r\n  },\r\n  \"headline\": \"Hunter Pricing: Everything You Need to Know Before Buying\",\r\n  \"description\": \"If you’re trying to get your cold outreach right, you’ve probably heard of Hunter.io. It’s one of the go-to tools for finding and verifying business emails. But before you swipe your card, it’s smart to look at Hunter pricing in detail so you know exactly what you’re paying for, and don’t waste money on the wrong plan.\",\r\n  \"image\": \"https://www.go4database.com/assets/uploads/media-uploader/agricultre-industry-mailing-list-go4database-10-11760112343.webp\",  \r\n  \"author\": {\r\n    \"@type\": \"\",\r\n    \"name\": \"\"\r\n  },  \r\n  \"publisher\": {\r\n    \"@type\": \"Organization\",\r\n    \"name\": \"\",\r\n    \"logo\": {\r\n      \"@type\": \"ImageObject\",\r\n      \"url\": \"\"\r\n    }\r\n  },\r\n  \"datePublished\": \"2025-10-10\",\r\n  \"dateModified\": \"2026-03-24\"\r\n}\r\n</script>', '1', 'Hunter Pricing: Everything You Need to Know Before Buying', 'hunter-pricing', 'Ashwini Bochkeri', 10, 'publish', 'en_US', '2026-03-24', '3718', '2025-10-09 18:08:11', '2026-07-02 10:11:05', 0, NULL, '[{\"question\":\"How much does Hunter.io cost?\",\"answer\":\"Plans range from free to $299\\/month, with custom enterprise options.\"},{\"question\":\"What is included in Hunter.io\\u2019s free plan?\",\"answer\":\"25 searches, 50 verifications, and basic campaign tools.\"},{\"question\":\"Does Hunter.io charge extra for API access?\",\"answer\":\"No, the API is included with every plan.\"},{\"question\":\"How does Go4Database pricing differ from Hunter.io?\",\"answer\":\"Go4Database offers one-time data purchases instead of monthly subscriptions.\"}]');
