(118, 'Saleshandy Vs ZoomInfo: Breaking Down Features, Value & More', '<p><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">Let&rsquo;s keep it simple, cold outreach is tricky. You want your </span></span></span><a href=\"https://www.go4database.com/blog/business-mailing-list\" style=\"text-decoration:none\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#3498db\"><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\">emails lists</span></span></span></a><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\"> to land in inboxes, not spam folders, and you don&rsquo;t want to throw money at tools that don&rsquo;t work.&nbsp;</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">Saleshandy is getting a lot of attention, but with all those plans, which one actually gives you the best return?</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">In this blog, I&rsquo;ll explain exactly what each Saleshandy plan costs, what you get, and who it&rsquo;s meant for, so you can choose with confidence.</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<h2><span style=\"font-size:24pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#434343\">Table of content</span></span></span></h2>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"color:#4e5f70\"><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\">1. Why Give Saleshandy a Look?</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"color:#4e5f70\"><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\">2. Does Saleshandy Have a Free Trial?</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"color:#4e5f70\"><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\">3. Saleshandy Pricing Plans (What You&rsquo;re Really Paying For)</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"color:#4e5f70\"><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\">4. About Add-Ons</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"color:#4e5f70\"><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\">5. How to Pick the Right Plan</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"color:#4e5f70\"><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\">6. Which Plan Really Gives You Value?</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"color:#4e5f70\"><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\">7. What&rsquo;s Good and What&rsquo;s Annoying</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"color:#4e5f70\"><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\">8.&nbsp;Conclusion</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"color:#4e5f70\"><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\">9. FAQ&rsquo;s</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<h2><span style=\"font-size:24pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#434343\">Why Give Saleshandy a Look?</span></span></span></h2>\r\n\r\n<p><br />\r\n<span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">If you&rsquo;ve ever tried searching your ideal prospect, you know deliverability is the name of the game.&nbsp;</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">Saleshandy tackles that with features like automatic warm-up, sender rotation, reply tracking, and a single inbox to stay organized.</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">That&rsquo;s why a ton of sales teams,</span><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\"><strong> </strong></span></span></span><span style=\"color:#4e5f70\">recruiters</span><span style=\"color:#666666\">,and founders trust it. Over 10,000 people rely on Saleshandy, with a 4.6-star G2 rating backing it up. That&rsquo;s proof it works.</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">But what really matters is whether the Saleshandy pricing makes sense for you. So let&rsquo;s dig in.</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">&nbsp;</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<h2><span style=\"font-size:24pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#434343\">Does Saleshandy Have a Free Trial?</span></span></span></h2>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">Yep! they give you 7 days to test the platform without a credit card. You can send 100 emails and get five lead credits and five verification credits, which is more than enough to see if Saleshandy fits your workflow before you spend anything.</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<div id=\"BigCTA\" style=\"background:#e7fde7; border:1px solid #6fd943; padding:20px 50px\">\r\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://go4database.com/assets/uploads/media-uploader/go4database-logo1751528079.png\" style=\"height:51px; width:200px\" /></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><strong><span style=\"font-size:20pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\">Smart Pricing, smart Data</span></span></span></strong></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><br />\r\n<span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">Go4Database&#39;s prices scale up according to your needs and grow with you.</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><br />\r\n<span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><a href=\"https://app.go4database.com/login?utm_source=blogpage&amp;utm_medium=internal&amp;utm_campaign=app_login\" id=\"TrailBtn\" target=\"_blank\">Create My Strategy</a></span></span><br />\r\n&nbsp;</p>\r\n</div>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">&nbsp;</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<h2><span style=\"font-size:24pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#434343\">Saleshandy Pricing Plans (What You&rsquo;re Really Paying For)</span></span></span></h2>\r\n\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<div id=\"blogTLDR\">\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\"><strong>TL;DR</strong></span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">Plans with features for solo founders and large agencies range from about $36 to $299 per month with Saleshandy. Reaching cleaner, verified contacts with Saleshandy and Go4Database improves return on investment for all plans.</span></span></span></p>\r\n</div>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">&nbsp;</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">Here&rsquo;s a clear look at what&rsquo;s on the table:</span></span></span><br />\r\n&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<h3><span style=\"font-size:20pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#434343\">Outreach Starter</span></span></span></h3>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li style=\"list-style-type:disc\"><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">$36 a month ($25 if you pay yearly)</span></span></span></li>\r\n	<li style=\"list-style-type:disc\"><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">Unlimited warm-up</span></span></span></li>\r\n	<li style=\"list-style-type:disc\"><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">Sender rotation for 10 accounts</span></span></span></li>\r\n	<li style=\"list-style-type:disc\"><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">2,000 active prospects</span></span></span></li>\r\n	<li style=\"list-style-type:disc\"><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">6,000 emails each month</span></span></span></li>\r\n	<li style=\"list-style-type:disc\"><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">Single unified inbox</span></span></span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\"><strong>Who should grab it?</strong></span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\"> Solo founders, freelancers, or side hustlers testing cold outreach without tons of bells and whistles.</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<h3><span style=\"font-size:20pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#434343\">Outreach Pro</span></span></span></h3>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li style=\"list-style-type:disc\"><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\"><strong>$99 a month</strong></span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\"> ($69 if paid annually)</