(119, 'Apollo Pricing 2026: Is it Worth It?', '<p><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">If you&rsquo;re hunting for a way to find leads, clean up your data, and run your outreach without juggling ten different tools, Apollo.io probably caught your eye.&nbsp;</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">It&rsquo;s popular for good reason, but before you spend a time, you really want to know if </span></span></span><a href=\"https://go4database.com/blog/apollo-vs.-zoominfo\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#1155cc\"><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\">apollo pricing</span></span></span></a><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\"> makes sense for you in 2026.&nbsp;</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">I&rsquo;ve broken it down what you&rsquo;re actually paying for, what you get, and who it works best for.</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">&nbsp;</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<h2><span style=\"font-size:24pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#434343\">How does Apollo.io&rsquo;s pricing work?</span></span></span></h2>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">Apollo gives you a giant B2B contact database adds enrichment on top of that, and wraps it all up with outreach tools like email lists and analytics.&nbsp;</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">Think of it like one big toolbox for sales teams, recruiters, or agencies.</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">They split their pricing into levels, depending on how many credits you need each month and what features make sense for you.&nbsp;</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">There&rsquo;s a free plan to get started, and then paid plans that grow with you as you need more data or features.&nbsp;</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">It&rsquo;s a smart way to match your team&rsquo;s size and budget without paying for things you&rsquo;ll never touch.</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">That setup makes Apollo a smart fit for B2B sales teams, recruiters, agencies, and marketers who want fewer tools and less hassle.</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<blockquote>\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\"><strong>Read more: </strong></span></span></span><a href=\"https://go4database.com/blog/go4database-vs-zoominfo\" style=\"text-decoration:none\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#1155cc\">Go4Database vs ZoomInfo: Which Tool Offers Best ROI?&nbsp;</span></span></span></a></p>\r\n</blockquote>\r\n\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<h2><span style=\"font-size:24pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#434343\">Apollo Free Trial: What&rsquo;s Included?</span></span></span></h2>\r\n\r\n<p><br />\r\n<span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">If you just want to try it out, Apollo&#39;s free plan is actually quite good. You will receive:</span></span></span><br />\r\n&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li style=\"list-style-type:disc\"><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">$0 per month</span></span></span></li>\r\n	<li style=\"list-style-type:disc\"><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">Part of credits for testing</span></span></span></li>\r\n	<li style=\"list-style-type:disc\"><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">Primary enrichment</span></span></span></li>\r\n	<li style=\"list-style-type:disc\"><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">Standard filters for creating lead lists&nbsp;</span></span></span></li>\r\n	<li style=\"list-style-type:disc\"><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">A few basic email lists</span></span></span><br />\r\n	&nbsp;</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">It&#39;s a good way to experience the features, see how the platform functions, and even conduct a small outreach test.</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">However, you will quickly run out of free credits if volume is important to you.</span></span></span><br />\r\n&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<div id=\"BigCTA\" style=\"background:#e7fde7; border:1px solid #6fd943; padding:20px 50px\">\r\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">&nbsp;<br />\r\n<img alt=\"\" src=\"https://go4database.com/assets/uploads/media-uploader/go4database-logo1751528079.png\" style=\"height:51px; width:200px\" /></span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:20pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><strong>Why Commit To Monthly Fees?</strong></span></span></span><br />\r\n&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">You can purchase data on your own terms with Go4Database.</span></span></span><br />\r\n&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://app.go4database.com/login?utm_source=productpage&amp;utm_medium=internal&amp;utm_campaign=login_tracking\" id=\"TrailBtn\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\">Discover the plans now!</span></span></a><br />\r\n&nbsp;</p>\r\n</div>\r\n\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<h2><span style=\"font-size:24pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#434343\">Apollo Pricing Plans Explained</span></span></span></h2>\r\n\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<div id=\"blogTLDR\">\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\"><strong>TL;DR</strong></span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">Apollo provides a range of plans with varying credits and features, including free, Basic ($49), Professional ($99), Advanced ($149), and customized Enterprise. Go4Database&#39;s straightforward, no-subscription pay-per-credit pricing may be more appropriate for you if you only occasionally need leads.</span></span></span></p>\r\n</div>\r\n\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">When you&#39;re prepared to go beyond free, here&#39;s how Apollo&#39;s 2026 plans compare:</span></span></span><br />\r\n&nbsp;