ations improve results by segmenting contact lists, customizing subject lines, and using the go4database application to search for verified prospects.\"},{\"question\":\"How does list hygiene impact lead generation success?\",\"answer\":\"Using the go4database application to access clean B2B lists ensures high inbox placement, prevents spam filter flags, and accelerates your sales pipeline.\"}]');
