(2, 'Privacy Policy', 'privacy-policy', 'Privacy Policy Title', 'Privacy Description Test', '<script type=\"application/ld+json\">\r\n{\r\n  \"@context\": \"https://schema.org\",\r\n  \"@type\": \"Organization\",\r\n  \"name\": \"Privacy Policy Change\",\r\n  \"url\": \"https://go4database.com/\",\r\n  \"logo\": \"https://go4database.com/assets/uploads/media-uploader/go4database-logo1751467973.png\",\r\n  \"contactPoint\": {\r\n    \"@type\": \"ContactPoint\",\r\n    \"telephone\": \"+17867852141\",\r\n    \"contactType\": \"customer service\",\r\n    \"areaServed\": \"US\",\r\n    \"availableLanguage\": \"en\"\r\n  },\r\n  \"sameAs\": \"https://www.facebook.com/Go4Database/\"\r\n}\r\n</script>', '<h2>&nbsp;</h2>\r\n\r\n<h4 style=\"text-align:justify\">&nbsp;</h4>\r\n\r\n<h4>&nbsp;</h4>\r\n\r\n<h4>&nbsp;</h4>\r\n\r\n<h1 style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>Privacy Policy</strong></h1>\r\n\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"text-align:justify\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<h4><strong>1. Introduction to Go4Database&rsquo;s Services</strong></h4>\r\n\r\n<p>At Go4Database, protecting your privacy is a priority, and this privacy policy reflects our commitment to delivering trustworthy and high-quality services. We encourage all customers, website visitors, and clients to read this Privacy Policy carefully before using any resources on our website. Terms like &ldquo;we,&rdquo; &ldquo;us,&rdquo; and &ldquo;our&rdquo; used in this document refer to Go4Database. Please note, this policy may be updated periodically, and we recommend checking it from time to time to stay informed.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Our Privacy Policy explains how we handle your data responsibly. However, it does not constitute an endorsement or guarantee for any services. For more details about what we offer, visit our website: <a href=\"https://www.go4database.com/\" target=\"_new\">https://www.go4database.com</a>.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<h4>&nbsp;</h4>\r\n\r\n<p>The information we gather comes from multiple sources, including our affiliates, networks, online partners, and clients directly</p>\r\n\r\n<div>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<h4>&nbsp;</h4>\r\n\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<h4 style=\"text-align:justify\"><strong>2.&nbsp; The Types of Data We Handle</strong></h4>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"text-align:justify\">Go4Database collects data from various sources, such as applications, business directories, and public records, including census archives. This data includes both personal and non-personal information.</p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"text-align:justify\">This includes details like your name, postal address, phone number, and email address. We use this information to:</p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"text-align:justify\">1. Manage your account and deliver services.</p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"text-align:justify\">2. Communicate via emails about updates or inquiries.</p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"text-align:justify\">3. Provide tailored solutions based on your preferences and usage of our services.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"text-align:justify\"><strong>Personal Information:</strong></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"text-align:justify\">Personal Information may be collected through our website, newsletter signups, events, and requests for information or downloads.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"text-align:justify\"><strong>Non-Personal Information:</strong></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"text-align:justify\">We also collect non-personal information when users visit our website, even if they do not submit personal details. This includes:</p>\r\n\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"text-align:justify\">1. The operating system and browser type used to access our site.</p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"text-align:justify\">2. IP addresses (to identify devices and user locations).</p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"text-align:justify\">3. Referral URLs, clickstream data, and pages accessed by the user.</p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"text-align:justify\">4. Duration of time spent viewing items of interest on our website.</p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"text-align:justify\">5. Cookies that help track user activity and preferences on our site.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"text-align:justify\">By accepting cookies, we can deliver targeted content and improve user experience. This data may also be combined with personal information to serve you better.</p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"text-align:justify\">We respect your right to privacy, and you can opt out of receiving marketing emails or campaigns anytime.</p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"text-align:justify\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"text-align:justify\"><strong>Note:</strong> Unsubscribing may limit your access to some service benefits. However, certain personal information may still be retained to comply with legal obligations, resolve disputes, or troubleshoot issues.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<h4 style=\"text-align:justify\"><strong>3. Collaborating with Third Parties</strong></h4>\r\n\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"text-align:justify\">Go4Database may share your data, including personal information, with trusted third-party partners and service providers to better serve your needs. Here&rsquo;s how we manage information sharing:</p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"text-align:justify\"><strong>A. Business Partners:</strong> We work with partners to assist with campaigns, performance evaluations, and operational improvements.</p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"text-align:justify\"><strong>B. Marketing Support:</strong> Personal information may be shared with our partners who use their platforms and channels to assist marketers.</p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"text-align:justify\"><strong>C. Legal Compliance:</strong> We may disclose information to law enforcement agencies when required by law.</p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"text-align:justify\"><strong>D. Protection of Rights: </strong>If necessary, we may share data to protect Go4Database&rsquo;s assets or respond to legal obligations.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"text-align:justify\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"text-align:justify\">We also use your information for marketing purposes, including newsletters, promotions, and event notifications. All marketing communications include an unsubscribe option in the email footer.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<h4 style=\"text-align:justify\"><strong>4. Cookies Policy</strong></h4>\r\n\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"text-align:justify\">Cookies are small text files stored on your device to improve your browsing experience. They allow us to:</p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"text-align:justify\"><strong>A. Save your login information for easy access.</strong></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"text-align:justify\"><strong>B. Offer a personalized browsing experience tailored to your preferences.</strong></p>\r\n\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"text-align:justify\">You can configure your browser to accept or reject cookies. However, rejecting cookies may prevent you from fully experiencing the benefits of our website.</p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"text-align:justify\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"text-align:justify\">Go4Database also works with third-party partners who may use their own cookies. We encourage you to review their cookie policies, as they are not covered under this Privacy Policy.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<h4 style=\"text-align:justify\"><strong>5. Your Choices and Opt-Out Rights</strong></h4>\r\n\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"text-align:justify\">We make it easy for you to opt out of marketing communications:</p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"text-align:justify\">Click the unsubscribe link provided at the bottom of every email.</p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"text-align:justify\">Alternatively, email us at newsletter@go4database.com with your first name, last name, and current address.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"text-align:justify\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"text-align:justify\">This helps us promptly terminate services and stop further emails or campaigns.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<h4 style=\"text-align:justify\"><strong>6. Data Security</strong></h4>\r\n\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"text-align:justify\">Protecting your data is our priority. We implement strict security measures, including:</p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"text-align:justify\">A. Routine database checks by our security team.</p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"text-align:justify\">B. Firewalls to prevent unauthorized access or data breaches.</p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"text-align:justify\">C. Limiting access to your data to authorized personnel only.</p>\r\n\r\n<div style=\"text-align:justify\">\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<h4><strong>7. Compliance with Data Protection Laws</strong></h4>\r\n\r\n<p>Go4Database adheres to the General Data Protection Regulation (GDPR), California Consumer Privacy Act (CCPA), and other applicable data protection laws.</p>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>A. GDPR:</strong> Protects the personal data of EU citizens and residents, even when services are provided by companies outside the EU.</p>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>B. CCPA:</strong> Grants California consumers control over their personal information.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p>If you want your information removed from our database, please fill out the removal request form on our website.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<h4><strong>8. Disclaimer</strong></h4>\r\n\r\n<p>By agreeing to this Privacy Policy, you acknowledge that Go4Database is not responsible for the content or privacy practices of external websites you may visit via links on our site.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<h4><strong>9. Questions and Concerns</strong></h4>\r\n\r\n<p>If you have questions about our services or privacy practices, please contact us at:</p>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>Privacy Officer</strong></p>\r\n\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p>TJMGLOBAL DIGITECH PVT LTD.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p>PO Box 1706 S WALTON BLVD</p>\r\n\r\n<p>BENTONVILLE, AR 72712-2500</p>\r\n\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n</div>\r\n\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"text-align:justify\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"text-align:justify\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"text-align:justify\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n</div>\r\n\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>', 'en_US', 'publish', '2020-07-25 04:01:55', '2025-07-19 19:00:11', 'all', NULL, NULL),
(5, 'Database Affiliate', 'database-affiliate', 'Database Affiliate Program | Go4Database', 'Join the Go4Database Affiliate Program and earn commissions by promoting AI-powered lead generation and verified business contact solutions.', NULL, '<h2><span style=\"font-size:24pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#434343\">Earn More by Partnering with Go4Database</span></span></span></h2>\r\n\r\n<p><br />\r\n<span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">Turn your audience into a recurring revenue stream by joining the Go4Database Affiliate Program. Whether you are a blogger, digital marketer, agency, influencer, SaaS provider, consultant, or business community owner, our affiliate program allows you to earn attractive commissions by referring customers to one of the fastest-growing AI lead generation platforms.</span></span></span><br />\r\n<br />\r\n<span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><a href=\"https://www.go4database.com/\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#3498db\">Go4Database</span></a><span style=\"color:#666666\"> helps businesses discover verified B2B and B2C contacts, generate quality leads, and grow their sales pipeline. Every successful referral you make has the potential to become a long-term source of income while helping businesses find the right audience faster.</span></span></span><br />\r\n&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<h2><span style=\"font-size:24pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#434343\">Why Become a Go4Database Affiliate?</span></span></span></h2>\r\n\r\n<p><br />\r\n<span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">The demand for verified business contacts and AI-powered lead generation continues to grow. By becoming a Go4Database affiliate, you can recommend a trusted platform that offers verified global business contacts, industry-specific databases, AI-powered prospecting, and affordable lead generation solutions for businesses of every size.</span></span></span><br />\r\n&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">Our platform has been serving startups, freelancers, marketing agencies, sales teams, and enterprises for over a decade, making it easier for affiliates to promote a service that delivers real business value.</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<h2><span style=\"font-size:24pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#434343\"><strong>Who Can Join?</strong></span></span></span></h2>\r\n\r\n<p><br />\r\n<span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">The Go4Database Affiliate Program is designed for anyone with an audience interested in business growth, sales, marketing, or entrepreneurship. Marketing agencies, SEO professionals, bloggers, YouTubers, business consultants, CRM partners, software resellers, startup communities, educational platforms, and freelance marketers can all benefit from promoting Go4Database.</span></span></span><br />\r\n<br />\r\n<span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">No technical expertise is required. If you can recommend products and generate referrals, you can become a successful affiliate.</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<h2><span style=\"font-size:24pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#434343\"><strong>How the Affiliate Program Works</strong></span></span></span></h2>\r\n\r\n<p><br />\r\n<span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">Getting started is simple. Register as a Go4Database affiliate and receive your unique referral link. Share the link through your website, blog, email newsletters, social media channels, online communities, or digital campaigns. When visitors click your referral link and purchase eligible Go4Database products or subscriptions, you earn commissions based on successful conversions.</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><br />\r\n<span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">Our affiliate dashboard allows you to monitor clicks, referrals, conversions, and commission earnings, helping you track your performance with complete transparency.</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<h2><span style=\"font-size:24pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#434343\"><strong>Why Your Audience Will Choose Go4Database</strong></span></span></span></h2>\r\n\r\n<p><br />\r\n<span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">Businesses trust Go4Database because it provides AI-verified business contacts that help improve prospecting and reduce the time spent searching for leads. Users can access millions of </span><a href=\"https://www.go4database.com/b2b/global-email-list\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#3498db\">global</span></a><span style=\"color:#666666\"> business contacts across thousands of industries while benefiting from advanced search filters, verified email addresses, business phone numbers, and industry-specific targeting. The platform is built to help businesses connect with decision-makers quickly, improve outreach campaigns, and generate better sales opportunities.</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<h2><span style=\"font-size:24pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#434343\"><strong>Benefits of Joining</strong></span></span></span></h2>\r\n\r\n<p><br />\r\n<span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">As a Go4Database affiliate, you gain access to competitive commission opportunities, marketing resources, dedicated affiliate support, reliable tracking, and a trusted product that businesses actively need. Since lead generation is an ongoing requirement for companies worldwide, affiliates have the opportunity to generate recurring revenue by promoting services with long-term demand.</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<h2><span style=\"font-size:24pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#434343\"><strong>Who Should Promote Go4Database?</strong></span></span></span></h2>\r\n\r\n<p><br />\r\n<span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">Our affiliate program is an excellent fit for professionals and organizations that serve business owners and sales teams. If your audience includes entrepreneurs, startup founders, B2B marketers, recruiters, SaaS users, digital agencies, business coaches, or sales professionals, Go4Database provides a relevant solution that can add value while creating an additional income opportunity for you.</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<h2><span style=\"font-size:24pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#434343\"><strong>Dedicated Affiliate Support</strong></span></span></span></h2>\r\n\r\n<p><br />\r\n<span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">We believe successful affiliates deserve reliable support. Our team is available to help you understand our products, optimize your promotional efforts, and answer any questions regarding referrals or commissions. We regularly update our platform and marketing materials to ensure you have everything needed to maximize your earning potential.</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<h2><span style=\"font-size:24pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#434343\"><strong>Start Earning Today</strong></span></span></span></h2>\r\n\r\n<p><br />\r\n<span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">Partner with Go4Database and monetize your audience by promoting a trusted AI-powered lead generation platform. Join our growing affiliate network today and start earning commissions while helping businesses discover verified business contacts, generate qualified leads, and accelerate their growth.</span></span></span></p>', 'en_US', 'publish', '2022-07-26 13:23:46', '2026-06-26 14:43:03', 'all', NULL, NULL),
(6, 'Terms of Services', 'terms-of-services', 'Go4Database Terms of Services', 'Terms of Services of Go4Database user', NULL, '<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<h1 style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>Terms Of Services</strong></h1>\r\n\r\n<h4 style=\"text-align:justify\">&nbsp;</h4>\r\n\r\n<h4 style=\"text-align:justify\"><strong>Welcome to Go4Database!</strong></h4>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"text-align:justify\">Thank you for choosing Go4Database. These Terms of Service (&quot;Terms&quot;) explain the rules and guidelines for using our mobile apps, websites, services, and software (collectively referred to as &quot;Go4Database&quot; or the &quot;Service&quot;). The Service is provided by TJMGLOBAL DIGITECH PVT LTD. (&quot;we,&quot; &quot;our,&quot; or the &quot;Company&quot;). These Terms apply to everyone who visits, uses, or accesses Go4Database (&quot;users&quot;).</p>\r\n\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"text-align:justify\">Please take the time to read these Terms carefully before using our services. By accessing or using Go4Database, you agree to these Terms and accept our practices regarding the collection and use of your data, as outlined in our Privacy Policy.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"text-align:justify\">If you&#39;re using Go4Database on behalf of an organization, such as a company or group, you&rsquo;re agreeing to these Terms on their behalf and confirm you have the authority to do so. In this case, &quot;you&quot; and &quot;your&quot; refer to the organization as well.</p>\r\n\r\n<h5 style=\"text-align:justify\"><strong>Using Go4Database</strong></h5>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"text-align:justify\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"text-align:justify\">Go4Database is designed to help you manage your email accounts and calendars conveniently on your device. It supports popular email services such as Gmail, Yahoo, AOL, iCloud, Outlook.com, Office365, and Exchange.</p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"text-align:justify\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<h5 style=\"text-align:justify\"><strong>To use Go4Database:</strong></h5>\r\n\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"text-align:justify\">A. Provide accurate information when signing up.</p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"text-align:justify\">B. You are responsible for keeping your account secure, including safeguarding your password.</p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"text-align:justify\">C. Do not attempt to access another user&rsquo;s account without their permission.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"text-align:justify\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"text-align:justify\">We trust you to use Go4Database responsibly. This means avoiding actions that could harm the platform, other users, or our services. Specifically, you must not:</p>\r\n\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"text-align:justify\">1. Copy, share, or distribute any part of Go4Database without permission.</p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"text-align:justify\">2. Try to hack or disrupt our systems or networks.</p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"text-align:justify\">3. Spread viruses, spam, or malware through the platform.</p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"text-align:justify\">4. Impersonate others or mislead others about your identity.</p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"text-align:justify\">5. Use the Service for illegal activities or anything that violates others&#39; privacy or rights.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"text-align:justify\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif; font-size:11.0pt\">If you violate these rules, we reserve the right to suspend or terminate your access to Go4Database, with or without notice.</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"text-align:justify\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<h5 style=\"text-align:justify\"><strong>Who Can Use Go4Database</strong></h5>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"text-align:justify\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"text-align:justify\">Go4Database is intended for users who can legally form a binding agreement. If you are under the age of consent in your country, you may only use our services with permission from your parent or guardian. However, Go4Database is not available to users under the age of 13.</p>\r\n\r\n<h5 style=\"text-align:justify\"><strong>Your Data and Privacy</strong></h5>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"text-align:justify\">Go4Database requires access to your email account to provide its services, such as organizing and delivering your emails. By using our platform, you grant us permission to process and manage your email data to ensure the service works smoothly.</p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"text-align:justify\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"text-align:justify\">Your privacy is important to us. Any data we collect is managed in compliance with our Privacy Policy, which details how we collect, use, and protect your information. For users governed by the GDPR or CCPA, we act as a &quot;processor&quot; or &quot;service provider&quot; and ensure compliance with applicable data protection laws.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<h5 style=\"text-align:justify\"><strong>Ownership and Intellectual Property</strong></h5>\r\n\r\n<h5 style=\"text-align:justify\">&nbsp;</h5>\r\n\r\n<p>All elements of Go4Database&mdash;its software, design, logos, trademarks, and other features&mdash;belong to TJMGLOBAL DIGITECH PVT LTD. By using the platform, you&rsquo;re granted a limited, non-exclusive license to use it for personal, non-commercial purposes.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>You cannot:</p>\r\n\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p>A. Modify, sell, or distribute our software.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>B. Use our trademarks, logos, or brand features without written permission.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>If you have suggestions or ideas to improve Go4Database, we&rsquo;re happy to hear them! However, submitting ideas means you allow us to use them freely without expectation of payment or recognition.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<h5 style=\"text-align:justify\"><strong>Subscription and Premium Features</strong></h5>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"text-align:justify\">Go4Database offers free basic services, but you may choose to access Premium Features through subscriptions. These features may include enhanced functionality or additional tools to improve your experience.</p>\r\n\r\n<h5 style=\"text-align:justify\">&nbsp;</h5>\r\n\r\n<h5 style=\"text-align:justify\"><strong>Refund &amp; Cancellation</strong></h5>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"text-align:justify\">Subscriptions are available on a monthly or annual basis and renew automatically unless canceled before the renewal period. Payments are processed securely via platforms like the App Store, Google Play, or Stripe. Note that cancellations will take effect after the current billing period, and no refunds are provided for unused subscription time.</p>\r\n\r\n<h5 style=\"text-align:justify\"><strong>Modifications to the Service</strong></h5>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"text-align:justify\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"text-align:justify\">We&rsquo;re constantly working to improve Go4Database by adding new features or retiring outdated ones. While we strive to notify you of significant changes, we reserve the right to modify or discontinue the service at any time without prior notice.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<h4 style=\"text-align:justify\"><strong>Legal Considerations</strong></h4>\r\n\r\n<h5 style=\"text-align:justify\"><strong>Indemnity</strong></h5>\r\n\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"text-align:justify\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"text-align:justify\">You agree to protect TJMGLOBAL DIGITECH PVT LTD. against claims, damages, or expenses resulting from your misuse of Go4Database, violation of these Terms, or infringement on others&#39; rights.</p>\r\n\r\n<h5 style=\"text-align:justify\"><strong>No Warranty</strong></h5>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"text-align:justify\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"text-align:justify\">Go4Database is provided &quot;as-is&quot; without guarantees of reliability or accuracy. Use it at your own risk, and we cannot promise uninterrupted service or freedom from errors.</p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"text-align:justify\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<h5 style=\"text-align:justify\"><strong>Limitation of Liability</strong></h5>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"text-align:justify\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"text-align:justify\">TJMGLOBAL DIGITECH PVT LTD. is not liable for indirect or incidental damages arising from your use of the service.</p>\r\n\r\n<h5 style=\"text-align:justify\"><strong>Final Notes</strong></h5>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"text-align:justify\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"text-align:justify\">These Terms are governed by the laws of New York, NY, USA. Any disputes will be resolved through arbitration, as outlined have above. If you any questions, please contact us at info@go4database.com.</p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"text-align:justify\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>', 'en_US', 'publish', '2024-12-17 00:47:09', '2026-01-21 20:49:00', 'all', NULL, NULL),
(7, 'GDPR - CCPA', 'gdpr-ccpa', NULL, NULL, NULL, '<h1 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"line-height: 107%;\"><b>&nbsp;GDPR &amp; CCPA</b></span><span style=\"color: inherit; font-size: 1rem; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\"><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></span></h1><h5 style=\"\"><span style=\"text-align: left;\"><b><br></b></span></h5><h5 style=\"\"><span style=\"text-align: left;\"><b>Our Commitment to You</b></span></h5><h4 style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"line-height: 107%;\">\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-top: 0in; margin-right: 0in; margin-bottom: 11.25pt; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\">We’re committed to partnering with our Customers and Users to be\r\nfully transparent in our approach to the General Data Protection Regulation\r\n(GDPR) and the California Consumer Privacy Act (<a href=\"https://oag.ca.gov/privacy/ccpa\" target=\"_blank\" style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 255);\">CCPA</a>). The GDPR is a very\r\ncomprehensive EU data privacy law which when into effect on May 25, 2018 and\r\nthe CCPA is a comprehensive privacy law passed in California (USA), that went\r\ninto effect on January 1st, 2020.</p><p style=\"margin-top: 0in; margin-right: 0in; margin-bottom: 11.25pt; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\">Besides strengthening and standardizing user data privacy across\r\nthe EU and US, it required new and additional obligations on all organizations\r\nthat handle EU and Californian citizens’ personal data, regardless of where the\r\norganizations themselves are located.</p></span></h4><h5 style=\"text-align: justify; margin-top: 0in; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\"><b>Protection of Your Data</b></h5><h4 style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"line-height: 107%;\"><p style=\"margin-top: 0in; margin-right: 0in; margin-bottom: 11.25pt; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\">We’re constantly striving to provide a seamless, integrated\r\nexperience to help you and your team work smarter and faster. To that end, we\r\nwant to give you an overview of our updated privacy policy. It’s more\r\nuser-friendly and addresses the new data regulations.<o:p></o:p></p><p style=\"margin-top: 0in; margin-right: 0in; margin-bottom: 11.25pt; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\">The primary goal of GDPR &amp; CCPA is to grant EU and\r\nCalifornia based users (respectively) full transparency and control over the\r\ndata which they share and how it is used, therein preventing any risk of misuse\r\nwhen consent isn’t explicitly granted. Even though the regulations only\r\nimpacted Europeans and Californians, we believe data security is still\r\nimportant wherever you happen to call home.<o:p></o:p></p><p style=\"margin-top: 0in; margin-right: 0in; margin-bottom: 11.25pt; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\">Aligned with this same goal and requirement, we introduced a few\r\nchanges on how the data of our users is handled, inclusive of collection,\r\nprocessing, control and access. Our Privacy Policy was updated to account for\r\nboth GDPR and CCPA provisions. We will also make the policies more transparent\r\nby providing specific details on our data processing activities.<o:p></o:p></p><p style=\"margin-top: 0in; margin-right: 0in; margin-bottom: 11.25pt; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\">\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n</p><p style=\"margin-top: 0in; margin-right: 0in; margin-bottom: 11.25pt; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\">This privacy policy went into effect on May <span style=\"background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\">25, 2018</span>. For questions\r\nplease reach out to us using the contact information provided in the <a href=\"https://www.go4database.com/privacy-policy\" target=\"_blank\" style=\"\">privacy policy</a>.<font color=\"#3c3c3c\" face=\"Arial, sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-size: 15pt;\"><o:p></o:p></span></font></p></span></h4><h5 style=\"text-align: justify; margin-top: 0in; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\"><b>Data Management Tools</b></h5><h4 style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"line-height: 107%;\"><p style=\"margin-top: 0in; margin-right: 0in; margin-bottom: 11.25pt; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\">User have requested tools to help them comply with the GDPR and\r\nCCPA, and we’re happy to say that we’ve built a dedicated tool.<o:p></o:p></p><p style=\"margin-top: 0in; margin-right: 0in; margin-bottom: 11.25pt; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\">\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n</p><p style=\"margin-top: 0in; margin-right: 0in; margin-bottom: 11.25pt; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\">Write an email to info@go4database to delete personal\r\ninformation, such as names and email addresses, from Go4Database.</p></span></h4><h5 style=\"text-align: justify; margin-top: 0in; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\"><b>Stay Updated</b></h5><h4 style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"line-height: 107%;\"><p style=\"margin-top: 0in; margin-right: 0in; margin-bottom: 0.0001pt; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\">Fulfilling our privacy and data\r\nsecurity commitments is important to us. To learn more about GDPR, visit the<span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 255);\">&nbsp;<a href=\"https://commission.europa.eu/law/law-topic/data-protection_en\" target=\"_blank\">official GDPR website of the EU.</a></span><o:p></o:p></p><p style=\"margin-top: 0in; margin-right: 0in; margin-bottom: 11.25pt; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\">\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n</p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0.0001pt; line-height: normal;\"><o:p style=\"\">&nbsp;</o:p></p><p style=\"margin-top: 0in; margin-right: 0in; margin-bottom: 11.25pt; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\"><font color=\"#3c3c3c\" face=\"Arial, sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-size: 15pt;\"><o:p><br></o:p></span></font></p></span></h4>', 'en_US', 'publish', '2024-12-17 00:47:53', '2024-12-20 06:04:44', 'all', NULL, NULL),
(9, 'ISO & SO2', 'iso', 'ISO & SOC 2 Compliance | Go4Database Security', 'Learn how Go4Database protects customer data with ISO and SOC 2 compliance, ensuring enterprise-grade security, privacy, and trusted data management.', NULL, '<p><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">At Go4Database, data security, privacy, and customer trust are at the core of everything we do. As a global B2B data intelligence and </span><a href=\"https://www.go4database.com/blog/lead-generation-guide\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#3498db\">lead generation</span></a><span style=\"color:#666666\"> platform, we are committed to maintaining the highest standards of information security and operational excellence. </span></span></span><br />\r\n<br />\r\n<span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">Our compliance with internationally recognized security frameworks demonstrates our dedication to protecting customer information, ensuring data integrity, and providing a secure environment for businesses worldwide.</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">Our ISO certification reflects our commitment to implementing a robust Information Security Management System (ISMS) that safeguards sensitive business information against potential risks. Through well-defined security policies, continuous risk assessments, employee awareness programs, and ongoing process improvements, we maintain a secure infrastructure that supports the confidentiality, integrity, and availability of customer data. </span></span></span><br />\r\n<br />\r\n<span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">These practices help organizations confidently use our platform while meeting their own compliance and governance requirements.</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><br />\r\n<span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">In addition to ISO standards, </span><a href=\"https://www.go4database.com/\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#3498db\">Go4Database</span></a><span style=\"color:#666666\"> aligns its security practices with SOC 2 principles, reinforcing our commitment to secure data processing, system availability, and operational transparency. We continuously monitor our systems, implement strict access controls, and follow industry best practices to ensure customer information remains protected throughout its lifecycle. </span></span></span><br />\r\n<br />\r\n<span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">This proactive approach helps minimize security risks while maintaining consistent service reliability.</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">Security is not a one-time achievement but an ongoing commitment. Our teams regularly review internal controls, strengthen security measures, and adopt evolving industry standards to stay ahead of emerging cyber threats. </span></span></span><br />\r\n<br />\r\n<span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">By continuously enhancing our compliance framework, we provide customers with a trusted platform for accessing verified business data and building successful sales and marketing campaigns.</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">Organizations worldwide rely on Go4Database because they know their data is handled with professionalism, responsibility, and transparency. </span></span></span><br />\r\n<br />\r\n<span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">Our commitment to ISO and SOC 2 compliance reflects our long-term investment in security, privacy, and regulatory best practices, allowing our customers to focus on business growth with confidence.</span></span></span></p>', 'en_US', 'publish', '2024-12-17 00:50:47', '2026-06-26 14:45:37', 'all', NULL, NULL);
INSERT INTO `pages` (`id`, `title`, `slug`, `meta_tags`, `meta_description`, `schema_code`, `content`, `lang`, `status`, `created_at`, `updated_at`, `visibility`, `page_builder_status`, `breadcrumb_status`) VALUES
(10, 'Reseller', 'reseller', 'Reseller Program | Grow Your Business With Our Solutions', 'Join the Go4Database Reseller Program and grow your business with verified B2B data, competitive pricing, dedicated support, and recurring revenue', '<script type=\"application/ld+json\">\r\n{\r\n  \"@context\": \"https://schema.org\",\r\n  \"@type\": \"Organization\",\r\n  \"name\": \"Reseller\",\r\n  \"url\": \"https://go4database.com/\",\r\n  \"logo\": \"https://go4database.com/assets/uploads/media-uploader/go4database-logo1751467973.png\",\r\n  \"contactPoint\": {\r\n    \"@type\": \"ContactPoint\",\r\n    \"telephone\": \"+17867852141\",\r\n    \"contactType\": \"customer service\",\r\n    \"areaServed\": \"US\",\r\n    \"availableLanguage\": \"en\"\r\n  },\r\n  \"sameAs\": \"https://www.facebook.com/Go4Database/\"\r\n}\r\n</script>', '<h2><span style=\"font-size:24pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#434343\">Grow Your Business as a Go4Database Reseller</span></span></span></h2>\r\n\r\n<p><br />\r\n<span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">Expand your product portfolio and unlock new revenue opportunities by becoming a Go4Database Reseller. Our reseller program is designed for businesses that want to offer trusted B2B data, AI-powered lead generation, and verified contact solutions to their own customers under a reliable partnership model.</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><br />\r\n<span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">Whether you are a technology company, digital marketing agency, sales consultancy, CRM provider, software reseller, or business solutions partner, </span><a href=\"https://www.go4database.com/\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#3498db\">Go4Database</span></a><span style=\"color:#666666\"> provides the tools and support you need to deliver high-quality lead generation services while growing your own business.</span></span></span><br />\r\n&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<h2><span style=\"font-size:24pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#434343\">Why Partner with Go4Database?</span></span></span></h2>\r\n\r\n<p><br />\r\n<span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">Businesses across industries rely on accurate business data to identify prospects, build sales pipelines, and increase revenue. As a Go4Database reseller, you can provide your customers with access to verified business contacts, targeted databases, and AI-driven lead generation solutions without investing in building or maintaining your own data infrastructure.</span></span></span><br />\r\n&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">Our reseller program enables you to expand your service offerings, strengthen customer relationships, and create recurring revenue while relying on Go4Database&#39;s proven expertise in business data solutions.</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<h2><span style=\"font-size:24pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#434343\">Who Can Become a Reseller?</span></span></span></h2>\r\n\r\n<p><br />\r\n<span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">The Go4Database Reseller Program is ideal for organizations that help businesses grow through sales, marketing, or technology solutions. Marketing agencies, software companies, CRM consultants, IT service providers, business consultants, lead generation firms, system integrators, startup advisors, and channel partners can all benefit from becoming an authorized reseller.</span></span></span><br />\r\n&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">Whether you serve small businesses, mid-sized organizations, or enterprise clients, our reseller program is designed to help you deliver greater value to your customers.</span></span></span><br />\r\n&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<h2><span style=\"font-size:24pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#434343\">How the Reseller Program Works</span></span></span></h2>\r\n\r\n<p><br />\r\n<span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">Getting started is straightforward. After joining the Go4Database Reseller Program, our team will work with you to understand your business goals and customer requirements. You&#39;ll receive access to our products, sales resources, and onboarding support, allowing you to confidently introduce Go4Database solutions to your clients.</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">As your customers purchase Go4Database products and services through your partnership, you earn reseller benefits while building long-term customer relationships. Our team remains available to provide technical guidance, product knowledge, and ongoing support whenever needed.</span></span></span><br />\r\n&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<h2><span style=\"font-size:24pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#434343\">What You Can Offer Your Customers</span></span></span></h2>\r\n\r\n<p><br />\r\n<span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">As a Go4Database reseller, you can provide businesses with access to verified B2B and B2C databases, AI-powered lead generation tools, industry-specific contact lists, business email databases, company information, and targeted marketing solutions. These services help organizations improve prospecting, identify decision-makers, generate qualified leads, and accelerate business growth.</span></span></span><br />\r\n&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">By offering trusted data solutions, you position your business as a strategic partner that helps customers make informed sales and marketing decisions.</span></span></span><br />\r\n&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<h2><span style=\"font-size:24pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#434343\">Benefits of Becoming a Reseller</span></span></span></h2>\r\n\r\n<p><br />\r\n<span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">The Go4Database Reseller Program is built to support long-term business success. Partners benefit from competitive revenue opportunities, dedicated onboarding assistance, product training, sales enablement resources, marketing support, and access to a growing portfolio of business data solutions. Our goal is to help every reseller build stronger customer relationships while creating sustainable business growth.</span></span></span><br />\r\n&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<h2><span style=\"font-size:24pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#434343\">Dedicated Partner Support</span></span></span></h2>\r\n\r\n<p><br />\r\n<span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">We believe successful partnerships are built through collaboration. Every reseller receives guidance from our experienced team throughout the partnership journey. From product demonstrations and implementation assistance to sales support and customer onboarding, we work closely with our partners to help them succeed in today&#39;s competitive marketplace.</span></span></span><br />\r\n&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<h2><span style=\"font-size:24pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#434343\">Why Customers Choose Go4Database</span></span></span></h2>\r\n\r\n<p><br />\r\n<span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">Organizations choose Go4Database because they need reliable, verified, and industry-focused business data that supports effective sales and marketing campaigns. Our solutions help businesses reduce prospecting time, improve outreach accuracy, identify decision-makers, and generate higher-quality leads. By becoming a reseller, you can deliver these trusted solutions while strengthening your own brand and expanding your service offerings.</span></span></span><br />\r\n&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<h2><span style=\"font-size:24pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#434343\">Join the Go4Database Reseller Network</span></span></span></h2>\r\n\r\n<p><br />\r\n<span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">Partner with Go4Database and become part of a growing network of businesses helping organizations connect with the right customers through verified business data and AI-powered </span><a href=\"https://www.go4database.com/blog/lead-generation-guide\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#3498db\">lead generation</span></a><span style=\"color:#666666\">. Whether your goal is to increase recurring revenue, expand your service portfolio, or provide greater value to your clients, our reseller program offers the foundation for long-term success.</span></span></span></p>', 'en_US', 'publish', '2024-12-17 00:51:57', '2026-07-27 15:26:33', 'all', NULL, NULL),
(17, 'Vendor Code of Conduct', 'vendor-code-of-conduct', 'Vendor Code of Conduct | Go4Database', 'Read Go4Database\'s Vendor Code of Conduct for ethical, legal, and responsible business standards', NULL, '<h2><span style=\"font-size:24pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#434343\">Introduction</span></span></span></h2>\r\n\r\n<p><br />\r\n<span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">At Go4Database, we believe that strong vendor relationships are built on integrity, transparency, accountability, and mutual respect. Our vendors, suppliers, contractors, consultants, and business partners play an essential role in helping us deliver high-quality data solutions and services to customers around the world. </span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">This Vendor Code of Conduct outlines the ethical, legal, environmental, and operational standards we expect from every organization that works with <a href=\"https://www.go4database.com/\" target=\"_blank\">Go4Database</a>. By entering into a business relationship with us, vendors acknowledge their commitment to complying with these standards and ensuring that their employees, representatives, and subcontractors uphold the same principles.</span></span></span><br />\r\n&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<h2><span style=\"font-size:24pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#434343\">Compliance with Laws and Regulations</span></span></span></h2>\r\n\r\n<p><br />\r\n<span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">Go4Database expects every vendor to conduct business in full compliance with all applicable local, national, and international laws and regulations. This includes legal requirements relating to labor and employment, taxation, trade compliance, anti-corruption, environmental protection, privacy, and information security. Vendors should maintain appropriate documentation demonstrating compliance with these obligations and cooperate with reasonable requests for audits or assessments whenever necessary.</span></span></span><br />\r\n&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<h3><span style=\"font-size:20pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#434343\">Ethical Business Practices</span></span></span></h3>\r\n\r\n<p><br />\r\n<span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">Integrity is the foundation of every business relationship at Go4Database. Vendors are expected to operate honestly, ethically, and transparently in all business dealings. Any form of bribery, corruption, fraud, kickbacks, or improper payments is strictly prohibited. Business records should accurately reflect all transactions and financial activities, and vendors should avoid situations that create actual or perceived conflicts of interest. Where such conflicts exist, they should be disclosed promptly so they can be managed appropriately.</span></span></span><br />\r\n&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<h3><span style=\"font-size:20pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#434343\">Human Rights and Fair Employment</span></span></span></h3>\r\n\r\n<p><br />\r\n<span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">Go4Database is committed to supporting internationally recognized human rights and expects its vendors to share this commitment. Vendors should provide workplaces where employees are treated with dignity, fairness, and respect. Forced labor, bonded labor, human trafficking, and child labor must never be used under any circumstances.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nEmployees should receive fair compensation and legally required benefits, and employment decisions should be based solely on qualifications, experience, and performance without discrimination. Vendors are also expected to maintain workplaces free from harassment, intimidation, abuse, and retaliation while respecting employees&#39; lawful rights to freedom of association where permitted by applicable laws.</span></span></span><br />\r\n&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<h3><span style=\"font-size:20pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#434343\">Health and Safety</span></span></span></h3>\r\n\r\n<p><br />\r\n<span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">Vendors are responsible for providing a safe, secure, and healthy working environment for their employees and contractors. Appropriate measures should be taken to identify workplace hazards, reduce operational risks, and comply with applicable occupational health and safety regulations.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nEmployees should receive adequate safety training and have access to suitable protective equipment where necessary. Vendors should also maintain emergency preparedness procedures and encourage employees to report health and safety concerns without fear of retaliation.</span></span></span><br />\r\n&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<h3><span style=\"font-size:20pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#434343\">Environmental Responsibility</span></span></span></h3>\r\n\r\n<p><br />\r\n<span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">Go4Database encourages vendors to operate responsibly with respect to the environment and to minimize the environmental impact of their operations. Vendors should comply with all relevant environmental laws and regulations while making reasonable efforts to reduce waste, conserve natural resources, improve energy efficiency, and manage hazardous materials responsibly.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nWe value partners who continuously seek opportunities to improve sustainability throughout their business operations and <a href=\"https://www.go4database.com/b2b/supply-chain-and-logistics-decision-makers\" target=\"_blank\">supply chains</a>.</span></span></span><br />\r\n&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<h3><span style=\"font-size:20pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#434343\">Information Security and Data Privacy</span></span></span></h3>\r\n\r\n<p><br />\r\n<span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">Protecting confidential information and maintaining strong information security practices are critical responsibilities for every vendor working with Go4Database. Vendors are expected to implement appropriate technical and organizational safeguards to protect confidential information, customer data, and other sensitive business information against unauthorized access, disclosure, alteration, or loss.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nCompliance with applicable data privacy laws is expected at all times, and vendors should promptly notify Go4Database of any security incidents or data breaches that could affect our information or services.</span></span></span><br />\r\n&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<h3><span style=\"font-size:20pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#434343\">Intellectual Property</span></span></span></h3>\r\n\r\n<p><br />\r\n<span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">Go4Database expects vendors to respect intellectual property rights and protect proprietary information belonging to the company, its customers, and business partners. Confidential business information, trademarks, copyrights, software, trade secrets, and other intellectual property must only be used for authorized business purposes and should never be copied, shared, or disclosed without appropriate permission.</span></span></span><br />\r\n&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<h2><span style=\"font-size:24pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#434343\">Responsible Business Relationships</span></span></span></h2>\r\n\r\n<p><br />\r\n<span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">We encourage our vendors to extend these ethical principles throughout their own supply chains. Vendors should exercise appropriate oversight when selecting subcontractors and third-party service providers to ensure that they maintain standards consistent with this Vendor Code of Conduct. Responsible sourcing, transparency, and accountability should remain priorities across all business relationships.</span></span></span><br />\r\n&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<h2><span style=\"font-size:24pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#434343\">Gifts, Hospitality, and Business Courtesies</span></span></span></h2>\r\n\r\n<p><br />\r\n<span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">Business gifts, hospitality, and entertainment should always be reasonable, infrequent, and appropriate to legitimate business relationships. Vendors must never offer or provide anything of value with the intention of improperly influencing business decisions or obtaining an unfair commercial advantage. Any exchange of gifts or hospitality should comply with applicable laws as well as the policies of both organizations.</span></span></span><br />\r\n&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<h2><span style=\"font-size:24pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#434343\">Confidentiality</span></span></span></h2>\r\n\r\n<p><br />\r\n<span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">During the course of business, vendors may have access to confidential or proprietary information relating to Go4Database, our customers, technologies, products, business strategies, or operations. Vendors are expected to protect such information with appropriate care and to use it only for authorized business purposes. These confidentiality obligations continue even after the business relationship has ended unless disclosure is required by law or expressly authorized by Go4Database.</span></span></span><br />\r\n&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<h3><span style=\"font-size:24pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#434343\">Reporting Concerns</span></span></span></h3>\r\n\r\n<p><br />\r\n<span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">Go4Database encourages vendors to report any suspected violations of this Vendor Code of Conduct, applicable laws, or unethical business practices as soon as they become aware of them. Reports made in good faith will be treated seriously and reviewed appropriately. Vendors are expected to cooperate with investigations, and retaliation against any individual who raises a genuine concern will not be tolerated.</span></span></span><br />\r\n&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<h2><span style=\"font-size:24pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#434343\">Monitoring and Compliance</span></span></span></h2>\r\n\r\n<p><br />\r\n<span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">To help ensure compliance with this Vendor Code of Conduct, Go4Database may periodically request documentation, certifications, questionnaires, or other information from its vendors. Where appropriate, compliance assessments or audits may also be conducted. Failure to comply with the standards described in this Code may result in corrective actions, suspension of business activities, or termination of the business relationship.</span></span></span><br />\r\n&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<h2><span style=\"font-size:24pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#434343\">Our Commitment</span></span></span></h2>\r\n\r\n<p><br />\r\n<span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">Go4Database is committed to building long-term partnerships founded on trust, integrity, legal compliance, and responsible business practices. We believe that ethical conduct, respect for people, protection of information, environmental responsibility, and operational excellence create lasting value for our customers, partners, employees, and communities. By conducting business with Go4Database, vendors acknowledge their commitment to supporting these principles and maintaining the highest standards of professional and ethical behavior.</span></span></span></p>', 'en_US', 'publish', '2024-12-19 06:11:18', '2026-06-26 14:46:36', 'all', NULL, NULL),
(19, 'Cookies Policy', 'cookies-policy', NULL, NULL, NULL, '<p><span data-sheets-root=\"1\" style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 11pt; font-family: Calibri, Arial;\">Cookies Policy</span></p><p><span data-sheets-root=\"1\" style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 11pt; font-family: Calibri, Arial;\"><span data-sheets-root=\"1\" style=\"font-size: 11pt;\">Cookies Policy</span></span></p><p><span data-sheets-root=\"1\" style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 11pt; font-family: Calibri, Arial;\"><span data-sheets-root=\"1\" style=\"font-size: 11pt;\"><span data-sheets-root=\"1\" style=\"font-size: 11pt;\">Cookies Policy</span></span></span></p><p><span data-sheets-root=\"1\" style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 11pt; font-family: Calibri, Arial;\"><span data-sheets-root=\"1\" style=\"font-size: 11pt;\"><span data-sheets-root=\"1\" style=\"font-size: 11pt;\"><span data-sheets-root=\"1\" style=\"font-size: 11pt;\">Cookies Policy</span></span></span></span></p>', 'en_US', 'publish', '2024-12-19 06:12:34', '2024-12-19 06:12:34', 'all', NULL, NULL),
(37, 'Email Verifier', 'email-verifier', 'Email List Verify – Clean & Validate Your Contacts Fast', 'Go4Database helps you verify email lists, reduce bounces, and boost marketing success. Get better results from your email campaigns today.', '<script type=\"application/ld+json\">\r\n{\r\n  \"@context\": \"https://schema.org\",\r\n  \"@type\": \"Organization\",\r\n  \"name\": \"Go4Database\",\r\n  \"url\": \"https://www.go4database.com/\",\r\n  \"logo\": \"https://go4database.com/assets/uploads/media-uploader/go4database-logo1751528079.png\",\r\n  \"contactPoint\": {\r\n    \"@type\": \"ContactPoint\",\r\n    \"telephone\": \"+ 1 786 785 2141\",\r\n    \"contactType\": \"customer service\",\r\n    \"areaServed\": \"US\",\r\n    \"availableLanguage\": \"en\"\r\n  },\r\n  \"sameAs\": [\r\n    \"https://www.facebook.com/Go4Database\",\r\n    \"https://twitter.com/go4database\",\r\n    \"https://www.instagram.com/go4database/\",\r\n    \"https://www.youtube.com/@Go4Database\",\r\n    \"https://www.linkedin.com/company/go4database/\",\r\n    \"https://in.pinterest.com/go4database/\"\r\n  ]\r\n}\r\n</script>\r\n<script type=\"application/ld+json\">\r\n{\r\n  \"@context\": \"https://schema.org/\", \r\n  \"@type\": \"Product\", \r\n  \"name\": \"Email Verifier\",\r\n  \"image\": \"\",\r\n  \"description\": \"Improve Delivery & Reduce Bounce Instantly - Get accurate, fast, and super-affordable bulk email verification trusted by 5,000+ marketers, SaaS teams, and sales professionals.\",\r\n  \"brand\": {\r\n    \"@type\": \"Brand\",\r\n    \"name\": \"Go4Database\"\r\n  },\r\n  \"aggregateRating\": {\r\n    \"@type\": \"AggregateRating\",\r\n    \"ratingValue\": \"5\",\r\n    \"bestRating\": \"5\",\r\n    \"worstRating\": \"1\",\r\n    \"ratingCount\": \"400\"\r\n  }\r\n}\r\n</script>\r\n<script type=\"application/ld+json\">\r\n{\r\n  \"@context\": \"https://schema.org/\", \r\n  \"@type\": \"BreadcrumbList\", \r\n  \"itemListElement\": [{\r\n    \"@type\": \"ListItem\", \r\n    \"position\": 1, \r\n    \"name\": \"Go4Database\",\r\n    \"item\": \"https://www.go4database.com/\"  \r\n  },{\r\n    \"@type\": \"ListItem\", \r\n    \"position\": 2, \r\n    \"name\": \"Email Verifier\",\r\n    \"item\": \"https://www.go4database.com/email-verifier\"  \r\n  }]\r\n}\r\n</script>\r\n\r\n<script type=\"application/ld+json\">\r\n         {         \r\n            \"@context\": \"https://schema.org/\",         \r\n            \"@type\": \"WebPage\",         \r\n            \"@id\": \"#WebPage\",         \r\n            \"url\": \"https://www.go4database.com/email-verifier\",          \r\n            \"name\": \"Email Verifier\"\r\n          } \r\n      </script>', '<p><img alt=\"Bulk Email Verifier - MillionVerifier\" src=\"https://www.millionverifier.com/images/articles/bulk_email_verifier_2_hero.jpg\" /></p>\r\n\r\n<h1 style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:36px\"><strong><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">Email verification</span></span></strong></span></h1>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">Email verification services are necessary to clean the email lists,enabling your marketing campaigns to adopt the correct strategies. </span></span></span><br />\r\n<br />\r\n<span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">You can filter out those bouncing emails and increase the deliverability standing intact which will also save your sender reputation. </span></span></span><br />\r\n<br />\r\n<span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">Services like </span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\"><strong>email list verify</strong></span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\"> and bulk email validation are meant to check the legitimacy of an e-mail address before operation in sending a campaign.</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<h2><img alt=\"Email Verifier: Verify email address with free email checker • Hunter\" src=\"https://hunter.io/assets/email-verifier-bulk-2f4f832bdd479699c782b8c9ac2027842fd219bab50d2bb08cd45b6559bc0876.svg\" style=\"height:455px; width:1000px\" /><br />\r\n<br />\r\n<br />\r\n<span style=\"font-size:24pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#434343\">For What Reason Is Email List Verification Necessary?</span></span></span></h2>\r\n\r\n<p><br />\r\n<span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">What email verification offers a business is the guarantee that their marketing campaigns will be sent to legitimate and real-time mail IDs only. </span></span></span><br />\r\n<br />\r\n<span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">Here&#39;s why it&#39;s important:</span></span></span><br />\r\n&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li style=\"list-style-type:disc\"><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\"><strong>Prevent Bounce Rates</strong></span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">: When you verify email lists, then there are the least options that emails will bounce back to because of it containing invalid skills here.</span></span></span><br />\r\n	<br />\r\n	<span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">Valid emails are good as they maximize the chances your messages get into inboxes rather than spam folders.</span></span></span></li>\r\n	<li style=\"list-style-type:disc\"><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">- </span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\"><strong>Increase engagement</strong></span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">: Real and active end users are on the verified email lists, making open-rates higheraining.&nbsp;</span></span></span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<h2><br />\r\n<span style=\"font-size:24pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#434343\">Types of Email Verifiers</span></span></span></h2>\r\n\r\n<p><br />\r\n<span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">There are different tools to tackle any business requirements associated with email list verification. </span></span></span><br />\r\n<br />\r\n<span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">But differ in features, pricing and effectiveness:</span></span></span><br />\r\n&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li style=\"list-style-type:disc\"><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\"><strong>Bulk Email Validator:</strong></span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\"> Users can verify most, if not all of their email addresses at once by uploading them; this will guarantee that only real emails are on the users list which saves time.</span></span></span><br />\r\n	&nbsp;</li>\r\n	<li style=\"list-style-type:disc\"><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\"><strong>Real-Time Email Verification:</strong></span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\"> Validates email addresses in real-time as they are typed into forms, resulting to decrease incorrect submissions.</span></span></span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<h2><span style=\"font-size:24pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#434343\">Compliance</span></span></span></h2>\r\n\r\n<p><br />\r\n<span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">All email verification services follow global rules such as GDPR and CAN-SPAM to guarantee your data is being handled with responsibility. </span></span></span><br />\r\n<br />\r\n<span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">All these services are privacy-centric guarantee that their will verify email lists keeping in mind all the data protection laws and also no violation of Email Marketing best practices.</span></span></span><br />\r\n&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<h2><span style=\"font-size:24pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#434343\">Benefits Of Mail Verification</span></span></span></h2>\r\n\r\n<p><br />\r\n<span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">It is quite clear that the email verifiers like bulk email verify and bulk email validation confer several advantages in keeping up a clean database of emails. </span></span></span><br />\r\n<br />\r\n<span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">This will help keep your emails out of the bounce box and reduce the chances of getting your domain blacklisted. </span></span></span><br />\r\n<br />\r\n<span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">This results in reducing costs from not spending money to send emails to the invalid email accounts, consequently enhancing inbound marketing efficiency. </span></span></span><br />\r\n<br />\r\n<span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">They also provide powerful analytics which surfaces a wide array of detailed information related to email list quality, and performance.</span></span></span><br />\r\n&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li style=\"list-style-type:disc\"><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\"><strong>Deliverability</strong></span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">: With an deliverability rate of 95%, the </span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\"><strong>,</strong></span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\"> helps you to have higher quality list that prevents hard bounces and increases your results in campaigns.</span></span></span><br />\r\n	<span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">&nbsp;</span></span></span></li>\r\n	<li style=\"list-style-type:disc\"><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\"><strong>Double Check</strong></span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">: Email data integrity is also improved through double verification, this ensures a validated email address exists by checking both the syntax and domain of an address(validate that correspondent with distribution service).</span></span></span><br />\r\n	&nbsp;</li>\r\n	<li style=\"list-style-type:disc\"><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\"><strong>Global Compliance: email checker list</strong></span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\"> service makes your lists GDPR compliant helping to ensure their ongoing legal security across the globe.</span></span></span><br />\r\n	<span style=\"font-size:16pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">&nbsp;</span></span></span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<h2><span style=\"font-size:24pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#434343\">How an Email List Verifier Works</span></span></span></h2>\r\n\r\n<p><br />\r\n<span style=\"font-size:16pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">Methods with which the email address is confirmed by an Email verification tool:</span></span></span><br />\r\n&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li style=\"list-style-type:disc\"><span style=\"font-size:16pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\"><strong>Syntax Check:</strong></span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:16pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\"> It verifies the email address to be in a correct format.</span></span></span></li>\r\n	<li style=\"list-style-type:disc\"><span style=\"font-size:16pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\"><strong>Domain Verification</strong></span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:16pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">: ensures the email domain is activated and receiving emails.</span></span></span></li>\r\n	<li style=\"list-style-type:disc\"><span style=\"font-size:16pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\"><strong>MX Record Check</strong></span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:16pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\"> &mdash; Validates the mail exchange ( MX ) record of email domain to detect whether an inputted server is capable of receiving emails.</span></span></span><br />\r\n	&nbsp;</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<h2><span style=\"font-size:24pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#434343\">Tips for Email Verifiers</span></span></span></h2>\r\n\r\n<p><br />\r\n<span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">In order for your email verification to be more effective, it is suggested that you follow these best practices.</span></span></span><br />\r\n<br />\r\n<span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#434343\"><strong>1.</strong></span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#434343\"> </span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\"><strong>Frequently Check The Email Lists</strong></span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">: To avoid invalid emails, keep your lists current.</span></span></span><br />\r\n<br />\r\n<span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#434343\"><strong>2.</strong></span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#434343\"> </span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\"><strong>Use Real-Time Verification</strong></span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">: Use real-time verification to catch only valid emails for websites with high traffic.</span></span></span><br />\r\n<br />\r\n<span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#434343\"><strong>3.</strong></span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#434343\"> </span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\"><strong>Sync with Your CRM</strong></span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">: A lot of verifiers provide the capabilities to plug in via API, as should verification simply be a part of your deal flow.</span></span></span><br />\r\n&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<h2><span style=\"font-size:24pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#434343\">FAQs</span></span></span><br />\r\n&nbsp;</h2>\r\n\r\n<h3><span style=\"font-size:20pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#434343\">1. What is email list verification?</span></span></span><br />\r\n&nbsp;</h3>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">Email list verification is the practice of verifying whether an email address in your database really exists.</span></span></span><br />\r\n&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<h3><span style=\"font-size:20pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#434343\">2. How does bulk email verification work?</span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:16pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\"> </span></span></span><br />\r\n&nbsp;</h3>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">It allows you to batch upload your email addresses and verify them in a bulk, separating the good emails from those that are invalid or high risk.</span></span></span><br />\r\n&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<h3><span style=\"font-size:20pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#434343\">3. Why should every Business have valid emails?</span></span></span><br />\r\n<span style=\"font-size:16pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">&nbsp;</span></span></span></h3>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">It lowers your bounce rates, increases deliverability and maintains sender reputation as no longer does to the make you send email which lands on dark dead silent inboxes.</span></span></span><br />\r\n&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<h3><span style=\"font-size:20pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#434343\">4. What is GDPR Compliance Of Email Verification?</span></span></span><br />\r\n<span style=\"font-size:16pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">&nbsp;</span></span></span></h3>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">Yes, almost all email validators including bulk email validator are GDPR compliances and compliant with other data protection regulations too.</span></span></span><br />\r\n&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<h3><span style=\"font-size:20pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#434343\">5. What is REAL-TIME Email Verification?</span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:16pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\"><strong>&nbsp;</strong></span></span></span></h3>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"text-align:justify\"><br />\r\n<span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">Indeed, a significant number of verifiers provide real-time verification that validates emails at the point they are entered on your website or app.</span></span></span></p>', 'en_US', 'publish', '2024-12-20 02:41:45', '2026-02-02 17:45:50', 'all', 'on', NULL),
