(136, 'AboutSectionStyleOne', 'update', 'dynamic_page', 3, 37, 'dynamic_page', 'a:17:{s:2:\"id\";s:3:\"136\";s:10:\"addon_name\";s:20:\"AboutSectionStyleOne\";s:15:\"addon_namespace\";s:76:\"QXBwXFBhZ2VCdWlsZGVyXEFkZG9uc1xBYm91dFNlY3Rpb25cQWJvdXRTZWN0aW9uU3R5bGVPbmU=\";s:10:\"addon_type\";s:6:\"update\";s:14:\"addon_location\";s:12:\"dynamic_page\";s:11:\"addon_order\";s:1:\"3\";s:13:\"addon_page_id\";s:2:\"37\";s:15:\"addon_page_type\";s:12:\"dynamic_page\";s:14:\"subtitle_en_US\";N;s:11:\"title_en_US\";s:26:\"Email Verification Process\";s:17:\"button_text_en_US\";N;s:16:\"button_url_en_US\";N;s:17:\"description_en_US\";s:600:\"<p>Email verification is the process of checking whether an email address is valid, safe, and ready to receive messages. Tools like Go4Database Email Verifier scan every email across multiple layers — syntax, domain health, MX records, spam traps, catch-all addresses, disposable emails, and mailbox existence. This helps you avoid bounces, protect your domain reputation, and improve inbox delivery. Whether you send bulk campaigns or cold emails, verifying your list ensures every message reaches a real inbox. Try our bulk email verifier with 100 free credits and clean your list in minutes.</p>\";s:17:\"summer_note_image\";N;s:16:\"left_image_en_US\";s:4:\"1114\";s:11:\"padding_top\";s:2:\"60\";s:14:\"padding_bottom\";s:2:\"60\";}', '2025-11-18 17:51:18', '2025-11-18 17:51:37', 'App\\PageBuilder\\Addons\\AboutSection\\AboutSectionStyleOne'),
