le=\"color:#0066ff\"><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\">Marketing Decision Maker</span></span></span></a></td>\r\n			<td><a href=\"https://www.go4database.com/b2b/vp-sales-mailing-list\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#0066ff\"><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\">VP Sales Mailing List</span></span></span></a></td>\r\n		</tr>\r\n	</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:20px\"><a class=\"boxed-btn\" href=\"https://wa.me/17867852141\" target=\"_blank\">Chat with Us</a></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<h2><span style=\"font-size:24pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#434343\">Frequently Asked Questions (FAQs)</span></span></span></h2>\r\n\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<h3><span style=\"color:#2c3e50\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-size:24px\">Q1. Why should I buy an email list instead of building one?</span></span></span></h3>\r\n\r\n<p><br />\r\n<span style=\"font-size:16pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">Of course, one of the benefits of buying an email list is saving time and resources on providing a quick way to get in touch with people. Purchased lists are already segmented, so business organizations can instantly start outreach with a targeted approach.</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<h3><span style=\"color:#2c3e50\"><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif\">Q2. Are the email lists compliant with GDPR?</span></span></span></h3>\r\n\r\n<p><br />\r\n<span style=\"font-size:16pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">Yes, all reputable providers do follow data privacy laws such as GDPR and CAN-SPAM. Due to compliance, the risk of fines is kept low due to the proper use of data.</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<h3><span style=\"color:#2c3e50\"><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif\">Q3. How often is the email list updated?</span></span></span></h3>\r\n\r\n<p><br />\r\n<span style=\"font-size:16pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">Our email lists have to be renewed periodically to keep the information right and accurate. It also verifies and cleans data to avoid problems with deliverability.</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>', NULL, 'A Global Email List is a powerful resource for any business looking to expand, connect borders, and also expand significantly in the market.', 'Global Email List for B2B | 95% Verified Contacts', 'Access a verified global email list of decision-makers across 200+ countries. Boost outreach, generate qualified leads, and scale B2B growth faster.', '<script type=\"application/ld+json\">\r\n{\r\n  \"@context\": \"https://schema.org\",\r\n  \"@type\": \"Organization\",\r\n  \"name\": \"Go4Database\",\r\n  \"url\": \"https://www.go4database.com/\",\r\n  \"logo\": \"https://go4database.com/assets/uploads/media-uploader/go4database-logo1751528079.png\",\r\n  \"contactPoint\": {\r\n    \"@type\": \"ContactPoint\",\r\n    \"telephone\": \"+ 1 786 785 2141\",\r\n    \"contactType\": \"customer service\",\r\n    \"areaServed\": \"US\",\r\n    \"availableLanguage\": \"en\"\r\n  },\r\n  \"sameAs\": [\r\n    \"https://www.facebook.com/Go4Database\",\r\n    \"https://twitter.com/go4database\",\r\n    \"https://www.instagram.com/go4database/\",\r\n    \"https://www.youtube.com/@Go4Database\",\r\n    \"https://www.linkedin.com/company/go4database/\",\r\n    \"https://in.pinterest.com/go4database/\"\r\n  ]\r\n}\r\n</script>\r\n\r\n<script type=\"application/ld+json\">\r\n{\r\n  \"@context\": \"https://schema.org/\", \r\n  \"@type\": \"Product\", \r\n  \"name\": \"Global Email List\",\r\n  \"image\": \"https://www.go4database.c