o remove outdated and inactive contacts, letting you to focus your outreach on genuine prospects in the American market.\"\r\n    }\r\n  },{\r\n    \"@type\": \"Question\",\r\n    \"name\": \"4. How do I get started with your US Business Email List?\",\r\n    \"acceptedAnswer\": {\r\n      \"@type\": \"Answer\",\r\n      \"text\": \"Getting started with our US Business Email List is simple and easy process. You can visit our website, check out the various options we offer, and choose the list that best suits your needs.\r\nOnce you\'ve made your selection, you can easily place an order, and our team will provide you with your customized list of mailing lists.\r\nIf you have any questions or need assistance, our customer support team is always here to help you navigate the process.\"\r\n    }\r\n  }]\r\n}\r\n</script>', '2 Days', 'Business', '$500', NULL, 'publish', '619', 'en_US', '2024-12-13 18:12:51', '2026-07-17 08:09:45');
INSERT INTO `works` (`id`, `title`, `slug`, `categories_id`, `description`, `faqs`, `excerpt`, `meta_tag`, `meta_description`, `schema_code`, `duration`, `clients`, `budget`, `gallery`, `status`, `image`, `lang`, `created_at`, `updated_at`) VALUES
(41, 'Free Email Lists vs. Paid Lists: Which Is Better for Your Marketing Campaigns?', 'free-email-mailing-list', 'a:1:{i:0;s:1:\"3\";}', '<p><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">Greetings! We hope you&#39;ve had a wonderful day! Or maybe stressful?</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">On a budget? Looking for a cheaper email list creation technique?</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">Don&#39;t worry, Go4Database family has got you!!!</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">Creating an email mailing list is essential for marketers, </span><a href=\"https://www.go4database.com/b2b/ceo-email-list\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#0033ff\">business owners</span></a><span style=\"color:#666666\"> &amp; entrepreneurs to grow their outreach.&nbsp;</span></span></span><br />\r\n&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:48pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\"><em>&ldquo;</em></span></span></span><strong><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\"><em>What is Free Email Mailing List?</em></span></span></span></strong><br />\r\n<span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\"><em>A free email lists is a collection of email addresses gathered without cost, either from publicly available sources or through manual compilation. It is often used for email marketing or outreach without paying for access to the contacts. ,,</em></span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">Simply put, &ldquo;An email list, also called a </span><a href=\"https://www.go4database.com/blog/mailing-list\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#0033ff\">mailing list</span></a><span style=\"color:#666666\">, is a collection of email addresses used by businesses and individuals to send email messages, newsletters, updates, and promotional material to a specific group of people.&rdquo;</span></span></span><br />\r\n&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<h2><span style=\"font-size:24pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#434343\">What are the Benefits of Having an Email List? Why Does it Matter?</span></span></span></h2>\r\n\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li style=\"list-style-type:disc\"><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">You can reach your audience anytime, without having to depend on a third party.&nbsp;</span></span></span><br />\r\n	&nbsp;</li>\r\n	<li style=\"list-style-type:disc\"><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">You get higher engagement and conversion rates.</span></span></span><br />\r\n	&nbsp;</li>\r\n	<li style=\"list-style-type:disc\"><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">This type of marketing is, I&#39;d say, the most cost effective.</span></span></span><br />\r\n	&nbsp;</li>\r\n	<li style=\"list-style-type:disc\"><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">The customer relationship built by this marketing technique is a strong one.</span></span></span><br />\r\n	&nbsp;</li>\r\n	<li style=\"list-style-type:disc\"><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">Increases website traffic and sales.</span></span></span><br />\r\n	&nbsp;</li>\r\n	<li style=\"list-style-type:disc\"><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">Automation saves time and effort.</span></span></span><br />\r\n	&nbsp;</li>\r\n	<li style=\"list-style-type:disc\"><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">You have full ownership of your leads, ensuring </span><a href=\"https://www.go4database.com/b2b/industry-mailing-list\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#0033ff\">long-term business growth</span></a><span style=\"color:#666666\">.</span></span></span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<h2><span style=\"font-size:24pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#434343\">10 Ways You Can Create a Free Email Mailing List (Detailed Explanation)</span></span></span></h2>\r\n\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">1. Google maps scrapping&nbsp;</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">2. Yellow pages extraction (Manually)</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">3. Company websites &lsquo;Contact Us&rsquo; page</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">4. LinkedIn profiles &amp; company pages</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">5. Facebook business pages</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">6. Instagram &amp; Twitter (X) bios</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">7. Business Directories e.g., Yelp, BBB, Angie&#39;s List</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">8. WHOIS Domain Lookup</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">9. Use Google Search Operators to Find Emails Faster</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">10. Forum &amp; Community Websites</span></span></span><br />\r\n&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">All these <strong>free email mailing list</strong> creation techniques require some effort, but these all are free! Here&rsquo;s a detailed guide to help you collect email address lists free, </span><a href=\"https://www.go4database.com/b2b/medical-industry-mailing-list\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#0033ff\">generate free business leads</span></a><span style=\"color:#666666\">, and find free </span><a href=\"https://www.go4database.com/blog/lead-generation-guide\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#0033ff\">lead generation</span></a><span style=\"color:#666666\"> strategies.</span></span></span><br />\r\n&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<h3><span style=\"font-size:20pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#434343\">1. Google Maps Scrapping (Manually &amp; Automated)</span></span></span></h3>\r\n\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">Google Maps scraping is the process of using automated tools or scripts to extract information like business names, locations, and reviews from Google Maps.</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li style=\"list-style-type:disc\">\r\n	<h4><strong><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">Manually</span></span></span></strong></h4>\r\n	</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">Search for the business in your niche, or target. (e.g. Restaurants in New York) that you want to incorporate in your free email mailing list.</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">Then individually click on every listing to view business details.</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">Look for the email addresses on the profile or visit the company&rsquo;s website to find their contact details.</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">Copy &amp; paste the email addresses into a spreadsheet, you can keep the title as &lsquo;Free email mailing list&rsquo;.</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><br />\r\n&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p><em><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\"><strong>TL;DR:</strong></span></span></span></em></p>\r\n\r\n<p><em><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">Google Maps scraping involves extracting business info (like names, emails, and phone numbers) manually or using automated tools. Manually, you search and collect data one by one. Automated tools like Chrome extensions or web scrapers speed up the process by pulling bulk data for easy download and lead generation.</span></span></span></em></p>\r\n\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li style=\"list-style-type:disc\">\r\n	<h4><strong><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">Automated</span></span></span></strong></h4>\r\n	</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">Install the chrome extension or sign up for the </span><a href=\"https://chromewebstore.google.com/detail/web-scraper-free-web-scra/jnhgnonknehpejjnehehllkliplmbmhn?hl=en\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#0033ff\">web-based scraper</span></a><span style=\"color:#666666\">.</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">Search for the target business with relevant keyword on google maps (e.g. &ldquo;restaurants in New York&rdquo;)&nbsp;</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">Run the scraper to extract business names, emails, phone numbers, and websites.</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">Download the data in CSV or Excel format for lead generation.</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">Some decent automated scrappers would be Instant Data Scraper (Chrome extension), Google maps Extractor (Chrome Extension), Data Miner (Chrome Extension), ParseHub (Free web scraper) and more.</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<h3 style=\"margin-left:72px\">&nbsp;</h3>\r\n\r\n<h3><span style=\"font-size:20pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#434343\">2. Yellow Pages Extraction (Manually)</span></span></span></h3>\r\n\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">The yellow pages are telephone directories of businesses, organized by category rather than alphabetically by business name, in which advertising is sold.</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">Visit yellow pages, and search for businesses &amp; startups in your niche.</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">Open each </span><a href=\"https://www.yellowpages.com/\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#0033ff\">business listing</span></a><span style=\"color:#666666\"> and look for the email you require.</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">If the email isn&#39;t displayed, look for their website and check their contact us page.</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">Collect the emails all in one place like on google spreadsheet, and done. You&#39;ve created yourself a </span><a href=\"https://www.go4database.com/blog/buy-email-list\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#0033ff\">free email lists for marketing</span></a><span style=\"color:#666666\">.</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p><strong><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">Tip: Use Google Search Operators like:</span></span></span></strong></p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li style=\"list-style-type:disc\"><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">&nbsp;site:yellowpages.com &quot;email&quot;</span></span></span></li>\r\n	<li style=\"list-style-type:disc\"><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">&quot;industry + city + contact email site:yellowpages.com&quot;</span></span></span><br />\r\n	&nbsp;</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<h3><span style=\"font-size:20pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#434343\">3. Company websites &lsquo;Contact Us&rsquo; Page</span></span></span></h3>\r\n\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">Search for your target business online like on google.</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">Look for the relevant email address in the &lsquo;About us&rsquo; or &lsquo;Contact&rsquo; section.</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">Add it to your list.</span></span></span><br />\r\n<br />\r\n&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<h3><span style=\"font-size:20pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#434343\">4. LinkedIn Profiles &amp; Company Pages</span></span></span></h3>\r\n\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">Search for business &amp; professionals in your niche.</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">Visit the company profiles and check for the &lsquo;Contact Info&rsquo; section.</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">If no email is visible, then you&#39;ll have to directly go to their website.</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">This method is great for free </span><a href=\"https://www.go4database.com/blog/business-leads\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#0033ff\">business leads</span></a><span style=\"color:#666666\">.</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><br />\r\n&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<h3><span style=\"font-size:20pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#434343\">5. Facebook Business Pages</span></span></span></h3>\r\n\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">Many businesses list their email on their respective facebook pages under the &lsquo;About&rsquo; section page.</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">Go to facebook searches, enter a business category(e.g. Chefs in Texas), and filter results by pages.</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">Open each page and collect the email addresses to add to your free email mailing lists.</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><br />\r\n&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<h3><span style=\"font-size:20pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#434343\">6. Instagram &amp; Twitter (X) Bios</span></span></span></h3>\r\n\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">Many influencers, business owners &amp; startups list their contact details in their bios of platforms like Instagram &amp; X.</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">Search for hashtags of your industry (e.g. #digitalmarketingagency).</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">Open profiles and collect all the publicly displayed emails.</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><br />\r\n&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<h3><span style=\"font-size:20pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#434343\">7. Business Directories e.g., Yelp, BBB, Angie&#39;s List</span></span></span></h3>\r\n\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">A business directory is a website or printed listing of information which lists businesses within niche based categories. Businesses can be categorized by niche, location, activity, or size.</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">Yelp, Better Business Bureau (BBB), and Angie&rsquo;s List have thousands of business listings.</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">Search for your target business, to build the free email mailing list.</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">Check their profiles, if not found on their profiles, then visit their website.</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><br />\r\n&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<h3><span style=\"font-size:20pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#434343\">8. WHOIS Domain Lookup</span></span></span></h3>\r\n\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">WHOIS stands for &ldquo;Who is responsible for this domain name&rdquo;. Whois is a widely used Internet record listing that identifies who owns a domain and how to get in contact with them.</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li style=\"list-style-type:disc\"><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">If a company&rsquo;s website does not list an email, use a </span><a href=\"https://whois.domaintools.com\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#0033ff\">WHOIS</span></a><span style=\"color:#666666\">&nbsp; lookup tool like </span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">.&nbsp;</span></span></span></li>\r\n	<li style=\"list-style-type:disc\"><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">Enter the website name, and it may show the registered email.</span></span></span></li>\r\n	<li style=\"list-style-type:disc\"><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">This method will help you add on to your free email mailing list.</span></span></span><br />\r\n	&nbsp;</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<h3><span style=\"font-size:20pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#434343\">9. Use Google Search Operators to Find Emails Faster</span></span></span></h3>\r\n\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">Instead of searching manually, use Google advanced search operators:</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li style=\"list-style-type:disc\"><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">&quot;business name&quot; + &quot;email&quot; site:website.com</span></span></span></li>\r\n	<li style=\"list-style-type:disc\"><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">&nbsp;&quot;industry&quot; + &quot;contact email&quot; + city</span></span></span></li>\r\n	<li style=\"list-style-type:disc\"><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">&nbsp;&quot;company name&quot; + &quot;@gmail.com&quot; OR &quot;@yahoo.com&quot; OR &quot;@outlook.com&quot;</span></span></span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">This method will help extract a </span><a href=\"https://www.go4database.com/b2b/healthcare-industry-email-list\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#0033ff\">free business list</span></a><span style=\"color:#666666\">. Here! One more step added to your free email mailing list.</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><br />\r\n&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<h3><span style=\"font-size:20pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#434343\">10. Online Community Websites and Forums</span></span></span></h3>\r\n\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">An online community, called an internet community or web community, is a community whose members interact with each other primarily via the Internet. </span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">Members of the community usually share common interests.</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">An Internet forum, Online forum or message board, is an online discussion site where people can hold conversations in the form of posted messages.</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">Many industry professionals share their email addresses in Quora &amp; Reddit.</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">Search for niche specific threads, and check user profiles or comments.</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">Now, add these emails to your free email mailing list.</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><br />\r\n&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">A free email mailing list is a budget friendly shortcut, but to be honest it has a lot of disadvantages (so please be cautious before utilising them) ! Like i can list a lot of them, but here are a few:</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">1. Low quality &amp; outdated data</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">2. Poor engagement &amp; ROI</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">3. Legal &amp; compliance issue</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">4. High spams &amp; Blacklist risks</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><sp