t\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#434343\">3. What is the frequency of updating the industry mailing list?</span></span></span></h3>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:16pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">You can subscribe to industry mailing lists, which should be updated every 2,3 months to ensure that the data are accurate and relevant.</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<h3><span style=\"font-size:20pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#434343\">4. What are the advantages of utilizing industry mailing list?</span></span></span></h3>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:16pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">Industry mailing lists offer this targeted outreach opportunity that (having been done poorly in the past) increases engagement dramatically at a lower cost because we are talking to relevant people.</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>', NULL, 'An industry mailing list is a basic marketing tool, making the businesses able to target set of professionals from different fields.', 'Industry Mailing List | 30M+ Verified Business Contacts', 'Go4Database- From our Industry mailing List, you can select companies and top decision-makers from any industry to market your goods and services.', '<script type=\"application/ld+json\">\r\n{\r\n  \"@context\": \"https://schema.org\",\r\n  \"@type\": \"Organization\",\r\n  \"name\": \"Go4Database\",\r\n  \"url\": \"https://www.go4database.com/\",\r\n  \"logo\": \"https://go4database.com/assets/uploads/media-uploader/go4database-logo1751528079.png\",\r\n  \"contactPoint\": {\r\n    \"@type\": \"ContactPoint\",\r\n    \"telephone\": \"+ 1 786 785 2141\",\r\n    \"contactType\": \"customer service\",\r\n    \"areaServed\": \"US\",\r\n    \"availableLanguage\": \"en\"\r\n  },\r\n  \"sameAs\": [\r\n    \"https://www.facebook.com/Go4Database\",\r\n    \"h