 style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\">Banking &amp; Finance&nbsp;List</span></span></span></a></p>\r\n			</td>\r\n			<td><a href=\"https://www.go4database.com/b2b/cto-email-list\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#2980b9\"><span style=\"font-size:16pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\">CTO Email List</span></span></span></a></td>\r\n			<td><a href=\"https://www.go4database.com/b2b/ceo-email-list\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#2980b9\"><span style=\"font-size:16pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\">CEO Email List</span></span></span></a></td>\r\n		</tr>\r\n	</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a class=\"boxed-btn\" href=\"https://app.go4database.com/login?utm_source=ProductPage&amp;utm_medium=Internal&amp;utm_campaign=app_login\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#ffffff\"><span style=\"font-size:20px\"><span style=\"background-color:#6fd943\">Unlock Access</span></span></span></a></p>\r\n\r\n<p><br />\r\n&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<h2><span style=\"font-size:24pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#434343\">FAQs</span></span></span><br />\r\n&nbsp;</h2>\r\n\r\n<h3><span style=\"font-size:20pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#434343\">1. What is an electrical industry list?</span></span></span></h3>\r\n\r\n<p><br />\r\n<span style=\"font-size:16pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">The electrical industry list is a type of database that comprises the contact details of the electric industry professionals, decision-makers, and gatekeepers.&nbsp;</span></span></span><br />\r\n&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:16pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">Mainly, it will contain the names, job titles, email IDs, and company names or other details that provide direct access through targeted marketing.</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p>&nb