(67, 'C Level Email List', 'c-level-email-list', 'a:1:{i:0;s:1:\"2\";}', '<p><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">Reach top decision-makers with our verified <strong>C-level email list</strong>, including CEOs, CTOs, CFOs, and investors across leading US tech companies.</span></span></span><br />\r\n&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">Built for precision targeting, this c level executives database ensures high deliverability, accurate contacts, and faster conversions for B2B sales, outreach, and growth campaigns.</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a class=\"boxed-btn\" href=\"https://app.go4database.com/login?utm_source=ProductPage&amp;utm_medium=Internal&amp;utm_campaign=app_login\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\">Download Free Sample List</span></span></a></p>\r\n\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<h2><span style=\"font-size:24pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#434343\">What is a C Level Email List?</span></span></span></h2>\r\n\r\n<p><br />\r\n<span style=\"font-size:16pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">A C level email list is an extensive, curated database that includes contact details of C-suite executives like CEOs, CFOs, CTOs, CMOs, COOs, CXOs, CROs, CMOs, and more from various companies across industries.&nbsp;</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:16pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">These contact details are made from essential data like names, job titles, industry names, company details, phone numbers, email addresses, and more.&nbsp;</span></span></span><br />\r\n&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:16pt\"><span style=\"font