mining sub- sectors are included in the list?</span></span></span></h3>\r\n\r\n<p><br />\r\n<span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">Go4Database&#39;s email list includes major areas of mining like coal mining, metal ore mining, rare earth mining, quarrying, surface and underground operations, mineral processing, and businesses involved in equipment and logistics connected to mining.</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<h2><span style=\"font-size:24pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#434343\">Others Targeted Industry Email List</span></span></span></h2>\r\n\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<table border=\"1\" cellpadding=\"1\" cellspacing=\"1\" class=\"table table-bordered\" style=\"width:800px\">\r\n	<tbody>\r\n		<tr>\r\n			<td><a href=\"https://www.go4database.com/b2b/dentists-mailing-list\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#3498db\"><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\">Dentists Mailing List</span></span></span></a></td>\r\n			<td><a href=\"https://www.go4database.com/b2b/cardiologists-mailing-list\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#3498db\"><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\">Cardiologists Mailing List</span></span></span></a></td>\r\n			<td><a href=\"https://www.go4database.com/b2b/hospitality-industry-email-list\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#3498db\"><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\">Hospitals Mailing List</span></span></span></a></td>\r\n		</tr>\r\n		<tr>\r\n			<td><a href=\"https://www.go4database.com/b2b/nursing-homes-email-list\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#3498db\"><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\">Nursing Homes Email List</span></span></span></a></td>\r\n			<td><a href=\"https://www.go4database.com/b2b/ceo-email-list\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color: