color:#666666\">A healthcare email list is a contact list comprising email addresses of healthcare industry leaders such as medical administration, biotechnologist, healthcare providers. The list also includes information on healthcare institutions or organizations like hospitals, clinics and pharmaceutical companies.</span></span></span><br />\r\n&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<h3 style=\"color:#434343; font-style:normal\"><span style=\"font-size:20pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#434343\">2. What is a healthcare mailing list used for?</span></span></span></h3>\r\n\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">A healthcare mailing list is used to communicate directly with the right audience within the medical industry to sell as well as expand businesses offerings and to boost marketing campaigns.</span></span></span><br />\r\n&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<h3 style=\"color:#434343; font-style:normal\"><span style=\"font-size:20pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#434343\">3. What is the importance of having an updated healthcare contact list?</span></span></span></h3>\r\n\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">To boost the business marketing campaign effectively, it is very important to have an updated and accurate healthcare contact list. As the list ensures that the data provided is precise and the communication is not wasted on irrelevant prospects, this ensures delivery of information on time.</span></span></span><br />\r\n&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<h3 style=\"color:#434343; font-style:normal\"><span style=\"font-size:20pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#434343\">4. Does Go4database offer a customized medical contacts list?</span></span></span></h3>\r\n\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:15pt\