(148, 'IT Decision Makers Data (CIO, CTO)', 'it-decision-makers-data', 'a:1:{i:0;s:1:\"4\";}', '<p><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">Go4database has a skilled team of experts who curate data from reliable sources. At Go4database, you get a comprehensive IT Decision Makers Email List that consists of key-decision makers like application developer, application support analyst, and others. You can connect with your targeted IT Companies and decision makers in the USA and Europe. To boost your B2B marketing campaign you get a well-crafted list of professionals from different sectors like enterprise software vendors, cybersecurity solution providers, and more. Boost your marketing efforts with active, authentic, specific dataset.</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<h2><span style=\"font-size:24pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#434343\">Who Gains Value from Our IT Decision-Makers Database?</span></span></span></h2>\r\n\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">Best suited to software companies, cloud services, and cybersecurity businesses aiming to reach CIOs, CTOs, and IT leaders.</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<div>\r\n<table cellspacing=\"0\" style=\"border-collapse:collapse; border:none; table-layout:fixed; width:624px\">\r\n	<tbody>\r\n		<tr>\r\n			<td style=\"vertical-align:top\">\r\n			<div id=\"blogTLDR\">\r\n			<ul>\r\n				<li style=\"list-style-type:disc\"><span style=\"font-size:13.999999999999998pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">Recruitment Firms</span></span></span></li>\r\n				<li style=\"list-style-type:disc\"><span style=\"font-size:13.999999999999998pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">SaaS Companies</span></span></span></li>\r\n			