\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<h3 style=\"color:#434343; font-style:normal\"><span style=\"font-size:20pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#434343\">3. What are the various validation methods used in Go4database&#39;s HR dataset?</span></span></span></h3>\r\n\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">Our primary verification methods include MTP checks, domain validation,&nbsp; phone number verification and AI-driven verification.</span></span></span><br />\r\n&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<h3 style=\"color:#434343; font-style:normal\"><span style=\"font-size:20pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#434343\">4. Do I get filters to customize my HR Decision Makers Contact List?</span></span></span></h3>\r\n\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">Yes. We offer more than 70 data filters, which include, industry, revenue, employee headcount, and many more. You can utilize the filters as per your requirements.</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<h2><span style=\"font-size:24pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#434343\">Other Targeted Industry Email List</span></span></span></h2>\r\n\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<table border=\"1\" cellpadding=\"1\" cellspacing=\"1\" class=\"table table-bordered\" style=\"width:800px\">\r\n	<tbody>\r\n		<tr>\r\n			<td><a href=\"https://www.go4database.com/b2b/admin-head-mailing-list\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#2980b9\"><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\">Admin Head Mailing List</span></span></span></a></td>\r\n			<td><a href=\"https://www.go4database.com/b2b/it-decision-makers-data\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#2980b9\"><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\">IT Decision Maker