:24pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#434343\">FAQs</span></span></span></h2>\r\n\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<h3 style=\"color:#434343; font-style:normal\"><span style=\"font-size:20pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#434343\">1. What information is included in an Oncologist Email List?</span></span></span></h3>\r\n\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">Oncologist email list includes Email Addresses, Contact information including Name, Fax and Location, Area of Specialization, Hospital Affiliations, Social Media Handles, Designation, Years of Experience, Postal Address, Phone Number, and more.&nbsp;</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><br />\r\n&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<h3 style=\"color:#434343; font-style:normal\"><span style=\"font-size:20pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#434343\">2. How accurate are Oncologist Emails?</span></span></span></h3>\r\n\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">We ensure that our data is updated at frequent intervals with 2 levels of verification process that promises 95% of accurate and updated oncologist email lists.</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><br />\r\n&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<h3 style=\"color:#434343; font-style:normal\"><span style=\"font-size:20pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#434343\">3. Where do you source your list of oncologist email data?</span></span></span></h3>\r\n\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\">Go4database is successfully managing long-term partnerships directly with Medical Organizations, Institutions across US and Europe. Thus it has its own built network for the process of data collection.</span></spa